<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤俭[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郤俭[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤俭[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郤儉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤俭[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤俭[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "方士。传说能辟谷，食茯苓。绝食百日，而尚能行步起居自若云。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王布> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王布"@zh .
