<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈应[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈应[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈应[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "桂阳太守赵范的管军校尉，原为桂阳岒山乡猎戶出身，善使飞叉，与同是猎戶出身、曾射杀双虎的鲍隆皆自恃勇力，劝本欲降刘备的赵范出兵相拒，不过与赵云交锋便被生擒。赵云放陈应回桂阳，令其劝赵范投降。赵范降后因失言而自不安，欲反，与陈应、鲍隆商议..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#龚衡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "龚衡"@zh .
