<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭敞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "郭嘉之孙。有才识，位散骑常侍。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#云英> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "云英"@zh .
