<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾琮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "举孝廉，迁为京兆尹，有政绩。中平元年（184）为交阯刺史，安民除害，在事三年，征拜议郎。又为冀州刺史、度辽将军，卒于官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨俊[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨俊[魏]"@zh .
