<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨俊[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨俊[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操任之为安陵令，又迁为南阳太守。俊宣德教、立学校、吏民称之。魏国既建，迁中尉。他自少及长，以人伦自任。黄初三年（222），文帝至宛，以市不丰乐，发怒收俊，遂自杀。众冤痛之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘本> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘本"@zh .
