<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘本> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘本> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "学者。师受经传，博学群书。举贤良方正，为般长，卒于官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏延> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "魏延"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文长"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "征西大将军、前军师、凉州刺史。以部曲随刘备入蜀，数有战功，迁牙门将军。刘备为汉中王，欲以重将镇汉川，众论以为必是张飞，张飞亦以心自许，结果拔魏延为督汉中镇远将军、领汉中太守，全军尽惊。诸葛亮驻汉中，以魏延为督前部，领丞相司马、凉州刺史..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "相貌与关羽极为相似。初从荆州刺史刘表，表卒，次子琮嗣。蔡瑁专权，献州降曹公。先主引军民投襄阳，瑁等乱箭射下。城外百姓，皆望敌楼而哭。延引数百人径上城楼，轮刀砍死守门将士，开了城门。文聘遂与之大战，从已至未，手下兵卒皆已折尽。延乃拨马而..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵酆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵酆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵酆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子"@zh .
