<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵酆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "齐王芳时，曾预朝议。入晋，为骠骑将军，封东平陵公。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕雅> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕雅"@zh .
