<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "赤乌八年（245）为校尉，将屯田及作士三万人凿句容中道。"@zh .
