<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵咨[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "董卓之乱，与同县司马朗奔黎阳。后仕魏为尚书。"@zh .
