<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟贲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "宦官。顺帝时为中常侍，为顺帝所宠爱。永和年间，与曹腾一同遭张逵等人诬害，被缚问罪。帝诛逵等，释贲与腾。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#靳详> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "靳详"@zh .
