<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏曹丕文德郭皇后姊子。曾还乡里，求小妻，为后劝止。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔瑷> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "崔瑷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔瑷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子玉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔瑷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔瑷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "文学家、书法家。崔骃之子。早孤，锐志好学。年十八，至京师，从侍中贾逵质正大义，遂精通天文、历数、《京房易传》等。因为兄报仇，杀人而逃至他方，会赦，归家。年四十余，始为郡吏。后几为贵戚吏，皆不遇被斥。举茂才，迁汲令。在事数言便宜，为人开..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯氏[单固母]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯氏[单固母]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯氏[单固母]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "夏侯氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯氏[单固母]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯氏[单固母]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "单固之母。曾劝其子跟从兖州刺史令狐愚为幕僚。后因单固参与令狐愚谋反而遭刑戮。临死愧不敢仰视其母。夏侯氏则以为其过在己。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王遂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王遂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王遂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王遂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王遂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王遂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "嘉禾中铸大钱，曾私取，后为典军吏刘助所觉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#游殷> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "游殷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#游殷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "游殷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#游殷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#游殷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为郡功曹。托子楚于小吏张既，后楚果得既助而显名，故关中称殷“生有知人之明”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈珩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "沈珩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈珩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲山"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈珩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈珩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少综贯经艺，尤善《春秋》内外传。初任西曹掾，孙权以为有智谋，能专对，乃使至魏，随事应答魏文帝，无所屈服。以奉使敏达而获得声誉，封永安乡侯，官至少府。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王隆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王隆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王隆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "平东将军、尚书王虔之子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟会> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "钟会"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟会> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "士季"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟会> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟会> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "自幼才华横溢，上至皇帝、下至群臣都对他非常赏识。在征讨毌丘俭、诸葛诞其间，钟会屡出奇谋。被人比作西汉谋士张良，又曾为司马昭献策阻止了曹髦的夺权企图，钟会得以成为司马氏的亲信。景元年间，钟会独力支持司马昭的伐蜀计划，从而发动伐蜀之战。灭..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟会> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "少有异才，受众人赏识，夏侯霸降蜀后预言其终究成为吴蜀之大患。毌丘俭叛乱后，钟会说服司马师亲征。司马师病死后，钟会又帮助司马昭保住兵权。诸葛诞叛乱其间，钟会多次献策助司马昭平叛。又画西蜀图本力劝司马昭伐蜀。伐蜀其间，钟会为严军法，处死名..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张世平> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张世平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张世平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張世平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张世平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张世平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "商人。世平、苏双等赀累千金，贩马周旋于涿郡，见刘备而异之，乃多与之金财。备由是得用合徒众。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张世平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "刘备、关羽、张飞三人结拜毕，来日收拾军器，但恨无马匹可乘。正思虑间，人报有两个客人，引一伙伴当，赶一群马，投庄上来。三人出庄迎接。乃世平同苏双，每年往北贩马，近因寇发而回。备请二人到庄，置酒管待，诉说欲讨贼安民之意。二客大喜，愿将良马..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐资> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "乐资"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐资> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "樂資"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐资> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐资> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "撰《山阳公载记》等书，为南朝宋裴松之注《三国志》所引，今已佚。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵达[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵达[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵达[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "趙達"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵达[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵达[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏官吏。任校事。执法多以爱憎。后奸事发，被曹操处死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵温> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵温"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵温> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子柔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵温> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵温> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为京兆郡丞，弃官去。献帝西迁，累拜司徒，录尚书市，封江南亭侯。李傕劫献帝至北坞，纳温于坞中，傕又欲移献帝于黄白城，温移书责傕，几乎被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈桃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈桃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈桃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳桃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈桃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈桃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "又臣郡吏陈桃梦臣与道士相遇，放发被鹿裘，布易六爻，挠其三以饮臣，臣乞尽吞之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈祎[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈祎[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈祎[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳禕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈祎[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈祎[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安二十四年（219），为长乐卫尉。时曹操出兵在外，魏讽与祎谋袭邺都，未及期，祎惧而告发。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李兴[西晋]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李兴[西晋]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李兴[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "雋石"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李兴[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李兴[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "历任别驾、参军、太傅掾。惠帝永兴中，镇南将军刘弘命他撰诸葛亮、羊祜碣文。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐顾> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐顾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐顾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐顧"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐顾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐顾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "其所驻屯之地与吕蒙营相比邻。顾死，吴主孙权欲以其众并入吕蒙军中，吕蒙坚辞不受，认为顾为国辛劳，他死后应该让其子弟为将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沮宗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "沮宗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沮宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "沮宗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沮宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沮宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "沮授弟。官渡之战前夕，授知绍必败而散其资产，宗却认为曹操兵马不敌绍。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关羽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "关羽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关羽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "云长"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关羽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关羽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "前将军。本字长生，亡命奔涿郡。与张飞追随刘备征战，当刘备为平原相时，他们俩为别部司马。二人与刘备寝则同床，恩若兄弟。稠人广坐则侍立终日。随同曹操和刘备讨吕布于下邳，事后为朝廷封为中郎将。当刘备袭杀曹操的徐州刺史车冑后，以关羽镇下邳太守..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关羽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "因本处势豪倚势凌人，关羽杀之而逃难江湖。闻涿县招军破贼，特来应募。与刘备、张飞桃园结义，羽居其次。使八十二斤青龙偃月刀随刘备东征西讨。虎牢关温酒斩华雄，屯土山降汉不降曹。为报恩斩颜良、诛文丑，解曹操白马之围。后得知刘备音信，过五关斩六..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马氏[荀霬妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马氏[荀霬妻]"@zh .
