<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文雍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文雍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权敬怀皇后王夫人同母弟。封为亭侯。"@zh .
