<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#野王君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#野王君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "姓夏，魏明悼毛皇后之母。青龙四年（236），追封为野王君。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张飞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张飞"@zh .
