<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱琬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父朱才卒，袭爵为将，至镇西将军。凤皇元年（272），从都督陆抗击叛将步阐，拒晋援军巴东监军徐胤于建平。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#綦毌闿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "綦毌闿"@zh .
