<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#綦毌闿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "经学家。刘表立学官，博求儒士，使其与宋忠等撰《五经章句》，称之《后定》。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#仲兴> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "仲兴"@zh .
