<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞延[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞延[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为张既所礼辟，终有名位。"@zh .
