<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "靖虽年逾七十，爱乐人物，诱纳后进，清谈不倦。丞相诸葛亮皆为之拜。章武二年卒。子钦，先靖夭没。钦子游，景耀中为尚书。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柴玉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "柴玉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柴玉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "柴玉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柴玉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柴玉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末三国初技工。在汉为铸钟工，意巧有思，形器之中，多所造作。曹操时曾取所铸钟，杂错更试，以为不如法，罪玉为养马士。文帝时又见信用。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁胤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁胤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "袁胤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "丹杨太守、袁术从弟。后胤替周尚为丹杨太守。后为孙策所逐。术败亡，胤弃寿春，投刘勋。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁术之侄。袁术死后，护送术灵柩、妻儿往庐江，於道为徐璆所杀，自此玉玺归太祖。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑妪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑妪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑妪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄭嫗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑妪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑妪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孤城郑妪能相人，及范、惇、达八人，世皆称妙，谓之八绝云。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘备> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘备"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘备> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "玄德"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘备> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘备> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀汉的开国皇帝，相传是汉景帝之子中山靖王刘胜的后代。刘备少年丧父，与母亲贩鞋织草席为生。黄巾起义时，刘备组织义兵，随政府军剿除黄巾，有功，任安喜县尉，不久因鞭打督邮弃官。后诸侯割据，刘备势力弱小，经常寄人篱下，先后投靠过公孙瓒、曹操、..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘备> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "刘备，蜀汉的开国皇帝，汉景帝之子中山靖王刘胜的后代。刘备少年孤贫，以贩鞋织草席为生。黄巾起义时，刘备与关羽、张飞桃园结义，成为异姓兄弟，一同剿除黄巾，有功，任安喜县尉，不久辞官；董卓乱政之际，刘备随公孙瓒讨伐董卓，三人在虎牢关战败吕布..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁侃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁侃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁侃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公然"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁侃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁侃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁涣子。议论清当，善与人交。曾任黄门选部郎，后至尚书。早卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱万岁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱万岁"@zh .
