<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈迁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈迁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太元二年正月，封和为南阳王，遣之长沙。恪即和妃张之舅也。妃使黄门陈迁之建业上疏中宫，并致问於恪。临去，恪谓迁曰：“为我达妃，期当使胜他人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐粲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐粲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐粲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐粲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐粲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐粲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾奉令出使宛陵，拘捕并审问县令贺惠。中书郎奚熙向吴帝孙皓进谗，告粲袒护贺惠，帝即遣人至宛陵杀粲，捕惠入狱。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀肃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀肃"@zh .
