<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴员> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "戴员"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴员> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "戴員"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴员> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴员> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "举孝廉，事吴郡太守盛宪。孙权杀宪，员亡匿山中。建安八年（203），权弟翊领丹杨太守，礼致之，任员为郡丞。不久员亲信边洪杀翊。孙河怒责员等。员等遂杀河，使人北迎扬州刺史刘馥。后员为翊旧将徐元等所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴员> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "东吴丹阳郡丞。与丹阳督将妫览、从人边洪三人密谋，使边洪杀丹阳太守孙翊。而后归罪边洪，斩之于市。二人乘势掳翊家资侍妾。后被翊妻徐氏用计复仇杀死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#挚虞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "挚虞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#挚虞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲洽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#挚虞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#挚虞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "起家为主簿。举贤良，拜中郎。擢为太子舍人，除闻喜令。以母忧解职，久之，召补尚书郎。惠帝元康（291-299）中，历秘书监、卫尉卿、光禄勋、太常卿。永嘉（307-313）之乱中，辗转流徙，由于素来为人清廉，遂致饿死道中。虞少事皇甫谧，博..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王普> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王普"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王普> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王普"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王普> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王普> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "广汉太守夏侯纂部下主簿。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹邵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹邵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯南"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操族人。初平中，曹操起兵，邵募徒众，从操周旋，为州郡所杀。其子秦真，后被曹操收为义子。但另据裴松之注引《魏略》的记载，曹真本姓秦，其父秦邵（字伯南）素来与曹操相善。兴平末年，袁术部曲与曹操在豫州交战，曹操一次外出时侦察时，遭遇袁术部..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李骧[西晋]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李骧[西晋]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李骧[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔龙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李骧[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李骧[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀平阳亭侯李福之子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许褚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "许褚"@zh .
