<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭颁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭颁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾为令史，出为官长。著有《魏晋世语》，今已佚。"@zh .
