<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘贞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西汉景帝子中山靖王刘胜之子。武帝元狩六年（前119）封涿县陆城亭侯，因坐酎金失侯，遂定居涿县（今河北涿县）。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘贞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
