<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨康> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "正始年间在兖州刺史令狐愚部下兼治中从事。后应司徒召诣洛阳，泄露王凌与令狐愚谋反事，希冀得到封官，以辞颇参错，与谋反者并斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑众> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑众"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑众> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲师，子师"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑众> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑众> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "年十二从父受业，精《左氏春秋》、《易》、《诗》，作《春秋难记条例》，知名于世。明帝永平（58-75）初，辟司空府，累迁给事中。八年，持节使匈奴，还，复遣之，不欲往而谏诤，诏系廷尉，遇赦归家。后复拜中郎将，使护西域，迁武威太守。所在谨边..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄华> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄华"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄华> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "黄華"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄华> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄华> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "延康元年（220），华举兵执太守辛机。护羌校尉、金城太守苏则讨伐，华降。后为兖州刺史。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#度尚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "度尚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#度尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "博平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#度尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#度尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "始为君上计吏，拜郎中，除上虞长，为政严峻。延熹间擢荆州刺史。讨战有功，封右乡侯。后为辽东太守，使鲜卑不敢入犯。平生轻财赴义，与张邈等人被称为“八厨”。延熹九年卒于官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#度尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "上虞县令。奏闻朝廷，表曹娥为孝女。度尚还令邯郸淳作文，镌碑以记其事。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙盛[西晋]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙盛[西晋]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙盛[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "安国"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙盛[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙盛[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "起于佐著作郎。陶侃、庚亮、桓温在荆州时，并引以为参军事，累迁至给事中、秘书监。笃好于学，自少至老，手不释卷。著《魏氏春秋》、《晋阳秋》，世称良史。书成，桓温大怒，以灭其族相威胁，盛不从，其子暗地改之，书遂两存。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁冲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "丁冲"@zh .
