<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁冲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁冲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "司隶校尉。宿与太祖亲善，时随乘舆。后因饮酒过度而死。"@zh .
