<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石伟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少好学，举茂才、贤良方正，皆不就。孙休即位，特徵伟，累迁至光禄勋。孙皓时，拜光禄大夫。西晋太康二年（281），诏任议郎，不受。太熙元年（290）卒，年八十三。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞隆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卞隆"@zh .
