<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈炜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "人称孔融有异才。太中大夫陈炜后至，同坐以告炜，炜曰：“人小时了了者，大亦未必奇也。”"@zh .
