<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马续> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "七岁通《论语》，十三岁明《尚书》、十六岁治《诗》，博观群籍，善九章算术。顺帝时为护羌校尉，迁度辽将军，所在以恩威著称。曾与班昭续修《汉书》。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘珍> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘珍"@zh .
