<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘珍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "安帝永初（107-113）中，为谒者仆射。后奉诏与马融等校定东观藏书，撰《东观汉记》。永宁元年（120），奉诏作《建武以来名臣传》，迁侍中、越骑校尉。顺帝永建元年（126），卒于官。所著另有诔、颂、连珠七篇，《释名》三十篇。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢鲲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "谢鲲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢鲲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "幼舆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢鲲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢鲲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋官吏。少知名，好《老》、《易》，能歌善鼓琴。惠帝永兴中，东海王司马越闻其名，辟为掾，转参军事。以时乱，托病去职。后为王敦的长史，因功封咸亭侯。东晋中宗司马睿在位时出为豫章太守，有政绩。卒于官，年四十三。追赠太常，谥康。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙钟> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙钟"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙钟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫鍾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙钟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙钟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "据史载及《富春孙氏宗谱》：孙钟为乌程侯孙坚之父，东吴大帝孙权之祖父，东汉后期，天下将乱，遂隐居于故乡富春江畔的阳平山，以种瓜为业。路人有求，慷慨相赠，因此孝友之名，肆闻乡里。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙钟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙坚十七岁的时候，和父亲乘船沿富春江去钱唐，途遇盗匪，商旅畏缩不前，惟孙氏父子见义勇为，孙坚提刀上岸，猛冲上前，驱散盗匪，还追杀了一名强人。此事远近传开，使少年孙坚名显地方，被举荐为校尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫烈> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卫烈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "衛烈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "臻子，与刘熙、孙密二人同以父势居高官，时称为三豫，乃一时俊士。咸熙中为光禄勋。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁厷> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "丁厷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁厷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "丁厷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁厷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁厷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "言多浮艳。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘展> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘展"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘展> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉展"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘展> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘展> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "奋威将军，封乐乡侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆玩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陆玩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆玩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "士瑶"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆玩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆玩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "器量淹雅，弱冠有美名。西晋末，官府辟召而不就。东晋元帝时，累加奋武将军，征拜侍中。明帝时，转尚书左仆射，领本州大中正。及苏峻反，玩潜说匡术归顺，以功封兴平伯转尚书令。成帝时，迁司空。卒后谥曰康，追赠太尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴达> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴达"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴达> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吴達"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴达> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴达> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "宦官。明帝时受卞太后差遣诣河南尹司马芝府传令，救护犯禁系狱的曹洪乳母当等，但司马芝仍将当等拷问致死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐统> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐统"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐统> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐統"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐统> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐统> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "故尚书令徐奕族子。奕死无子，曹丕以统为郎，以奉奕后。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马钧> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马钧"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马钧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马钧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马钧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉安帝时征西将军，司马懿的高祖。东汉安帝二年（公元95年），司马均任左冯翊征讨先零羌，与其同僚右扶风仲光发生矛盾。在之后的行动中，仲光率兵深入，被敌人伏击，司马均因为赌气没有出兵营救，致使仲光和其他将领和士兵兵败战死。之后司马均因为此..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马钧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "那七庙：汉征西将军司马钧，钧生豫章太守司马量，量生颍川太守司马隽，隽生京兆尹司马防，防生宣帝司马懿，懿生景帝司马师、文帝司马昭，是为七庙也。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀融> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀融"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯雅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "荀衍孙。与王弼、钟会俱知名，同论《易经》、《老子》之义，传于世。任洛阳令，参大将军军事。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范明友> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "范明友"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范明友> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "範明友"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范明友> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范明友> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西汉大将，为霍光女婿，汉武帝晚期开始得到重用，汉昭帝、宣帝时期北方重要的将军之一。开始以羌骑校尉的身份随鸿胪田广明、军正王平击益州羌人谋反，斩首捕虏三万余人，获畜产五万余头。后来升为中郎将，又被封为度辽将军。多次讨伐匈奴、乌桓，并取得..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐季龙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐季龙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐季龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "开明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐季龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐季龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "有才机，任清和县令时，曾与方士管辂讨论未卜先知之理。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙虑[孙綝兄]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙虑[孙綝兄]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙虑[孙綝兄]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫慮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙虑[孙綝兄]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙虑[孙綝兄]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙綝从兄。孙峻死时委政事于孙綝，綝专横，吕据、滕胤谋废之，綝即派孙虑迎击吕据于江都。事平，綝日益骄横无礼，待虑薄于峻时，虑遂与将军王惇合谋诛綝，事败后被迫服药而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谯秀> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "谯秀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谯秀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元彦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谯秀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谯秀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "隐士。谯周孙。性清静，不交于世。州郡征辟，不就。常冠鹿皮，躬耕山泽。穆帝永和三年（347），桓温平蜀表荐，秀抗节玉立，誓不降辱。年九十余，卒于家。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘龟> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘龟"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘龟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉龜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘龟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘龟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "明帝时，为宜阳（今河南洛宁东北）典农。后因私自闯入皇苑射免，被捕治罪。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘必> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘必"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘必> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉必"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘必> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘必> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘必> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "东汉时期人，演义中曾提到此人祁阳侯刘谊之子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#扈瑁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "扈瑁"@zh .
