<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#扈瑁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "益州牧刘焉卒后，被任命为益州刺史。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#第五巡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "第五巡"@zh .
