<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞溥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞溥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任鄱阳内史，撰有《江表传》。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁昔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲁昔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁昔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "魯昔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁昔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁昔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末太原乌丸王。献帝建安二十二年（217），曹操署为骑督，使屯池阳（今陕西泾阳县西北）。后因思妻复叛，为鲜卑兵所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛韬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "辛韬"@zh .
