<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范旃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范旃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "扶南王。赤乌六年（243）遣使向吴献乐人及方物。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙希> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙希"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙希> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫希"@zh .
