<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙希> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权之孙，太子孙登之子。早夭。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周光> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周光"@zh .
