<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁几> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "明帝时为司马懿参军，曾被司马懿派遣到孟达处考察其是否谋反。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁几> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "在三国演义中写作“梁畿”，司马懿参军，在孟达暗中谋反曹睿时，被司马懿派遣到孟达处进行迷惑，延缓了孟达的谋反时间。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郁筑鞬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郁筑鞬"@zh .
