<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郁筑鞬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "鲜卑族首领，轲比能婿。魏明帝太和二年（228），杀魏译官夏舍。其秋，田豫率众征讨，大破之。"@zh .
