<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张休[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "正元二年（255），为庐江太守，助毌丘俭、文钦起兵，反抗司马师。"@zh .
