<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈象> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权末年，为五营督。时孙权欲废太子孙和而立孙亮，象与无难督陈正上书谏止，遭族诛。"@zh .
