<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#汝超> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "后主刘禅时任益州别驾。炎兴元年（263），刘禅致书魏将邓艾请降，得允，即派遣他与太常张峻前去接受邓艾节度。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛建> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "诸葛建"@zh .
