<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "诸葛恪少子。官至步兵校尉。吴主孙亮建兴二年（253），恪为孙峻所杀，旋亦遇害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡威> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "胡威"@zh .
