<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡威> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "胡质子。少有志尚，厉操清白。魏元帝咸熙中任徐州柳史，有治绩。入晋，为武帝信用，官至前将军，青州刺史。太康元年卒，追赠镇东将军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔衍> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孔衍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔衍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "舒元"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔衍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔衍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孔子二十二世孙。少好学，年十二，能通《诗》、《书》。晋元帝引为安东参军，专掌记室。后又补中书郎，领太子中庶子。后受王敦排挤，出为广陵郡。大兴三年（320）卒於官，年五十三。经学深博，撰述百余万言，著有《汉魏春秋》等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭奕[西晋]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭奕[西晋]"@zh .
