<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任大中正。读书有识鉴，尝搜集当地掌故，写成《交广二州春秋》一书，太康八年（287）献之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李移子> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李移子"@zh .
