<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李移子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "以贩缯为业，家资巨亿。为公孙瓒所宠信。瓒、移子与卜数师刘纬台、贾人乐何当结为兄弟，互为儿女亲家。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#元稹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "元稹"@zh .
