<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周奕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "景帝孙休时任光禄大夫，曾与石伟受命巡行风俗，察将吏清浊，民间疾苦。"@zh .
