<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇象> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "幼工书。时有张子并、陈梁甫能书。象斟酌其间，甚得其妙。官青州（今山东益都）刺史。"@zh .
