<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任中郎将时，因其不讲礼节，放纵部曲，违法犯纪，为潘濬所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#屈恭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "屈恭"@zh .
