<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#屈恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "屈晃弟。孙皓即位，以其兄忠谏亡身，封他与兄干为立义都尉。"@zh .
