<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞放> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "由曹腾推荐为官。顺帝时，为杨震受冤鸣不平。桓帝时，担任过太常、司空。与李膺、杜密等结为朋党，灵帝时因党事下狱，死于狱中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜安> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜安"@zh .
