<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑诩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "郑袤第四子。位至列卿。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐祚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐祚"@zh .
