<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐祚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权吴夫人弟。父徐琨卒，其兄徐矫袭封。矫卒，无子，乃以祚袭爵，后以战功官至芜湖督、平魏将军。"@zh .
