<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞耸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虞翻第六子。耸清虚无欲，进退以礼，在吴历清官，入晋，除河间相。"@zh .
