<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#顾徽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "出身江南士族。少游学，有才干，孙权召署主簿，转东曹掾。后拜辅义都尉，出使于曹操，应对得宜。还，拜巴东太守。权欲重用，寻卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#驳位居> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "驳位居"@zh .
