<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任旐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "以至行称，被誉为“天下贤人”。黄巾军至博昌，崇其贤而不入其乡。后举孝廉，历任酸枣、祝阿县令。"@zh .
