<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙宏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "中都侯孙资长子，孙楚之父。娶田豫之女为妻。嘉平二年（251）父死后，袭其职。后任南阳太守。"@zh .
