<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟辿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "钟繇孙，为钟会所养。元帝咸熙元年（264），钟会谋叛被杀，辿下狱，当伏诛，蒙赦。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秃瑰来> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "秃瑰来"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秃瑰来> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "秃瑰來"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秃瑰来> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秃瑰来> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时匈奴别部赀虏首领之一。本为大人檀柘部的枝大人。檀柘死后，率部往广魏、令居境，数次反魏，后为涼州官府所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#窦礼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "窦礼"@zh .
