<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盛冲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为郎中，孙休曾从其受学。孙休即位后，为博士。"@zh .
