<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘熙[刘靖子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "镇北将军刘靖长子，袭父爵为侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘熙[刘靖子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操横槊赋诗，醉酒刺死了刘馥，其子刘熙告请父尸归葬。据《三国志·魏书·刘馥传》记载三国时魏镇北将军刘靖长子，袭父爵为侯。系刘馥之孙。三国演义中误记为扬州刺史刘馥之子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李昭[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李昭[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李昭[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李昭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李昭[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李昭[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任冗从仆射。甘露五年（260），从曹髦发兵于陵云台，讨司马昭，败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张恂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张恂"@zh .
