<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张恂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张恂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "永安元年（258），以兄张布诛孙綝有功，被任命为校尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李仁[吴]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李仁[吴]"@zh .
