<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李仁[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李仁[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "末帝孙皓时为侍中。晋灭吴后，晋侍中庾峻等向他问以孙皓虐政，李仁所答多加回护。"@zh .
