<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱诞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "朱誕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱诞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱诞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "历任淮南内史、光禄勋、左积弩将军。陈敏称楚公，谋据江东，收用名士，惟有贺循和他不参与。永嘉三年（309）叛晋投汉王刘渊，官至大司农，后被刘聪诛杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅募> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "傅募"@zh .
