<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅募> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "傅佥之子，以罪没入奚官，后免为庶人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宣璠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "宣璠"@zh .
