<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宣璠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "时董卓欲迁都长安，司徒杨彪等反对，卓敕司隶校尉璠以灾异劾奏，因策免彪。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟瑜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "钟瑜"@zh .
