<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟瑜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟瑜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为族子钟繇供给资费，使其专心学习。后繇成名。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐何当> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "乐何当"@zh .
