<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐何当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "商人。与奋武将军、蓟侯公孙瓒为结义兄弟。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姚琼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "姚琼"@zh .
