<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姚琼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姚琼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十七年（212）与杨阜等起兵讨马超，超遂南奔，陇右平定。"@zh .
