<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田晏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "灵帝熹平六年（177）任破鲜卑中郎将，出云中伐鲜卑，大败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴生> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "裴生"@zh .
