<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#应贞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#应贞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "应璩子。少以才学称，善谈论。魏元帝咸熙中参相国军事。司马炎为抚军大将军时，以贞参军事。晋代魏，迁太子中庶子、散骑常侍。又以儒学与大尉荀顗共同撰定新礼，未施行。泰始五年（269）卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王秘[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王秘[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王秘[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王祕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王秘[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王秘[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏将领，曾与邓艾等参与对蜀国的作战。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王休[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王休[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王休[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王休"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王休[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王休[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘备将关羽围襄阳时，休曾与张嘉献上玉玺。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹范[曹据子]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹范[曹据子]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹范[曹据子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹範"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹范[曹据子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹范[曹据子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "彭城王据之子。黄初二年（221），诏以曹范奉郿戴公子整后。三年，封平氏侯。四年，徙封成武。太和三年（229），进爵为公。青龙三年（235）卒，谥曰悼公。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#圈文生> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "圈文生"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#圈文生> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "圈文生"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#圈文生> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#圈文生> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "郭林宗传曰：“兹弱冠与同郡圈文生俱称盛德。林宗与二人共至市，子许买物，随价雠直，文生訾呵，减价乃取。林宗曰：“子许少欲，文生多情，此二人非徒兄弟，乃父子也。”后文生以秽货见损，兹以烈节垂名。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张俭[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张俭[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张俭[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張儉"@zh .
