<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡贵人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋武帝司马炎贵人，胡奋之女。因有宠，兄弟亲戚皆任高官。"@zh .
