<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#常忌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋官吏。晋武帝向罗宪询问蜀大臣子弟及先辈宜时叙用者，宪荐忌等，即叙用。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆喜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陆喜"@zh .
