<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何绥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太仆何遵之子。官至侍中尚书。他奢侈过度，轻物简傲。后受刘舆、潘滔诬陷为东海王司马越所杀。"@zh .
