<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王访> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与同郡刘表、张隐、薛郁、宣靖、公绪恭、刘祗、田林为八交，或谓之八顾。"@zh .
