<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华荟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "怀帝时为大司农、太常。愍帝时为卫将军、河南尹。建兴五年（317），为刘聪将领袭杀于定颍。"@zh .
