<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张京[功曹]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张京[功曹]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张京[功曹]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張京"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张京[功曹]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张京[功曹]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "明帝时，为宜阳典农刘龟功曹。龟擅自于禁内射兔，京诣校事告之。后廷尉高柔判其罪。"@zh .
