<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李祯[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "都亭候李典之子，典死嗣爵。曹丕即位，追念李典前功，增祯食邑百户。"@zh .
