<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏舍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏明帝太和二年（228），魏乌丸校尉田豫派遣夏舍前往轲比能女婿郁筑鞬部，为鞬所杀。"@zh .
