<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕并> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安中为屯田客，自称将军，聚众据陈仓（今陕西宝鸡），后为曹操部属、关中护军赵俨攻灭。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王述> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王述"@zh .
