<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕习> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任庐江主簿。景初元年（237），密使人请兵于吴，欲为内应，开门献城。吴军既至，事情败露，撤回。"@zh .
