<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "何熙之孙。官至尚书。时宦官把持朝政，他敢于直言，以在党中坐罪下狱。亲属皆禁锢。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜松> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜松"@zh .
