<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初平中，任襄贲校尉。因其部民炅母等叛乱，并与昌豨通，曹操以吕虔代松为襄贲校尉。"@zh .
