<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#闾丘邈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉安帝时隐士。大将军邓骘辟浩，稍迁尚书仆射，出为彭城相，荐隐士闾丘邈等，征拜廷尉。"@zh .
