<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宣隆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "宣隆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宣隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宣隆"@zh .
