<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宣隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "时诸葛诞擅权，隆为主簿，秉节守义，临事固争，为诞所杀。"@zh .
