<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴瓒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "裴楷子，杨骏婿。风韵超群，见者敬之。任中书郎。杨骏诛，为乱兵所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雷谭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "雷谭"@zh .
