<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雷谭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任宜都太守。凤皇元年（272），西陵督步阐据城以叛，谭力主攻阐，失利。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛机> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "辛机"@zh .
