<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛机> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛机> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄初中，被任命为酒泉太守。群人黄华与西平人曲演、张掖人张进相结为乱，自称太守，拒不纳机。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘承[吴]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘承[吴]"@zh .
