<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘承[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘承[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "疑即“刘丞”。吴主孙亮太平三年（259），与吴主谋诛孙綝，事败，被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夷廖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夷廖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夷廖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "夷廖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夷廖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夷廖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "交州刺史张津部将。张津被区景所杀后，故将夷廖、钱博之徒尚多。建安十五年（210），孙权遣步骘为交州刺史，遂除廖、博等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏荣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏荣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏荣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "夏榮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏荣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏荣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙邕弟子。光和（178-183）中北海人王和平好道术，自称成仙。济南人孙邕从小跟从他学习。和平死后，孙邕把他葬到东陶，连和平的百余卷书和数包药一起埋葬。后来邕弟子夏荣告邕和平尸体已解。孙邕为未能取出宝书仙药而遗憾。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石威则> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "石威则"@zh .
