<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴捷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操子楚王彪，中山恭王衮犯交通之禁，赵宗、戴捷代受其罪。"@zh .
