<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#解弘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "弘父死，赴丧百日，不能随军行动，明帝大怒，经高柔劝解，弘才得免。"@zh .
