<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#商升> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安元年（196）为候官长。时会稽太守王朗被孙策击走，升为王郎起兵。先破策所置南部都尉韩晏，后与策属吏贺齐议和。升手下武官张雅、詹强等不愿升降，遂共杀升。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕禄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕禄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕禄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吕禄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕禄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕禄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "表字不详，秦末和西汉初人物，汉高祖皇后吕雉的侄子。吕雉死后，诸吕伺机叛乱，太周勃派刘章领兵进宫，杀掉吕产。及后，捕斩吕禄，诸吕势力很快就被周勃等人铲除。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕禄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘满> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "潘满"@zh .
