<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘满> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末尚书左丞潘勖之子。仕魏为平原太守，以学行名于时。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯谅> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "冯谅"@zh .
