<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯谅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯谅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾为郡吏，顿丘县民郭政私通从妹，杀其夫程他，谅被系狱为证。后县令胡质断明案情，谅乃获释。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘馀> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘馀"@zh .
