<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙耽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太平三年（258）吴帝孙亮谋杀权臣孙綝，事泄被废为会稽王，綝即遣将军孙耽送亮之封国。"@zh .
