<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫慎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卫慎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫慎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "衛慎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫慎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫慎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "明帝时任郎中，时辽东太守公孙渊遣使南通孙权。帝知渊持两端，遣慎等赍诏书宣示辽东，以分化渊部。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧仓> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "臧仓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧仓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "臧倉"@zh .
