<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧仓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾向鲁君进谗诋毁孟子，使其不接见孟子，人谓之臧仓小人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧仓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "战国末年鲁国人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩暨> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩暨"@zh .
