<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩暨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩暨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏司徒。同县豪右陈茂，谮暨父兄，畿至大辟。暨阳不以为言，庸赁积资，阴结死士，遂追呼寻禽茂，以首祭父墓，由是显名。举孝廉，司空辟，皆不就。乃变名姓，隐居避乱鲁阳山中。山民合党，欲行寇掠。暨散家财以供牛酒，请其渠帅，为陈安危。山民化之，终..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩暨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏国太常卿。大将军曹真与蜀军战，司马懿奏请魏明帝曹睿，令人去告戒曹真：“凡追赶蜀兵，必须观其虚实，不可深入重地，以中诸葛亮之计。”睿即时下诏，遣太常卿韩暨持节去告戒曹真。临行之际，司马懿又再三叮咛。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙苗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙苗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙苗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫苗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙苗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙苗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "夏日沔中督、威远将军孙邻之子，邻死后继立。"@zh .
