<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉中期大将。曾率东汉军队与匈奴作战。因违忤马防，被劾，下狱审治，后来免除还归本郡。不久，耿恭死于家中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "东汉中期大将。曾率东汉军队与匈奴作战。演义中有提及此人。"@zh .
