<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘德然> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘德然> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与蜀先主刘备同宗，为少时好友。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马繇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马繇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马繇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "思玄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马繇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马繇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "司马懿孙，琅邪王伷子。初拜东安公，历散骑黄门侍郎，迁散骑常侍。贾后与楚王司马玮诛灭杨骏，繇以功拜右卫将军，领射声校尉，进封郡王。永康初，迁尚书，转左仆射。后为成都王颖所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘贤[刘表]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘贤[刘表]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘贤[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉賢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘贤[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘贤[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘贤[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "零陵太守刘度之子。先主取零陵，贤荐上将邢道荣迎敌。后贤从道荣计，引伏兵袭先主军，为张飞生擒。诸葛亮放其归，贤回零陵见父度，备述亮德，劝父投降。度从之，遂于城上竖起降旗，大开城门，赍捧印绶出城，竟投玄德大寨纳降。亮教度仍为郡守，贤赴荆州..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒯通> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蒯通"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒯通> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蒯通"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒯通> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒯通> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "因为避汉武帝之违而改为通。辩才无双，善于陈说利害，陈胜派武臣进取赵地，武臣用其策，不战而降燕赵三十余城。后又劝韩信取齐地，并劝韩信自立为王。曹参为齐相时，为曹参宾客。著有《隽永》八十一篇，今佚。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒯通> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉初期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙绍[吴]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙绍[吴]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙绍[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫紹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙绍[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙绍[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾与张昭、滕胤、郑礼等採周、汉之制，撰定朝仪。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张磐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张磐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张磐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張磐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张磐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张磐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴书曰：谦性刚直，有大节，少察孝廉，拜尚书郎，除舒令。郡守张磐，同郡先辈，与谦父友，意殊亲之，而谦耻为之屈。与众还城，因以公事进见，坐罢，磐常私还入，与谦饮宴，或拒不为留。常以舞属谦，谦不为起，固强之；及舞，又不转。磐曰：“不当转邪？..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李氏[庞德妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李氏[庞德妻]"@zh .
