<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李氏[庞德妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李氏[庞德妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "正史无记载。三国演义中庞德出战关羽前，有虚构她的情节，"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李氏[庞德妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "庞德妻。庞德出战前，唤其妻李氏与其子庞会出，谓其妻曰：“吾今为先锋，义当效死疆场。我若死，汝好生看养吾儿；吾儿有异相，长大必当与吾报仇也。”妻子痛哭送别。"@zh .
