<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘康> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉献帝刘协嫡孙，封桂氏乡侯。献帝死后，嗣立为山阳公。"@zh .
