<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙邕[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙邕[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉灵帝时方士。光和中曾从北海王和平学道术，随其至京城。和平死，邕把他葬于东陶，并将其遗留百余卷书、数袋药一起埋葬。后邕弟子夏荣告以和平尸解，邕后悔当初没有取其宝书仙药。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯充> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯充"@zh .
