<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯充> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "夏侯惇长子。夏侯惇死后继承了家业。其死后子夏侯廙继承。廙薨，由廙子劭继承。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘丞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘丞"@zh .
