<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#信都令> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "管辂善卜，曾经对信都县令说，其屋下埋有死尸，导致其妻子生病。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#太甲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "太甲"@zh .
