<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王韬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司马昭主簿，曾帮助司马昭解困铁龙山。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张芝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张芝"@zh .
