<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张尚[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张尚[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴臣，孙皓时为侍郎，以言语辩捷见知，擢为侍中、中书令。后因得罪皓，积他事下狱，送建安作船。后被诛。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴应> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴应"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴应> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "温舒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴应> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴应> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏振威将军吴质之子。入晋后官至尚书。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李离> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李离"@zh .
