<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧艾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "臧霸子。少以才理著称，为黄门郎，历位郡守，官至青州刺史、少府。他曾因图显官，巴结朝臣，将父妾送与邓飏，颇为京师人所讥。袭父爵为良成侯。谥恭侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞察> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "虞察"@zh .
