<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丙吉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丙吉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西汉大臣。治律令，本为鲁狱史，累迁廷尉监。武帝末诏治巫蛊郡邸狱。后任大将军霍光长史，建议迎立宣帝。地节三年为太子太傅，迁御史大夫。元康三年封博阳侯。神爵三年任丞相。政尚宽大。掾史不称职，辄给长假以去。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丙吉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉大臣，丞相，政尚宽大。演义中有提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨肇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨肇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨肇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "秀初"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨肇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨肇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋折冲将军、荆州刺史。杨暨子，有才能，肇善草隶，初任任大将军参军，后迁折冲将军、领荆州刺史。吴将步阐举西陵降，肇与羊祜、徐胤领兵八万应之。胤率水军诣建平，肇至西陵。吴都督陆抗身率三军，凭围对肇。明日，肇攻故夷兵处，抗命旋军击之，矢石雨..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#迷当> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "迷当"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#迷当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "迷當"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#迷当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#迷当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "正始元年，蜀将姜维出陇西。魏将郭淮遂进军，追至强中，维退，遂讨羌迷当等，按抚柔氐三千馀落，拔徙以实关中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#迷当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀延熙十六年秋，将军姜维遣使赍金珠蜀锦入羌，结好羌王迷当，共讨魏。迷当得了礼物，便起兵五万，令羌将俄何烧戈为大先锋，引兵南安来。后魏将陈泰定计，生擒迷当。郭淮好言劝之，迷当降，从淮计，引魏军至蜀营，维及夏侯霸出迎，魏将不等迷当开言，就..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐琨> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐琨"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐琨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐琨"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐琨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐琨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙坚外甥，孙权表兄，徐真之子。少随坚征伐有功，拜偏将军。后随孙策征讨樊能、张英、笮融、刘繇等人，以功领丹阳太守。又以督军中郎将领兵，从策破庐江太守李术，封广德侯，迁平虏将军。后从讨黄祖，中流矢而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严遵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "严遵"@zh .
