<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与刘秀同游学。后刘秀即帝位，欲重用他，不从，终身隐居不仕。"@zh .
