<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张皇后[曹芳妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张皇后[曹芳妻]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张皇后[曹芳妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張皇後"@zh .
