<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高浑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高浑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "安国侯高柔孙。柔死后，浑嗣。元帝咸熙中，开建五等，改封昌陆子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#留略> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "留略"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#留略> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "留略"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#留略> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#留略> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "留赞之子。建兴元年十月，大帝崩，太傅诸葛恪会众於东兴，更作大堤，左右结山侠筑两城，各留千人，使都尉略、将军全端守之，引军而还。五凤二年，以略为东海太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#留略> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "大帝崩，建兴元年，魏军来攻东兴。时，略守右城、全端守左城，魏将胡遵令桓嘉、韩综攻之。略率众死守，后平北将军丁奉率援军至。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华轶> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "华轶"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华轶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦夏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华轶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华轶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少有才气，闻于当世。初为博士，累迁散骑常侍。司马越为兖州牧，引为留府长史。永嘉中，历振威将军、江州刺史。永嘉五年（311），怀帝为刘聪所擒。司空荀藩移檄州郡，以琅邪王司马睿为盟主。睿承制改易长史，轶不从命，睿于是遣左将军王敦都督甘卓、..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢颙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邢颙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢颙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子昂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢颙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢颙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "举孝廉，司徒辟，皆不就。易姓字，適右北平，从田畴游。积五年，而太祖定冀州。颙装还乡里，畴曰：“邢颙，民之先觉也。”乃见太祖，求为乡导以克柳城。太祖辟颙为冀州从事，又除广宗长，以故将丧弃官。有司举正，太祖曰：“颙笃于旧君，有一致之节。”..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宿舒> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "宿舒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宿舒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宿舒"@zh .
