<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宿舒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "公孙渊部下校尉，与孙综一同奉命出使东吴以称籓于权，并献貂马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩谧> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩谧"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩谧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "长深"@zh .
