<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏[陆抗妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏[陆抗妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏[陆抗妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陆抗妻。为张昭的孙女，张承之女，陆景之母，诸葛恪外甥女。恪被诛，张氏坐见黜。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#纶直> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "纶直"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#纶直> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "綸直"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#纶直> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#纶直> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "景初二年，渊将反，将军直、贾范等苦谏，渊皆杀之。后渊败死，司马懿封直等之墓，显其遗嗣。（资料取自晋书，三国志未记载此人）"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#纶直> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "渊将反，直以不详征兆劝之，渊勃然大怒，叱武士绑直斩于市。后渊败死，司马懿封其墓而荣其子孙。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩冉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩冉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩冉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "韓冉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩冉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩冉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为刘备军谋掾。献帝建安二十五年（220），曹操卒。备遣冉奉书吊，并送锦布为礼。曹丕恶其借丧求好，命荆州刺史斩冉，绝其使命。又说冉称疾住上庸，致书于曹丕，病卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[刘纂妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙氏[刘纂妻]"@zh .
