<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[刘纂妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[刘纂妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时吴主孙权中女。刘纂妻，早卒。"@zh .
