<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘建[贞王]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉宗室。河间惠王刘政之子，嗣爵为王。凡立十年，桓帝元嘉元年卒，谥为贞王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓超> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "桓超"@zh .
