<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓超> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏尚书令桓阶祖父，桓胜之父。曾典州郡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾逵[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "贾逵[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾逵[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "景伯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾逵[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾逵[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "经学家。贾谊九世孙。父徽，曾从刘歆受学。逵悉传其父业，博通经史。永平中，进献《春秋左氏传解诂》及《国语解诂》，为明帝所重，并奉旨作《神雀颂》，以博物多识拜为郎，与班固并校秘书。章帝时，受诏讲学于北宫白虎观、南宫云台。和帝永元三年（91..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#豫让> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "豫让"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#豫让> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "豫讓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#豫让> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#豫让> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "春秋末期晋国人，姬姓，毕氏。为晋卿智瑶（智伯）家臣。晋出公二十二年（前453），赵﹑韩﹑魏共灭智氏。豫让用漆涂身，吞炭使哑，暗伏桥下，谋刺赵襄子未遂，后为赵襄子所捕。临死时，求得赵襄子衣服，拔剑击斩其衣，以示为主复仇，然后伏剑自杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#豫让> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "春秋末期晋卿智瑶的家臣，是我国古代著名的“士为知己者死”的刺客。演义中有提及此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#木鹿大王> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "木鹿大王"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#木鹿大王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "木鹿大王"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#木鹿大王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#木鹿大王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#木鹿大王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "八纳洞洞主木鹿大王，深通法术：出则骑象，能呼风唤雨，常有虎豹豺狼、毒蛇恶蝎跟随。手下更有三万神兵，甚是英勇。自己骑巨象出征，击退了蜀汉军。但是，被诸葛亮破了法术而战死与乱军之中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘式> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘式"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘式> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉式"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘式> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘式> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "监军后将军刘邕嗣子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全纪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "全纪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "全紀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东吴黄门侍郎，太常全尚之子，皇后全氏之兄。大将军孙綝以吴主孙亮始亲政事，常向其多所问难，孙亮甚惧其人。孙綝后还建业，称疾不入朝，筑私室于朱雀桥之南，并使其弟威远将军孙据为苍龙宿卫，又令武卫将军孙恩、偏将军孙干、长水校尉孙闿分屯诸营，欲..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "皇后全氏之兄。时大将军孙綝以吴主孙亮始亲政事，常向其多所问难。孙綝为人专恣，孙亮甚惧其人，与全纪密谋诛除孙綝，并约全尚、将军刘丞谋诛孙綝。全纪承诏，以之告父全尚，不料全尚心无远虑，将事告知其妻。全纪妻是孙綝之姊，当下便使人密告于孙綝。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩縯> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩縯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩縯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯南"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩縯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩縯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任河内太守。顺帝时为丹阳太守，有政绩。桓帝时拜为司徒。后阿附梁冀，及冀被诛，縯坐罪，以减死论，遣归本郡，免为庶人。延熹八年（165），复拜縯为司隶校尉。縯奏宦官之罪恶，左悺及兄左称皆自杀，贬具瑷及兄具恭，稍抑宦官之势。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯绩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯绩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯绩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "夏侯績"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯绩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯绩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "夏侯渊之孙，夏侯衡之子。衡死，夏侯绩继之而立，封安宁亭侯，为虎贲中郎将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞舜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "虞舜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞舜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "都君"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞舜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞舜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三皇五帝之一，传说目有双瞳而取名重华,字都君；生于姚墟、诸冯，故姚姓。舜，为部落联盟首领，以受尧的“禅让”而称帝于天下，其国号为“有虞”，故号为“有虞氏帝舜”。帝舜、大舜、虞帝舜、舜帝皆虞舜之帝王号,故后世以舜简称之。死后，禅位于禹。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏绍> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苏绍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏绍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "世嗣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏绍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏绍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "臣松之案愉子绍，字世嗣，为吴王师。石崇妻，绍之女兄也。绍有诗在金谷集。绍弟慎，左卫将军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李譔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李譔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李譔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "钦仲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李譔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李譔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀中散中大夫、右中郎将。父仁，与同县尹默俱游荆州，从司马徽、宋忠等学。譔具传其业，又从默讲论义理，五经、诸子，无不该览，加博好技艺，算术、卜数、医药、弓弩、机械之巧，皆致思焉。始为州书佐、尚书令史。延熙元年，后主立太子，以譔为庶子，迁..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李譔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀博士。建兴四年，丞相亮伐魏，留譔为博士。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳浦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "柳浦"@zh .
