<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳浦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳浦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "公孙渊部下参军，在公孙渊授意下与群臣上书魏为渊求封国。（《魏书》）"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜度> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜度"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯度"@zh .
