<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "书法家。累官御史大夫。章帝时，为齐相。善草书。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#颜回> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "颜回"@zh .
