<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#颜回> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "是孔子最得意的弟子，却英年早逝，孔子为此非常遗憾。自汉代起，颜回被列为七十二贤之首，有时祭孔独以颜回配享。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#颜回> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "春秋时期鲁国人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨谟> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨谟"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨谟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊謨"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨谟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨谟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "安定长史杨阜从弟。曾协助姜叙、杨阜起兵卤城，击败马超。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓范子> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "桓范子"@zh .
