<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓范子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓范子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹爽谋士桓范的儿子，在桓范得知司马懿政变后，与其子商议出城通报曹爽。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓范子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹爽智囊桓范的儿子，在桓范得知司马懿政变后，与其子商议出城通报曹爽。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马玮> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马玮"@zh .
