<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马玮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马玮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "司马炎第五子。初封始平王。太康末，徙封楚王，都督荆州诸军事。武帝死，入为卫将军，领北军中候，加侍中、行太子少傅。时司马亮入朝辅政。玮承贾后旨，诬亮与卫瓘有废立之谋，矫诏杀之。“八王之乱”由此始。不久，即为贾后所杀，年二十一。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋显> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蒋显"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋显> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蔣顯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋显> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋显> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀太子仆。父琬，大将军、大司马。蜀亡，显赴剑阁，传圣旨与大将军姜维。魏镇西将军钟会爱其才，留于己边。翌年，会反，魏兵入，显等亦死于乱军之中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋显> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀太子仆。蜀亡，显携圣旨往剑阁与大将军姜维。翌年，魏镇西将军钟会反，事败，死于乱军之中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾复> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "贾复"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾复> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "君文"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾复> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾复> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西汉末年，天下大乱，光武任复为破虏将军、偏将军、都护将军，累有战功。光武即位，拜为执金吾，封冠军侯、胶东侯。参议国家大事，颇受光武信用。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈符> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈符"@zh .
