<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "著名围棋手。卫尉严畯再从子。围棋无敌手。与皇象等八人，各有绝艺，世皆称妙，谓之八绝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王离> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王离"@zh .
