<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈徵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "案陈氏谱：群之后，名位遂微。谌孙佐，官至青州刺史。佐弟坦，廷尉。佐子准，太尉，封广陵郡公。准弟戴、徵及从弟堪，并至大位。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田林> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "田林"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田林> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "田林"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田林> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田林> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与同郡刘表、张隐、薛郁、王访、宣靖、公绪恭、刘祗为八交，或谓之八顾。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏铄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苏铄"@zh .
