<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏铄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄门监。嘉平六年（254）二月，从夏侯玄、李丰、张缉等谋，欲诛大将军司马师，拥玄辅政。事泄被诛。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐详> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "乐详"@zh .
