<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴秀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴秀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "地理学家。祖茂，汉尚书令。父潜，魏尚书令。秀少好学，有风操，八岁能属文。秀年十余岁，有诣徽者，出则过秀。然秀母贱，嫡母宣氏不之礼，尝使进馔于客，见者皆为之起。秀母曰：“微贱如此，当应为小兒故也。”宣氏知之，后遂止。时人为之语曰：“后进..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴秀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "与贾充、何曾劝司马昭立长子炎为世子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高式> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高式"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高式> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "高式"@zh .
