<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高式> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "性至孝，尽力供养父母。传其孝感天神，安帝永初（107-113）中螟蝗为害，独不食其麦。圉令以麦州郡。太守杨舜举式孝子，不受。后以孝廉为郎。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩蔚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩蔚"@zh .
