<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#广阳乡君> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "广阳乡君"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#广阳乡君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "廣陽鄉君"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#广阳乡君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#广阳乡君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏武帝卞皇后侄卞琳之妻，封广阳乡君。"@zh .
