<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李若> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄初中，任东莞书吏。曾谋杀士人卢显。东莞太守胡质穷诘案情，自首。"@zh .
