<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯本> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "夏侯尚从孙。尚谋反被诛，灭三族。正元（254-255）中续功臣之世时，封夏侯本为昌陵亭侯，以奉尚后。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梅敷> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "梅敷"@zh .
