<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梅敷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梅敷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时夷王。率部曲万余家屯于中庐、宜城西山鄢、沔二谷中。后为魏将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张林> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张林"@zh .
