<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙琙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "玄菟太守。有子豹，早卒。公孙度与豹同年，琙见而亲爱之，遣就师学，为娶妻。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#微子> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "微子"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#微子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "微子"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#微子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#微子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "殷商宗室贵族，商王帝乙的长子，纣王的庶兄.初封于微地。为政贤能，为殷民所爱戴。商乱，殷代将亡，微子多次亲谏殷商纣王，但纣王并没有接纳。便谋于太师箕子、少师比干。 箕子认为“今诚得治国，国治身死不恨；为死终不得治，不如去”于是远离纣王逃..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#微子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "商朝时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄定> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄定"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "黄定"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "臣质不胜昊天至原，谨遣所亲同郡黄定恭行奉表，乃讬降叛，间关求达，其欲所陈，载列于左。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩肇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩肇"@zh .
