<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华锜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为孙权近臣，后出辅权子齐王孙奋，对奋违制言行，多所匡正。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩洪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩洪"@zh .
