<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊续> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊续> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建宁初，辟大将军窦武府；窦武败死，他坐党禁锢十余年。党禁解，累官庐江、南阳二郡太守，镇压黄巾军等农民起义军。中平六年，灵帝欲以为太尉。时拜三公者，须交纳礼钱十万。他拒绝交纳，故不登公位，而征为太常，未任病亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楚襄王> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "楚襄王"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楚襄王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楚襄王"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楚襄王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楚襄王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "楚顷襄王，简称楚襄王，姓名熊横，楚怀王之子，生母郑袖。熊横为太子时，曾经在齐国当人质。前299年楚怀王被秦国扣留后，齐湣王让熊横返回楚国，楚人立熊横为王，是为楚顷襄王。顷襄王元年（前298年），秦国知道楚国另立新君后，发兵攻楚，大败楚..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楚襄王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "春秋时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张华[西晋]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张华[西晋]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张华[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "茂先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张华[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张华[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "自幼博学多才，曾促使晋武帝定下决心出兵灭吴，而一旦出兵，又亲任度支尚书，以保证军需粮草的供给。晋元康元年六月事变后，为发动政变的贾后所倚重，出任侍中、中书监，在以后几年中对稳定政局起了重要作用。晋永康元年，因废太子遹事件卷入政争，四月..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张华[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "秘书丞。正与皇帝司马炎下棋时，送来了讨伐东吴的上奏。他表示赞同，因为强烈反对贾充的消极论调，被贾充怀恨在心。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#注诣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "注诣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#注诣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "註詣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#注诣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#注诣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "烧当羌王。景初二年秋八月，烧当羌王芒中、注诣等叛，凉州刺史率诸郡攻讨，斩注诣首。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李骧[起义军]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李骧[起义军]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李骧[起义军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元龙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李骧[起义军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李骧[起义军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西晋时流民起义首领。李特之弟，成汉王李雄之叔。为骁骑将军，屡立战功。成汉建国，任太傅。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯佐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯佐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯佐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "夏侯佐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯佐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯佐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "夏侯惇之孙。封高安乡侯。佐死无嗣，晋武帝司马炎以惇之近属夏侯劭继之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韦晃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韦晃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韦晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "韋晃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韦晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韦晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "二十三年春正月甲子，少府耿纪、丞相司直韦晃、太医令吉本、本子邈、穆、金祎等起兵诛曹操，攻焚丞相长史王必营，不克。典农中郎将严匡收纪、晃等，将斩之，纪呼魏王名曰：“恨吾不自生意，竟为群儿所误耳！”晃顿首搏颊，以至于死，夷三族。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韦晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "与耿纪等人密谋杀曹，事泄灭族。行刑时，韦晃以面颊顿地曰：“可恨！可恨！”咬牙皆碎而死。"@zh .
