<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙阳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权部下都督。建安十八年（213），曹操进军濡须口，攻破权江西营。阳为曹操所俘。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹氏[荀粲妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹氏[荀粲妻]"@zh .
