<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#壶寿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "长安所署冀州牧。袁绍军入朝歌鹿场山苍岩谷讨于毒，围攻五日，破之，斩毒及寿等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙楚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙楚"@zh .
