<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙楚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙楚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙宏之子。才藻卓绝。以佐著作郎，参石苞军事。自负才气，常侮慢苞，为苞所参，遂削职数年。后王骏起用为参军，转梁令。惠帝初任冯翊太守、讨虏护军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙英> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙英"@zh .
