<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权之孙，太子孙登之子。封为吴侯。五凤元年（254）因大将军孙峻专权，欲谋诛之，事泄自杀，爵被除。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阮柯> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阮柯"@zh .
