<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阮柯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "阮坦之弟。初选为濮阳王文学，后迁领军长史，死于任上。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马亮> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马亮"@zh .
