<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "全琮之孙，全绪之子。太平二年（257），全琮妻孙鲁班得罪于吴，仪与全祎等人奔魏降，受魏官爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#殷兴> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "殷兴"@zh .
