<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#殷兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "郭马部曲。天纪三年（279）马反于广州，杀广州督虞授，任兴为广州刺史。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#介象> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "介象"@zh .
