<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#介象> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时仙人。有诸方术。吴主征象到武昌，甚敬贵之，为起宅。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#武陔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "武陔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#武陔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元夏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#武陔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#武陔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "武周子。洁身自好。先为魏大臣，后为西晋吏部尚书，又迁左仆射、右光禄大夫，开府仪同三司。卒于官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张玄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张玄"@zh .
