<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁谞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "出于役伍，与顾邵友善。后官至典军中郎。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱才> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱才"@zh .
