<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱才> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "朱治之子。为人精敏，善骑射，常侍从孙权出游。少以父任为武卫校尉，领兵随从征伐，屡有功。嗣父爵，迁偏将军，后病故。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢景> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "谢景"@zh .
