<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权黄龙元年（229），为太子宾客。赤乌四年（241），任豫章太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张南[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张南[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张南[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張南"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张南[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张南[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁熙帐下大将。建安十年春正月，太祖讨袁熙。熙大将南、焦触等叛攻熙、尚，熙、尚奔三郡乌丸。触等举其县降，封为列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张南[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "建安十年春正月，太祖征袁谭，斩之，引兵入南皮，安抚百姓。忽有一彪军来到，乃熙将南、焦触倒戈卸甲，特来投降。封为列侯。后随南征，二将欲引小舟出，夺旗鼓而还。吴将韩当、周泰出迎，南见触为当所杀，大叫赶来，隔斜里泰船出。南挺枪立于船头，两边..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁平> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁平"@zh .
