<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁汤长子，袁绍伯父。早卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#子婴> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "子婴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#子婴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子嬰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#子婴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#子婴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "秦朝嬴氏宗族。他是秦帝国第三任皇帝，也是秦朝最后一位统治者，世称“秦三世”。初称皇帝，后来改称“秦王”，在位46天，史称“秦子婴”。子婴性格仁爱且节制。秦二世胡亥被弑后。赵高迎立始皇帝嫡长孙子婴即皇帝位。其后不久，子婴依赵高建议，废帝..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#子婴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "秦朝末年人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙越> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙越"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙越> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫越"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙越> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙越> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙韶之子，孙楷之弟。韶死，越继立，官至右将军、京下督。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈就> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈就"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈就> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳就"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈就> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈就> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "从太守黄祖，建安十三年，吴主孙权攻江夏，祖令就逆以水军出战。权平北都尉吕蒙勒前锋，亲枭就首，将士乘胜，进攻其城。祖闻就死，委城走，兵追禽之。权曰：“事之克，由陈就先获也。”以蒙为横野中郎将，赐钱千万。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈就> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "从江夏太守黄祖。祖令苏飞为大将，陈就、邓龙为先锋，尽起江夏之兵迎敌。陈就、邓龙各引一队艨艟截住沔口，东吴兵至，不能骤胜。吴将甘宁、董袭、吕蒙引小船百余只破之，甘宁砍死邓龙。陈就弃船而走，急待上岸，吕蒙舍命赶到跟前，当胸一刀砍翻，祖兵大败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕通> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕通"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕通> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吕通"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕通> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕通> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕通> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "赤壁之战前，曹操俱分五色旗号，吕通为右白旗。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李覃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李覃"@zh .
