<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张雄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张雄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张雄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張雄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张雄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张雄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张郃之子。郃死，雄嗣爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯荣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯荣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯荣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "幼权"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯荣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯荣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "夏侯渊五子。从小就聪敏惠达，七岁时就能作出文章，朗诵书籍文章一日可达千言，凡过目即可记住内容。曹丕知道这件事后邀请其参加宴会。到场的宾客达百余人，每人作一份名剌，写上他们的出生籍贯和姓名字号，让他过目一遍，然后一一复述，竟然一个都没错..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张苞[董卓]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张苞[董卓]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张苞[董卓]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張苞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张苞[董卓]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张苞[董卓]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "李傕部将。后汉书注引献帝纪曰：“汜与傕将张苞、张龙谋诛傕，汜将兵夜攻傕门。候开门内汜兵，苞等烧屋，火不然。汜兵弓弩并发，矢及天子楼帷帘中。”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李立> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李立"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李立> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "建贤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李立> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李立> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操置荆州刺史。建安十三年，华容有女子忽啼呼云：“荆州将有大丧。”言语过差，县以为妖言，系狱月余，忽于狱中哭曰： “刘荆州今日死。”华谷去州数百里，即遣马吏验视，而刘表果死，县乃出之。续又歌吟曰：“不意李立为贵人。”后无几，太祖平荆州..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#廉颇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "廉颇"@zh .
