<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#来歙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#来歙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "有才力，讲信义。先事刘玄，数言事不用，以病辞。更始败，归光武，拜太中大夫。建武八年（32）袭略阳，与隗嚣军相战，有战功。十一年遭刺，遂自杀。追赠中郎将、征羌侯，谥节侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张震[张昭孙]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张震[张昭孙]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张震[张昭孙]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張震"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张震[张昭孙]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张震[张昭孙]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张昭之孙。父承死，嗣爵。后诸葛恪为孙峻所杀。震乃恪外甥，受株连而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#妫览> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "妫览"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#妫览> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "嬀覽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#妫览> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#妫览> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末，由吴郡太守盛宪举孝廉。盛宪为吴主孙权所杀，遂入吴为大都督督兵。后因谋杀孙权弟孙翊，遗族诛。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#妫览> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "妫览是丹阳督将，与郡丞戴员勾结丹阳太守孙翊的从人边洪，杀死了太守孙翊。妫览因孙翊妻徐氏貌美欲图之，徐氏为替夫报仇假意应允。密召孙翊心腹旧将孙高、傅婴二人入府计议图二贼，雪此仇辱。至晦日，徐氏先召孙、傅二人伏于密室帏幕之中，然后设祭于堂..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#屈原> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "屈原"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#屈原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "原"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#屈原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#屈原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "屈瑕的后代。屈原早年受楚怀王信任，先后任三闾大夫、左徒，常与怀王商议国事，参与法律的制定。同时主持外交事务。主张楚国与齐国联合，共同抗衡秦国。在屈原努力下，楚国国力有所增强。但由于自身性格耿直骄傲，加之他人谗言与排挤，屈原逐渐被楚怀王..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#屈原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "战国时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#狐忠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "狐忠"@zh .
