<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#狐忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "参军。后主建兴九年（231），受李严之遣，与督军成藩一起以运粮不继喻旨诸葛亮退兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜微> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜微"@zh .
