<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜微> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜微> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少受学于广汉任安。刘璋辟为从事，以疾去官。及先主定蜀，微常称聋，闭门不出。建兴二年，丞相亮领益州牧，选迎皆妙简旧德，微为主簿。微固辞，辇而致之。亮以微不闻人语，与之书谈，微自乞老病求归，亮答以只以德辅后主，不责以军务，其敬微如此。拜其..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜微> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀国尚书。诸葛亮伐魏，身为尚书的杜微与郭攸之、董允、费祎等内外文武官僚一百余员，同理蜀中之事。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞诩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "虞诩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞诩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "升卿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞诩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞诩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉名将。安帝时，始为朝歌（今河南省汤阴西南）长，后任怀县县令、武都太守。顺帝时，官至司隶校尉、尚书仆射、尚书令等职。虞诩一生文韬武略，战功卓著，为官清正廉明，刚正不阿。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞诩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "东汉名将，顺帝时，官至司隶校尉、尚书仆射、尚书令等职。演义中有提及此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#应绍> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "应绍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#应绍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "應劭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#应绍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#应绍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "应璩孙。永嘉中，为黄门侍郎。后被长史潘滔等诬陷，为东海王司马越所害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞氏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "虞氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "虞氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏明帝曹叡的妃子。黄初三年（222），叡为平原王，始纳虞氏为妃。叡即帝位，虞氏不得立为后，遂绌还鄴宫。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵谦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵谦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵谦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦信"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵谦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵谦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝时为司隶校尉。车师王侍子为董卓所爱，屡犯法，被他绳之以法。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴纲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴纲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴纲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吴綱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴纲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴纲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西汉长沙王吴芮十六世孙。任征东大将军诸葛诞的长史。甘露二年（257），司马昭召诸葛诞入朝，诞拒命起兵，称臣于吴，派遣他赴吴请求救兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴纲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "长史，诸葛诞的心腹。叛乱之时为请求援军而为使者赴吴。以诸葛诞之子诸葛靓为人质，并送到东吴，完成了使命。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳下惠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "柳下惠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳下惠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳下惠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "展氏，名获，字禽，春秋时期鲁国（今山东曲阜）人，是鲁孝公的儿子公子展的后裔。“柳下”是他的食邑，“惠”则是他的谥号，所以后人称他“柳下惠”。据说他又字“季”，所以有时也称“柳下季”。为官能任劳任怨，不以职位低下而卑，以贤能著称。曾评议..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳下惠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "即展获。春秋时鲁国大夫。演义中曾提及此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞子夏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庞子夏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞子夏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "龐子夏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞子夏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞子夏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "娶赵君安之女娥亲为妻。后君安为同县李寿所杀，蛾亲手刃寿，复父仇。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全怿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "全怿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全怿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "全懌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全怿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全怿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "全琮之子。太平二年五月，魏征东大将军诸葛诞以淮南之众保守寿春城，并遣将军朱成向吴称臣上疏，又遣儿子诸葛靓、长史吴纲诸牙门之子为人质入吴。东吴孙琳使全怿与全端、文钦、唐咨等步骑三万救诞。十一月，全怿兄全绪之子祎、仪携全怿母奔降于魏。十二..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全怿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "太平二年五月，魏征东大将军诸葛诞以淮南之众保守寿春城，并遣儿子诸葛靓为人质入吴。东吴孙琳使全怿与全端为大将，引文钦、唐咨、于诠等起兵七万救诞，却屡为魏军所败。全怿、全端与文钦先入寿春为助。后全端之子全祎降魏，并修书劝父同降。全怿得书后..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#位宫> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "位宫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#位宫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "位宫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#位宫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#位宫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时高句丽王。父伊夷模死后，立为王。因出生对能开日视人，似其曾祖宫，故取名位宫，亦称宫。有勇力，善骑射。魏明帝景初二年（238），曾派兵数千增援魏太尉司马懿，进攻辽东公孙渊。齐王芳正始三年（242），攻魏西安平；五年，为魏幽州刺史母..."@zh .
