<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙秀[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙秀[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "伏波将军。祖匡，吴大帝之四弟，乌程侯。父泰，吴长水校尉。秀初为前将军、夏口督。秀公室至亲，握兵在外，吴主孙皓意不能平。建衡二年，皓遣何定将五千人至夏口猎。先是，民间佥言秀当见图，而定远猎，秀遂惊，夜将妻子亲兵数百人奔晋。晋以秀为骠骑将..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙秀[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "秀为吴宗室，投晋。及吴平，群臣毕贺，秀退朝，向南而哭曰：“昔讨逆壮年，以一校尉创立基业；今孙皓举江南而弃之！悠悠苍天，此何人哉！”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘景宗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘景宗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘景宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉景宗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘景宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘景宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "山阳太守，佗别传中记载：人有在青龙中见山阳太守广陵刘景宗，景宗说中平日数见华佗，其治病手脉之候，其验若神。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#能臣氐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "能臣氐"@zh .
