<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐璜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "宦官。桓帝时为中常侍，以诛梁冀功封武原侯。与单超、左琯、具瑗、唐衡同日而封，世谓之“五侯”。璜恃宠骄横，天下谓之“徐卧虎“。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐璜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司空曹操，祖父中常侍腾，与左棺、徐璜并作妖孽，饕餮放横，伤化虐民。"@zh .
