<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王同[乌丸]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王同[乌丸]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "乌丸将。初附魏，为归义侯。鲜卑王轲比能反，同、王寄等随之反。鲜卑大人步度根、泄归泥等与轲比能为隙，将部落三万馀家诣郡附塞。敕令还击比能，杀比能弟苴罗侯，及叛乌丸同、王寄等，大结怨雠。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭表> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭表"@zh .
