<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵正> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "亮卒于敌场。仪既领军还，又诛讨延，自以为功勋至大，宜当代亮秉政，呼都尉赵正以周易筮之，卦得家人，默然不悦。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范蠡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "范蠡"@zh .
