<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李延[袁绍]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李延[袁绍]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李延[袁绍]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李延"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李延[袁绍]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李延[袁绍]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末官吏。初平中，任袁绍的豫州从事，为董卓俘获，煮死。另外华佗传中记载，治愈疾病的一个东汉府吏也叫李延，不再单独记录。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙综> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙综"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙综> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫綜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙综> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙综> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "在公孙渊手下任郎中令。曾奉渊命，与校尉宿舒一起以甘言厚礼诱骗吴军。吴使张弥、许晏等四百余人至，悉为渊所获。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沐并> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "沐并"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沐并> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "德信"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沐并> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沐并> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少孤苦，袁绍父子时，始为名吏。后曹操召署军谋掾。黄初中，为成皋令，坐罪免官。正始中，复为三府长史。出为济阴太守，后召为议郎。嘉平中，病死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左夫人> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "左夫人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "左夫人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "江表传记载为三国时吴将领张布之大女。初嫁冯纯，以貌美为孙皓所夺，拜为左夫人。三国志中记载为左夫人王氏，建衡二年（270）卒。根据描述当为同一个人。及左夫人死，孙皓十分悲伤，整天都在哭，几个月都没有出外露面，以至于民间传闻说孙皓已死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阮武> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阮武"@zh .
