<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阮武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阮武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "阮谌之子。阔达博通，官至清河太守。"@zh .
