<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱整> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏正始中任黄门侍郎，入晋后为尚书。太康中多次参与议朝仪新礼，官至尚书右仆射，封广兴侯。"@zh .
