<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢宏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢宏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾出使朝鲜，拜高句丽王宫为单于，并赐衣物珍宝。会宫受魏旨，欲执宏等。宏即缚宫使三十余人为质，宫乃谢罪，贡马数百匹。宏完成使命，乘船载马而还。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢服> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "谢服"@zh .
