<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢服> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "射援祖先，本姓谢，为将军出征。天子以谢服非令名，改为射，子孙即以射为姓。"@zh .
