<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛丰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "是三国时著名政治家、军事家诸葛亮之远祖。官至司隶校尉，以执法严明，刚直尽忠见称。诸葛丰起初因为通晓经学而作琅邪郡文学，后来御史大夫贡禹征命诸葛丰为他的属官，后又举荐他为侍御史。汉元帝时，升诸葛丰为司隶校尉。因为诸葛丰执法严谨，敢于与犯..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛丰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙虑[孙权子]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙虑[孙权子]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙虑[孙权子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子智"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙虑[孙权子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙虑[孙权子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "大帝子，宣太子登弟也。少敏惠有才艺，权器爱之。黄武七年，封建昌侯。后二年，丞相雍等奏虑性聪体达，所尚日新，比方近汉，宜进爵称王，权未许。久之，尚书仆射存上疏，权乃许之，于是假节开府，治半州。虑以皇子之尊，富于春秋，远近嫌其不能留意。及..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵晔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵晔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵晔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "长君"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵晔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵晔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉学者。少为县吏，奉命迎督邮，他以为耻辱，遂弃车马而去。后拜杜抚学《韩诗》，通晓诗意。后举有道，卒于家。著有《吴越春秋》等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琮[刘禅子]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘琮[刘禅子]"@zh .
