<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙璠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权之孙，太子孙登子。早夭。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘威> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘威"@zh .
