<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘威> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝时父为豫州刺史，病亡，遂代职。后因叔父刘勋犯罪，连坐免官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘伶> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘伶"@zh .
