<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘伶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "“竹林七贤”之一，曾为建威参军。晋武帝时因为强调无为而治而被罢免。他对司马氏的统治不满、反对虚伪礼教。为避免迫害，他经常装醉、行为放荡，最后得以善终。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#芮玄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "芮玄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#芮玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文表"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#芮玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#芮玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴初，其兄芮良死，率其兵，拜奋武中郎将，以功封凓阳侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘纂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘纂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘纂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉纂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘纂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘纂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "车骑将军，历仕吴大帝孙权至末帝孙皓。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴徽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "裴徽"@zh .
