<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴徽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴徽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "裴潜弟。高才远度，善言玄理。时傅嘏善名理，荀粲尚玄，常相争不让，徽于二家之间，释二家之义，通彼此之怀，常使两情皆得。仕至冀州刺史。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜密> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜密"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜密> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "周甫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜密> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜密> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "历代郡太守、太山太守、北海相，对宦官子弟为官作恶的，皆加收捕。后为尚书令，迁河南尹，转太仆。遭党锢之祸免官，与李膺齐名，时称“李杜”。灵帝时，太傅陈蕃辅政，他复为太仆。党锢之祸再起，被迫自杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习忠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "习忠"@zh .
