<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "官至尚书郎。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘石> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘石"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘石> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉石"@zh .
