<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘石> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末黄巾农民大起义首领之一。活动于今河北与河南交界的地区，后为袁绍所破。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱损> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱损"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱损> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "朱損"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱损> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱损> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "朱据之子。会稽王孙亮时，领兵任外部督，遭全公主孙鲁班诬陷，孙亮令丁奉将其杀死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王双[讨吴]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王双[讨吴]"@zh .
