<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王双[讨吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王双[讨吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴孙权黄武元年（222），魏大司马曹仁率军攻吴，双随之。为吴将朱恒所败，双被俘获。此王双与对蜀国作战的王双不是一个人。"@zh .
