<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛则> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛则> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛则> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "受程武计，引三万军埋伏于右，围困赵云。后拦住张苞道路，被苞斩首。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹整> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹整"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹整> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹整"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹整> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹整> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操之子。奉从叔父曹绍后。建安二十二年（217），封郿侯。二十三年卒。魏黄初二年（221）追进爵，谥曰戴公。以彭城王曹据子曹范奉其后。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀俣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀俣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀俣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔倩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀俣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀俣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "荀彧子。曾任东郡太守。官至御史中丞，早卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李合> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李合"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李合> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "庶姜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李合> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李合> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "长于内学，关右（今陕西甘肃一带）知名。自称有孔子《玉版》，天子历数，虽百世可知。曾预言曹操定天下，神之所命，以应天人之位。后病死于邺。三国志中有记载“武都李庶姜合羁旅汉中”，现今许多版本在断句时，误将“李庶”和“姜合”断为两人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庆忌> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庆忌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庆忌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "慶忌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庆忌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庆忌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴王僚之子，吴国勇士。阖闾指庆忌之勇，世所闻也。筋骨果劲，万人莫当。走追奔兽，手接飞鸟，骨腾肉飞，拊膝数百里。最后被阖闾派遣的刺客要离所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庆忌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "春秋时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王虔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王虔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王虔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "恭祖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王虔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王虔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "王恂弟。以功干见称。官卫尉、平东将军、光禄勋，直至尚书。封安寿亭侯。后为刘聪所害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#嵇昭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "嵇昭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#嵇昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子远"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#嵇昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#嵇昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "嵇康之父。官至治书侍御史。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧舜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "臧舜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧舜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "太伯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧舜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧舜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "臧霸之子。时人称他才颖条畅，识赞时宜。官散骑常侍。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盗跖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "盗跖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盗跖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盗跖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "原名展雄，又名柳下跖、柳展雄，相传是当时贤臣柳下惠的弟弟，为鲁孝公的儿子公子展的后裔，因以展为姓。是春秋战国之际奴隶起义领袖。一作蹠，先秦典籍中常称之为“盗跖”、“桀跖”。活动年代可能稍后于墨子而先于孟子。据传说，曾带领奴隶九千与贵族..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盗跖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "是春秋战国之际奴隶起义领袖。演义中曾提及此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞忠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "虞忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "世方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虞翻第五子。贞固干事，好识人物。仕至宜都太守。晋征吴，忠坚守不下，城溃被害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙阿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙阿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙阿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫阿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙阿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙阿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太庙歌手。《列异传》载：蒋济亡子托梦其母，言自己在地下为泰山伍伯，憔悴困辱，而太庙西歌手孙阿已被召为泰山令，请父母求孙阿给自己谋一好职。蒋济夫妇遂找到孙阿，告以梦中之事。阿不以将死为忧，反以即为泰山令而喜。阿死后月余，蒋济亡子果托梦告..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘钦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘钦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉欽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏兴太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭都> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭都"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭都> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郭都"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭都> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭都> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "文德郭皇后之弟，早卒。魏明帝青龙四年（236），追封谥为武城亭孝侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#和洽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "和洽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#和洽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "阳士"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#和洽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#和洽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "举孝廉，大将军辟，皆不就。袁绍在冀州，遣使迎汝南士大夫。洽独以“冀州土平民强，英桀所利，四战之地。本初乘资，虽能强大，然雄豪方起，全未可必也。荆州刘表无他远志，爱人乐士，土地险阻，山夷民弱，易依倚也”。遂与亲旧俱南从表，表以上客待之。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#和洽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉献帝朝中侍中。与侍中王粲、杜袭、卫凯四人，议欲尊曹操为魏王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#山曜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "山曜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#山曜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "山曜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#山曜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#山曜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "宛句县令。竹林七贤山涛的父亲。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柏孝长> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "柏孝长"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柏孝长> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "柏孝長"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柏孝长> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柏孝长> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉西鄂功曹。建安六年（201）刘表攻西鄂（今河南南阳南部），柏孝长闻兵攻声，恐惧，入室闭户，牵被覆头。相攻半日，稍敢出面。其明，侧立而听。二日，往出户问消息。至四五日，乃更负楯亲斗。贪生怕死，为世人嘲笑。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#定州太守> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "定州太守"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#定州太守> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "定州太守"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#定州太守> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#定州太守> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国演义中张飞怒打督邮出现的特定虚拟人物。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#定州太守> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "张飞怒打督邮后，刘备兄弟三人亡命下野，督邮回报，定州太守申文省府，差人捕捉刘备。另外这里的定州并不是三国时期的地名，当时刘备所处安喜县的上级是中山国，是郡一级的行政单位。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#斯从> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "斯从"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#斯从> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "斯從"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#斯从> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#斯从> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝初为县吏，轻侠为奸，为县长贺齐所斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#令狐景> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "令狐景"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#令狐景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "令狐景"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#令狐景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#令狐景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "清商令。因谏曹芳肆行昏淫，受灼刑，身体皆烂。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张俊> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张俊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張俊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建衡元年（269）为豫章太守。二年，孙皓左夫人王氏卒，皓朝夕哭临，数月不出，民间或谓皓死，讹言孙奋与上虞侯奉当有立者。奋母仲姬墓在豫章，俊疑其或然，扫除坟茔。皓闻之，车裂俊，夷三族。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毕子礼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "毕子礼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毕子礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "畢子禮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毕子礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毕子礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安中为典农校尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王羡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王羡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王羡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王羡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王羡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王羡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "世语曰：伟字公衡。伟子长武，有宠风，年二十四，为大将军掾。高贵乡公之难，以掾守阊阖掖门，司马文王弟安阳亭侯干欲入。干妃，伟妹也。长武谓干曰：“此门近，公且来，无有入者，可从东掖门。”干遂从之。文王问干入何迟，干言其故。参军王羡亦不得入..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张松[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张松[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张松[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張鬆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张松[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张松[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "玄莬郡部中，告发了秦旦的起义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿苞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "耿苞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿苞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "耿苞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿苞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿苞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任主簿。绍欲称帝，暗使苞劝己称帝自立，又将此事示军府将吏，以观众意。众人皆以为苞言妖妄宜诛，绍乃杀苞以自解。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#琐奴> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "琐奴"@zh .
