<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍丹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍丹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "鲍信父。官至少府、侍中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#满长武> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "满长武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#满长武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "滿長武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#满长武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#满长武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "满伟子。身材长大，年二十四，为大将军掾。遭王羡谄毁，为司马师所恨，被考讯杖死，时人以为冤屈。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁廙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "丁廙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁廙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "敬礼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁廙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁廙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏黄门侍郎。父冲，宿与太祖亲善，时随乘舆。廙少有才姿，博学洽闻。初辟公府，建安中为黄门侍郎。廙尝劝太祖立植为嗣，太祖虽深善其言，卒未纳用。文帝即王位，诛廙、兄仪并其男口。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁廙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏文士。与临淄侯曹植善，太祖薨，植不奔丧，与廙兄弟烂醉。后褚皆缚之，载于车上。文帝下令，先将丁仪、丁廙等尽行诛戳。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王起> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王起"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王起> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王起"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王起> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王起> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "咸熙元年八月，自魏平蜀之后，吴国敌寇聚兵进逼永安，于魏派遣荆州、豫州各军互相呼应前去救援之战中，癸巳日，王起传贾辅话以振奋军心，有功。朝廷任命散将军王起为部曲将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#五习> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "五习"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#五习> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "五習"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#五习> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#五习> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "原本是郭汜的部将，曾经奉郭汜的指令焚烧学舍以威逼汉献帝。此后在郿县反叛郭汜，并率军袭杀了郭汜。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#五习> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中为伍习。却说曹操引军回许都，人报段煨杀了李傕，伍习杀了郭汜，将头来献。段煨并将李傕合族老小二百余口，活解入许都。操令分于各门处斩，传首号令。人民称快。天子升殿，会集文武，作太平筵宴。封段煨为荡寇将军，伍习为殄虏将军，各引兵镇守长安。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士武> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "士武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "士武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "士燮之弟，在士燮表荐下任南海太守，早卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李膺[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李膺[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李膺[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李膺"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李膺[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李膺[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "青龙中，任庐江太守。"@zh .
