<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "鲍邵子。邵卒，融嗣为新都亭侯。"@zh .
