<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏轼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "北宋文学家、书画家。眉州眉山（今四川）人。一生仕途坎坷，学识渊博，天资极高，诗文书画皆精。与欧阳修并称欧苏，为“唐宋八大家”之一。著有《苏东坡全集》和《东坡乐府》等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏轼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "北宋文学家、书画家。三国演义中有提及此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛莹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "薛莹"@zh .
