<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张存> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "以荆州从事随刘备入蜀，为广汉太守。存素不服庞统，统中箭卒，刘备发言嘉叹，存不以为然，被免官。顷之，病卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙登[吴]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙登[吴]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙登[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子高"@zh .
