<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#向充> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "向宠之弟。为中书郎时，上表议立诸葛亮庙于沔阳，为后主刘禅接受。后任射声校尉尚书，协助大将军姜维。后降魏，授梓橦太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郝普> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郝普"@zh .
