<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉中太守李密母。密父早亡，何氏改嫁。密由祖母刘氏抚养成人。"@zh .
