<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阳逵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十七年（212），韩遂败于关中，回到西平，三年后病死。逵与田乐等就斩遂头，送至曹操，操因表赐爵关内侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋舒> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蒋舒"@zh .
