<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "甘露二年（257），司马昭召驻扎寿春的征东大将军诸葛诞入朝。诸葛诞拒命起兵，派他前去吴国上疏称臣。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#爰倩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "爰倩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#爰倩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "君幼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#爰倩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#爰倩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "爰邵少子。宽厚有器局，勤于当世，历位冀州刺史、太子右卫率。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏[张鲁女]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张氏[张鲁女]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏[张鲁女]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏[张鲁女]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏[张鲁女]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张鲁女儿。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏[张鲁女]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "马超归降张鲁后，张鲁欲把女儿嫁给马超，被部将杨柏拦阻。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐干> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐干"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伟长"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "“建安七子”之一。擅长诗赋。由曹操任为司空军谋祭酒掾属，转五官中郎将文学。所作文辞甚为曹丕赞赏。著《中论》，认为“凡学者大义为先，物名为后，大义举而物从之”。反对流行的训诂章句之学。另有文集，已散佚，后人辑有《徐伟长集》。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石德林> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "石德林"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石德林> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "石德林"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石德林> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石德林> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝建安初，拜长安宿儒栾文博为师，治《诗》、《书》。十六年（211），关中乱，南入汉中，不治产业，常读《老子》五千文及诸内书。二十五年（220），还长安，独居穷巷小屋，人与之衣食，不肯取，号之曰寒贫。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙据> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙据"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙据> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫據"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙据> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙据> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙綝之弟。吴帝孙亮亲政，綝称疾不朝，而以其弟分屯诸营，控制局势。孙綝废亮后，迎立孙休为帝，綝及其四弟孙恩、孙据、孙干、孙闿皆任要职，握重兵，出现了“一门五侯”的局面。孙据自威远将军迁右将军，封县侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙据> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "（孙亮）虽然聪明，却被孙綝把持，不能主张，綝令弟威远将军孙据入苍龙宿卫，武卫将军孙恩、偏将军孙干、长水校尉孙闿分屯诸营。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马遵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马遵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "馬遵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "遵及诸官属随雍州刺史郭淮偶自西至洛门案行，会闻诸葛亮已到祁山，淮顾遵曰：“是欲不善！”遂驱东还上邽。遵念所治冀县界在西偏，又恐吏民乐乱，遂亦随淮去。时维谓遵曰：“明府当还冀。”遵谓维等曰：“卿诸人复信，皆贼也。”各自行。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀相诸葛亮伐魏，遵用姜维计败之。后中亮离间之计，误以维投蜀，关城拒之，维遂降蜀。后疑梁绪、尹赏与姜维结连，欲暗害之，二人献城，引蜀军入，楙、遵惊慌，引数百人出西门，弃城投羌胡城而去。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟劭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "钟劭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟劭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鍾劭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟劭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟劭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "钟繇弟子。文帝时，封为列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张隐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张隐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张隐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張隱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张隐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张隐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与刘表、薛郁等八人为八交，或谓之八顾。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辟蹏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "辟蹏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辟蹏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "辟蹏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辟蹏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辟蹏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "羌族首领。黄初年间，蹄反于安定。旋被郭淮平息。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙仲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙仲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙仲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫仲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙仲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙仲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙仲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "黄巾余党。黄巾军败，仲、赵弘、韩忠，聚众数万，望风烧劫，称与张角报仇。朝廷命朱儁以得胜之师讨之。仲等据宛城，儁引军围城数日。仲引贼突出北门，正迎刘备，无心恋战，只待奔逃。备张弓一箭，正中仲，翻身落马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞光> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "虞光"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "虞光"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虞翻的高祖父。少治孟氏《易》。曾任零陵（治今湖南零陵）太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王湛> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王湛"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王湛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "处冲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王湛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王湛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "王昶子。少有识度，寡言语，读《周易》剖析玄理，微妙有奇趣。历官太子洗马、尚书郎、太子中庶子，出为汝南内史。惠帝元康五年（295）卒，年四十七。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张景明> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张景明"@zh .
