<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙邻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "征虏将军、都亭侯孙贲之子。九岁时代领豫章太守，进封都乡侯。在郡二十年，讨平叛贼，功绩卓著。后召还武昌，为绕帐督。曾劝太常潘濬宽释舒燮。迁夏口沔中督、威远将军。赤乌十二年（249）卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王业[西晋]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王业[西晋]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王业[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王業"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王业[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王业[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任散骑常侍。后入晋为中护军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王业[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "髦归后宫，召侍中王沈、尚书王经、散骑常侍王业三人入内计议。髦泣曰：“司马昭将怀篡逆，人所共知。朕不能坐受废辱。卿等可助朕讨之！”王经奏曰：“不可。昔鲁昭公不忍季氏，败走失国。今重权已归司马氏久矣，内外公卿不顾顺逆之理，阿附奸贼，非一人..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#岑璧> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "岑璧"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#岑璧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "岑璧"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#岑璧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#岑璧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#岑璧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁谭部将。袁绍亡，长子谭与幼子尚相攻，尚败走。谭与郭图再议进兵，令璧为将，领兵前来。尚自引兵出冀州。两阵对圆，旗鼓相望。璧出骂阵；尚欲自战，大将吕旷，拍马舞刀，来战璧。二将战无数合，旷斩璧于马下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏育[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏育[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏育[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "夏育"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏育[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏育[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "灵帝时任护乌丸校尉。熹平六年（178）与破鲜卑中郎将田晏、匈奴中郎将臧旻一起出击鲜卑，为檀石槐所败，兵马还者仅十分之一。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦旦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "秦旦"@zh .
