<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦旦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦旦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "嘉禾元年（233）魏辽东太守公孙渊向孙权称臣，次年权即遣张弥、许晏等使辽东，旦亦在其中。及至辽东，公孙渊已复降魏，为图张、许，先分其众，旦与黄疆等人被置玄菟郡。旦遂与疆等谋反，事泄逾城而逃。历尽千辛万苦，得还吴都。孙权拜旦为校尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍成> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲍成"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鮑成"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国京兆新丰百姓。献帝兴平中，关中乱，人相食。成家贫，采莲蓬为生。有吃人赋掠其母而去，欲煮以为食。成等不敢追夺，其兄鲍出独追得还。"@zh .
