<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴押狱妻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "华佗临死时，将其医学著作《青囊书》交付给吴押狱，吴押狱的妻子认为华佗如此的医术，却落得悲惨结局，不同意吴押狱学医，因此将书烧毁。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜默> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜默"@zh .
