<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜默> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少与荀寓、裴楷、王戎俱有名于京师。仕晋，历吏部郎、卫尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#脂习> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "脂习"@zh .
