<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭冲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任代郡太守。晋初为扶风王骏官属，条诸葛亮五事，以为诸葛亮“权智英略，有踰管、晏”。"@zh .
