<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#殷模> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾为校尉，有过，孙权下议其罪，诸葛瑾为之说情，遂获免。"@zh .
