<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱熹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "南宋时儒学大师，字元晦、一字仲晦，号晦庵、晦翁、考亭先生、云谷老人、沧洲病叟、逆翁。祖籍南宋江南东路徽州府婺源县（今江西省婺源），出生于南剑州尤溪。19岁进士及第，曾任荆湖南路安抚使，仕至宝文阁待制。为政期间，申敕令、惩奸吏、治绩显赫..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱熹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "南宋时儒学大师，三国演义在评判黄权投降魏国时，有提及此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#素利> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "素利"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#素利> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "素利"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#素利> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#素利> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "（？-228）三国时东部鲜卑首领之一。曾与小种鲜卑首领轲比能及步度根部互相攻击，为汉乌丸校尉田豫劝和。文帝时封素利为归义王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹胤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹胤"@zh .
