<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏文帝曹丕妃。出身望族，性狷急不婉顺，因数次触怒曹丕而被遣出宫。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘劭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘劭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘劭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孔才"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘劭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘劭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "学者。建安中，为计吏，诣许。太史上言：“正旦当日蚀。”劭时在尚书令荀彧所，坐者数十人，或云当废朝，或云宜卻会。劭言推术谬误也，彧善其言。敕朝会如旧，日亦不蚀。御史大夫郗虑辟劭，会虑免，拜太子舍人，迁秘书郎。黄初中，为尚书郎、散骑侍郎。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘劭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "明帝闻吴分兵三路而来，亦起兵三路迎之：令劭引兵救江夏，田豫引兵救襄阳，帝自与满宠率大军救合淝。后擒得吴军文书，知吴将陆逊计策，乃令劭谨防吴后兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘熙[刘协子]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘熙[刘协子]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘熙[刘协子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉熙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘熙[刘协子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘熙[刘协子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝刘协之子，建安十七年（212），立为济阴王。后献帝禅位于魏，熙随之降为列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙熙[孙贲子]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙熙[孙贲子]"@zh .
