<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞和> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞和> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "按照《韩非子·和氏篇》记载：卞和在荆山发现一块石头，认定内藏美玉，就献给楚厉王，楚厉王叫玉匠鉴定此玉，玉匠说：“这是石头。”楚厉王就以欺君之罪，砍掉卞和的左脚。楚厉王驾崩，楚武王即位。卞和跛着脚再次去献玉，不料被楚武王砍掉右脚。楚文王..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞和> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "战国时期人。"@zh .
