<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王直> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王直> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "戏口守将。黄武二年（223），为另一守将晋宗所杀。宗叛降魏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛夏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "薛夏"@zh .
