<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毌丘毅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毌丘毅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "都尉。灵帝末，大将军何进遣毅诣丹杨募兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程延> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "程延"@zh .
