<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "程昱少子。文帝时以昱功封列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李术> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李术"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李术> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李術"@zh .
