<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许猛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "有治理才学，元康中为幽州刺史。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞凤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "虞凤"@zh .
