<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#龚景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#龚景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "东汉末年青州太守。城为黄巾军所围，龚景乃向刘焉求救。焉遣刘备引军相救，龚景引兵出城夹击，大胜。青州之围遂解。"@zh .
