<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华佗徒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国演义中的虚构人物，为孙策治伤。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华佗徒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙策遇刺负伤，让人寻找华佗医治，不想华佗已往中原去了，只有徒弟在吴，为其治伤。"@zh .
