<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹赞[曹林子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹赞[曹林子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "沛王曹林之子。建安二十年，以西乡侯玹无子而卒，命赞袭玹爵邑。赞亦早卒。魏太和六年（232），追谥赞曰西乡哀侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙登[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙登[魏]"@zh .
