<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贝羽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末官吏。任华容长。刘表初至荆州任刺史，他拥兵作乱。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐盛> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "唐盛"@zh .
