<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐盛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "监军使者，曾与钟离徇戍守西陵。因反对钟离徇筑城信陵，致晋军抢先，吴军受到威胁。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁谧> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "丁谧"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁谧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦靖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁谧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁谧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "谧少不肯交游，但博观书传。为人沈毅，颇有才略。太和中，常住邺，借人空屋，居其中。而诸王亦欲借之，不知谧已得，直开门入。谧望见王，交脚卧而不起，而呼其奴客曰：“此何等人？促呵使去。”王怒其无礼，还具上言。明帝收谧，系鄴狱，以其功臣子，原..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁谧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "大将军曹爽门客。随爽侍奉魏主曹芳，出城谒明帝墓，就去畋猎。司马懿就夺爽权。及爽灭，谧等亦伏诛，夷三族。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高皇后> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "高皇後"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹腾夫人。明帝太和三年（229），追尊高祖大长秋曰高皇帝，夫人吴氏曰高皇后。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严敬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "严敬"@zh .
