<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#眭元进> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "绍与曹公战。建安五年，曹公火烧乌巢，尽燔其粮谷宝货，斩督将元进、骑督韩莒子、吕威璜、赵叡等首。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#眭元进> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "大将军、冀州牧袁绍督将。绍与曹公战，以元进、韩莒子、吕威璜、赵睿等随大将淳于琼引二万人马，守乌巢。曹公火烧乌巢，元进、赵睿运粮方回，见屯上火起，急来救应，为曹军所败，二将抵敌不住，皆被曹军所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王沈> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王沈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王沈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "处道"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王沈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王沈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父王机，魏东郡太守。沈少孤，养于从叔司空昶，事昶如父。奉继母寡嫂以孝义称。好书，善属文。大将军曹爽辟为掾，累迁中书门下侍郎。及爽诛，以故吏免。后起为治书侍御史，转秘书监。正元中，迁散骑常侍、侍中，典著作。与荀顗、阮籍共撰《魏书》，多为..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王沈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司马文王当权，高贵乡公召侍中沈、尚书王经、散骑常侍王业三人，入内计议。公欲亲讨文王，沈、业恐取灭族之祸，欲往文王府下出首，劝经同往，经不从，二人自去。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王冲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王冲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王冲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王衝"@zh .
