<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王冲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "原为蜀牙门将，统属江州督李严，后降魏，任乐陵太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周札> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周札"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周札> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宣季"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周札> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周札> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "周处子。有才力。元帝中兴之初，得宠。凶淫放恣，为百姓所恨。明帝太宁中，为王敦所杀。"@zh .
