<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#季雍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "公孙瓒属下鄃县令。初从袁绍，后雍以鄃叛绍而降公孙瓒，瓒遣兵卫之。绍遣朱灵攻之，力战拔之，生擒雍。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#常俱> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "常俱"@zh .
