<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#常俱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴国人。曾起兵反抗朝廷。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张音> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张音"@zh .
