<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张音> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安二十五年（220）为使持节、行御史大夫事、太常。献帝禅位于曹丕，由音奉玺绶成礼。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程咨> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "程咨"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程咨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "程咨"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程咨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程咨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "程普之子。孙权称帝，追论普功，封咨为亭侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程咨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "程咨乃是程普长子，随父从军。程普年长于周瑜，今瑜爵居其上，心中不乐，是日乃托病不出，令程咨自代。程咨见父，说周瑜调兵，动止有法。普叹服。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊友> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "樊友"@zh .
