<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊友> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊友> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时蜀宜都太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍素> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲍素"@zh .
