<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍素> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "大将军姜维北伐，令素屯兵于祁山谷口，以惑魏军。维尽率大兵，望南安进发。然计为魏将邓艾所破，祁山寨已破，素阵亡，全寨人马皆退回汉中去了。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑冲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑冲"@zh .
