<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑冲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑冲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "出身寒微，博究儒术。初为魏文帝文学，累迁尚书郎、陈留太守。大将军曹爽引为从事中郎，累迁至光禄勋，后又拜司空、司徒、太保等，封寿光侯。朝中定礼仪律令，皆先咨之。入晋，拜太傅，进爵为公。后屡表退休，避不视事。泰始十年（274）卒。与何晏等..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许国> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "许国"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许国> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "許國"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许国> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许国> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初仕于蜀。蜀亡后，罗宪荐之于晋武帝，因得叙用。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于圭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "于圭"@zh .
