<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于圭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏将于禁子，嗣封益寿亭侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李膺[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李膺[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李膺[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元礼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李膺[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李膺[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "桓帝时为司隶校尉，与太学生首领郭泰等结交，反对宦官专权，被称为“天下楷模”。延熹九年（166），宦官诬以结党诽谤朝廷之罪，捕入狱，释放后禁锢终身。灵帝立，外戚窦武执政，又任长安少府，因与陈蕃等谋诛宦官失败，死于狱中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贺纯> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "贺纯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贺纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "賀純"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贺纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贺纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "儒学有重名。汉安帝时为侍中、江夏太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#仲长统> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "仲长统"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#仲长统> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公理"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#仲长统> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#仲长统> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "政论家、哲学家。汉尚书郎。少好学，博涉书记，赡于文辞。年二十余，游学青、徐、并、冀之间，与交者多异之。并州刺史高干素贵有名，招致四方游士，多归焉。统过干，干善待遇之，访以世事。统谓干曰：“君有雄志而无雄才，好士而不能择人，所以为君深戒..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#大懿皇后> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "大懿皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#大懿皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "大懿皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#大懿皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#大懿皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权妻。孙和母。王卢九之女。王氏被选入宫，到黄武年间得到孙权宠幸，并且诞下三子孙和及四子孙霸。当时王氏是继孙权另一妻子步夫人以后最受宠的一位妃嫔。赤乌元年(238年)，步氏逝世。又赤乌五年(242年)，孙权立孙和为太子，并且有意让王氏..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#大懿皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "却说吴主孙权先有太子孙登，乃徐夫人所生，于吴赤乌四年身亡，遂立次子孙和为太子，乃琅琊王夫人所生。和因与全公主不睦，被公主所谮，权废之。和忧恨而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱纪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱纪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "朱紀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "朱治子。孙权嫁以孙策之女，以校尉领兵口。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔谅[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "崔谅[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔谅[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "崔諒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔谅[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔谅[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔谅[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏安定太守。蜀攻魏，谅在城中闻蜀兵围了南安，困住夏侯楙，十分慌惧，即点军马约共四千，守住城池。中蜀相诸葛亮计，调兵救南安。后为蜀将关兴、张苞截杀。谅奔回安定，城又为蜀将魏延所取。谅慌投天水郡来，行不到一程，蜀相亮亲截之。谅诈降，欲与杨..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞兰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卞兰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "卞蘭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏武帝曹操卞皇后弟卞秉子。少有才学，为奉车都尉、游击将军，加散骑常侍，袭父爵为开阳侯。原有文集二卷，已佚。今存《赞述太子赋》、《许昌宫赋》等四篇，见于《全三国文》。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张登> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张登"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张登> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張登"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张登> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张登> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安末为县主簿，值黑山农民起义军围郡，与县长王雋帅兵赴救，交战后吏兵散走，雋将见害，赖登相救而保全性命。守长夏逸，为督邮所枉，登身受考掠，理逸之罪。黄初初，任太官令。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄皇后> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "甄皇后"@zh .
