<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "齐王曹芳皇后。与甄俨兄妹之称。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梅颐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "梅颐"@zh .
