<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐庶母> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐庶母"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐庶母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐庶母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "徐庶母亲。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐庶母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "徐庶帮助刘备击败曹军，曹操为了得到徐庶，先将徐母迎到许昌，然后模仿徐母笔迹至书与徐庶，迫使徐庶投奔了曹操，徐母见到徐庶后愤然自尽。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹楷[曹彰子]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹楷[曹彰子]"@zh .
