<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹楷[曹彰子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹楷[曹彰子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏王公。任城王彰之子。黄初四年（223）彰卒，楷嗣爵，赐封中牟。五年，改封任城县。太和六年（232），复改封任城国。青龙三年（235），坐私遣官属诣中尚方作禁物，削户邑。正始七年，徙封济南。入晋后，为崇化少府。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙瑾[吴]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙瑾[吴]"@zh .
