<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙瑾[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙皓之子。建衡元年（269）立为太子，封淮阳、东平王。吴亡后，晋拜瑾为中郎。"@zh .
