<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董卓母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "董卓被谋诛时，其母年逾九十，也一并被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董卓母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "王允密谋诛杀董卓，骗董卓进京继位，其母有不详预感，董卓被杀，其母亦被杀。"@zh .
