<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司马昭部下。诸葛诞叛，昭用钟会计，埋伏众军，诱敌深入。令俊引车仗牛马驴骡，装载赏军之物，四面聚集于阵中，如敌来则弃之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈本> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈本"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈本> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "休元"@zh .
