<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈本> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陈矫长子。假节都督河北诸军事，历位郡守、九卿，官至镇北将军。所在操纲领，举大体，能使下属尽力。（据徐震锷《世说新语校笺》）"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王寄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王寄"@zh .
