<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王寄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "乌丸归义侯。为鲜卑大人步度根、泄归泥等所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#射坚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "射坚"@zh .
