<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王金> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "延康元年（220），聚众在南海起事，为孙权将吕岱所擒，处斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙峻> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙峻"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子远"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙坚弟静之曾孙也。孙恭独子。少便弓马，精果胆决。孙权末，徙武卫都尉，为侍中。权临薨，受遗辅政，领武卫将军，故典宿卫，封都乡侯。太元元年，权寝疾，诣都，留为太常，与诸葛恪等俱受遗诏辅政。孙亮即位，加卫将军。峻既诛诸葛恪，迁丞相大将军，督..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初为诸葛恪夺军权，峻暗恨之。恪专权，峻与滕胤谋，于酒席诛恪，以功封丞相、大将军。后病死，以后事付孙綝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左咸> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "左咸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左咸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "左鹹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左咸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左咸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左咸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "当关羽被孙权所擒时，誓死不降，大骂孙权。孙权有意招降之，却被左咸一句话而下了决心，最终处死了关羽、关平父子。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王仪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王仪"@zh .
