<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "王修子。字朱表，司马昭部下司马。齐王芳嘉平五年（253），东关之役败后，为司马昭所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘祥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘祥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘祥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉祥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘祥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘祥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘巴之父。曾为江夏太守，荡寇将军。时孙坚举兵讨董卓，以南阳太守张咨不给军粮，杀之。遂为南阳军民所恨，举兵攻之，与战，败亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡岐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "胡岐"@zh .
