<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡岐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任并州刺史。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马艾> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马艾"@zh .
