<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍子胥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "伍子胥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍子胥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子胥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍子胥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍子胥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "伍子胥之父伍奢为楚平王子建太傅，因受费无忌谗害，和其长子伍尚一同被楚平王杀害。伍子胥逃到吴国，成为吴王阖闾重臣。公元前506年，伍子胥带兵攻入楚都，掘楚平王墓，鞭尸三百，以报父兄之仇。吴国倚重伍子胥等人之谋，遂成为诸侯一霸。公元前48..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍子胥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "春秋时期楚国人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴乔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴乔"@zh .
