<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴乔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴乔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀车骑将军吴壹之孙。李雄建立成汉政权，他沦落益州，长达三十年，始终不向李雄屈服。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[徐真妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙氏[徐真妻]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[徐真妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[徐真妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[徐真妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末江东豪族孙坚妹，徐真妻。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘璝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘璝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘璝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉璝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘璝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘璝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘备攻益州，璋遣璝、冷苞、张任、邓贤等率精兵拒捍备於涪，皆破败，退保绵竹，绵竹督李严降。璝又退与璋子循守雒城。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘璝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "璋请刘备入川，其将璝等不悦。后二刘设宴，备将魏延、刘封欲乘机杀璋，璝及张任、冷苞、邓贤等御之。后备攻益州，璋遂令璝、泠苞、张任、邓贤点五万大军，星夜往守雒县拒备。四将行兵之次，璝请同往锦屏山问命於紫虚上人。所得灾运，璝信，任不从。璝数..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范方> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "范方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "范方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "公孙瓒属吏。初平中，瓒遣方将骑助兖州刺史刘岱。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盛宪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "盛宪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盛宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝章"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盛宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盛宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "器量雅伟，举孝廉，补尚书郎，稍迁吴郡太守，以疾去官。孙策平定吴、会，诛其英豪，宪素有高名，策深忌之。后为孙权所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟皓> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "钟皓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟皓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟皓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟皓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "温良笃慎，博学诗律，教授门生千余人。为郡功曹。曾九辟三府，迁南乡、林虑长，皆不就。为当世名士，李膺推崇其“至德可师”。年六十九卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华核> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "华核"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华核> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "永先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华核> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华核> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "始为上虞尉、典农都尉，以文学入为秘府郎，迁中书丞。孙皓即位，封徐陵亭侯。宝鼎二年，皓更营新宫，制度弘广，饰以珠玉，所费甚多。是时盛夏兴工，农守并废，覈上疏谏,书奏，皓不纳。后迁东观令，领右国史，覈上疏辞让。时仓廪无储，世俗滋侈，覈上疏..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华核> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "中书丞。劝谏对外采取积极策略的孙皓要慎重行事，激怒了孙皓，被赶出宫中。忧患吴国的将來，隐姓埋名。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏朗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "魏朗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "少英"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少为县吏。为报兄仇而杀乡人，亡命于陈国。从博士欲仲信学《春秋图纬》，又到太学学《五经》。为李膺等名士敬仰。历任彭城令、九真都尉、议郎、尚书、河内太守，所在有政绩。为名士八俊之一，因党锢而免官。后坐窦武事自杀。著书数篇，书名《魏子》。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟离骃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "钟离骃"@zh .
