<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#仍弩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#仍弩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时高涼一带流民首领。后为吴南海太守钟离牧讨平。"@zh .
