<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王畅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初举孝廉，不就。后拜司隶校尉，转渔阳太守，坐事免官。太尉陈蕃荐其清方公正，为尚书，又任南阳太守，有治绩。灵帝时，位至司空。畅有名于时，与李膺、荀昱、杜密等号为八俊。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#骆俊> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "骆俊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#骆俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝远"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#骆俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#骆俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "有文武才干。少为郡吏，察孝廉，补尚书郎，拜陈相。时天下大乱，群雄并起。俊保疆境，贼不敢犯。发展生产，岁获丰收。袁术军众饥困，求俊给粮。俊疾恶术，不给，寻为术所害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭建> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭建"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔始"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "明元郭皇后从弟。齐王芳时，追谥郭皇后父郭满为西都定侯，以建绍其爵。建又为镇护将军，掌宿卫。嘉平末为临晋侯。咸熙初，封临渭县公。入晋后，加特进。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缪胤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "缪胤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缪胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "休祖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缪胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缪胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "缪袭孙。初为尚书郎，后迁太弟左卫率，转魏郡太守。东海王司马越使胤与其兄播俱入长安，说河间王司马颙，迎惠帝还洛阳。迁冠军将军，南阳太守。怀帝即位，拜左卫将军，转散骑常侍、太仆卿。永嘉三年（309），为司马越所害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周术> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周术"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周术> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "周術"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周术> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周术> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝春秋曰：初，豫章太守周术病卒，刘表上诸葛玄为豫章太守，治南昌。汉朝闻周术死，遣朱皓代玄。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵宗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵宗"@zh .
