<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操子楚王彪、中山恭王兖犯交通之禁，宗代受其罪。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫演> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卫演"@zh .
