<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严匡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任曹操典农中郎将。建安二十三年（218），吉本、耿纪、韦晃等扶汉反曹，攻许昌，烧丞相长史王必营。必与匡讨斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞舒> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庞舒"@zh .
