<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞舒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吕布败于长安时，曾与妻子分散，其妻赖舒私藏，方免于难。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞舒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "布乃去投张扬，扬纳之。时庞舒在长安城中，私藏吕布妻小，送还吕布。李傕、郭汜知之，遂斩庞舒，写书与张扬，教杀吕布。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马肃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马肃"@zh .
