<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马肃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "马腾之父。典略曰：腾字寿成，马援后也。桓帝时，其父（马肃）名肃字子硕，尝为天水兰干尉。后失官，因留陇西，与羌错居。家贫无妻，遂娶羌女，生腾。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马肃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "马腾之父。演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#壹多杂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "壹多杂"@zh .
