<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#壹多杂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#壹多杂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时车师后部王。治于赖城，魏赐壹多杂守魏侍中，号大都尉，受魏王印。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#翟元> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "翟元"@zh .
