<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#武茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#武茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "武周子。官至侍中、尚书。时贵戚荀恺欲与茂交，茂拒而不答。元康元年（291），恺诬茂为杨骏党人，被诛。众人知其冤而痛惜。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#法邈> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "法邈"@zh .
