<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#法邈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "法正子。正死，赐爵关内侯。后官至奉车都尉、汉阳太守。"@zh .
