<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "任左都督，随司马懿征辽东。因秋雨连绵，劝说司马懿移营高处，被训斥。"@zh .
