<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李丰[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李丰[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李丰[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宣国"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李丰[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李丰[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父义，魏卫尉。丰识别人物，海内注意。明帝得吴降人，问江东闻中国名士为谁？以安国对之。是时丰为黄门郎，改名宣。上问安国所在？左右公卿即具以丰对。上曰：‘ 丰名乃被于吴、越邪？’转骑都尉、给事中。帝崩后，为永宁太仆，以名过其实，能用少也。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李丰[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "与夏侯玄、张缉为帝芳召见，商以谋诛晋王司马师。然为师所察，问之，丰以观书对之，被识破，师将三人腰斩于市，灭其三族。三人骂不绝口。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀淑> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀淑"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀淑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季和"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀淑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀淑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少有高行，博学而不好章句，与当世名贤李固、李膺友善。举为贤良方正，对策讥刺贵倖，为外戚梁冀所忌。出补朗陵侯相，办事明理，称为“神君”。不久弃官归乡，隐居养志，建和（147-149）中死。有子八人，并有名，时称“八龙”。颍阴县令苑康将其..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#攴胡赤儿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "攴胡赤儿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#攴胡赤儿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "攴胡赤兒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#攴胡赤儿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#攴胡赤儿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "素为卓婿牛辅所厚，卓死，吕布使李肃至陕，欲以诏命诛辅。后辅营兵有夜叛出者，营中惊，辅以为皆叛，乃取金宝，独与赤儿等五六人相随，逾城北渡河，赤儿等利其金宝，斩首送长安。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#攴胡赤儿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "为卓婿牛辅心腹，卓死，辅、李傕等起兵为卓报仇，与吕布战，不胜，是夜辅唤赤儿商议曰：“吕布骁勇，万不能敌；不如瞒了李傕等四人，暗藏金珠，与亲随三五人弃军而去。”赤儿应允。是夜收拾金珠，弃营而走，随行者三四人。将渡一河，赤儿欲谋取金珠，竟..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔宙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孔宙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔宙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孔宙"@zh .
