<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔宙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末著名学者孔融父。官太山都尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张景> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张景"@zh .
