<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安二十二年（217），为并州刺史梁习从事，募鲜卑善射者，射杀太原乌丸王鲁昔。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐毅> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "乐毅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐毅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "永霸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐毅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐毅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "中山灵寿（今河北灵寿西北）人。军事家，拜燕上将军，受封昌国君，辅佐燕昭王振兴燕国，报了强齐伐燕之仇。魏将乐羊后裔。公元前284年，他统帅燕国等五国联军攻打齐国，连下70余城，创造了中国古代战争史上以弱胜强的著名战例。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐毅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "战国时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马延> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马延"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "馬延"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初从袁尚，袁氏兄弟交战，审配出兵城北，欲与袁尚对决围。太祖逆击之，败还，尚亦破走，依曲漳为营，太祖遂围之。未合，尚惧，遣阴夔、陈琳乞降，不听。尚还走滥口，进复围之急，延等临陈降，觽大溃，尚奔中山。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "与张顗共为先锋。为降曹的吕旷、吕翔二将招降。后随太祖出兵赤壁。时值曹军败北，延、顗二将率三千北地军马保护太祖逃命。二将飞骑前行，中埋伏，被吴将甘宁斩杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵累> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵累"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵累> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "趙累"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵累> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵累> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "潘璋部将马忠擒获关羽及其子关平、都督赵累等于章乡，遂定荆州。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵累> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "荆州管粮都督。为败走的关羽出谋略，随羽从麦城逃出，但遇到东吴伏兵，战死。"@zh .
