<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈球> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈球"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈球> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯真"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈球> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈球> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少时习儒学，善律令。顺帝阳嘉中，举孝廉，稍迁繁阳令。累官侍御史、零陵太守，击破谋反者朱盖等，迁魏郡太守。征拜将作大匠，作桓帝陵园，省下大量费用。灵帝光和元年（178），官至太尉，数月以日食免。次年为永乐少府，与司徒刘郃谋诛宦官。事泄，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯威> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯威"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯威> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季权"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯威> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯威> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "性格任侠，历荆、兖二州刺史，并与曹丕、曹植等相友善。其时泰山人羊祜，博学能属文，善谈论；夏侯威深异其才，乃以其兄夏侯霸之子嫁为羊祜妻，后羊祜果成一代名将。沛国朱建平善于相术，一次于曹丕宴会上渭夏侯威道：「你四十九岁时将位至州牧，然而亦..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯威> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "夏侯渊之子。于演义第一百零二回登场。其时蜀相诸葛亮分兵五路出祁山攻魏，司马懿便向魏明帝曹睿保荐夏侯威及其兄夏侯霸并为左右先锋，随当蜀兵。此役夏侯威、夏侯霸奉司马懿之计，击王平、张嶷于渭南，大获胜捷。后来夏侯威从司马懿赴襄平战公孙渊，复..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏攸> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "魏攸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏攸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "魏攸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏攸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏攸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘虞之东曹掾。先刘虞与公孙瓒失和。后虞当胡夷，数请瓒会，称疾不往。至是战败，虞欲讨之，以告东曹掾右北平魏攸。攸曰：“今天下引领，以公为归，谋臣爪牙，不可无也。瓒文武才力足恃，虽有小恶，固宜容忍。”虞乃止。后一年，攸病死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#弥加> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "弥加"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#弥加> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彌加"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#弥加> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#弥加> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "鲜卑部落首领。与中原通市，又遣使贡献。魏文帝时，立弥加为归义王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许慎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "许慎"@zh .
