<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#焦伯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏官吏，高贵乡公曹髦在位时为黄门从官。甘露五年（260）五月，随曹髦出讨司马昭，未获成功，曹髦反为昭手下人所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟康> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孟康"@zh .
