<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟康> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "文帝黄初时，拜散骑侍郎。齐王芳正始中，任弘农太守，领典农校尉，有政绩。嘉平末，为中书令，后转中书监。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程畿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "程畿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程畿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季然"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程畿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程畿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘璋时为汉昌长，迁江阳太守。刘备领益州牧，辟为从事祭酒。章武元年（221），随刘备伐吴。次年兵败，溯江而还，为吴军追杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程畿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "刘备为弟报仇兴兵伐吴，程畿为参谋。后陆逊火烧连营，蜀军大败，畿拔剑自刎。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管辰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "管辰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管辰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "管辰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管辰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管辰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏术士管辂之弟。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华廙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "华廙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华廙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "长骏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华廙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华廙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "华歆之孙，华表长子。以岳父卢毓典选，避嫌不举姻亲，故华廙至35岁仍不得仕。后为中书通事郎。武帝司马炎以华廙气量宏大，思维敏捷，且有才有义，泰始初（265）迁为冗从仆射，历黄门侍郎、散骑常侍、前军将军、侍中、南中郎将、都督河北诸军事。以..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹胡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "尹胡"@zh .
