<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹胡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "歌师。能歌宗庙郊祀之曲。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何植> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "何植"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何植> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "何植"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何植> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何植> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初仕吴，为吴帝皓舅。凤皇三年，临海太守奚熙与会稽太守郭诞书，非论国政。诞但白熙书，不白妖言，送付建安作船。植为三郡督，帝亮遣往收熙。后为牛渚都督。天纪三年八月，以植为司徒。四年，晋攻吴，吴累败，帝皓谴植、建威将军孙晏送印节诣晋将王浑降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何植> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "吴国司徒。晋攻吴，帝皓大惊，急招之计议退兵之策。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘许> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘许"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘许> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文生"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘许> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘许> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘放之子。聪颖博放，与当时名士张华等人，并称文辞可观。晋惠帝世，仕为越骑校尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆景> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陆景"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "士仁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陆抗之子。偏将军、中夏督。父抗，吴大司马、荆州牧。景以尚公主拜骑都尉，封毗陵侯，既领抗兵，拜偏将军、中夏督，澡身好学，著书数十篇也。天纪四年，晋攻吴，龙骧将军王濬顺流东下。所至辄克，终如抗虑。二月壬戌，长兄陆晏为濬别军所杀。癸亥，景亦..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "天纪四年，晋攻吴，景奉命率军从水路进军迎之。后晋镇南大将军杜预攻破东吴大军，时景在船上，望见江南岸上一片火起，巴山上风飘出一面大旗，上书：“晋镇南大将军杜预”。景大惊，欲上岸逃命，为晋将张尚马到斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹礼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "尹礼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "尹禮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄巾起，臧霸仕陶谦，收兵于徐州，与礼、孙观、吴敦等并聚众，以霸为帅，屯于开阳。太祖之讨吕布也，礼等将兵助布。太祖募索得霸，见而悦之，使霸招礼、吴敦、孙观、观兄康等，皆诣太祖。以礼为东莞太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初为泰山寇，吕布与太祖战，先使陈宫、臧霸、结连礼、孙观、吴敦、昌豨，东取山东兖州诸郡，后为太祖所败。及布亡，霸降。太祖使霸招安礼等，并加其官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛胜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "薛胜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛胜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "薛勝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛胜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛胜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "武帝太康元年（280），随晋军伐吴，大胜，"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#路蕃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "路蕃"@zh .
