<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#路蕃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#路蕃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "甘露二年（257），诸葛诞反，骑督偏将军蕃前往讨伐，忠壮勇烈，封亭侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全祎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "全祎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全祎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "全禕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全祎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全祎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "全琮之孙，全绪之子。太平二年五月，魏征东大将军诸葛诞以淮南之众保守寿春城，并遣将军朱成向吴称臣上疏，又遣儿子诸葛靓、长史吴纲诸牙门之子为人质入吴。东吴孙琳使全端与全怿、文钦、唐咨等步骑三万救诞，全祎时在建业。十一月，全祎、全仪携祖母奔..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全祎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "吴将全端之子。太平二年五月，魏征东大将军诸葛诞以淮南之众保守寿春城，并遣儿子诸葛靓为人质入吴。东吴孙琳使全端与全怿为大将，引文钦、唐咨、于诠等起兵七万救诞，却屡为魏军所败。全怿、全端与文钦先入寿春为助。后全端之子全祎回安丰，为孙綝所责..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#拔奇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "拔奇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#拔奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "拔奇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#拔奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#拔奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "句丽王伯固的长子。国人因其不肖，而立其弟。建安中，降属公孙康。后迁往辽东（治今辽宁辽阳北），有子留句丽国。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯硕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "冯硕"@zh .
