<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯硕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯硕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "后汉书记载，建安元年，李傕郭汜反目争斗，汉献帝奔往洛阳，曹操前来救驾，曹操自领司隶校尉，录尚书事。期间，曹操杀侍中台崇、尚书冯硕等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王植> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王植"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王植> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王植"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王植> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王植> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王植> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操之荥阳太守。与韩福是两亲家，闻得关公杀了韩福，商议欲暗害关公，命从事胡班夜间放火,后班敬关羽气概,将事告之。当晚,关公行不到数里，背后火把照耀，人马赶来。王植拍马挺枪，径奔关公，被关公拦腰一刀，砍为两段。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘勋[曹芳近臣]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘勋[曹芳近臣]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘勋[曹芳近臣]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉勳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘勋[曹芳近臣]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘勋[曹芳近臣]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏齐王曹芳的近臣。"@zh .
