<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭永> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭永> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "文德郭皇后之父。官至南郡太守。魏明帝太和四年（230），追谥安阳乡敬侯；青龙四年（236），追改封观津敬侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭永> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "安平广宗人。其女被曹丕纳为贵妃。郭永尝曰：“吾女乃女中之王也。”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐胤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐胤"@zh .
