<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任巴东监军。泰始八年（272）与车骑将军羊祜、荆州刺史杨肇合围江陵。为吴将陆抗所败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾洪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "贾洪"@zh .
