<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "好学有才，精于《左传》。建安初，仕郡，举计掾，应州辟。洪历守三县令，所在辄亲授诸生。后归曹操，署军谋掾，出为阴泉长。延康中，转为白马王相，后病亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁鹄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "梁鹄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁鹄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孟皇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁鹄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁鹄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末官吏、书法家。灵帝时，以善书法官至选部尚书。于时曹操欲为洛阳令，鹄以为北部尉。鹄后依刘表，及荆州平，曹操募求鹄。鹄惧，自缚诣门，操署军假司马，使在秘书，以勒书自效。魏宫殿题署，皆鹄所书。梁鹄经历三国初年的兼并和战乱，官场的得失早..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙歆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙歆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙歆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫歆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙歆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙歆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴乐乡督。曾祖羌，武烈皇帝坚同产兄也。天纪四年，晋侵吴。以歆为乐乡督，及晋军所战皆克，歆震恐，与江陵督伍延书曰：“北来诸军，乃飞渡江也。后晋龙骧将军王濬攻乐乡，其牙门周旨、伍巢等伏兵乐乡城外。歆遣军出距濬，大败而还。旨等发伏兵，随歆军..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙歆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "吴骠骑将军。天纪四年，晋军侵吴。吴帝皓以骠骑将军歆为都督，进兵拒夏口等处军马。后歆为先锋，晋督杜预引兵前进，歆船早到。两兵初交，预便退。歆引兵上岸，迤逦追时，不到二十里，一声炮响，四面晋兵大至。吴兵急回，预乘势掩杀，吴兵死者不计其数。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕安> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕安"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲悌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吕昭次子。有济世志，性刚烈。与嵇康友善。元帝景元中，为兄吕巽诬以不孝，被囚，嵇康为他辨白得免。因与钟会有隙，钟会劝司马昭除掉他与嵇康，二人遂被杀。原有集二卷，已佚。今存《髑髅赋》等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍子春> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲍子春"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍子春> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鮑子春"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍子春> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍子春> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任列人令。好《易经》，喜占卜。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵融[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵融[东汉]"@zh .
