<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵融[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵融[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾与袁绍同列西园八校尉，他为助军校尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩宣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩宣"@zh .
