<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩宣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉献帝建安中，为丞相府军谋掾。魏文帝黄初时，任尚书郎。后出为清河、东郡太守。明帝时，任尚书大鸿胪，数岁卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞广> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卞广"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞广> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "卞廣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞广> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞广> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏武帝曹操卞皇后祖父，明帝时追谥开阳恭侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#焦炳> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "焦炳"@zh .
