<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董蒙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董蒙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "封南乡亭侯。与荀攸等人劝进曹操为魏公。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴邈> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "裴邈"@zh .
