<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴光禄勋刘基弟，官骑都尉。入晋，因为尚书令裴秀占官稻田，事发，服罪。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#步协> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "步协"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#步协> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "步協"@zh .
