<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卜静> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴名士。与张敦齐名，官至剡令。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢贞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邢贞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢贞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "邢貞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢贞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢贞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安中，任中尉。文帝时，任太常。黄初二年（221），被派遣持节授孙权大将军、吴王，加九锡。孙权出迎于都亭，贞有骄色，不下车，引起孙权部属不满，为张昭所斥。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢贞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "太常卿，授命至东吴，册封孙权为吴王，加九锡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麋芳> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "麋芳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麋芳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麋芳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麋芳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "麇竺弟。祖世货殖，僮客万人，赀产钜亿。初，同兄竺仕徐州牧陶谦，谦卒，先主领之。后曹公表芳为彭城相，与兄皆去官，随先主周旋。及益州定，以芳为南郡太守，与关羽共事。芳私好携贰，及吕蒙举军西上，芳叛迎孙权，开城出降，羽因覆败。芳投吴，然虞翻..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麋芳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初，随兄竺仕徐州牧陶谦，谦卒，先主领之。随刘备多周旋。长坂坡之战，芳身带重伤，误以赵云投魏，白先主。及益州定，以芳为南郡太守，与关羽共事。因羽以芳、傅士仁饮酒失火，怒责之。后荆州失，二人惧羽，投吴，羽因覆败。及先主伐吴，芳、仁杀吴将马..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙轻> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙轻"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙轻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫輕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙轻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙轻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "常山、赵郡、中山、上党、河内诸山谷皆相通，其小帅轻、王当等，各以部众从张燕，众至百万，号曰黑山。灵帝不能征，河北诸郡被其害。后为张辽招降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尤突> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "尤突"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尤突> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "尤突"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尤突> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尤突> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "鄱阳起义军首领。建安二十一年，鄱阳民尤突受曹公印绶，化民为贼，陵阳、始安、泾县皆与突相应。贺齐与陆逊讨破突，斩首数千，余党震服，丹杨三县皆降，料得精兵八千人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卜清> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卜清"@zh .
