<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卜清> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卜清> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴国人，与丁览齐名。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏桀> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏桀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏桀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "夏桀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏桀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏桀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "中国夏朝第十七任君主，亦是最后一任君主，发之子，另一说皋之子。桀身体强壮，能赤手空拳搏虎豹。后世的文献将他描述成一个暴君：他宠信王后妺喜，对政事不闻不问之余，还大量残杀忠良，以炮烙杀大臣关龙逢。《通鉴外纪》载：“桀作瑶台，罢民力，殚民..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏桀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "夏朝时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋奇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "宋奇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宋奇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "封{氵隐}强侯。曹操从妹夫。熹平中，以事被诛，曹操从坐免官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张韬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张韬"@zh .
