<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张韬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张韬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张韬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "郭贵妃欲谋为后，与幸臣张韬商议，趁着曹丕患病，张韬诈称在甄夫人宫中掘得桐木偶，曹丕大怒，将甄夫人赐死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘阜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘阜"@zh .
