<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘阜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘阜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "官至陈留（今河南陈留）太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘助> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘助"@zh .
