<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘助> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "典军吏。曾因查正一冤案，受吴主孙权赏赐百万。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭彝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭彝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭彝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郭彝"@zh .
