<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王含> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王含"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王含> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王含"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王含> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王含> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "监军。后主景耀六年（263），魏钟会率军大举伐蜀，蜀兵退，含守乐城，兵五千。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王含> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "被姜维命令和蒋斌共同统左军，二将谨慎，因立寨未定，恐魏兵来劫寨，不敢解甲而寝。后邓艾遣副将郑伦，引五百掘子军，于当夜二更，径从地道直至左营，于帐后地下拥出。是夜中军大乱，二将急绰兵器上的马时，寨外邓忠引兵杀到。内外夹攻，王、蒋二将奋死..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王旦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王旦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王旦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王旦"@zh .
