<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张允[刘表]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张允[刘表]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张允[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張允"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张允[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张允[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "乃刘表外甥。他与刘表妻弟蔡瑁同样得宠于刘表，亦与刘表次子刘琮相睦。刘表及蔡氏欲以刘琮为后，而蔡瑁、张允则为其党羽。刘表部将江夏太守黄祖为孙权所杀，表长子刘琦便求代其任。及至刘表病重，刘琦归看父疾，张允等人恐刘琦入见后父子相感，竟有托后..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张允[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "荆州牧刘表手下将领。与刘表妻弟蔡瑁交厚，二人皆谄佞之徒，彼此狼狈为奸。蔡瑁之姊蔡夫人生刘琮，乃刘表次子，蔡氏姊弟欲使刘琮为荆州继任人，张允则为其党羽。刘表死后，蔡瑁、张允立刘琮为继，又大力劝其降曹。张允降曹后因深通养练水军之法，被封为..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于羝根> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "于羝根"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于羝根> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "于羝根"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于羝根> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于羝根> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黑山农民起义军首领，本非冠盖，自相号字，因饶须故名。后为袁绍、曹操击败。"@zh .
