<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#去卑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#去卑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "匈奴右贤王。曾祖尸利，单于以为谷蠡王，号独孤部。尸利生乌利，乌利生去卑。建安元年，汉帝自长安东归，右贤王去卑与白波贼帅李乐、韩暹、胡才等待卫天子，拒击李傕、郭汜。二十一年，单于呼厨泉来朝，曹公因留于邺，而遣去卑归平阳，监其监其五部国焉..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朵思大王> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朵思大王"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朵思大王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "朵思大王"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朵思大王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朵思大王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朵思大王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "南蛮秃龙洞的元帅。孟获之弟孟优的朋友，据说是南蛮第一智者。帮助处于劣势中的孟获，用秃龍洞的四眼毒泉与诸葛亮对抗。后守把三江城，被诸葛亮攻破，朵思大王死于乱军之中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘泌> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘泌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘泌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉泌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘泌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘泌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘泌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "刘泌，樊城县令，汉室宗亲，刘封的舅舅。刘备用徐庶之计攻克樊城后，与刘泌相见，因而见到在他身后侍立的刘封（当时叫寇封），心下喜爱，于是收刘封为义子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘举> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "潘举"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘举> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "潘舉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘举> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘举> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘举> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司马懿准备抓捕曹爽，自引大军据武库，早有人报知曹爽家，守门将潘举令人乱箭射下，懿不得过。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹矩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹矩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹矩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹矩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹矩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹矩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操之子。早卒。魏黄初三年（222），追封谥为范阳闵公。太和六年（232），追进号曰范阳闵王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#浮云> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "浮云"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#浮云> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "浮雲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#浮云> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#浮云> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末黄巾起义军首领。张角起义后，浮云即率众响应。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋谦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "宋谦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋谦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宋謙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋谦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋谦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时吴将领，御韩当、黄盖齐名。初从孙策平东南。建安二十年，从孙权征合肥，与诸将被张辽等击败。黄武元年，从陆逊抵抗刘备东征，与诸将攻蜀五屯，皆破之，斩其将。上表乞攻刘备于白帝，陆逊为备魏攻，劝阻孙权，未纳其主张。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋谦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "吴主权亲引军敌曹公将张辽。宋谦与贾华二将使方天画戟，两边护卫。曹公将乐进刺斜里径取权，华、谦急将画戟遮架。刀到处，两枝戟齐断，只将戟杆望马头上打。然后李典向孙权射箭，被孙权躲过，箭射到宋谦身上，宋谦当场死去。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高躬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高躬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高躬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "高躬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高躬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高躬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "官至蜀郡太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝恬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "祝恬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝恬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "祝恬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝恬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝恬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "司徒。刘焉之师。人称祝公。恬死，焉为之奔丧而去官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡条> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蔡条"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡条> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡条> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "末帝孙晧时任尚书令、太子少傅。中书令蔡款长子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹嘉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹嘉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹嘉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "楚王彪世子。彪自杀后，正元元年（254），诏以嘉为常山真定王。入晋后，封高邑公。元康中为国子博士，后又为东莞太守。其才干学义，良素修洁，为人所称道。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毌丘甸> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "毌丘甸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毌丘甸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子邦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毌丘甸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毌丘甸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "毌丘俭之子，官至治书侍御史，俭反，逃走新安灵山上，别攻下之，灭三族，唯有宗等四人在吴仕官，太康中，回晋，宗字子仁，有父风。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毌丘甸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "扬州都督、镇东将军毌丘俭的长子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑浑> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑浑"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑浑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文公"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑浑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑浑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "著名学者郑众曾孙，汉扬州刺史郑泰之弟。曾祖父众，众父兴，皆为名儒。兄泰亡，浑将泰小子袤避难淮南，袁术宾礼甚厚。浑知术必败。时华歆为豫章太守，素与泰善，浑乃渡江投歆。太祖闻其笃行，召为掾，复迁下蔡长、邵陵令。浑课使耕桑，又兼开稻田，重去..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙桓> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙桓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙桓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙桓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙桓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙河的第三子，仪容端正，器怀聪明，博学强记，能论议应对，孙权常称为宗室颜渊，擢为武卫都尉。从讨关羽于华容，诱羽余党，得五千人，牛马器械甚众。年二十五拜安东中郎将，与陆逊共拒刘备伐吴，刘备军甚重，孙桓分兵夷道攻备前锋，为被所困，孙桓乃固..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙桓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀帝备伐吴，孙桓请令抵之。然战败，退彝陵，蜀军不能克。后都督陆逊大破蜀军，孙桓率军杀出，追杀蜀兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘岱[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘岱[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘岱[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉岱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘岱[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘岱[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操之司空长史。以司空长史从征伐有功，封列侯。建安四年，刘备阴与董承等谋太祖，至下邳，遂杀徐州刺史车胄，举兵屯沛。太祖遣岱、王忠击之，备谓岱等曰：“使汝百人来，其无如我何；曹公自来，未可知耳！”攻之，不克。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘岱[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操部将。昔为兖州刺史，从讨董卓。因与桥瑁借粮，瑁不借，岱怒而杀之，尽分其兵。后降太祖，建安四年，刘备杀徐州刺史车胄，举兵屯沛。岱同王忠引兵五万，虚打曹公旗号，攻徐州。为张飞生擒，后为刘备释放。及归，为公黜罢爵禄。此实与兖州刺史刘岱混..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙伦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙伦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙伦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫倫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙伦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙伦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "赤乌四年（241）与朱然同率五万人围攻魏之樊城，后因司马懿率军来援，遂退还。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹范[曹仁子]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹范[曹仁子]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹范[曹仁子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹範"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹范[曹仁子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹范[曹仁子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹仁之子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李勖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李勖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李勖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李勖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李勖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李勖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "末帝孙皓时，任少府。楼下都尉何定为子求娶其女，不许，结怨。建衡元年（269），孙皓委以监军，与督军徐存从建安海道发兵，欲赴合浦击交阯。次年，以海道不通，杀导将冯斐，引军还。何定谮以“枉杀冯斐，擅撤军退还”，孙皓遂杀勖、徐存及其家属。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘弘[刘备父]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘弘[刘备父]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘弘[刘备父]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉弘"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘弘[刘备父]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘弘[刘备父]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘备父亲。曾为州郡小官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘弘[刘备父]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中为刘备的父亲。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张睦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张睦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张睦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張睦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张睦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张睦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任西海太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹皑> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹皑"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹皑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹皚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹皑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹皑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹真之子。真卒，封皑为列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何定> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "何定"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "何定"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "原为孙权给使，后出补吏。孙皓时，上表自称先帝旧人，求还内侍，皓任以楼下都尉，掌酤籴事宜，专为威福。以佞邪谄媚得幸于孙皓，被委以众事，为殿中列将。替儿子求少府李勖女不成，挟忿诬陷李勖于孙皓，勖被诛。动用大量人力钱财，搜求好犬作御犬，养以..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹楷[曹仁子]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹楷[曹仁子]"@zh .
