<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "荆州牧刘表子，官至东安太守。著诗、赋、颂六篇。赵幼文赞同《文选．与杨德祖书》李注引东安作乐安。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡款> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蔡款"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡款> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文德"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡款> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡款> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "历位内外官，以清贞显于当世。后以卫尉领中书令，封留侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹冏[曹操族子]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹冏[曹操族子]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹冏[曹操族子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元首"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹冏[曹操族子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹冏[曹操族子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹叔兴之后，少帝（曹芳）族祖也。是时天子幼稚，冏冀以此论感悟曹爽，爽不能纳。为弘农太守。有才学，托名曹操著有《六代论》。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹抗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹抗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹抗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹抗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹抗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹抗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏王公。樊安公均之子。建安二十四年（219），均卒，抗嗣爵。黄初三年（222），徙封抗蓟公。四年，徙封屯留公。景初元年（237）卒，谥曰定公。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范滂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "范滂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范滂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孟博"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范滂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范滂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少厉清节，举孝廉。汝南太守宗资请署功曹，委任政事。与太学生交结，反对宦官专权。延熹九年（166），因党事与李膺等下狱。旋释放，迎之者数千。建宁二年（169），又因党事下狱，死于狱中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范滂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "与刘表等七名士为友，时号“江夏八俊”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹鼎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹鼎"@zh .
