<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹鼎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹鼎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹洪伯父，官至尚书令。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘胤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘胤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉胤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘备孙。后主延熙七年（244），嗣为安平王，十九年（256）卒，谥曰哀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麋威> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "麋威"@zh .
