<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麋威> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麋威> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "麋竺之子。官至虎贲中郎将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤嘉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郤嘉"@zh .
