<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "起于微贱。文帝时赐爵关内侯。为官苛刻。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐隐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "乐隐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐隐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "樂隐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐隐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐隐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初以教授为业，后为车骑将军何苗长史，董卓之乱中，被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓绥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邓绥"@zh .
