<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓绥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓绥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉和帝皇后。太博邓禹孙女。六岁能史书，十二岁通《诗》、《论语》，永元七年（95）选入宫，为贵人。帝甚爱之。十四年立为皇后。和帝死后，先后立殇帝、安帝，为皇太后，临朝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#殷馗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "殷馗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#殷馗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "殷馗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#殷馗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#殷馗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初，桓帝时有黄星见于楚、宋之分，辽东殷馗。善天文，言后五十岁当有真人起于梁、沛之间，其锋不可当。至是凡五十年，而公破绍，天下莫敌矣。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#殷馗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "桓帝时，有黄星见于楚、宋之分，辽东人殷馗善晓天文，夜宿于此，对老汉等言：黄星见于乾象，正照此间。后五十年，当有真人起于梁沛之间。昔有殷馗善观天文，尝谓‘群星聚于颍分，其地必多贤士。’"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严干> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "严干"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公仲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "性情淳厚，好击剑，为冯翊甲族桓、田、吉、郭及故侍中郑文信等赏识。建安初，仕东郡为右职。司隶辟，不至。郡举孝廉，拜蒲阪令，以病去官。复举至孝，为公车司马令。为州所请，诏拜议郎，还参州事。建策捕高干，又追录前讨郭援功，封武乡侯，迁弘农太守..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹孚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹孚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹孚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹孚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹孚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹孚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "中山恭王兖之子。兖卒，孚嗣爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘安妻> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘安妻"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘安妻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉安妻"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘安妻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘安妻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘安妻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "猎户刘安之妻。刘备为吕布所破，与孙乾往山中逃难，寻小路投许都，路上绝粮，于村中求食。到一家投宿，其家一后生出拜，问之，乃猎户安也。闻是豫州牧至，遍寻野味不得，乃杀其妻以食之，言是狼肉。至晓将去，往后院取马，忽见一妇人杀于厨下，臂上肉已..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙密> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙密"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙密> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫密"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙密> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙密> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙资之子。密与中书监刘放子刘熙、吏部尚书卫臻子韦烈并称为三豫。明帝以其互相攀比之风徒长浮华，免三人之官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹铄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹铄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹铄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹鑠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹铄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹铄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操之子。早卒。魏太和三年（229），追封曰相殇王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹澳> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹澳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹澳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹澳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹澳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹澳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏王公。陈留王峻之子。峻卒，澳嗣爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯徽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯徽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯徽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "媛容"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯徽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯徽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "司马师的首任妻子。夏侯徽高雅而且有见地，每当司马师有所谋划，夏侯徽都必定帮他思考。明帝即位后，司马懿身居上将的重任，他的儿子，司马师、司马昭等人，都有雄才大略。夏侯徽知道司马师也不愿意做魏国的忠臣，而她自己又是曹氏的外甥女，司马师深深..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吾粲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吾粲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吾粲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孔休"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吾粲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吾粲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴太子太傅。孙河为县长，粲为小吏，河深奇之。河后为将军，得自选长吏，表粲为曲阿丞，迁为长史，治有名迹。虽起孤微，与同郡陆逊、卜静等比肩齐声矣。孙权为车骑将军，召为主簿，出为山阴令，还为参军校尉。黄武元年，与吕范、贺齐等俱以舟师拒魏将曹..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吾粲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙策薨，弟权统众。权招贤纳士，粲投之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀衍> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀衍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀衍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "休若"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀衍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀衍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "荀彧第三兄。以监军校尉守邺，都督河北军事。曹操征袁尚，高千密遣兵谋袭邺，衍发觉后击破之，诛千。以功封列侯。"@zh .
