<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹棘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操之子，母刘姬，曹棘早卒。魏太和五年（231），追封谥曰广宗殇公子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许耽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "许耽"@zh .
