<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄初六年（225），利成郡兵蔡方等以郡反，杀太守。文帝遣步兵校尉昭等讨平之。"@zh .
