<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁封> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "丁奉弟，官至后将军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁封> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "吴主见蜀中危急，即令老将丁奉为主帅，丁封、孙异为副将，率兵五万，前往救蜀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#栗成> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "栗成"@zh .
