<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#栗成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任魏郡太守。后手下兵反，与黑山黄巾军首领于毒所部颠覆郡治邺城，被杀。栗成疑即栗攀，参见“栗攀”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢该> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "谢该"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢该> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文仪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢该> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢该> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任为公车司马令，以父母老，托疾去官。孔融上书荐举，拜议郎。后卒于官。该博通群艺，周览古今，尤善《春秋左氏》，为世名儒，门徒数百千人。建安中，河东乐详就《左氏传》疑问请教于该，该皆答之，为《谢氏释》，行于世。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘子平> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘子平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘子平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉子平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘子平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘子平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与刘备相善。典略中记载：平原刘子平知备有武勇，时张纯反叛，青州被诏，遣从事将兵讨纯，过平原，子平荐备于从事，遂与相随，遇贼于野，备中创阳死，贼去后，故人以车载之，得免。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贺达> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "贺达"@zh .
