<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贺达> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "嘉禾二年（233），与太常张弥、执金吾许晏将兵万人，至辽东封公孙渊为燕王，被渊袭杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李惠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李惠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李惠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李惠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李惠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李惠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "明帝时，曾监作宫室。"@zh .
