<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨嚣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "杨修之子。泰始初为典军将军，受心膂之任，早卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#儿禅> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "儿禅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#儿禅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "兒禪"@zh .
