<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#儿禅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时丁零大人。明帝太和五年（231），到幽州向魏贡名马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞乐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庞乐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞乐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "龐樂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞乐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞乐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为赵韪部将。韪因民怨谋叛，攻刘璋，璋入成都固守。后乐与李异等反韪，斩韪首。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程武> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "程武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "程武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "安乡侯。黄初元年，父昱薨，武嗣其爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "程昱之子。蜀丞相诸葛亮北伐，魏以驸马夏侯楙为将，武为参军。楙惧赵云，武料赵云有勇无谋，计使楙分兵埋伏，诱云深入而后围之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨骏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨骏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨骏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文长"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨骏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨骏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西晋初，任车骑将军。因其女杨芷为武帝皇后，又封临晋侯。武帝死前，受遗诏与汝南王亮辅政，任太傅、大都督。他清除异己，遍树亲党，后为贾后所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈修> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈修"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳脩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "子脩有武风，年十九，权召见奖厉，拜别部司马，授兵五百人。时诸新兵多有逃叛，而脩抚循得意，不失一人。权奇之，拜为校尉。建安末，追录功臣后，封脩都亭侯，为解烦督。黄龙元年卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何桢> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "何桢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何桢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元干"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何桢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何桢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "出身寒微。有文学器幹，容貌甚伟。魏太和中为扬州别驾，正始中为弘农太守、历幽州刺史、廷尉，入晋为尚书、光禄大夫、封雩娄侯。有集五卷。作《许都赋》。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀恺> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀恺"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀恺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子举"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀恺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀恺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "荀彧曾孙、司马懿外孙。征蜀时任护军，晋立，依裙带至尚书仆射，因欲结名士武茂、牵秀等未成，甚诬害之。太傅杨骏因罪株，裴楷息瓒，骏之婿也，为乱兵所害。恺与楷不平，因奏楷是骏亲，收付廷尉。晋武帝时为侍中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀恺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "随钟会伐蜀，时会拍马过桥，桥上土塌，陷住马蹄，争些儿掀下马来。马挣不起，会弃马步行；跑下桥时，蜀将卢逊赶上，一枪刺来，却被魏兵中荀恺回身一箭，射卢逊落马。钟会麾众乘势抢关，关上军士因有蜀兵在关前，不敢放箭，被钟会杀散，夺了山关。即以荀..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾胤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "贾胤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "賈胤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "贾诩曾孙。贾模子，仕晋惠帝，乃惠帝于太子时之近侍。永嘉年间任护军，在洛阳大败刘聪，斩呼延颢。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡博> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "胡博"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡博> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "胡博"@zh .
