<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈佐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈佐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为陈谌之孙，官至青州刺史。"@zh .
