<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛州> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末农民起义军首领。率众万余户，活动于沿海地区。后降广陵太守陈登。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#窦茂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "窦茂"@zh .
