<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#窦茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#窦茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉末氐王。建安二十年（215）三月，曹操西征张鲁，将入氐，氐人塞道，张郃等攻破之。四月，茂众万余人，恃险拒操。五月，操攻屠之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀彪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀彪"@zh .
