<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀彪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "荀攸孙。黄初（220-227）中封为陵树亭侯，后转封丘阳亭侯。"@zh .
