<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜隐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十七年（212）与杨阜等起兵讨马超，超遂南奔，陇右平定。"@zh .
