<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴桓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄巾起义军首领。与会稽郡吏留赞交战，为赞所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨岳> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨岳"@zh .
