<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨岳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨岳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "杨阜从弟。时马超击陇上郡县，岳在冀城作偃月营抵抗。马超破城，拘岳。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞伟高> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "虞伟高"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞伟高> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "虞偉高"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞伟高> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞伟高> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与南阳何颙相好。伟高有父仇未报，笃病将终，泣而诉于颙，颙感其义，为伟高复仇。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭胜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭胜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭胜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郭勝"@zh .
