<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭胜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉灵帝时为中常侍，与张让、赵忠等狼狈为奸，并皆封侯。曾助同乡何进贵幸。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭胜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中十常侍之一。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛显> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "诸葛显"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛显> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "諸葛顯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛显> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛显> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "诸葛亮养子诸葛乔之孙。魏灭蜀，随迁至洛阳。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙匡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙匡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙匡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季佐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙匡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙匡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙翊之弟。曾举孝廉茂才，未及试用即卒，年仅二十岁。一说匡因违犯军令被孙权开除族姓，别姓丁氏，禁锢终身。裴松之以为禁锢终身者当是孙权异母弟孙朗。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙匡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "长兄策平江东，曹公知其强盛，遂以曹仁之女许配匡，两家结亲。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田乐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "田乐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田乐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "田樂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田乐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田乐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "赐爵关内侯。韩约失众，从羌中还，依(郭)宪。众人多欲取约以徼功，而宪皆责怒之，言：“人穷来归我，云何欲危之？”遂拥护厚遇之。其后约病死，而田乐、阳逵等就斩约头，当送之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯儒> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯儒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯儒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "俊林"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯儒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯儒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "夏侯尚的从弟，初为鄢陵侯曹彰的骁骑司马，后为征蜀护军，进驻关西，曾同张既一起平定了酒泉苏衡的叛乱。齐王曹芳正始（240-248）初，吴将朱然围樊城，夏侯儒奉命救援，惧不敢进，仅在沿途鼓吹惑敌，离朱然尚有六七里便退回。一月之后司马懿至，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘虎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘虎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉虎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末荆州牧刘表侄儿。曾率兵与孙策作战。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄昂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄昂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "黄昂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安中，太守徐揖诛郡中强族黄氏，时昂得脱在外，乃以其家粟金数斛，募众得千余人以攻揖。揖守城，昂陷城杀揖。昂同郡人杨丰以昂为不义，求救于武威太守，入南羌中合众得千余骑，至酒泉杀昂。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫玠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卫玠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫玠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔宝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫玠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫玠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "出身士族。风神秀异，好言玄理。屡辟，皆不就。后任太傅西閤祭酒，拜太子洗马。后以天下大乱，移家建邺。怀帝永嘉六年（312）卒，年二十七。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#昌奇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "昌奇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#昌奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "昌奇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#昌奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#昌奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#昌奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "杨任部将。曹操攻张鲁，杨任与夏侯渊战于南郑。任遣部将昌奇出马，与渊交锋；战不三合，被渊一刀斩于马下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周纡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周纡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周纡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "周紆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周纡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周纡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任洛阳令。曾多次召请神童杜安，不得见。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#扶严> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "扶严"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#扶严> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "扶嚴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#扶严> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#扶严> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时交阯地方首领。建衡三年（271），吴末帝孙皓遣陶璜等诸将破交阯，杀晋所置守将，分交阯为新昌郡，并破严，置武平郡于其地。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨怀> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨怀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨怀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊懷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨怀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨怀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘璋白水军督。庞统为刘备计曰：“杨怀、高沛，璋之名将，各仗强兵，据守关头，闻数有笺谏璋，使发遣将军还荆州。将军未至，遣与相闻，说荆州有急，欲还救之，并使装束，外作归形；此二子既服将军英名，又喜将军之去，计必乘轻骑来见，将军因此执之，进..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨怀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "同高沛共守涪水关。二将谋刺刘备，然为庞统所觉，定计斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡奋> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "胡奋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡奋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "玄威"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡奋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡奋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "皇室外戚。性开朗，有筹略，少好武事。其父胡遵是曹魏车骑将军，封阴密侯，是个官宦世家。早年，胡奋效力于军中，当司马懿率领军队征讨辽东时，胡奋以白衣侍从身份随军出征，后拜官校尉，再出任徐州刺史。与路蕃将军联合，平定了匈奴刘猛发动的叛乱活动..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡奋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏国诸葛诞见司马昭欺君罔上，废主弄权，遂反司马昭兴兵讨之。胡奋随司马昭平叛，于寿春斩杀诸葛诞。后为晋平南将军参与伐吴。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞会> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庞会"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞会> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "龐會"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞会> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞会> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父庞德，立义将军。德为关羽所杀，太祖封其为列侯。帝即王位，思德忠烈，赐会等四人爵关内侯，邑各百户。甘露二年，为平寇将军、临渭亭侯。诸葛诞反，会与骑督偏将军路蕃不肯相从，斩门突出，进会爵乡侯。景元四年，会随镇西将军钟会伐蜀，兵追蜀大将军..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞会> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "名将德子，德台榇战关羽前，与会母子别，指会有异相，他日必能为父报雠。后会为魏大将，随镇西将军钟会伐蜀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#侯声> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "侯声"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#侯声> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "侯聲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#侯声> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#侯声> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾为曹操军祭酒。时东阿令枣祗主张屯田，侯声持异议，以为为屯田于官便，于客不便。"@zh .
