<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱熊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "朱据之子。会稽王孙亮时，领兵任虎林督，为全公主孙鲁班所谮，被杀。"@zh .
