<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#廖式> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "赤乌二年（239），任都督，随将军蒋秘南征，杀临贺太守严纲自立，称平南将军。与其弟廖潜一起攻打零陵、桂阳，震动广西地区。后为吕岱、唐咨讨平。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#惠衢> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "惠衢"@zh .
