<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯异> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "好读书，通《左传》、《孙子兵法》。新莽时，以郡掾监五县，为王莽抵御起义军。后归刘秀，为主薄。别收河间兵，拜偏将军。从破王郎，封应侯。异为人谦退不伐，每所止舍，诸将并坐论功，异常独避树下，军中号曰“大树将军”。后诸将劝刘秀即帝位，异以为..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何都> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "何都"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何都> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "何都"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何都> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何都> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴末昏乱，何氏子弟骄横，百姓以为患。曾谣传孙皓已死，而何都以颜状似皓代立。临海太守奚熙信谣举兵，欲诛都，为都叔父何植击杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞喜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卞喜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞喜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "卞喜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞喜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞喜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞喜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汜水关守将。原是黄巾余党，后投曹操，拨来守汜水关。善使流星锤。在镇国寺设下伏兵欲谋害千里寻兄的关羽，但是寺中僧人普净暗示加以解救。最后被关羽斩杀。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左思> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "左思"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左思> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "太冲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左思> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左思> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "出身寒微，不好交游，官至秘书郎。其代表作《三都赋》，构思十年写成，显名一时。豪贵之家竞相传写，洛阳为之纸贵。他所作诗文托古讽今，对门阀制度表示不满。今传《左太冲集》，系后人辑本。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#闵纯> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "闵纯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#闵纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯典"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#闵纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#闵纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "韩馥别驾，在韩馥让冀州于袁绍时，曾和耿武及李历一同劝谏韩馥，认为韩馥可以利用军粮把袁绍玩弄于股掌之间而不必寄人篱下，韩馥拒绝采纳。在袁绍将来到冀州时，以刀杖抗拒袁绍而被袁绍命田丰杀害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#闵纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中为关纯。袁绍欲取冀州，韩馥即差别驾关纯去请袁绍。耿武与关纯伏于城外，以待袁绍。耿武、关纯拔刀而出，欲刺杀绍。绍将颜良立斩耿武，文丑砍死关纯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张方> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张燕之子。燕卒，方嗣爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴胡阿狼泥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "戴胡阿狼泥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴胡阿狼泥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "戴胡阿狼泥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴胡阿狼泥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴胡阿狼泥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "鲜卑部族首领。明帝青龙元年（233），鲜卑叛魏，寇边。魏将秦朗讨之，鲜卑众走漠北。戴胡阿狼泥等率众诣并州归降，朗引军还。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苦蝤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苦蝤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苦蝤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "苦蝤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苦蝤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苦蝤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末黄巾起义领袖之一。与白波、黄龙等部各起兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范耀> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "范耀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范耀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "範耀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范耀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范耀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太尉范慎子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李球> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李球"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李球> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李球"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李球> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李球> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "羽林右部督。伯父恢，蜀安汉将军、建宁太守。景耀六年，随诸葛瞻拒魏将邓艾，临陈授命，死於绵竹。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李球> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "景耀六年，随诸葛瞻拒魏将邓艾。及瞻父子战死，恢与张遵，黄崇引军杀出绵竹，皆战死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘陶[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘陶[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘陶[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子奇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘陶[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘陶[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少游太学，两次上书言事。后举孝廉，除顺阳（今湖北光化西）长。到任厉精图治，一县肃然。灵帝时，拜侍御史，封中陵乡侯，三迁尚书令。因直言极谏，为权臣所惮，徙京兆尹，后征拜谏议大夫。是时，黄巾农民大起义，天下纷乱。陶审时度势，上书极言宦官祸..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘陶[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "东汉末年，十常侍祸乱朝政，谏议大夫刘陶忠心进谏，汉灵帝昏晕无能，不听劝告，将其下狱，当夜，被十常侍谋杀而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁龙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁龙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "袁龍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "关羽部将。建安二十年（215）吴将吕岱等取长沙、零陵、桂阳三郡，中郎将袁龙降岱，不久又据醴陵叛吴应关羽，为岱擒斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯熙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "冯熙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯熙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子柔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯熙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯熙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权为车骑将军时，熙历东曹掾。黄武初为立信都尉。二年（223），权遣熙聘于蜀，吊刘备丧。使蜀还，为中大夫。后使魏，文帝召见，对答如流。文帝以陈群与熙同郡，使群诱之，啗以重利，熙不为回。魏故意刁难，送走后卫复召还，熙为免辱君命，引刀自刺..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙丞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙丞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙丞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "显世"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙丞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙丞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "征南将军孙慎之子。丞好学，有文才，曾为黄门侍郎，与顾荣俱为侍臣，二人记事，丞答荣问，受到赏识。吴亡后赴洛阳，为范阳涿县（今河北涿县）令，有政绩。永安（304）中，陆机为成都王大都督，请孙丞为司马，后与陆机一起被害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庾亮> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庾亮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庾亮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元规"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庾亮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庾亮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东晋时期的权臣，历任至太尉文康公，庾遁曾孙。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑宝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑宝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑宝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄭寳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑宝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑宝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "扬州大姓强豪，才力过人，一方所惮。汉末军阀混战，欲驱百姓赴江南，商之于名士刘晔，为晔所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑宝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "周瑜向孙权推荐鲁肃时说道，其友刘子扬欲约彼往巢湖投郑宝，肃尚踌躇未往。今主公可速召之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石冰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "石冰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石冰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "石冰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石冰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石冰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西晋时流民起义将领。张昌部下。惠帝太安二年（303），张昌发动荆州汉、蛮各族人民起义，令他东攻扬州，击败晋朝史陈徽，不久又攻破江州，声势很大。永兴元年（304），在建康为陈敏所败，投奔封云，被叛将张统杀害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕壹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕壹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕壹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吕壹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕壹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕壹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "嘉禾中任中书郎，为孙权所信任，委以校事，典校诸官府及州郡文书，刺探臣民言行。性苛惨，用法严酷。擅作威福，排陷无辜，诬告顾雍、朱据、刁嘉等官员。太子孙登数谏，孙权不听，群臣畏之侧目。赤乌初，事情败露，被处死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#牛辅> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "牛辅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#牛辅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "牛輔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#牛辅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#牛辅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "董卓的女婿，曾任中郎将，征讨白波军，不能取胜。董卓被杀时，牛辅别屯于陕地。吕布派李肃前去征讨牛辅，被牛辅击败。后来，牛辅营中有士兵半夜背叛出逃，造成内乱，牛辅以为整营皆叛，于是带着金银珠宝，独与亲信支胡赤儿等五六人出逃。支胡赤儿等人谋..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#牛辅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "第3回登场，于董卓进京之际留守陕西。董卓被杀后，牛辅伙同李傕、郭汜、张济、樊稠等杀往长安，欲为董卓报仇。牛辅为西凉军前驱，先与李肃交战，抵敌不过，败阵而去，而后半夜劫营，大败李肃。牛辅进而与吕布交战，被吕布杀得大败，牛辅料不能取胜，于..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎宇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阎宇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎宇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎宇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎宇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "仕蜀为右大将军。宿有功幹，于事精勤。继踵在马忠后，其威风称绩，皆不及忠。督巴东，为领军，后主拜罗宪为宇副贰。魏之伐蜀，召宇西还。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎宇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "因黃皓关照，代替姜维赴对魏作战前线，但是听说魏将邓艾非常厉害，吓得不敢出战。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郄俭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郄俭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郄俭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郄儉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郄俭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郄俭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任益州刺史，为政苛烦。灵帝中平五年（188），马相攻破雒县（今四川广汉北），杀俭。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿鄙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "耿鄙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿鄙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "耿鄙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿鄙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿鄙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉灵帝时凉州刺史。信任奸吏，引起王国起义和氐、羌造反。被州民杀死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟演> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "钟演"@zh .
