<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "文帝时，光杀郡守叛。魏将张既传檄告谕诸羌，为光等所误者宥之；斩光首者重加封赏。于是光部众斩送光首。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹淑> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹淑"@zh .
