<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹淑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏明帝女，太和六年薨，追封谥为平原懿公主，为之立庙。取后亡从孙黄与合葬，追封黄列侯，以夫人郭氏从弟德为之后，承甄氏姓，封德为平原侯，袭公主爵。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吉穆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吉穆"@zh .
