<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#罗袭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "罗宪子。晋武帝时，任给事中。宪卒，以淩江将军统其父部曲，早卒。追赠广汉太守。"@zh .
