<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缘城> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末黄巾农民大起义首领之一。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜长> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜长"@zh .
