<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜长> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "平难中郎将张燕部将。初平中，袁绍与公孙瓒争冀州，张燕遣长等助公孙瓒，为袁绍所败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王柔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王柔"@zh .
