<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#土安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "乌戈国藤甲军领兵俘长。与奚尼同随国王兀突骨大败蜀军，后为蜀相诸葛亮施计引入盘蛇谷中，尽烧其众，无所生还。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘岱[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘岱[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘岱[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公山"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘岱[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘岱[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉兖州刺吏。齐孝王少子封牟平侯，子孙家焉。岱伯父宠，为汉太尉。弟繇，扬州牧、振武将军。岱历位侍中，兖州刺吏。初平元年春正月，岱从袁绍、曹操令，起兵反董卓。后岱与桥瑁相恶，岱杀瑁，以王肱领东郡太守。初平中，岱与袁绍、公孙瓒和亲，绍令妻子..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘岱[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉兖州刺吏。初平元年，从袁绍起兵伐董卓。后与桥瑁借粮，瑁不借，岱怒而杀之，尽分其兵。后同王忠引兵五万，虚打曹公旗号，攻徐州。为张飞生擒，后为刘备释放。及归，为公黜罢爵禄。此实与沛人刘岱混为一人，误。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟达[蜀]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孟达[蜀]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟达[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子度"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟达[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟达[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "本为刘璋属下，后降刘备。本字子敬，因刘备的叔父名叫刘子敬，为避讳而改字为子度（小说《三国演义》中作子庆）。刘璋遣达副法正，各将兵二千人，使迎先主，先主因令达并领其众，留屯江陵。蜀平后，以达为宜都太守。建安二十四年，命达从秭归北攻房陵，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟达[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初仕刘璋，与张松、法正为腹契友。璋遣达领精兵五千，迎玄德入川为援。后投先主，庞统以达与霍峻守葭萌关。后为张鲁将马超所攻，先主救之。后太祖遣张郃攻葭萌关，为黄忠、严颜所救。后关羽被围麦城，廖化突围求救，达、封不应。羽败死，先主怒，及彭羕..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧戒> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "臧戒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧戒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "臧戒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧戒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧戒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "华县狱吏。臧霸父。因据法不听太守欲所私杀，被太守逮送州府。途中，其子率众夺获，一同逃亡东海。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缪徵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "缪徵"@zh .
