<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#骆曜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末农民起义领袖。以宗教的形式号召和组织民众。灵帝熹平中，在三辅率领民众起义，揭开了黄巾起义的序幕。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张吉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张吉"@zh .
