<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盛曼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建平太守。永安七年二月，曼与镇军将军陆抗、抚军将军步协、征西将军留平，率众围蜀巴东守将罗宪。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王儁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王儁"@zh .
