<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王儁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王儁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "皇甫谧逸士传曰：汝南王儁，字子文，少为范滂、许章所识，与南阳岑晊善。公之为布衣，特爱儁；儁亦称公有治世之具。及袁绍与弟术丧母，归葬汝南，儁与公会之，会者三万人。公于外密语儁曰：“天下将乱，为乱魁者必此二人也。欲济天下，为百姓请命，不先..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王颀[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王颀[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王颀[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王頎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王颀[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王颀[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "官越骑校尉。初平三年（192），王允与吕布共杀董卓。卓将李傕、郭汜入长安城，杀王允。颀与鲁馗、周奂、崔烈等俱被杀，吏民死者不可胜数。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐质[魏讨蜀护军]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐质[魏讨蜀护军]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐质[魏讨蜀护军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐質"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐质[魏讨蜀护军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐质[魏讨蜀护军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "讨蜀护军。奋威将军陈泰率质、南安太守邓艾等进兵围之，断其运道及城外流水。嘉平六年，军前与蜀将张嶷交锋，临陈斩之。蜀军进围襄武，与质交锋，军破被斩，魏军败退。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐质[魏讨蜀护军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "辅国将军。嘉平五年，蜀军接连羌兵侵犯南安。大将军司马师知质英勇过人，令质为先锋，领兵望陇西进发。军至董亭，正遇蜀大将军姜维，两军列成阵势。质使开山大斧，出马挑战，连败蜀将廖化、张翼，质驱兵掩杀，蜀兵大败，退三十余里。后中蜀将夏侯霸埋伏..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹玉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹玉"@zh .
