<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹玉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东平灵王曹徽叔父，为朗陵侯，卒后谥曰哀侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王摩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王摩"@zh .
