<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王摩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太祖东征之。绍攻禁，禁坚守，绍不能拔。复与乐进等将步骑五千，击绍别营，从延津西南缘河至汲、获嘉二县，焚烧保聚三十余屯，斩首获生各数千，降绍将何茂、王摩等二十余人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#嵇绍> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "嵇绍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#嵇绍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "延祖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#嵇绍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#嵇绍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "嵇康之子。少知名，起家秘书郎。元康中，为给事黄门侍郎。赵王伦篡位，署为侍中。惠帝复祚，遂居其职。永兴元年（304），从惠帝北征成都王颖，王师败绩，百官皆走，惟绍以身扞卫，遂死于帝侧。追赠太尉，谥曰忠穆公。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏马> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苏马"@zh .
