<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏马> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏马> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾拥兵自固，后为孙策击败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高迁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高迁"@zh .
