<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#太史慈母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太史慈母。孔融多次送与钱物。黄巾军管亥围困孔融后，太史慈前去救援。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#太史慈母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "太史慈母，曾受到过北海国孔融的照顾，当孔融受到管亥围困时，她遣自己的儿子太史慈前往救援。"@zh .
