<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张持> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三月，遣使者羊衜、郑胄、将军孙怡之辽东，击魏守将张持、高虑等，虏得男女。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庾嶷> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庾嶷"@zh .
