<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙集> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任建义中郎将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙奇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙奇"@zh .
