<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "公子孙霸与太子孙和争夺权位时，依附于霸，谮毁太子，致使太子孙和被废，但孙霸亦遭赐死，奇亦因党霸毁和之罪被诛。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐原> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐原"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐原"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为人慷慨有才志，性忠诚耿直。吕岱甚器之，荐拔为侍御史。吕岱每有过失，原则直言强谏，或当众评论。及原死，吕岱哭之甚哀，以为失去知己。原死之前，曾遗书陆瑁，托以孤弱之子。陆瑁就为之修建坟墓，收养教导其子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段默> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "段默"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段默> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "段默"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段默> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段默> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太和二年（228），有人告夏侯楙，明帝意欲杀之，以问长水校尉默，默以为谮抅。查之，果不属实。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴砀> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴砀"@zh .
