<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴砀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴砀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任安成长。建安二十年（215），孙权遣吕岱取长沙三郡。他与安成、攸、永新、茶陵四县吏共入阴山城，合众拒岱，不敌而降。后据攸县，与驻醴陵的中郎将袁龙应关羽，再反孙权。权遣横江将军鲁肃攻攸县，他突围逃走。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈声> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈声"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈声> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳聲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈声> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈声> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙皓时，为中书丞、司市中郎将，素为孙皓幸臣。以对孙皓爱妾使人至市劫夺百姓财物绳之以法，触怒孙皓。皓假借他事烧锯断其头，将其身扔于四望之下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李朔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李朔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李朔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李朔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李朔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李朔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与郡内其它豪强各拥部曲，侵害平民。太守令郡督邮满宠举法惩处。朔等请罪，不再抄掠。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张进> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张进"@zh .
