<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张进> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张进> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "延康元年（220），朝廷初置凉州，以安定太守邹岐为刺史，进执太守杜通，举兵拒岐。护羌校尉、全城太守苏则讨进，斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫权> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卫权"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫权> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯舆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫权> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫权> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汝南王亮辅政时，权任尚书郎。曾为左思的《吴都赋》作叙及注。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柯吾> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "柯吾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柯吾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "柯吾"@zh .
