<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕由> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕由"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕由> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吕由"@zh .
