<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓威> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任安成令。年十八即著《浑舆经》。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#侯览> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "侯览"@zh .
