<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏种> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操曾举种为孝廉。兖州叛，种归袁绍，失曹操所望。献帝建安四年（199），操拔射犬，擒种，因其才而不杀，举为河内太守，掌河北事。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑熙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑熙"@zh .
