<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑熙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "玄菟郡高显县长，后为起义吏民所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴懿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴懿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴懿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子远"@zh .
