<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴懿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "随刘焉入蜀。刘璋时，为中郎将，将兵拒先主于涪，诣降。先主定益州，以壹为护军讨逆将军，纳壹妹为夫人。章武元年，为关中都督。建兴八年，与魏延入南安界，破魏将费瑶，徙亭侯，进封高阳乡侯，迁左将军。十二年，丞相亮卒，以壹督汉中，车骑将军，假节..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴懿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初为刘璋将，先主入川，懿降之。蜀建，先主纳懿妹。后封为左将军，高阳侯，随丞相诸葛亮北伐。亮薨，懿守汉中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥公> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "桥公"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥公> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "橋公"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥公> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥公> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末人。有二女，皆绝代佳人。长女大桥嫁孙策，次女小桥嫁周瑜。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥公> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中为乔公、乔国老。建安三年，孙策攻皖，策、周瑜得乔公两女，皆国色也。策自纳大乔，瑜纳小乔。后瑜定美人计，引刘备进吴成亲，乔公不知详情，力促此婚事成。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#檀石槐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "檀石槐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#檀石槐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "檀石槐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#檀石槐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#檀石槐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末鲜卑部族首领。他创立法律，统一了东西诸部落，立庭于弹汗山。兵马强盛，征战四方，尽据匈奴故地，东西万二千余里，南北七千余里。他又将其辖地分为东、中、西三部，每部各置大人为首领。常攻掠汉族地区。桓帝时，征之不克；遣使者赍印绶，欲封其..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋休> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蒋休"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋休> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蔣休"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋休> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋休> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时吴将领蒋钦少子。父兄卒，代领兵，后因罪失业。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐宣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐宣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐宣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宝坚"@zh .
