<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐宣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "宣避乱江东，又辞孙策之命，还本郡。与陈矫并为纲纪，二人齐名而私好不协，然俱见器于太守陈登，与登并心于太祖。海西、淮浦二县民作乱，都尉卫弥、令梁习夜奔宣家，密送免之。太祖遣督军扈质来讨贼，以兵少不进。宣潜见责之，示以形势，质乃进破贼。太..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#不耐濊王> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "不耐濊王"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#不耐濊王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#不耐濊王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "濊首领。濊南与辰韩，北与高句丽、沃沮接，东穷大海，今属朝鲜。魏齐王芳正始六年（245），乐浪太守刘茂等兴师伐之，不耐侯等举邑降。其八年，诏更拜不耐濊王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#顺阳乡君> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "顺阳乡君"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#顺阳乡君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "順陽鄉君"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#顺阳乡君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#顺阳乡君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏高贵乡公曹髦卞皇后之亲母，刘氏，追封为顺阳乡君。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李孚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李孚"@zh .
