<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李孚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李孚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "兴平中，本郡人民饥困。孚为诸生，当种薤，欲以成计。有从索者，亦不与一茎，亦不自食，故时人谓能行意。后为吏。建安中，袁尚领冀州，以孚为主簿。太祖进攻谭，谭战死。孚还城，城中虽必降，尚扰乱未安。孚权宜欲得见太祖，乃骑诣牙门，称冀州主簿李孚..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李孚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁尚主簿。时曹公讨河北，尚遣孚扮作曹军都督，直至城下。大叫：“开门！”审配认得是李孚声音，放入城中，说：“袁尚已陈兵在阳平亭，等候接应，若城中兵出，亦举火为号。”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周直> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周直"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周直> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "周直"@zh .
