<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周直> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "豪族。拥众二千余家。因与李通有隙，被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐存> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐存"@zh .
