<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐存> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建衡元年（269）以督军之职奉命从建安海路往合浦，与虞汜、薛珝、陶璜、李勖等将合击晋空阯，因道不通而还，被吴主孙皓诛杀，其家属亦不免。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张衡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张衡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張衡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "“五斗米道”创立者张陵之子。陵死，衡行其道。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "原来张鲁乃沛国丰人，其祖张陵在西川鹄鸣山中造作道书以惑人，人皆敬之。陵死之后，其子张衡行之。百姓但有学道者，助米五斗，世号米贼。张衡死，张鲁行之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜基> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜基"@zh .
