<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜基> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜基> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "杜袭之兄。明帝时，杜袭迁大将军军师，分其食邑百户给基，并赐爵关内候。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李定> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李定"@zh .
