<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾预言刘备家必出贵人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马伦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马伦"@zh .
