<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王士> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "先为符节长，迁牙门将，出为宕渠太守。后随诸葛亮南征，转为益州太守，为西南部族所害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邯郸淳> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邯郸淳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邯郸淳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子叔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邯郸淳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邯郸淳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "博学有才章。初平时，从三辅客荆州，得太祖召见，甚敬异之。又得曹植喜爱。时世子未立，而淳屡赞植之才。文帝即位，以淳为博士给事中。著有《投壶赋》。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邯郸淳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "年少有文采。上虞令度尚为表彰孝女曹娥的事迹，令邯郸淳作文，镌碑以记其事。时邯郸淳年方十三岁，文不加点，一挥而就，立石墓侧。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高尚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高尚"@zh .
