<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白爵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉农民起义军首领之一，响应张角起兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#濮阳兴> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "濮阳兴"@zh .
