<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#濮阳兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权时为上虞令，迁尚书左曹、五官中郎将、会稽大守。孙休即位，征为太常卫将军、平军国事，封外黄侯。永安三年（260），力主建丹杨湖田，事倍功半，百姓大怨。后迁为丞相。休卒，与张布迎立孙皓。任侍郎，领青州牧。为万彧所谮，徙广州，于道中被追..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#濮阳兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "丞相。无视皇帝孙休的遗嘱，拥立年长的孙皓为皇帝。因为劝谏暴虐的孙皓而惹得孙皓发怒，一族全都被斩首。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张横> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张横"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张横> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張橫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张横> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张横> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十六年（211），马超与关中诸将张横、侯选、程银、李堪、梁兴、成宜、马玩、杨秋、韩遂等，凡十部，俱反，其众十万，同据河、潼，建列营陈。后为曹操所败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张横> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "建安十六年，横随马超、韩遂等反。后横随遂、庞德等夜袭曹营，中埋伏，战死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁统> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "梁统"@zh .
