<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨帛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张鲁部将。曾劝霍峻降于张鲁，峻不从，投奔刘备。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈友> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "沈友"@zh .
