<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王照> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "据地为乱。延康元年（220），与郑甘率众降魏，封为列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王商> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王商"@zh .
