<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋玮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "章武二年（222），彝陵之战前，魏攻吴，吴与蜀联盟。刘备曾多次派遣他和费祎等使吴。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#骨进> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "骨进"@zh .
