<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#骨进> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#骨进> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "乌丸王。乌丸王骨进桀黠不恭，田豫因出塞案行，单将麾下百馀骑入进部。进逆拜，遂使左右斩进，显其罪恶以令众。众皆怖慴不敢动，便以进弟代进。自是胡人破胆，威震沙漠。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕桂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕桂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕桂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吕桂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕桂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕桂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "万年亭侯吕虔之孙，吕翻之子。翻死后嗣封。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾信> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "贾信"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾信> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "賈信"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾信> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾信> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安八年（203），随曹操攻破袁尚，屯黎阳（今河南浚县东南）。又讨伐反将田银、苏伯、大破之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡讽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蔡讽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡讽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蔡諷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡讽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡讽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉末名将蔡瑁的父亲，姐姐嫁给太尉张温，长女嫁给黄承彦（诸葛亮岳父），小女为刘表后妻。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#向朗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "向朗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#向朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "巨达"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#向朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#向朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "先荆州牧刘表以为临沮长。表卒，归先主。先主定江南，使朗督秭归、夷道、巫（山）、夷陵四县军民事。蜀既平，以朗为巴西太守，顷之转任牂牁，又徙房陵。后主践阼，为步兵校尉，代王连领丞相长史。丞相亮南征，朗留统后事。五年，随亮汉中。朗素与马谡善..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#向朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "向宠之叔父。一直为刘表效力，表忘，归顺了刘备。后辅佐关羽，守备荆州。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严昕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "严昕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严昕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "嚴昕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严昕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严昕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "盐渎严昕与数人共候佗，適至，佗谓昕曰：“君身中佳否？”昕曰：“自如常。”佗曰：“君有急病见于面，莫多饮酒。”坐毕归，行数里，昕卒头眩堕车，人扶将还，载归家，中宿死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓骘> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邓骘"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓骘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "昭伯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓骘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓骘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "邓训长子，少辟大将军窦宪府。及妹为和帝皇后，累迁至车骑将军。殇帝卒，与太后定策立安帝，封上蔡侯。奉诏率军讨西羌，还拜大将军。母忧去职。建光元年（121），邓太后卒，徙封为罗侯，未几，免官，遣就国，不食而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡方> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蔡方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蔡方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为利成郡（今山东临沂）兵，魏文帝黄初六年（225），率同伙谋叛，杀郡太守徐质，后兵败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙规> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙规"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙规> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫規"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙规> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙规> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十九年（214）五月孙权向刘备索还荆州不得，便派吕蒙督规等将领攻取长沙、零陵、桂阳三郡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴乾> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "戴乾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴乾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "戴乾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴乾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴乾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陈群举荐于曹操，用之。后吴人叛，乾遇害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#子冥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "子冥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#子冥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子冥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#子冥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#子冥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "夏朝时商部落首领，相土的曾孙，曹圉之子，商汤八世祖，子姓，甲骨文中称谓季。冥任夏司空，是在大禹之后的又一位治水英雄，任官勤劳，死于水中，后商人以郊祭祭祀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#扶禁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "扶禁"@zh .
