<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#扶禁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘备入蜀后，与刘璋冲突，自葭萌南还袭刘璋，以中郎将霍峻留守。禁与向存等率众万余攻葭萌近一年，不能下，后反为霍峻伺隙击破。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王潜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王潜"@zh .
