<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王潜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王潜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "北降入吴。曾向步骘献策。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许仪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "许仪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "許儀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父许褚，武卫将军。许褚亡，仪嗣爵。太和中，帝思褚忠孝，下诏褒赞，复赐褚子孙二人爵关内侯。伐蜀之时，会令牙门将仪在前治道，会在后行，而桥穿，马足陷，于是斩仪。泰始初，子综嗣。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "许褚之子，武卫将军。随钟会伐蜀，为先锋开道。然及会过路陷，会归，大怒斩仪。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李越> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李越"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李越> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李越"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李越> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李越> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安中，在陇西起兵反。曹操所置金城太守苏则率羌、胡围攻，越即请降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李通[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李通[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李通[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "次元"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李通[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李通[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "家中富有。初仕莽新为五威将军从事，出补巫县丞，以有能力闻名，后自免归，与刘秀密定大计。起兵后，其父、兄弟、宗族数十人被王莽所杀。更始立，以战功拜大将军，封平西王。光武即位，任卫尉，累官大司空。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#史路> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "史路"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#史路> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "史路"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#史路> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#史路> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "值京都乱，苗、隐见害，招俱与隐门生史路等触蹈锋刃，共殡敛隐尸，送丧还归。道遇寇钞，路等皆悉散走。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#普富卢> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "普富卢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#普富卢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "普富盧"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#普富卢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#普富卢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末代郡乌丸行单于。曹操来到易水，代郡乌丸行单于普富卢、上郡乌丸行单于那楼带领他们的各个王前来道贺。"@zh .
