<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姚泰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "江陵令。曹魏围攻江陵，泰领兵备城北门，见外兵盛，城中人少，乃与曹军交通，谋为内应，事泄，被杀。"@zh .
