<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙布> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太和五年（228）孙布诈降魏刺史王淩，当王淩遣步骑七百人迎降时，布即乘夜掩击，魏军死伤过半。"@zh .
