<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张翔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张翔怨恨许靖不和自己结交，搜寻许靖送的书信奏疏，全部都投到了水中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴起> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴起"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴起> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吴起"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴起> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴起> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "著名的政治改革家，卓越的军事家、统帅、军事改革家,法家学派早期代表人物。卫国左氏（今山东定陶，一说山东曹县）人，他曾经拜鲁国的曾子为师，学习儒术。敢于改革、善于用兵。后世把他和孙武连称“孙吴”，著有《吴子》，《吴子》与《孙子》又合称《..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴起> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "战国时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈成> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "沈成"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "沈成"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安中，与同郡瞿恭、江宫等起事造反，为曹操部将李建所破斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白侯子安> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "白侯子安"@zh .
