<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白侯子安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白侯子安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东吴大臣张昭之师，授《左氏春秋》。白侯为复姓。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙狼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙狼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙狼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫狼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙狼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙狼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末农民起义军首领。建安二十三年（218）陆浑（今河南嵩县东北）县长张固发民服徭役，百姓惶俱，狼等乘机发动起义，杀县主簿，攻破县城，后南下投奔蜀将关羽。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周荣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周荣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周荣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "平孙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周荣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周荣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "周瑜从曾祖父。章帝时辅袁安与窦氏争权，生死度外。窦氏败，封为尚书令。后犯法，和帝念其忠节，免下狱，由颍川太守贬为共县令，后为山阳太守。所在郡县，有政绩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁准> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁准"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁准> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝尼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁准> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁准> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "忠信公正，不耻下问。以世事多险，故常恬退而不敢求进。著书十余万言，论治世之务，为《易》、《周官》、《诗》传，并论五经滞义，圣人微言，以传于世。入晋后，泰始（265-274）中任给事中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢显> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卢显"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢显> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "盧顯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢显> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢显> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "文帝黄初中，书吏李若贪其妻色而杀显。太守胡质为之伸冤。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛冉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "辛冉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛冉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "辛冉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛冉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛冉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "惠帝时任广汉太守。性贪暴，激起李特为首的流民起义。为李特所败，出奔江阳。八王之乱爆发后，他向镇南大将军刘弘进纵横之计，刘弘怒而斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马量> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马量"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马量> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "司馬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马量> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马量> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "司马懿之曾祖父。另一种说法为司马景。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马量> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司马懿之曾祖父。演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王惇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王惇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王惇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王惇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王惇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王惇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太平元年十一月，以孙綝为大将军、假节，封永宁侯。将军惇与孙宪谋杀綝，事觉，綝杀惇，迫宪令自杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王惇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙峻病亡，从弟綝辅政。綝为人强暴，杀大司马滕胤、将军惇、吕据等，因此权柄皆归于綝。后綝废吴主亮，立休为帝，休诛綝，将被害惇等家，重建坟墓，以表其忠。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟进> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "钟进"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟进> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鍾進"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟进> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟进> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟进> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "钟繇之弟。随钟繇一起守备长安，夜间发现长安西门起火，他前去救火时，被早已混进城中的马超部将庞德斩杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#牛盖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "牛盖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#牛盖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "牛蓋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#牛盖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#牛盖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "随张辽讨陈兰，有功。陈兰、梅成以氐六县叛，太祖遣于禁、臧霸等讨成，辽督张郃、牛盖等讨兰。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张世> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张世"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张世> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張世"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张世> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张世> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权随从。建安二十三年（218），权乘马射虎于庱亭，马为虎所伤，权投以双戟，未中，世击以戈，获之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡风> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蔡风"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡风> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蔡風"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡风> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡风> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "安帝时为辽东太守，后与高句丽王战，败殁。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#中黄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "中黄"@zh .
