<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#中黄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "亦称“中黄伯”。远古传说中人物，黄帝时为将，破杀蚩尤。三国演义中有提及此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关定> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "关定"@zh .
