<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "关定有二子，长子关宁学文，次子关平学武。关羽千里寻兄，会刘备于关定庄上，关定因敬慕羽，欲令次子关平跟随关羽。刘备做主让关羽收关平为子，关定大喜，便命关平拜关公为父，呼玄德为伯父。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞延[蜀]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庞延[蜀]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞延[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "龐延"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞延[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞延[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "时举茂才，蒋琬固让于延等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘子惠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘子惠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘子惠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉子惠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘子惠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘子惠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝时，为冀州牧韩馥治中从事。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛洪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "葛洪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "稚川"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "思想家、医药学家。自号抱朴子。历任散骑常侍、谘议参军等职。曾参与镇压石冰起义。好儒学，兼及神仙导养之术，晚年辞官谢客，于罗浮山精研炼丹。著有《抱朴子》和《肘后备急方》，论及疾病、长寿、世事。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫弥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卫弥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫弥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "衛彌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫弥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫弥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "时海西、淮浦二县民众起兵，杀官吏。弥任当地都尉，惧乱，连夜躲入徐宣家，密送出境，方免被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄袭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄袭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄袭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "黄襲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄袭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄袭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "因街亭之败，被夺兵权。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕旷> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕旷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕旷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吕曠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕旷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕旷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末袁尚部将。袁绍死，其子谭、尚争冀州。谭被尚所围，求救于曹操。操至，尚解围去。旷遂与吕翔叛尚，率众降曹操，封为列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕旷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁尚麾下大将，吕翔之兄。战无数合斩袁谭将岑璧，得以令袁尚军败袁谭。后投降袁谭，接受了将军印绶，但是将其献给曹操，归顺了曹氏。与吕翔一起进攻新野，但是被赵云刺死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董恢> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董恢"@zh .
