<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐他> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "阴谋叛操而杀之，因许褚常侍左右而无机会下手，后乘许褚休假怀刀欲乱，褚忽感心跳，故还侍曹操。他等入操帐见有许褚，惊愕色变，为褚所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘括> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘括"@zh .
