<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘括> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝建安十六年（211），避乱入汉中，买得因乱失散的刘备长子刘禅，遂养以为子，为娶妻立家。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习隆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "习隆"@zh .
