<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢举> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安中，任乌桓校尉。广阳人阎柔利用鲜卑人众，将其杀死，代为乌桓校尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑默> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑默"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑默> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "思元"@zh .
