<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑默> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "郑袤长子。起家秘书郎，仕魏至司徒左长史，封关内侯。入晋为中庶子，出为东郡（今河南濮阳县南）太守，以忧国忧民受褒奖。后父丧去官，寻起为廷尉。又母丧守孝，期满，为大司农，转光禄勋。武帝太康元年（280）卒，年六十八，谥曰成。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全熙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "全熙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全熙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "全熙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全熙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全熙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "全琮族子。建兴二年（253），他与孙壹、施绩攻公安督诸葛融，迫使诸葛融自杀。太平二年（257），同族全怿、全端、全祎、全仪等降魏，他以谋泄被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张英> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张英"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張英"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "扬州牧刘繇部将。繇遣英、樊能屯江边以拒之。以吴景、孙贲为袁术所授用，乃迫逐使去。于是术乃自置扬州刺史，与景、贲并力攻英、能等，岁余不下。汉命加繇为牧，振武将军，众数万人，孙策东渡，破英、能等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙策东渡，英领一军屯于牛渚，两军相对，英与策将黄盖战，后为蒋钦、周泰于后军放火，军大乱，英弃了牛渚，望深山而逃。英败回见繇，繇怒欲斩之。谋士笮融、薛礼劝免，使屯兵零陵城拒敌。后策破繇，还兵复攻秣陵，中冷箭，策诈死，军中举哀。礼闻策死，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡济> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "胡济"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伟度"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为丞相亮主簿，有忠荩之效，故见褒述。李恢诣允尝与尚书令费祎、中典军济等共期游宴，严驾已办，而郎中襄阳董恢诣允脩敬。建兴九年，李严乱军，济为行参军、昭武中郎将，与亮奏请废之。十二年，亮薨，为中典军，统诸军，封成阳亭侯。延熙十一年，镇北..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀国昭武中郎将，先随诸葛亮后随姜维伐魏。姜维屯田避祸，就令胡济守汉寿城。钟会伐蜀，汉中失，济抵敌不住，逃回成都求援。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高通> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高通"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高通> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "高通"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高通> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高通> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "宦官。得吴主孙皓宠信，赏以重爵，使领战兵。陆凯斥之为“黄门小人”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜叙母> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "姜叙母"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜叙母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "姜敍母"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜叙母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜叙母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "马超败走历城，尽洗城中百姓，杀姜叙老母及尹奉、赵昂全家老幼。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜叙母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏国抚彝将军姜叙的母亲，马超杀死刺史韦康，她鼓励儿子要为国尽忠，抵抗马超。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寇娄敦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "寇娄敦"@zh .
