<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寇娄敦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寇娄敦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时右北平乌丸单于。景初元年（237），魏遣幽州刺史毌丘俭讨辽东，寇娄敦率众降。并遣弟阿罗槃等诣魏都朝贡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张范> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张范"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公仪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "丞相参军祭酒、领赵郡太守、汉司徒张歆之孙、汉太尉张延之子。太傅袁隗欲以女妻范，范辞不受。性恬静乐道，忽于荣利，徵命无所就。范避地扬州。袁术备礼招请，范称疾不往，术不强屈也。太祖平冀州，遣使迎范。范以疾留彭城，遣承诣太祖，太祖表以为谏议..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘宠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘宠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘宠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "祖荣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘宠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘宠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "以明经举孝廉，除东平陵令。母疾，弃官奉养。累迁至豫章太守、会稽太守。桓帝、灵帝时，四列九卿，两为司空，再迁司徒、太尉。任内，薄衣服，弊车马，无货积。往来京师，下道而过。为政简，除烦苛，禁察非法。以老病卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高雅> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高雅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高雅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "高雅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高雅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高雅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吕布部将。在须昌为曹操部将于禁所败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#审德> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "审德"@zh .
