<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#审德> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权黄武五年（227），屯皖（今安徽安庆市北），为魏征东大将军曹休所破，被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左伯桃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "左伯桃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左伯桃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "左伯桃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左伯桃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左伯桃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "春秋时人，与羊角哀为友，一同到楚国去谋事，路途中干粮用尽，又降大雪，左伯桃认为学问不如羊角哀，便脱衣冻死，让羊角哀把自己的衣服穿上，把剩余的干粮带走。羊角哀到了楚国，楚平王因爱惜羊角哀的才能，以上卿的礼节安葬左伯桃。其后羊角哀梦见左伯..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#左伯桃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "春秋时人，与羊角哀为友，有羊角哀舍命全交的典故。三国演义中有提及此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甘瑰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "甘瑰"@zh .
