<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马齐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马齐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马齐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "承伯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马齐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马齐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "齐为太守张飞功曹。飞贡之先主，为尚书郎。建兴中，从事丞相掾，迁广汉太守，复为（飞）参军。亮卒，为尚书。齐以才干自显见；归信於州党，不如姚伷。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑弘> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑弘"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑弘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "巨君"@zh .
