<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "安远将军、庲降都督。以荆州从事随先主入蜀。蜀既定，为犍为属国都尉，因易郡名，为朱提太守，选为安远将军、庲降都督，住南昌县。章武二年卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张通> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张通"@zh .
