<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张通> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张通> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘禅末年为殿中督。刘禅降魏，东迁洛阳，蜀之大臣无翼从者，唯通与郤正舍妻子，单身随侍。在魏封列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁安> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁安"@zh .
