<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁绍高祖。好学有威重。明帝时为楚郡太守，治办楚王案，所申理者四百余家，皆蒙全济，遂成名臣。章帝时任司徒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑胄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑胄"@zh .
