<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑胄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少知名，举贤良，累迁建安（今福建建瓯）太守、宣信校尉、执金吾、步兵校尉等官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王门> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王门"@zh .
