<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹卢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹卢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴大帝孙权黄武元年（222），为吴将全琮、徐盛所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘毅> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘毅"@zh .
