<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘毅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "北海敬王刘睦子。初封平望侯，和帝永元（89-105）中，坐事夺爵。安帝元初元年（114），著上《汉德论》并《宪论》十二篇。永宁年间（120-121），受诏与刘珍等人撰《中兴以下名臣列士传》（即《东观汉记》之部分）。《后汉书》有传。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张邵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张邵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張邵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "惠帝时为中护军，与舅杨骏同时被诛。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吾彦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吾彦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吾彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "士则"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吾彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吾彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋大长秋。出自寒微，有文武才干。身长八尺，手格猛兽，旅力绝群。仕吴为通江吏。初为小将，给吴大司马陆抗。抗奇其勇略，将拔用之，患众情不允，乃会诸将，密使人阳狂拔刀跳跃而来，坐上诸将皆惧而走，唯彦不动，举几御之，众服其勇，乃擢用焉。稍迁建..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吾彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "吴建平太守。吴灭，众军皆降，惟独彦拒城不下，闻吴亡，乃降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郎稚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郎稚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郎稚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郎稚"@zh .
