<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#慕容烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#慕容烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国演义中的虚构人物。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#慕容烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "文聘部将。赵云前往汉水北山援救被困的黄忠，他与赵云相遇，一合之内被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡班> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "胡班"@zh .
