<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡班> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡班> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "荥阳太守王植麾下从事。其父胡华曾任桓帝时议郎，致仕回乡。胡班奉命放火夜袭关公，因敬服关公气概，并从关公处得到其父家书。班看毕，感叹险些误杀忠良，遂将关公放走。后胡班到荆州来投降关公，公念其旧日相救之情，甚爱之；令随费诗入川，见汉中王受爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊建> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "樊建"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "长元"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初仕蜀，延熙二十四年，以校尉使吴，值孙权病笃，不自见建。权问诸葛恪曰：“樊建何如宗预也？”恪对曰：“才识不及预，而雅性过之。”后为侍中，守尚书令。自建、董厥、诸葛瞻统事，姜维常征伐在外，宦人黄皓窃弄机柄，咸共将护，无能匡矫，然建特不与..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "先仕蜀，以典军书记随丞相亮北伐。后为令史，姜维欲再次伐魏，建谏止，维不从。后为尚书令，及蜀破，后主禅赴洛阳，建等数人跟随。入魏，封侯爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘植> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘植"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘植> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘植> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘植> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西汉末，从王郎起兵，旋归刘秀，拜骁骑将军。东汉光武帝建武二年（26），封昌城侯。后战死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏迁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "魏迁"@zh .
