<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄他> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄他> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为小吏。"@zh .
