<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "卢毓子。仕魏为尚书郎、侍御史、琅邪太守、从事中郎、阳平太守、淮北都督、伏波将军。所在甚有政绩。拜散骑常侍、大司农。迁吏部尚书，进封大梁侯。曾袭父爵为大利亭侯。晋立，钦为都督沔北诸军事、平南将军、假节。在镇缓急得当，疆场无虞。入为尚书仆..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙毓> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙毓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙毓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫毓"@zh .
