<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙毓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "青州刺史孙观之子。观死，毓嗣，官至青州刺史。"@zh .
