<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜冏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "姜维之父。曾任功曹，值羌、戎叛乱，以身卫护郡将，没于战场。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张俭[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张俭[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张俭[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元节"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张俭[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张俭[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初举茂才，以刺史非其人，谢病不起。延熹八年（165），太守翟超请为东部督邮。中常侍侯览残暴百姓，俭举劾其罪，触怒览。乡人朱并诬告俭与同郡二十四人为党，朝廷刊章讨捕，俭长期流亡在外。中平元年(184)，党事解，乃归乡里。大将军、三公并辟..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张俭[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中介绍江夏八俊时，提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阳仪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阳仪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阳仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陽儀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阳仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阳仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "公孙度吏。奉承公孙度当为天子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#掖邪狗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "掖邪狗"@zh .
