<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#掖邪狗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏正始四年（243），受倭王派遣，与伊声耆等八人，向魏献生口、倭锦、绛青缣等。魏对掖邪狗等皆拜率善中郎将印绶。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管统> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "管统"@zh .
