<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管统> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东莱太守，后投奔袁谭。曹操破袁谭，嘉其忠，赦之。"@zh .
