<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王生> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹真部下。诸葛亮围祁山时，真以亮惩于祁山，后出必从陈仓，乃使将军郝昭、王生守陈仓，治其城。"@zh .
