<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张超[张邈弟]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张超[张邈弟]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张超[张邈弟]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張超"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张超[张邈弟]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张超[张邈弟]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "表字不详，据嘉靖版《三国志通俗演义》字孟高（另有说法认为他字景明，事实上张景明并不是张超，而是张导）。灵帝末为广陵太守。董卓弑帝，图危社稷，功曹臧洪说超诛除国贼，超然其言，与洪西至陈留，见兄邈计事。超从曹公檄文，起兵讨卓。后超遣洪诣大..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张超[张邈弟]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "广陵太守。董卓弑帝，超从曹公檄文，起兵讨卓。后随兄邈投吕布，城为曹公破，超自刎。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#屈绪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "屈绪"@zh .
