<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董嗣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董嗣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董嗣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "董嗣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董嗣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董嗣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "地方势力首领。活动在豫章、临川一带。吴鄱阳太守周鲂遣间谍，诱杀之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏恂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏恂"@zh .
