<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏恂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏恂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "属韩当部。蜀主备统军侵吴，当及周泰引军相迎。当回顾众将曰：“谁敢冲突蜀兵？”恂挺枪出马。蜀将张苞挺丈八矛，纵马而出，大喝一声，直取恂。恂见苞声若巨雷，心中惊惧；恰待要走，泰弟平见恂抵敌不住，挥刀纵马而来。蜀将关兴见了，跃马提刀来迎。苞..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任奕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "任奕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任奕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "任奕"@zh .
