<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任奕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "官御史中丞。学者朱育称其为“文章之士”。著有《任子》。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡阳> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蔡阳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡阳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蔡陽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡阳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡阳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "亦作蔡扬，曹操部将。建安六年九月，袁绍使刘备略汝南，汝南贼龚都等应之。太祖遣阳击都，不利，军破，阳为备所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡阳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操部将。太祖部下诸将皆敬服关羽，独阳不服，故今日闻其千里寻兄，欲往追之。太祖叱之，不令去赶。后羽过关斩将，杀阳外甥秦琪，阳引军追至古城边，挺刀纵马战羽，为羽所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李韶> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李韶"@zh .
