<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾轻贱曹操，及操贵，欲报旧怨，邵惧而逃至交州避难，操遣使令太守士燮尽诛其族。邵被带到操前，叩头谢罪，操仍杀之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄吴> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄吴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄吴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "黄吴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄吴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄吴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "高凉渠帅。赤乌十一年（248），交阯九真夷人攻没城邑，交部骚动。交州刺史、安南校尉陆胤实行招抚政策，吴率所领出降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士壹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "士壹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士壹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "士壹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士壹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士壹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "士燮之弟。曾因恭送刺史丁宫而后被宫召入朝廷，因董卓之乱，士壹逃回故里，领合浦太守。后随兄降吴，最后因其侄士徽叛乱牵连而被免为庶人，数年后因犯法而被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王豹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王豹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王豹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王豹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王豹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王豹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "王基之父。追赠北海太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#翟文耀> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "翟文耀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#翟文耀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "翟文耀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#翟文耀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#翟文耀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "石苞为鄴典农，与辂相见，问曰：“闻君乡里翟文耀能隐形，其事可信乎？”辂言：“此但阴阳蔽匿之数，苟得其数，则四岳可藏，河海可逃。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘柱> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘柱"@zh .
