<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊阿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "名医。华佗高徒，善针术及养生之道，寿百余岁。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛诠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "诸葛诠"@zh .
