<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛诠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛诠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "诸葛冲之子。字德林，历兖州刺史、散骑常侍、廷尉等官。怀帝永嘉五年（311），为石勒所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄邕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄邕"@zh .
