<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄邕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄权在曹魏的儿子，继嗣。死后无子，爵除。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马伷> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马伷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马伷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子将"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马伷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马伷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "司马懿第五子，司马师、司马昭之同父异母弟。司马伷年轻时就有才能和名气，在魏仕官至征虏将军，西晋代魏后被封为东莞郡王，入朝为尚书右仆射、抚军将军，又外放为镇东大将军，镇守下邳，治御有方，得将士死力，吴人都很顾忌他。后来，司马伷改封为琅邪..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马伷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西晋镇东大将军、瑯琊王，三国演义第120回登场，于灭吴之战中兵出涂中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡元才> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蔡元才"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡元才> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蔡元才"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡元才> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡元才> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏术士管辂之友，号称清才。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄朗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄朗"@zh .
