<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄初中为长吏，迁长安令，会母丧不赴任。复为魏令，迁襄城典农中郎将、涿郡太守。明帝时因病而卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周遗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周遗"@zh .
