<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周遗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周遗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为生活所迫，逃入丹杨山。后为臼阳长胡伉缚送官府。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖郎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "祖郎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖郎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "祖郎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖郎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖郎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "时吴主策既平定江东，袁术深怨策，乃阴遣间使赍印绶与郎等，使激动山越，大合众，图共攻策。策自率将士讨郎，生获之。策谓郎曰：“尔昔袭击孤，斫孤马鞍，今创军立事，除弃宿恨，惟取能用，与天下通耳。非但汝，汝莫恐怖。”郎叩头谢罪。即破械，赐衣服..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖郎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "泾县大帅。袁术使孙策为怀义校尉，引兵攻郎得胜。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#如淳> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "如淳"@zh .
