<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄珍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安年间为郡丞。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王必> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王必"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王必> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王必"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王必> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王必> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为太祖心腹，汉少府耿纪、丞相司直韦晃、太医令吉本、本子邈、穆以金祎与必善，因以间之，若杀必，欲挟天子以攻魏，南援刘备。建安二十三年春正月甲子，纪等起兵诛太祖，攻焚丞相长史必营，不克。邈等率杂人及家僮千余人夜烧门攻必，祎遣人为内应，射必..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王必> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏丞相长史。太祖因见辂言许都将大火，不敢轻动，留居邺郡。教长史必总督御林军马。主簿司马懿言必嗜酒性宽，恐不堪任此职。太祖以必是其披荆棘历艰难时相随之人，忠而且勤，心如铁石，最足相当。遂不从，委必领御林军马屯于许都东华门外。少府耿纪等放..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩龙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩龙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "韓龍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "青龙三年（235），幽州刺史王雄遣龙刺杀鲜卑族大人轲比能。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵浮> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵浮"@zh .
