<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#舒伯膺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#舒伯膺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "其亲友为人所杀，弟邵为之报怨。事觉，兄弟争死，皆得免。"@zh .
