<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨赐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太尉杨震孙。少传家学，笃志博闻。建宁初，侍讲于华光殿，迁少府，光禄勋。熹平年间，历任司空、光禄大夫、司徒。光和年间、历任太常、太尉。中平二年（185）卒，谥文烈侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高艾> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高艾"@zh .
