<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高艾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "聚众数千，出入幽冀两州打家劫舍为害。魏护乌丸校尉田豫诱使鲜卑素利部斩之，传首京都。"@zh .
