<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹珍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "正元二年（255），吴将孙峻等袭寿春，珍与其遇于高亭，交战，败绩。"@zh .
