<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏伯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十六年（211），曹操西征马超，伯与田银反于河间。曹仁都督七军破之。"@zh .
