<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#舒燮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "赤乌中为重安长，有罪下狱。太常潘濬尝失燮，欲镇之以法，赖孙邻规劝，濬意即解。"@zh .
