<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫旌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与步骘同年相善。曾任武陵太守，因疑潘濬与蜀相通而被免官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#施宽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "施宽"@zh .
