<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#施宽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太平元年（256），骠骑将军吕据反，孙綝遣宽等以舟兵抵抗吕据。"@zh .
