<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徵崇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "学者。初隐居会稽，射耕谋生。吴主孙权时，尚书令严畯荐之。官至中书郎，年七十而卒。治《易》、《春秋左氏传》，兼善内术。教生徒不务多，然必令其有成。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#正昂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "正昂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#正昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "正昂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#正昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#正昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "益州、建宁郡太守。为当地大姓雍闿等所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#靳允> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "靳允"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#靳允> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "靳允"@zh .
