<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#靳允> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任范县（今山东梁山西北）令。时吕布作乱，执允母弟妻子，陈宫投奔吕布。允杀陈宫使臣氾嶷，固守范县城。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵泉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵泉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵泉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "赵泉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵泉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵泉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "御医。雍为相十九年，年七十六，赤乌六年卒。初疾微时，权令医赵泉视之，拜其少子济为骑都尉。雍闻，悲曰：“泉善别死生，吾必不起，故上欲及吾目见济拜也。”权素服临吊，谥曰肃侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王度> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王度"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王度"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄巾起，县丞王度反应之，烧仓库。县令逾城走，吏民负老幼东奔渠丘山。昱使人侦视度，度等得空城不能守，出城西五六里止屯。昱谓县中大姓薛房等曰：“今度等得城郭不能居，其势可知。此不过欲虏掠财物，非有坚甲利兵攻守之志也。今何不相率还城而守之？..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘惇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘惇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘惇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子仁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘惇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘惇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末术士。遭乱避地，客游庐陵（今江西吉安西），事庐陵太守孙辅为军师。善方术，尤精天文，以此显名江南。著书百余籍。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕合> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕合"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕合> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吕合"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕合> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕合> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安中与秦狼等在会稽、东冶五县起事。后孙权遣蒋钦、吕岱率兵镇压，遂被擒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨原> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨原"@zh .
