<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑甘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑甘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾揭竿造反。魏文帝黄初元年（220），降魏，封列侯。二年，复叛，兵败被斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周旌> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周旌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周旌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "周旌"@zh .
