<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周旌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "时天下大乱，与冀州刺史王芬、南阳许攸等谋废灵帝，立合肥侯以此告曹操，曹操拒之，后败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘临> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "潘临"@zh .
