<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘临> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "会稽山贼大帅。临旧为所在毒害，历年不禽。陆逊以手下召兵，讨治深险，所向皆服。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢毓> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卢毓"@zh .
