<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒲忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "镇守魏吴边境，多次被吴将朱然击败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏则> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苏则"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏则> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文师"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏则> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏则> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏东平相。少以学行闻，举孝廉茂才，辟公府，皆不就。起家为酒泉太守，转安定、武都，所在有威名。太祖征张鲁，过其郡，见则悦之，使为军导。鲁破，则绥定下辩诸氐，通河西道，徙为金城太守。则外招怀羌胡，得其牛羊，以养贫老。与民分粮而食，旬月之间..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#种暠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "种暠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#种暠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "景伯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#种暠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#种暠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "暠父遗财三千万，暠悉以赈恤宗族邑里贫者。顺帝时举孝廉，为侍御史。后出为益州刺史。匈奴寇边，擢为度辽将军，后迁司徒。卒于位。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆晏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陆晏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆晏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陸晏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆晏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆晏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陆抗之子。抗卒，晏与弟景等分领抗兵。为裨将军、夷道监。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马洪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马洪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孔业"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "（？-276）晋宗室。字孔业。司马望子。出继叔父遗。仕魏历任典农中郎将、原武太守，封襄贲男。晋武帝立国，封河间王。咸宁二年（276）卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘夫人> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘夫人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉夫人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏武帝曹操妻，早卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩暹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩暹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩暹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "韓暹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩暹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩暹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "原为河东故白波帅。献帝兴平二年（195），助杨奉与李傕、郭汜战，败。后胁献帝都安邑，拜为征东大将军。因粮尽兵乱，还洛阳。曹操迎帝都许昌。暹、奉不能奉王法，逃奔。建安二年（197年），袁术遣其大将张勋、桥蕤等与韩暹等人攻吕布。吕布说服韩..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩暹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "河东郡“白波贼”的大将，与董承、杨奉等人一起护送献帝去洛阳。害怕曹操的威势，和杨奉联手与曹操敌对。后来被关羽、张飞杀死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#顾邵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "顾邵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#顾邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝则"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#顾邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#顾邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "出身江南士族。顾雍长子。博览群书，远近称之。娶孙策女为妻。年二十七任豫章太守。在郡五年，善知人，有治绩。卒于官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王靖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王靖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王靖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王靖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王靖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王靖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "鲂所代故太守广陵王靖，往者亦以郡民为变，以见谴责，靖勤自陈释，而终不解，因立密计，欲北归命，不幸事露，诛及婴孩。鲂既目见靖事，且观东主一所非薄，婳不复厚，虽或蹔舍，终见翦除。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀恽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀恽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀恽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "长倩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀恽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀恽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏虎贲中郎将。荀彧子，太祖之尚书令，文帝践祚，追赠太尉。建安十七年，彧薨，恽嗣侯。初，文帝与平原侯植并有拟论，文帝曲礼事彧。及彧卒，恽又与植善，而与夏侯尚不穆，文帝深恨恽。恽早卒，子甝嗣。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀恽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操之侍中荀彧之子。太祖欲称魏公，彧谏之。太祖怒，示意其自尽。彧薨，恽，发哀书报曹操。操甚懊悔，命厚葬之，谥日敬侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李鸿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李鸿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李鸿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李鴻"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李鸿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李鸿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建兴三年（225），降蜀。拜见诸葛亮，言及魏将孟达有归蜀意。诸葛亮欲诱孟达为外援，遂与孟达交通。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#濮阳逸> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "濮阳逸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#濮阳逸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "濮阳逸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#濮阳逸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#濮阳逸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末避乱江东，与陆瑁友善。后官至长沙太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁忠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "丁忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "丁忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "五官中郎将。末帝宝鼎元年（266）正月，与大鸿胪张俨使晋吊祭晋文帝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董贵人> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董贵人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董贵人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "董貴人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董贵人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董贵人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父董承，汉献帝刘协妃嫔之一。董贵人父亲被曹操所杀，自己也受牵连。董贵人虽有身孕，汉献帝数次为她向曹操求情，仍被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董贵人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中为董贵妃，乃是董承亲女。曹操杀了董承等人，随既带剑入宫，来杀董贵妃。时妃已有五月身孕，操叱武士擒董妃至。操曰：“一人造反，九族皆诛！”怒喝牵去斩之。献帝以董妃有身孕，向操哀告见怜。操不赦，叱武士牵出，勒死于宫门之外。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘仲始> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘仲始"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘仲始> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉仲始"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘仲始> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘仲始> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾经在市集做买卖的时候，被巿吏所侮辱，然后很生气，他踩断自己的官尺，出游求学，入很多人门下修行，最终流名海内。后来因为有高尚的品德被征用，他不肯接受，大家都把他归为高尚的人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊衜[吴]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "羊衜[吴]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊衜[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "羊衜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊衜[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊衜[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "才博辩捷，初为孙权长子孙登宾客，任中庶子。孙登死后，历督军使者，曾任始兴太守，卒于桂阳太守任上。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡伉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "胡伉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡伉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "胡伉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡伉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡伉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任臼阳长，擅缚降民，诸葛恪以伉违令，逐斩以徇。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄龙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄龙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "黄龍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末农民起义军首领。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴頠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "裴頠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴頠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "逸民"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴頠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴頠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "惠帝时为国子祭酒，兼右军将军。以诛杨骏功封武昌侯。曾奏修国书，刻石写经。进尚书左仆射，专任门下事。忧时俗浮虚，著“崇有之论”以释其蔽，提倡务实。后为赵王伦所杀。惠帝反正，追谥成侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭诞[吴]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭诞[吴]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭诞[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郭誕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭诞[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭诞[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "凤凰三年（274）为会稽太守。是年，会稽妖言章安侯奋当为天子，临海太守奚熙致书诞，非论国政。诞上白熙书，而不白妖言，遂被送付建安作船。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#洪明> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "洪明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#洪明> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "洪明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#洪明> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#洪明> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末地方武装势力首领。建安年间屯居汉兴。后为孙吴将贺齐所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨敬叔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨敬叔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨敬叔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊敬叔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨敬叔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨敬叔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "赤乌年间，魏司马宣王谋攻吴，敬叔向孙权传述清论，以为人才凋尽，应当大胆提拔。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#焦先> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "焦先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#焦先> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝然"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#焦先> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#焦先> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末隐者。字孝然，河东（治今山西夏县西北）人。中平末，白波农民起义军势盛。时先年二十余，与同郡侯武阳相随，客居扬州。建安初西还，武阳诣大阳占户，先留陕界。建安十六年（211），关中乱，先失家属，独窜于河渚间，食草饮水，无衣履。后注籍..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙绍[孙策子]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙绍[孙策子]"@zh .
