<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙俊[孙和子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权之孙，孙和第四子，张承外孙。聪明辨惠，为远近所称。曾任骑都尉，后被孙皓所杀。"@zh .
