<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田韶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "郡中名豪大姓田韶等宿遇无恩，皆以法诛，所夷灭百余家，郡中震栗。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#娄圭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "娄圭"@zh .
