<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#淳于式> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权属吏。曾任会稽太守，爱惜民力，为陆逊所称。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李成> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李成"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李成"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "患重病，昼夜咳嗽，时吐脓血。华佗为其治愈后，与药，告诫他说：“后十八岁，疾当发动。”成遇亲人患有同样疾病，将药与之。十八年后，成病复发，因无药而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#令狐邵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "令狐邵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#令狐邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孔叔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#令狐邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#令狐邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父为汉乌丸校尉。邵先后任丞相主簿、弘农太守，有治绩。黄初初，拜羽林郎，迁虎贲中郎将。三年后病卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马氏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马氏"@zh .
