<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀将领马超女。许配与安平王刘理。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹炽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹炽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹炽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹熾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹炽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹炽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹仁之父。官至侍中、长水校尉。曹丕即王位，追赐仁父炽谥曰陈穆侯，置守冢十家。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高祚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高祚"@zh .
