<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高祚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操攻张鲁，鲁将张卫及杨昂坚守阳平关。曹操久攻不下，乃佯为退兵，而阴使祚等乘险夜袭，大败鲁军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐武> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "故司空徐邈之子，邈死，武嗣其业。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董昭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董昭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公仁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "原仕袁绍，多有功劳，因受谗言而离开，成为张杨的谋士，后随张杨迎接汉献帝，被拜为议郎。董昭建议曹操将汉献帝迁往许昌，从此成为曹操的谋士，深受曹操信赖。后来，在董昭的建议下，曹操加九锡，成为魏公、魏王。曹丕、曹睿执政期间，董昭也多有谋划，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "原为袁绍、张杨的从事，后朝见汉献帝，被拜为议郎，因擅长养生之道而引起曹操的注意。董昭建议曹操将汉献帝迁往许昌，从此成为曹操的谋士，深受曹操信赖。后来，在董昭的建议下，曹操加九锡，成为魏公。董昭在魏官至司徒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马俊> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马俊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元异"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "司马彪序传曰：朗祖父俊，字元异，博学好古，倜傥有大度。长八尺三寸，腰带十围，仪状魁岸，与众有异，乡党宗族咸景附焉。位至颍川太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王伉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王伉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王伉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王伉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王伉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王伉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "益州大姓雍闿反，伉为府丞，与永昌五官掾功曹吕凯帅厉吏民，闭境拒闿。后丞相亮南征讨闿，既发在道，而闿已为高定部曲所杀。亮至南，上表伉为永昌太守，封亭侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王伉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "建兴三年，蛮王孟获，大起蛮兵十万，犯境侵掠。众太守皆降，唯伉不肯反。雍闿、朱褒、高定三人部下人马，皆与孟获为向导官，攻打永昌郡。伉与功曹吕凯，会集百姓，死守此城，其势甚急。后丞相亮引军救之。及蛮平，亮留伉、凯守南中四郡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董厥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董厥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董厥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "龚袭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董厥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董厥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初仕蜀，丞相亮时为府令史，亮称之曰：“董令史，良士也。吾每与之言，思慎宜適。”徙为主簿。亮卒后，稍迁至尚书仆射，代陈祗为尚书令，迁辅国大将军，南乡侯，平台事，而义阳樊建代焉。蜀破之明年春，厥、建俱诣京都，同为相国参军，其秋并兼散骑常侍..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董厥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "跟随诸葛亮参加南征北伐。与姜维一起守备剑阁以阻挡魏国进攻。蜀灭亡之后，因为心痛，病发身死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹参> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹参"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹参> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "敬伯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹参> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹参> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "名将，是继萧何后的汉代第二位相国。秦二世元年（前209），跟随刘邦在沛县起兵反秦，身经百战，屡建战功，攻下二国和一百二十二个县。刘邦称帝后，对有功之臣，论功行赏，曹参功居第二，赐爵平阳侯，仅次于萧何。史载曹参“身被七十创，攻城略地，功..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹参> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉时期人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士赐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "士赐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士赐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "士賜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士赐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士赐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "士燮之父。其先本鲁国汶阳人。至王莽之乱，避地交州，遂为苍梧广信人。桓帝时为日南太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙述> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "公孙述"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙述> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子阳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙述> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙述> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉哀帝时，以父任为郎，后补清水长。王莽天凤中，任蜀郡太守。刘玄更始立，起兵自称为蜀王，都成都。东汉光武帝建武元年（25），自立为天子，号成家，建元龙兴。以李熊为大司徒，弟光为大司马，恢为大司空，尽有益州之地。光武帝出兵征讨，并修书劝降..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王则> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王则"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王则> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王則"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王则> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王则> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操部下奉车都尉。曾作为使者，赍诏书及平东将军印绶往见吕布。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王则> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "王则赍诏至徐州，布迎接入府，开读诏书：封布为平东将军，特赐印绶；又出操私书。王则在吕布面前极道曹公相敬之意，布大喜。忽报袁术遣人至，布唤入问之。使言：“袁公早晚即皇帝位，立东宫，催取皇妃，早到淮南。”布大怒曰：“反贼焉敢如此！”遂杀来..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜畿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜畿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜畿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯侯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜畿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜畿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少孤，继母苦之，以孝闻。年二十，为郡功曹，守郑县令。举孝廉，除汉中府丞。会天下乱，遂弃官客荆州，建安中乃还。荀彧进之太祖，太祖以畿为司空司直，迁护羌校尉，使持节，领西平太守。太祖既定河北，而高幹举并州反。时河东太守王邑被徵，河东人卫固..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄琼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄琼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄琼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "世英"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄琼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄琼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初以父任为太子舍人，辞病不就。顺帝永建中，征拜议郎，稍迁尚书仆射。顷之，迁尚书令。出为魏郡太守，稍迁太常。和平中，以选入侍讲禁中。元嘉元年（151），迁司空。后以地动策免。复为太仆。永兴元年（153），迁司徒，转太尉。延熹元年（158..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨恭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨恭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊恭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少与蜀参军张裔友善。恭早死，裔养其母子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张纮> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张纮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张纮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子纲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张纮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张纮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙策、孙权谋士。游学京都，还本郡，举茂才，公府辟，皆不就。避难江东。孙策创业，投策。表为正议校尉。从讨丹杨。谏策勿身临行陈。建安四年，纮奉章至许都，留为侍御史。谏曹公不以策薨伐吴。曹公从其言。出纮为会稽东部都尉。权以为长史，从征合肥。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张纮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙策征讨江东，亲顾张纮家中，请出为自己划谋。江东平定后，张纮奉命去许都上表。恰逢孙策死去，张纮说以利害，劝曹操不要加兵江南。曹操平定荆州，赤壁鏖兵，张纮等文官主张降曹。后来谏孙权迁都秣陵，不久病故。孙权听从了他的建议，把都城迁到秣陵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨宗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨宗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊宗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时蜀将。魏占领成都后，吴欲袭巴东，巴东太守罗宪遣参军宗突围北出，告急安东将军陈骞．又送文武印绶、任子诣晋王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆康> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陆康"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆康> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季宁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆康> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆康> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少惇孝悌，勤脩操行，太守李肃察其孝廉。肃后坐事伏法，康敛尸送丧还颍川，行服，礼终，举茂才，历三郡太守，所在称治。灵帝中平年间为庐江太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆康> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "庐江太守。孙策攻打庐江太守陆康，得胜而回。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢逊> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卢逊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢逊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "盧遜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢逊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢逊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢逊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "南郑关守将。用埋伏计击败魏军先锋许仪。魏都督钟会亲自统兵来攻，卢逊指挥士兵用诸葛连弩射击，魏军大败。钟会引军急退，过桥时却落入陷坑。逊挺枪来刺，却被魏将荀恺一箭射死。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习祯> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "习祯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习祯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文祥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习祯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习祯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "随刘备入蜀，历雒、郫令，广汉太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祁庚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "祁庚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祁庚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "祁庚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祁庚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祁庚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "代父死罪。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛融> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "诸葛融"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔长"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "诸葛瑾次子，字叔长。少学章句，多技艺，后拜骑都尉。赤乌（238-251）中，代新都都尉。父死，代领兵业，袭爵，驻公安。孙亮即位，徙奋威将军。兄诸葛恪被诛，遂饮药而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董奉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董奉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "君异"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少时治医学，医术高明，与南阳张机、谯郡华佗齐名，并称“建安三神医”。如当时交州刺史吴士燮病危，延董奉诊治，以三丸药纳之口中，以水灌之，并使人捧、摇其头，经抢救而愈。董氏医德高尚，对所治愈病人轻只要求在其住宅周围种植杏树，以示报答。日久..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#带固> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "带固"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#带固> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "帶固"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#带固> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#带固> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "高句骊王宫属吏。孙权遣使者谢宏、中书陈恂拜宫为单于，加赐衣物珍宝。恂等到安平口，先遣校尉陈奉前见宫，而宫受魏幽州刺史讽旨，令以吴使自效。奉闻之，倒还。宫遣主簿笮咨、带固等出安平，与宏相见。宏即缚得三十馀人质之，宫於是谢罪，上马数百匹。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹操叔父> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹操叔父"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹操叔父> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹操叔父"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹操叔父> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹操叔父> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "历史上未记载其名，在表现曹操玩弄心术的一件事中，提及了曹操与其叔父。根据曹瞒传记载：曹操小时候喜欢飞鹰走狗，游荡无度，他的叔父数次告诉曹嵩。曹操很忧虑。有一次，曹操在路上遇见叔父，立刻装成中风之状，叔父大惊，急忙告诉曹嵩。曹嵩把曹操叫..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹操叔父> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "历史上未记载其名，演义中曹操第一次出场，介绍曹操身世时，提到了与其叔父有关的事。操幼时好游猎，喜歌舞，有权谋，多机变。操有叔父，见操游荡无度，尝怒之，言于曹嵩。嵩责操。操忽心生一计，见叔父来，诈倒于地，作中风之状。叔父惊告嵩，嵩急视之..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹徽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹徽"@zh .
