<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘元起> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与刘备同宗。史称刘备自小即深受其赏识，并常得其资助。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘元起> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "玄德幼时，与乡中小儿戏于树下，曰：“我为天子，当乘此车盖。”叔父刘元起奇其言，曰：“此儿非常人也。”因见玄德家贫，常资给之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董季中> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董季中"@zh .
