<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董季中> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董季中> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "兴平年间，关中扰乱，与弟董遇依将军段煨。"@zh .
