<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许叔龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "会先主定蜀，祎遂留益土，与汝南许叔龙、南郡董允齐名。"@zh .
