<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#炅母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "襄贲校尉杜松部民。魏初，与昌豨串通反叛。曹操以吕虔代杜松，虔赐酒食诱母辱数十人，待醉，伏兵杀之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭图> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭图"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭图> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公则"@zh .
