<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田银> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操征关中，银与苏伯等反河间，为曹仁讨平。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阴化> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阴化"@zh .
