<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛晖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操部将。曾反叛，得臧霸助，后仍为操手下郡守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐翕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐翕"@zh .
