<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐翕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操在兖州时，乱，翕等皆叛。后兖州平定，投操降臧霸，曹操向霸要人，霸以理驳回，终庇翕等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓忠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邓忠"@zh .
