<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘邕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "后将军、监军。随先主入蜀。益州既定，为江阳太守。建兴中，稍迁至监军后将军，赐爵关内侯，卒。子式嗣。少子武，有文，与樊建齐名，官亦至尚书。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#温恢> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "温恢"@zh .
