<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高蕃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任魏郡太守。官渡之战时，率兵屯河上，绝水道，为魏将李典、程昱所破。"@zh .
