<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辅匡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "右将军。随先主入蜀。益州既定，为巴郡太守。先主征吴，以匡为别督。建兴中，徙镇南，为右将军，封中乡侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈策> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈策"@zh .
