<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈策> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末人。在庐江界聚众数万人，临险而守，不服朝令。后为曹操所克。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伊健妓妾> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "伊健妓妾"@zh .
