<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李整> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏青州刺史、破虏将军李典从兄。父乾为吕布别驾薛兰、治中李封所杀。太祖使乾子整将乾兵，与诸将击兰、封。兰、封破，从平兗州诸县有功，稍迁青州刺史。整卒，从弟典将整军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘阐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘阐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘阐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉闡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘阐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘阐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "御史中丞、昔益州刺史刘璋次子。父璋降，先主迁璋于南郡公安。后孙权杀关羽，取荆州，以璋为益州牧，驻秭归。璋卒，南中豪率雍闿据益郡反，附於吴。权复以璋子阐为益州刺史，处交、益界首。丞相诸葛亮平南土，阐还吴，为御史中丞，后疾终於家。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘胄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘胄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘胄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉胄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘胄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘胄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀南中一带的豪帅。后主建兴十一年（233），率众反。未几，为马忠击斩。"@zh .
