<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王才> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "骑都尉王才、幸乐人孟思所为不法，振动京都，而其罪状发于小吏，公卿大臣初无一言。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麋竺> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "麋竺"@zh .
