<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#扰龙宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#扰龙宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任侍御史。时董卓拥兵京城，专断朝政，欲杀人立威。龙宗未解剑而见卓议事，卓立杀之，京师震动。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨迪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨迪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨迪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊迪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨迪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨迪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "官宣诏郎。时廷尉监隐蕃交结豪傑，迪拒绝不与通，蕃后叛逆，众人乃知迪有卓识。"@zh .
