<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭石> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "反贼。长沙贼区星自称将军，众万馀人，攻围城邑。石、周朝亦帅徒众起於桂、零，与星相应。长沙太守孙坚遂越境寻讨，三郡肃然。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周峻> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周峻"@zh .
