<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐肇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏扬州刺史乐綝之子、右将军乐进之孙。袭父爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙仪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙仪"@zh .
