<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "都护征虏将军孙皎之子，丹杨侯孙胤之弟，曾任将军，无难督，封侯。五凤二年（255）与张怡、林恂等谋杀孙峻，事败自杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘献> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘献"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘献> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉獻"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘献> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘献> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝时，为袁谭别驾。袁谭在青州，辟脩为治中从事，别驾刘献数毁短脩。后献以事当死，脩理之，得免。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛恢> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "诸葛恢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛恢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "道明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛恢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛恢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "诸葛诞之孙，字道明，琅邪阳都（今山东临沂）人。弱冠知名，试守即丘长，转临沂令。值天下大乱，避地江南。东晋元帝时，累迁至会稽太守。封博陵亭侯，以母忧去官，服除，拜中书令，转侍中，加奉车都尉。讨王含有功，进封建安伯。官至尚书令、吏都尚书、..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀爽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀爽"@zh .
