<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张嘉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张嘉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張嘉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾与王休向关羽献玉玺，以明刘备称帝乃“瑞命符应，非人力所致”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁览> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "丁览"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁览> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝连"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁览> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁览> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "八岁而孤，清身立行，以义让称。仕郡至功曹，守始平长。孙权深器重之，未及擢用，因病卒。子固，后官至司徒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛敞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "辛敞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛敞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "泰雍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛敞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛敞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "侍中辛毗之子。魏大将军曹爽参军。司马懿将诛爽，因爽出，闭城门。大将军司马鲁芝将爽府兵，犯门斩关，出城门赴爽，来呼敞俱去。敞惧，问姊宪英曰：‘天子在外，太傅闭城门，人云将不利国家，于事可得尔乎？’宪英曰：‘天下有不可知，然以吾度之，太傅..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛敞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹爽参军，咸熙中为河内太守。司马懿发动高平陵兵变，敞为参军，曹爽反抗司马懿，邀敞参加，敞害怕就问姊宪英该怎么办，宪英告诉他领兵杀出洛阳，归属曹爽。后司马懿诸杀曹爽统领曹爽原来的部众，辛敞归属司马懿。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阮瑀> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阮瑀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阮瑀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元瑜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阮瑀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阮瑀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "文学家，“建安七子”之一。初受业于蔡邕，都护曹洪欲使掌书记，他不为所屈。后为曹操司空军谋祭酒，与陈琳同管记室，军国书檄多出其手。后又任仓曹掾属。原有集五卷，已佚。明人辑有《阮元瑜集》一卷。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨丰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨丰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨丰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊豐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨丰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨丰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "和司空掾田豫等人结为党与，妬害孙资。而孙资宽宏大量。丰子为尚方吏，魏帝以职事谴怒，欲致之法。资请活之，不念其父旧恶。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李康> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李康"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李康> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "萧远"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李康> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李康> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国魏文学家。性狷介不能和俗。曾作《游山九吟》（此文已佚，只有《艺文类聚》中提到《游山九吟序》：“盖人生天地之间也，若流电之过户牖，轻尘之栖弱草”），魏明帝异其文。初仕为浔阳长，有政绩。魏末晋初病逝。旧有集2卷，今佚。存《运命论》1篇..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苻健> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苻健"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苻健> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "苻健"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苻健> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苻健> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "武都氐王。建兴十四年，武都氐王苻健请降，遣将军张尉往迎，过期不到，大将军蒋琬深以为念。张嶷平之曰：“苻健求附款至，必无他变，素闻健弟狡黠，又夷狄不能同功，将有乖离，是以稽留耳。”数日，问至，健弟果将四百户就魏，独健来从。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙皎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙皎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙皎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔朗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙皎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙皎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父孙静，孙坚侄子，昭义中郎将。皎始拜护军校尉，领众二千余人。是时曹公数出濡须，皎每赴拒，号为精锐。迁都护征虏将军，代程普督夏口。黄盖及兄瑜卒，又并其军。轻财能施，善于交结，与诸葛瑾至厚，委庐江刘靖以得失，江夏李允以众事，广陵吴硕、河南..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙皎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙权命吕蒙与孙皎一同为都督夺取荆州。蒙以当年周瑜、程普为左右都督关系不和之事告之孙权，于是令孙皎在后接应粮草。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞羲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庞羲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞羲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "龐羲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞羲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞羲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为议郎，与刘焉通家，焉阴令子范通马腾袭长安，事败，羲募将焉诸孙入蜀。后焉子璋立，汉宁太守张鲁稍骄恣，不承顺璋，璋杀鲁母及弟，遂为雠敌。璋累遣羲等攻鲁，数为所破。鲁部曲多在巴西，故以羲为巴西太守，领兵御鲁。后羲与璋情好携隙，赵韪称兵内..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞羲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "营中司马。初为刘璋帐下巴西太守，以拒张鲁。时庞羲探知张鲁欲兴兵取川，急报知刘璋，璋用张松计引先主入蜀。后先主定蜀，以羲为营中司马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈茂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈茂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳茂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "豪强。因陷害本县韩暨父兄，为暨所结死士所擒，暨斩其首级，用以祭父墓。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庾纯> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庾纯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庾纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "谋甫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庾纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庾纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "博学有才义，为世儒宗。郡补主簿，仍参征南府，累迁黄门侍郎，封关内侯，历中书令、河南尹。以得罪贾充免官。后晋武帝复以纯为国子祭酒，加散骑常侍。迁侍中，以父忧去官。起为御史中丞，转尚书。除魏郡太守，不之官，拜少府。年六十四卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦晃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "秦晃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "秦晃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "赤乌四年（241）随卫将军全琮与魏将王淩战于芍陂（今安徽寿县南），阵亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王戎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王戎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王戎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "濬冲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王戎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王戎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "王浑之子。“竹林七贤”之一，也是公认最庸俗的一位，然而他胆色出众，常常临危不惧。他投靠司马氏，仕途一帆风顺，历任吏部黄门郎、散骑常侍、河东太守、荆州刺史，进爵安丰县侯，后升任光禄勋、吏部尚书，直至司徒。永兴二年（305），死于郏县，年..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王戎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "晋朝建威将军，于三国演义120回登场，在最后的灭吴之战中领一路兵马出兵武昌。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王海> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王海"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王海> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王海"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王海> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王海> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十八年（213）与彭材、李玉等起兵，众万余人，为贺齐讨平。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐方> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾打败过曹操。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董箕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董箕"@zh .
