<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕贡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安、延康时任豫州刺史。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐孺子> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐孺子"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐孺子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孺子"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐孺子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐孺子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "家境贫寒，常亲自耕稼。官府多次征辟，皆不出任。陈蕃、胡广等上疏荐举，桓帝备厚礼征召，他因不满宦官专权，终不愿为官。时人称之为“南州高士”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙弘> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙弘"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙弘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫弘"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙弘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙弘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任中书令。鲁王孙霸与太子孙和各植党羽，弘即依附孙霸。孙权病笃，而太子年少，于是以弘领少傅。权临终，召他与诸葛恪、孙峻等嘱以后事。权死，弘素与恪不和，怕为所治，秘权死讯，欲矫诏除恪，被孙峻告发，恪请孙弘议事，于座中诛杀之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#智郁筑鞬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "智郁筑鞬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#智郁筑鞬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "智鬱築鞬"@zh .
