<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#智郁筑鞬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "鲜卑部落首领。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马秦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马秦"@zh .
