<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马秦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末起义军首领。献帝建安二十三年（218）与高胜一起在郪（治今四川中江东南）起义，聚众数万人，进军资中县，后为蜀将李严击败斩杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严圭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "严圭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严圭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "嚴圭"@zh .
