<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严圭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄武二年（223）三月，魏曹仁遣将军常彫等袭濡须中州，圭等率兵击破之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐忠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐忠"@zh .
