<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十九年（214）孙权遣吕蒙进攻荆州时，蒙即派忠等人领兵二万取长沙、零陵、桂阳三郡，克之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#国渊> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "国渊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#国渊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子尼"@zh .
