<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#国渊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "是汉末经学大师郑玄的高足，曾避乱辽东，后来归魏为臣。他是魏国著名的政治大臣，功绩比得上枣祗、袁涣等人；初归曹氏时，主治屯田事宜，在任期间「屡陈损益，相土处民，计民置吏，明功课之法」，使「五年中仓廪丰实，百姓竞劝乐业」。当曹操征讨关中之..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊子昭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "樊子昭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊子昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "樊子昭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊子昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊子昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为小商贩，后为名士许劭所荐，得为官，时年六十。不详所终。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#隐蕃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "隐蕃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#隐蕃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "隱蕃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#隐蕃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#隐蕃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "有口才，太和四年（230），奉魏明帝命，诈叛归吴，任廷尉监。蕃交结豪杰，与众官交好。后谋叛，事觉伏诛。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#萧望> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "萧望"@zh .
