<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#萧望> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#萧望> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少府萧望被宣帝任为宰相。又被启用，任命为冯翊太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩福> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩福"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩福> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "韓福"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩福> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩福> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩福> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "洛阳太守。与荥阳太守王植是亲家，关羽千里寻兄，韩福与牙将孟坦设谋诱杀关羽。后事败，孟坦为关羽斩。但被韩福暗箭射中左臂，关羽飞马径奔韩福，挥刀斩于马下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马承> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马承"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "馬承"@zh .
