<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李乾> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李乾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李乾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李乾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李乾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李乾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "破虏将军李典从父、青州刺史李整之父。有雄气，合宾客数千家在乘氏。初平中，以众随太祖，破黄巾於寿张，又从击袁术，征徐州。吕布之乱，太祖遣乾还乘氏，慰劳诸县。布别驾薛兰、治中李封招乾，欲俱叛，乾不听，遂杀乾。子整将乾兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙贲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙贲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙贲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯阳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙贲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙贲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙坚侄儿。贲早失二亲，弟辅婴孩，贲自赡育，友爱甚笃。为郡督邮守长。坚于长沙举义兵，贲去吏从征伐。坚薨，贲摄帅余众，扶送灵柩。后袁术徙寿春，贲又依之。术从兄绍用会稽周昂为九江太守，绍与术不协，术遣贲攻破昂于阴陵。术表贲领豫州刺史，转丹杨..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张爽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张爽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张爽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張爽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张爽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张爽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安末年，为刘备劝学从事，参与劝备登帝位者之列。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张爽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "诸葛亮劝刘备称帝，刘备勉强同意，从事张爽等众人拜服于地，建议刘备择日以行大礼。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李辅> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李辅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李辅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李輔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李辅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李辅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为新城太守孟达将，太和二年，达接连蜀相诸葛亮。晋王司马懿诱辅及达甥邓贤，贤等开门纳军。达被围旬有六日而败，焚其首于洛阳四达之衢。景元四年，为前将军。镇西将军钟会帅辅、征蜀护军胡烈等自骆谷袭汉中。秋八月，军发洛阳，大赉将士，陈师誓众。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李辅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初为孟达将，达接连蜀军，晋王司马懿围新城，辅与达甥邓贤斩达首后开城投降。景元四年，为前将军。随镇西将军钟会征蜀。及入汉中，会令其领兵一万，攻蜀将王含於乐城。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙震> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙震"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙震> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫震"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙震> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙震> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "征虏将军孙贲之孙、威远将军孙邻之子。晋伐吴，任护军。天纪四年，震随丞相张悌、丹杨太守沈莹帅众三万济江，围成阳都尉张乔于杨荷桥，众才七千，闭栅自守，举白接告降。后与晋扬州刺史周浚等战于板桥。为浚破之。临阵斩悌、震首。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍韬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲍韬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍韬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鮑韬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍韬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍韬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "时天下大乱，与兄鲍信于乡里收徒众二万余自保。会曹操起兵，韬与信以兵应之，拜为裨将军。初平元年（190），讨董卓，至荥阳汴水，败，阵亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#后钱> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "后钱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#后钱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "后錢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#后钱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#后钱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安初，聚众数千起义，为张辽、何夔讨破。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀昱> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀昱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀昱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯修"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀昱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀昱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "和弟昙并杰俊有殊才。与李膺、王畅、杜密等号为八俊，位至沛相。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭马> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭马"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭马> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郭馬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭马> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭马> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国末期叛军首领。本是吴国合浦太守修允的部曲督，修允被迁为桂林太守，因为疾病，滞留在广州，不久病死。郭马认为自己是修允老兵，修允死后应当自己统领他的部队。于是他就在吴天纪三年的夏天反叛，与部将何典、王族、吴述、殷兴等合聚人众，攻杀广州..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郝温> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郝温"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郝温> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郝温"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郝温> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郝温> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与乌丸王单于相勾结，为曹操部下代郡太守裴潜所斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙恩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙恩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙恩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫恩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙恩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙恩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "权臣孙綝之弟。吴帝孙亮与将军刘承谋诛綝，事泄，綝即发动宫廷政变，遣武卫将军恩率军杀刘承，围皇宫。孙亮废后，恩行丞相事，率群臣迎立新君孙休。休立，即以大将军孙綝为丞相，而以恩为御史大夫、卫将军、中军督，封县侯。后又加为侍中，与孙綝分掌诸事。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙恩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "一日，吴主孙亮闷坐，黄门侍郎全纪在侧。纪乃国舅也。亮因泣告曰：“孙綝专权妄杀，欺朕太甚。今不图之，必为后患！”纪曰：“陛下但有用臣处，臣万死不辞！”亮曰：“卿可只今点起禁兵，与将军刘丞各把城门，朕自出杀孙綝。但此事切不可令卿母知之。卿..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#申生> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "申生"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#申生> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "申生"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#申生> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#申生> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋献公之嫡长子，齐姜所生。申生父亲晋献公，继母为骊姬。献公获骊姬后，颇爱之，后来骊姬产下一子，取名奚齐，晋献公欲立骊姬之子奚齐即位。骊姬一次在头发上涂蜂蜜，引来蜜蜂追赶，并要求申生帮她赶蜜蜂，故意让晋献公看到。晋献公以为儿子在调戏骊姬..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#申生> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "春秋时代人物，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马腾> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马腾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马腾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "寿成"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马腾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马腾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉卫尉、汉伏波将军马援后。父肃，桓帝时尝为天水兰干尉。后失官，因留陇西，与羌错居。家贫无妻，遂娶羌女，生腾。腾少贫无产业，常从彰山中斫材木，负贩诣城市，以自供给。腾为人长八尺馀，身体洪大，面鼻雄异，而性贤厚，人多敬之。灵帝末，凉州刺史..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马腾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "征西将军、西凉太守、汉伏波将军马援后。董卓乱政，腾起兵应诏。及卓灭，余党李傕、郭汜秉政，腾受献帝诏，封征西将军，同韩遂讨傕，因短粮，败，退还西凉。后帝为曹公劫，往许都，腾入朝，与董承受衣带诏，回西凉备兵，密谋诛曹，然事败，腾遂据西凉。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫隆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "皇甫隆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "皇甫隆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "嘉平年间任敦煌太守，有政绩。曾教民耧犁，又教衍溉，岁终率计，其所省庸力过半，得谷加五。并改进服饰，为民兴利。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马忠[蜀]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马忠[蜀]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马忠[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "德信"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马忠[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马忠[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "出身士大夫，三国时蜀汉名将。少养外家，姓孤，名笃，后乃复姓，改名忠。东汉末期为巴西郡吏，察孝廉，为汉昌长。昭烈帝刘备兵败夷陵，驻跸永安。巴西太守阎芝征集五千人，为刘备补充兵员，派马忠带兵前往。刘备与之交谈，甚为器重，对尚书令刘巴称赞说..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马忠[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "马忠随丞相诸葛亮南征，曾多次在诸葛亮指挥下击败南蛮军，但在对抗祝融夫人时为营救张嶷曾一度被俘，北伐其间以奋威将军、博阳亭侯身份担任右军领兵使。建兴七年其间参与大败曹军的战役。诸葛亮六出祁山其间，马忠与姜维同领中队进攻北原。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴绪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "裴绪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "裴緒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀建兴五年，诸葛亮率兵北伐，久攻南安郡不下，于是派人假冒夏侯楙心腹将裴绪，诱使安定太守崔谅前去南安救援，诸葛亮因此取了安定。其后假裴绪又去诱天水太守马遵，被其部将姜维识破。由于裴绪本身是个虚构人物，而且未在演义中出场，因此就以裴绪名定..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛绰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "诸葛绰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛绰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "诸葛綽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛绰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛绰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "诸葛恪长子。官至骑都尉，以交关鲁王事，吴主孙权遣付其父教诲，恪鸩杀之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙静> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙静"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙静> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "幼台"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙静> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙静> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "武威皇帝坚季弟也，坚始举事，静纠合乡曲及宗室五六百人以为保障，众咸附焉。及策破刘繇，定诸县，进攻会稽，遣人请静，静将家属与策会于钱唐。是时太守王朗拒策于固陵，策数度水战，不能克。静说策计，策从之。策果破之，遂定会稽。表拜静为奋武校尉，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙静> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "坚欲往攻刘表，静劝之，不从。及策图江东，静为策谋而克会稽，策乃留静守之。后策薨，张昭令静理会丧事。权统事，令静引一枝军守吴会。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭汜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭汜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭汜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郭汜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭汜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭汜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "又名郭多，董卓的部下，被派往陈留、颍川等地劫掠。董卓被杀后，郭汜归无所依，于是采用贾诩之谋，伙同李傕、张济、樊稠等原董卓部曲将攻向长安，击败吕布，杀死王允等人，占领长安，把持朝廷大权。后诸将不和，李傕在会议上杀死了樊稠，又与郭汜分别劫..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭汜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "郭汜，董卓的部下。在诸侯联军伐董卓之际，同李傕一起镇守汜水关，董卓迁都长安后，又同李傕、张济、樊稠一同镇守郿坞。董卓被杀后，郭汜等人逃往陕地，得不到赦免，于是采用贾诩之谋，纠集部队一起攻往长安。败吕布，杀王允，占领长安，把持朝政。又击..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀氏[毌丘俭儿媳]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀氏[毌丘俭儿媳]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀氏[毌丘俭儿媳]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "荀氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀氏[毌丘俭儿媳]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀氏[毌丘俭儿媳]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "毌丘俭后败，荀氏被系于狱。武卫将军荀顗上书救之。荀氏免后，又乞为官婢以赎其女命，获免。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘政> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘政"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘政> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉政"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘政> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘政> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "史称其平生以勇略雄气称，因之为辽东太守公孙度所疾，几为所杀，后脱逃。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱铄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱铄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱铄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "朱鑠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱铄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱铄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安末任中领军，与太子中庶子司马懿及陈群、吴质号为四友。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李傕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李傕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李傕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "稚然"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李傕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李傕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为校尉，隶董卓将牛辅，屯于陕，与郭汜、张济等败河南尹朱俊于中牟，并掠陈留、颍川诸县。董卓被杀后，李傕归无所依，于是采用贾诩之谋，伙同郭汜、张济、樊稠等原董卓部曲将攻向长安，击败吕布，杀死王允等人，占领长安，把持朝廷大权。后诸将不和，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李傕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "在诸侯联军伐董卓之际，同郭汜一起镇守汜水关，董卓迁都长安之后，又同郭汜、张济、樊稠一同镇守郿坞。董卓被杀后，李傕等人逃往陕地，得不到赦免，于是采用贾诩之谋，纠集部队一起攻往长安，败吕布，杀王允，占领长安，把持朝政，又击败前来勤王的马腾..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾彩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "贾彩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾彩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "賈彩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾彩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾彩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "贾诩的兄弟。据《贾氏武威郡宗谱》，贾龚为轻骑将军，徙居武威，有两子：贾彩、贾诩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王训> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王训"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王训> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王訓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王训> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王训> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "王平之子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘理> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘理"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘理> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "奉孝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘理> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘理> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "安平王。刘备少子，后主庶弟也，与永异母。章武元年六月，使司徒靖立理为梁王，策曰：“小子理，朕统承汉序，祗顺天命，遵脩典秩，建尔于东，为汉籓辅。惟彼梁土，畿甸之邦，民狎教化，易导以礼。往悉乃心，怀保黎庶，以永尔国，王其敬之哉！”建兴八年..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘理> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀梁王、后主庶弟。建安二十六年四月，先主登基，封三子理为梁王。章武二年夏六月，陆逊大破蜀兵于猇亭彝陵之地；先主奔回白帝城，病笃，托孤丞相诸葛亮，命二王以父事亮。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐众> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐众"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐众> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐衆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐众> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐众> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "史学家。《三国评》作者。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨阿若> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨阿若"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨阿若> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯阳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨阿若> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨阿若> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少游侠，常以报仇解怨为事，时人为之号曰：“东市相砍杨阿若，西市相砍杨阿若。”建安中，太守徐揖诛郡中强族黄氏，黄昂得脱在外，谋攻揖。昂恚丰不与同，乃重募取丰。武威太守张猛假丰为都尉，丰遂单骑入南羌，合众得千余骑，捕得昂，杀之。黄初中，州..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯兰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯兰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "夏侯蘭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘备之军正。初为曹将，随夏侯惇战于博望，为赵云所获。兰是赵云乡里人，少小相知，云推荐给刘备，荐兰明于法律，任为军正。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "随夏侯惇攻新野，为张飞刺死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄奎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄奎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄奎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "黃奎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄奎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄奎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄奎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "黄琬之子，与进京的马腾一同密谋杀曹操，后因事机败露而全家被斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞恭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庞恭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "龐恭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "马超败于渭南后，据冀城，尽兼陇右之众。杨阜欲复冀城，遂联络恭等，与之盟誓，于献帝建安十九年（214），起兵反超，占据冀城，超奔汉中。陇右平定，恭等受封。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁不疑> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "梁不疑"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁不疑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "梁不疑"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁不疑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁不疑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "大将军梁商之子。顺帝永和年间为侍中，旋拜河南尹。桓帝初立，封不疑为颍阳侯。不疑好经书，善待士，兄冀阴疾之，因中常侍白帝，转为光禄勋。不疑自耻兄弟有隙，遂让位归第，闭门自守。先冀而卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董袭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董袭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董袭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元代"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董袭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董袭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "身高八尺，武力过人。孙策进入会稽郡，董袭在高迁亭迎接孙策，十分欣赏，派他到地方担任门下贼曹。孙策讨伐山阴贼黄龙罗、周勃，董袭亲自斩杀黄龙罗、周勃首级，升为别部司马，扬武都尉。建安四年，董袭跟随孙策攻打皖，在寻阳征讨刘勋，到江夏讨伐黄祖..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董袭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙策征战江东时，董袭献上严白虎的人头来降孙策。赤壁之战，董袭受周瑜命，分兵去汉阳，合肥会战接应太史慈，逍遥津支援孙权。濡须口。董袭在船上督战，船覆董袭坚守殉职。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董遇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董遇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董遇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季直"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董遇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董遇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "性质讷而好学。兴平中，关中扰乱，遇采稆负贩为生。建安初，郡举孝廉，迁黄门侍郎。曾为汉帝侍讲经书。常随曹操西征。黄初中，出为郡守。明帝时入为侍中、大司农。后以病亡。遇善治《老子》、《左氏传》，劝人们在“三余”即冬季、雨天、夜间抓紧读书。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯礼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "冯礼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "馮禮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁尚部属。建安九年（204），曹操攻邺，为地道，审配亦于内作堑以当之。礼叛应曹操，开突门纳曹操兵三百余人，被审配从城上以大石击死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "冀州东门守将。因酒醉，有误巡警，被审配痛责。冯礼怀恨，潜地出城降操。操问破城之策，礼曰：“突门内上厚，可掘地道而入。”操便命冯礼引三百壮士，夤夜掘地道而入。谁知被审配发现，急唤精兵运石，击突闸门。门闭，冯礼及三百壮士皆死于土内。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑文> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑文"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑文> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄭文"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑文> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑文> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑文> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "郑文到诸葛亮处诈降，被识破，最后害死秦郎兄弟。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘豹[匈奴]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘豹[匈奴]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘豹[匈奴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉豹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘豹[匈奴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘豹[匈奴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "南匈奴首领，为并州左贤王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘豹[匈奴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "匈奴左贤王，三国演义第33回和第71回中提及。高干兵败后投奔左贤王，左贤王不愿结怨于曹操，于是将高干呵退。蔡邕之女蔡琰被匈奴劫往北地，曹操派人去赎，左贤王迫于曹操的势力，送还蔡琰。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王烈> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王烈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少师事陈寔，名闻当时。董卓作乱，避祸辽东。曹操多次征召，命为丞相掾，皆不就。建安二十三年（2l8）卒于辽东，年七十八。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊英> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "樊英"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季齐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "术士、学者。少习《京氏易》，兼明《五经》，又善天文及谶纬之学，隐居于邓州新城（今河南邓县西北），受业者四方而至。安帝初，征为博士。后建光元年（121）、永建二年（127），两次诏征，均固辞不就，地方官乃强令驾载进京。至四年，始屈，拜五..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅肜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "傅肜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅肜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "傅肜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅肜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅肜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "先主伐吴，肜为别督。先主退军，断后拒战，兵人死尽，吴将语肜令降，肜骂曰：“吴狗！何有汉将军降者！”遂战死。子佥后亦殁于王事。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅肜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中为傅彤。随先主征吴，守江南第四营。吴将陆逊命末将淳于丹探之，为肜所败。后蜀军遭火攻，肜断后，为吴军围住。吴将语其降，肜叱曰：“吾乃汉将，安肯降吴狗乎！”挺枪纵马，率蜀军奋力死战，不能得脱。口中吐血，死于吴军之中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阿骛> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阿骛"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阿骛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "阿騖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阿骛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阿骛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "荀攸妾。攸亡，攸好友钟繇操持荀攸家里的事情，将阿骛改嫁，使其有了好的去处。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#奚熙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "奚熙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#奚熙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "奚熙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#奚熙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#奚熙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任临海太守。孙皓为夫人治丧，极尽奢华，又半年不出理朝，国人皆以为死者是孙皓本人。皓舅子何都长相似皓，人皆以为何都代皓而立。奚熙信以为真，遂举兵欲回师诛讨何都，被何都叔父何植击杀，夷灭三族。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕虔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕虔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕虔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子恪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕虔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕虔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "因有胆识策略出名，被曹操招为从事，后历任襄贲校尉、泰山太守，多次平定黄巾军等反乱势力，使原本混乱泰山郡成为曹操领地内出名的强郡，受到曹操下令嘉奖。吕虔共在泰山郡任职十多年，很有威信和政绩。魏文帝时，吕虔改任徐州刺史，后于魏明帝时期去世。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕虔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操手下战将，最初被刘晔推荐，在兖州被曹操聘为军中从事，后又任校尉、中军护卫等职，在讨吕布时射死布将薛兰，在征刘备时与李典等人同为先锋，在赤壁时掌管水军后军，屡随曹操征战，多有战功。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李乐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李乐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李乐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李樂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李乐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李乐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为白波帅，建安元年，董卓余党李傕、郭汜交兵，后悔令天子东，乃来救段煨，因欲劫帝而西。董承、杨奉密遣间使至河东，招故白波帅乐、韩暹、胡才及南匈奴右贤王去卑，并率其众数千骑来，与承、奉共击傕等，大破之，斩首数千级，乘舆乃得进。乐、承拥卫..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李乐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉征北将军。初为白波帅，建安元年，李傕、郭汜交兵，后共劫驾。董承、杨奉一面差人与二贼讲和，一面密传圣旨往河东，急召故白波帅乐、韩暹、胡才三处军兵前来救应。乐是啸聚山林之贼，不得已而召之。傕、汜二军，四面混战，乐军大败。奉、承遮拦不住，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任嘏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "任嘏"@zh .
