<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任嘏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任旐之子。八岁丧母，年十四始学，号为神童。后应召为曹操官属，历尚书郎。文帝时为黄门侍郎，累迁河东太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆机> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陆机"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆机> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "士衡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆机> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆机> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "本为吴大司马陆抗之子。文学家。少有异才，文章冠世。抗卒，领父兵为牙门将。年二十而吴灭，退居旧里，闭门勤学，积有十年。太康末与弟云入洛阳，以文才名重一时。太傅杨骏辟为祭酒。骏诛，累迁太子洗马、著作郎。吴王晏出镇淮南，以机为郎中令，迁尚书..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛房> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "薛房"@zh .
