<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛房> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为郡中大姓。黄巾起义，房等据县自保。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐钦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐钦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐欽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "故左仆射徐宣之子。宣死，继之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#强端> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "强端"@zh .
