<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程威> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "乐安任嘏卒后，威以故吏，与刘固、上官崇等录嘏行事及所著书奏之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#难升米> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "难升米"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#难升米> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "難升米"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#难升米> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#难升米> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "明帝景初二年（238），奉倭女王命至魏都贡献，明帝封倭女王为亲魏倭王，假金印紫绶；封难升米为率善中郎将，假银印青绶。并赐各种物品。齐王芳正始六年（245），赐难升米黄幢。八年，因倭国不和、相攻击，魏国使者赍诏书、黄幢，拜假难升米为檄告喻之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伊夷模> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "伊夷模"@zh .
