<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伊夷模> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伊夷模> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "高句丽王。本是高句丽王伯固的小儿子。伯固死，国长以长子拔奇不肖，便共立他为王。建安中，辽东侯公孙康破高句丽，拔奇怨为兄而不得立，率下户三万余口降附，他更作新国。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆瑁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陆瑁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆瑁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子璋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆瑁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆瑁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陆逊之弟。少好学笃义，州郡辟举，皆不就。嘉禾元年（232），公车征瑁，拜议郎、选曹尚书。孙权欲亲征公孙渊，瑁两次上疏，终于谏止。赤乌二年（239）卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麻余> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "麻余"@zh .
