<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麻余> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时夫余王。为简位居孽子，简位居卒，诸大臣立麻余为王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢渊> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "谢渊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢渊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "休德"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢渊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢渊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少务农为业。后举孝廉，官至建武将军。孙权赤乌六年（243），曾上书陈言，欲兴利改作。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张泉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张泉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张泉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張泉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张泉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张泉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张绣之子。绣死，泉嗣爵。建安二十四年（219），坐与魏讽谋袭邺反曹，被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王甫> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王甫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王甫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "国山"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王甫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王甫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀荆州议曹从事。好人流言议。刘璋时，为州书佐。先主定蜀后，为绵竹令，还为荆州议曹从事。随先主征吴，军败于秭归，遇害。子祐，有父风，官至尚书右选郎。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王甫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "关羽部属，随军司马。羽攻打襄阳时，提醒关羽荆州的守备令人不安。后羽逃出麦城后，他据守麦城，闻吴兵在城下，将关公父子首级招安。王甫、周仓大惊，急登城视之，果关公父子首级也。王甫大叫一声，堕城而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严氏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "严氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "嚴氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "吕布的妻子，生一女，吕布最为钟爱。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任延> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "任延"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "长孙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少学于长安，显名太学，号为“任圣童”。年十九官会稽都尉，尊贤赈贫，延聘隐逸。建武中征为九真太守，教民垦辟耕种和嫁娶礼法，移风易俗。后历颍川、河内太守，病卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘详> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘详"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘详> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉詳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘详> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘详> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "世族豪强袁术部将。献帝初平四年（193），领兵屯匡亭与曹操大战，败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆绩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陆绩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆绩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公纪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆绩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆绩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "偏将军、郁林太守。陆康之子，汉末为庐江太守。绩年六岁，於九江见袁术。术出橘，绩怀三枚，去，拜辞堕地，术问，答曰：“欲归遗母。”术大奇之。孙策在吴，张昭、张纮、秦松为上宾，共论四海未泰，须当用武治而平之，绩年少末坐，遥大声驳之，昭等异焉..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆绩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "陆逊同族。年幼的时候，在接见袁术之际将席上的蜜柑偷藏入袖中，被问及，说是要帶回去给母亲吃。后诸葛亮舌战群儒时被驳斥为小儿之见。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨林> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨林"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨林> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊林"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨林> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨林> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "时乌丸首领蹋顿帮助袁绍击破公孙瓒，绍遣行谒者林赍单于玺绶车服以报答蹋顿。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹羲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹羲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹羲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹羲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹羲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹羲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏官吏。曹真之子。真卒，封为列侯。正始中为中领军、安乡侯。与兄曹爽等谋削司马懿之权，被以谋反罪收捕，伏诛，夷三族。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹羲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹羲，曹真之子，曹爽之弟。魏明帝曹睿去世后，曹爽和司马懿同受托孤辅政。曹爽排挤司马懿，将诸兄弟均进封为朝廷要职，曹羲受封中领军，掌握禁兵。曹爽经常外出狩猎，曹羲恐他人暗算，出言劝谏，但不被采纳。终于，司马懿借曹爽兄弟外出之际发动政变，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张良> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张良"@zh .
