<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙坚庶子，也叫孙仁。黄武元年，魏攻吴，魏将曹休出洞口，吕范率军御之。时朗为定武中郎将，违范令放火，烧损茅芒，以乏军用，范即启送朗还吴。大帝别其族为丁氏，禁固终身。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "吴夫人之妹即为孙坚次妻，亦生一子一女：子名朗，字早安；女名仁。是演义的虚构或者错乱。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任福> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "任福"@zh .
