<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨伟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "能直言，明帝治宫室，上谏批评；曹爽发卒六、七万人进击关中，又为爽陈形势，劝退兵。还精通天文，参与修订历法。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张就> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张就"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张就> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張就"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张就> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张就> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安末年，敦煌太守马艾卒官，府又无丞，就父功曹张恭素有学行，郡人推行长史事。遣就东诣曹操，请委派太守。时酒泉黄华、张掖张进各据其郡，欲与恭并势以便割据。就至酒泉，为黄华恭所拘执，劫以白刃。就终不挠，私与父疏，不与黄华等为伍。后黄华、张..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马遹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马遹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马遹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "熙祖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马遹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马遹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋惠帝司马衷长子。初封广陵王。惠帝即位，立为皇太子。及长，不好学，惟与左右嬉戏。后为贾后废，黄门孙虑以药杵椎杀之，年二十三。贾后死，谥愍怀，史称愍怀太子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#山简> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "山简"@zh .
