<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#山简> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "山涛之子，与嵇绍、刘谟、杨准齐名。初为太子舍人，累迁太子庶子、黄门郎，出为青州刺史，直至尚书左仆射。年六十卒，追赠征南大将军、仪同三司。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱寓> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱寓"@zh .
