<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱寓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱寓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与李膺、杜密、王畅等为八俊。历尚书、庐江太守。灵帝即位，窦武辅政，任以司隶校尉。建宁二年（169），党锢之祸再起，与李膺等百余人被捕杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏仆延> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苏仆延"@zh .
