<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏仆延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏仆延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "后汉末辽东属国乌丸大人。率众千余落，自称峭王，服从辽西乌丸大人丘力居教令。丘力居死，子楼班年小，从子蹋顿代立，苏仆延亦从其教令。袁绍与公孙瓒连战不决，为求助兵，矫制赐苏仆延等乌丸三王单于印绶。后楼班长大，苏仆延率其部众奉楼班为单于。建..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许定> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "许定"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "許定"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
