<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "明帝太和元年（227），英反，杀临羌令、西都长。魏遣将军郝昭、鹿磐讨斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈元[西晋]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈元[西晋]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈元[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳元"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈元[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈元[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈元[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "晋将、羊祜部将。祜与吴都督陆抗对峙，祜有小疾，抗送酒与祜。元恐有奸诈，劝祜且宜慢饮。祜笑而不从。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭贡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭贡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭贡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郭貢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭贡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭贡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉豫州刺史。兴平元年，曹公东击陶谦，使彧守甄城，任以留事。会张邈、陈宫以兖州反，潜迎吕布。贡帅众数万来至城下，或言与吕布同谋，众甚惧。贡求见彧，彧将往。东郡太守夏侯惇恐彧遭害，彧以贡与邈等分非素结，今来速者，计必未定，及其犹豫，宜时说..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雍茂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "雍茂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雍茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "雍茂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雍茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雍茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任主簿。茂与尚书令刘巴向刘备进言，劝广罗人才。刘备后以他事杀茂。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伯固> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "伯固"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伯固> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯固"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伯固> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伯固> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "高句丽王。父宫死立为王。顺帝、桓帝时，他进攻辽东郡新安、居乡、西安平，杀带方县令，掠取乐浪太守妻子。灵帝建宁二年（169），为玄菟太守耿临所败，降，属辽东。熹平中，乞属玄菟。公孙度割据辽东时，他曾助度镇压富山“贼”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴陵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "戴陵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴陵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "戴陵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴陵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴陵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任长水校尉。黄初元年（220），陵谏文帝不宜数行狩猎，帝大怒，陵减死罪一等。后复官。太和五年（231），诸葛亮围祁山。司马懿督张郃、戴陵等西屯长安。陵率精兵四千守上邽。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴陵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "奉司马懿之命，担任张郃的副将袭击诸葛亮的营地，但反被包围，让张郃救出。后来当诸葛亮与司马懿比阵时被捉，以墨涂面释回。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王良> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王良"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王良"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "春秋时晋国大夫，善于御马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "春秋时晋国大夫，善于御马。演义中有提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#来忠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#来忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "來忠"@zh .
