<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#来忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "来敏子。博览经学。与尚书向充等协赞姜维，为参军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘长仁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘长仁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘长仁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉長仁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘长仁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘长仁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏安德（今山东陵县）令。有辩才，与当时名术士管辂交好。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蛾遮塞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蛾遮塞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蛾遮塞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蛾遮塞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蛾遮塞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蛾遮塞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "羌将。正始八年，陇西、南安、金城、西平诸羌饿何、烧戈、伐同、蛾遮塞等相结叛乱，攻围城邑，南招蜀兵，凉州名胡治无戴复叛应之。讨蜀护军夏侯霸督诸军屯为翅。九年，遮塞等屯河关、白土故城，据河拒军。郭淮见形上流，密於下渡兵据白土城，击，大破之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡氏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "胡氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "胡氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘琰妻。有美色，琰疑其与后主有私，挝胡，胡具以告，琰下狱，弃市。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀国大臣刘琰之妻，极有颜色。因入宫朝见皇后，后留在宫中，一月方出。琰疑其妻与后主私通，乃唤帐下军士五百人，列于前，将妻绑缚，令每军以履挞其面数十，几死复苏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢洪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卢洪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "盧洪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任校事。洪为官不正，高柔谏宜加以惩办，曹操不从。后奸利事发，曹操杀洪以谢柔。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀羡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀羡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀羡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "令则"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀羡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀羡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "荀崧子。清和有才。尚公主，拜驸马都尉。年二十八即为北中郎将，任徐、兖二州刺史，假节都督徐、兖、青三州诸军事，时封疆大吏中未有若羡之年少者。累立战绩，甚得众心。在镇十年，遇疾解职，卒于家，追赠骠骑将军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴普> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴普"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴普> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吴普"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴普> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴普> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "名医华陀弟子。华陀向他传授五禽之戏，他用以健身，年逾九十，耳目聪明，齿牙完坚。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱讚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱讚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱讚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "朱讚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱讚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱讚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少与乡人大司马曹真、曹遵并事太祖。赞、遵早亡，真愍之，乞分所食邑封赞、遵子。后真请分真邑赐赞、遵子爵关内侯，各百户。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱讚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中称为朱赞。蜀军侵魏，真以赞为副先锋。副都督郭淮命二将抄出祁山之后，去劫蜀寨。然中蜀相亮计，二人夺路而逃。后复中计，赞引兵追赶，忽然一彪军闪出，为首大将乃赵云也。赞措手不及，被云一枪刺死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王买> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王买"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王买> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王買"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王买> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王买> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "随镇西将军钟会伐蜀，与参军皇甫闿等从涪南出冲其腹。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王买> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "与监军卫瓘，护军胡烈，大将买、田续、庞会、田章、爰青彡、丘建、夏侯咸、皇甫闿、句安等八十余员随钟会伐蜀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周昂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周昂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "周昂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任九江太守。曾被袁绍派遣攻夺孙坚所屯阳城，并断孙坚粮草。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟虬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孟虬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟虬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孟虬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟虬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟虬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时蜀国御史中丞孟获之子，孟获亡后率领南中众族发动叛乱，在蜀国灭亡后接受蜀使诸葛质之通好，容许洮阳王刘恂在南中永昌定居。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高柔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高柔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高柔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文惠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高柔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高柔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父靖，为蜀郡都尉。柔留乡里，柔从兄幹，袁绍甥也，在河北呼柔，柔举宗从之。会靖卒於西州，时道路艰涩，兵寇纵横，而柔冒艰险诣蜀迎丧，辛苦荼毒，无所不尝，三年乃还。太祖平袁氏，以柔为管长。高干既降，顷之以并州叛。柔自归太祖，太祖欲因事诛之，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高柔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "太傅司马懿欲夺曹爽之权，听说曹爽兄弟及御林军，随魏主曹芳出城，谒明帝墓，就去畋猎。懿大喜，即到省中，令司徒高柔假以节钺，行大将军事，先据曹爽营。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨览> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨览"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨览> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公质"@zh .
