<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨览> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "南阳太守杨俊孙。曾任汝阴太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨弘[袁术]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨弘[袁术]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨弘[袁术]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊弘"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨弘[袁术]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨弘[袁术]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁术长史，术死，弘及术大将张勋等将其众欲就孙策，庐江太守刘勋截击，悉虏之，收其珍宝以归。三国演义中误作“杨大将”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨弘[袁术]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "术暗有称帝之心，乃回书推托不还玉玺，急聚弘、张勋、纪灵等商议，弘献计攻刘备。后术败回淮南，遣人往江东问孙策借兵报仇不成，怒欲伐之，弘力谏方止。术为众诸侯所围，弘进坚守寿春之计，术从之。演义当中误为杨大将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#种拂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "种拂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#种拂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "颖伯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#种拂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#种拂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "种暠之子。初为司隶从事，拜宛令。时，南阳郡吏好因休沐，游戏市里，为百姓所患。拂出逢之，必下车公谒，以愧其心，自是莫敢出者。政有能名，累迁光禄大夫。初平元年，代荀爽为司空。明年，以地震策免，复为太常。李傕、郭汜之乱。长安城溃，百官多避兵..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#种拂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "李傕、郭汜纵兵大掠。太常卿种拂、太仆鲁馗、大鸿胪周奂、城门校尉崔烈、越骑校尉王颀皆死于国难。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘氏[费观妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘氏[费观妻]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘氏[费观妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘氏[费观妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘氏[费观妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末益州牧刘璋女、三国时蜀汉江州都督费观之妻。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张烱> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张烱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张烱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張烱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张烱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张烱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾以符命说袁术，术乃称帝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张绍> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张绍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张绍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張紹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张绍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张绍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张飞次子。刘禅末年，官至侍中、尚书仆射。景耀六年，魏大兴徒众，征西将军邓艾临成都。后主遣私署侍中绍、光禄大夫谯周、驸马都尉邓良奉赍印缓，请命告诚，敬输忠款，存亡敕赐，惟所裁之。绍、良与艾相遇于雒县。艾得书，大喜，即报书，遣绍、良先还。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张绍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "景耀六年，征西将军邓艾临成都。后主令谯周作降书，遣私署侍中张绍等赍玉玺来雒城请降。艾拆降书视之，大喜，受下玉玺，重待绍等。后姜维事败身死，后主赴洛阳，绍等跟随。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊琇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "羊琇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊琇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "稚舒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊琇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊琇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "羊祜从弟。魏末，以郎中参镇西将军钟会军事，从平蜀。钟会谋据蜀，他苦苦劝谏；乱起不从，事后赐爵关内侯。他与司马炎相善，密谋画策，助其取得储位。司马炎即王位后，擢为左卫将军，封甘露亭侯。西晋初，累迁中护军，加散骑常侍，典禁兵，参预机密。性..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士匡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "士匡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士匡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "士匡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士匡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士匡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "士壹之子，吴中郎将。其堂兄士徽反叛，吕岱奉命征讨，因为和士匡有旧遣匡说徽服罪、保无他忧；士匡说服了士徽，投降，然而吕岱为了功利将士徽斩杀，士匡贬为庶人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寇恂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "寇恂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寇恂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子翼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寇恂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寇恂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "世为著姓。初为郡功曹，太守耿况甚重之。刘秀定河内，以恂为河内太守，行大将军事。时刘秀北伐燕、代，恂征积租谷，转以给年，以解军食急乏之困。建武二年（26），复任颍川太守，破郡中连兵为寇者，封雍奴侯。次年为汝南太守，肃清境内，郡中无事。七..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王当> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王当"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王當"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黑山起义军张燕部下小帅。燕剽捍捷速过人，故军中号曰飞燕。其后人觽寝广，常山、赵郡、中山、上党、河内诸山谷皆相通，其小帅孙轻、王当等，各以部觽从燕，觽至百万，号曰黑山。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李修> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李修"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯游"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初受业于樊鯈。安帝时官至太尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟优> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孟优"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟优> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孟優"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟优> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟优> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟优> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "南蛮王孟获之弟。与诸葛亮的南征军交战，向战败的兄长推荐朵思大王，劝兄长借助朵思之力与蜀军对抗。后来与兄长一起归顺蜀汉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于诠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "于诠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于诠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "于詮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于诠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于诠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴将。为了增援在魏国发动叛乱的诸葛诞，率领援军出征。干宝晋纪曰：数百人拱手为列，每斩一人，辄降之，竟不变，至尽，时人比之田横。吴将于诠曰：“大丈夫受命其主，以兵救人，既不能克，又束手于敌，吾弗取也。”乃免胄冒陈而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于诠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "为了增援在魏国发动叛乱的诸葛诞，率领援军出征。虽然魏将王基劝说他投降，但他还是为国尽忠，战死沙场。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯斐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "冯斐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯斐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "馮斐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯斐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯斐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建衡元年（269），随李勖等从建安海道，就合浦击交阯，斐为导将。次年，勖以建安道不利，杀斐。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李应> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李应"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李应> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李应"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李应> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李应> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "董卓部将李傕从弟。曾为司徒赵温的属吏。兴平二年（195），董卓旧将自相冲突，李傕劫持献帝，欲迁至黄白城，赵温致书加以劝阻，触怒傕。傕欲遣人杀温，应数日劝谏，温乃获免。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#南斗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "南斗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#南斗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#南斗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "南斗六星君，正是管理世间一切人、妖、灵、神、仙等生灵的天官。被《正统道藏》列为众经之首，万法之宗的《度人经》，据说是三国吴时太极徐真人传下，在里边即有提到：“北斗注生，南斗注死。” "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#南斗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "南斗六星君，正是管理世间一切人、妖、灵、神、仙等生灵的天官。被《正统道藏》列为众经之首，万法之宗的《度人经》，据说是三国吴时太极徐真人传下，在里边即有提到：“北斗注生，南斗注死。” 演义中在介绍管辂事迹时有提到南斗。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#项庄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "项庄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#项庄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "項莊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#项庄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#项庄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "故楚大将军项燕的第三个孙子。是战国末年、秦朝、楚汉相争等时期的人物，属楚国贵族，是项羽的堂弟，项梁、项羽起义抗秦时，项庄也加入其阵营。在鸿门宴中，由于项羽与范增对刘邦是否该刺杀的意见相左，范增私下找来项庄，请求项庄在刘邦的接待宴席上表..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#项庄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "秦朝末年人物，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何双> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "何双"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何双> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "汉偶"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何双> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何双> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "何宗之子。谈笑滑稽，有淳于髡、东方朔之风。任双柏县长。早卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贺齐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "贺齐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贺齐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公苗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贺齐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贺齐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "后将军、徐州牧。少为郡吏，守剡长。县吏斯从轻侠为奸，齐怒，立斩从。从族党遂相纠合，众千馀人，举兵攻县。齐率吏民，开城门突击，大破之，威震山越。后太末、丰浦民反，转守太末长，诛恶养善，期月尽平。建安元年，孙策临郡，察齐孝廉。策遣永宁长韩..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹宪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹宪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操女儿。献帝建安十八年（213），与姊宪、节同被汉献帝聘为夫人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#费观> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "费观"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#费观> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宾伯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#费观> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#费观> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘璋母乃观之族姑，璋又以女妻观。建安十八年，观参李严军，拒先主於绵竹，与严俱降，先主既定益州，拜为裨将军，后为巴郡太守、江州都督，建兴元年封都亭侯，加振威将军。观为人善於交接。都护李严性自矜高，护军辅匡等年位与严相次，而严不与亲亵；观..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#费观> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初从刘璋，为璋妻弟。刘备征益州，费观举李严共提兵守把绵竹。刘备兵至，费观令李严出战。李严败降，愿回城招降费观。李严入绵竹，对费观赞玄德仁德，并说：“今若不降，必有大祸。”费观从其言，开门投降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍弋> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "霍弋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍弋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "绍先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍弋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍弋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "南中都督。父峻，蜀梓潼太守、裨将军。弋先主末年为太子舍人。后主践阼，除谒者。丞相诸葛亮北驻汉中，请为记室，使与子乔共周旋游处。亮卒，为黄门侍郎。后主立太子璿，以弋为中庶子，璿好骑射，出入无度，弋援引古义，尽言规谏，甚得切磋之体。后为参..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍弋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初为蜀建宁太守，弋闻成都不守，素服望西大哭三日。诸将皆劝速降，弋不从。后弋探听得后主受封，遂率部下军士来降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘琰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "威硕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘备在豫州时，辟刘琰为从事，以其人同宗姓，有名士风流，善于谈论，于是对其厚待亲任。刘备西定益州，以刘琰为固陵太守。及至后主刘禅登位，封刘琰为都乡侯，迁车骑将军，班位每亚于李严。然而刘琰不知国政，但只领兵千余人，辄随丞相诸葛亮坐谈讽议而..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "于演义第一百一十五回登场。时蜀后主刘禅宠信黄皓，溺于酒色，不理朝政。刘琰之妻胡氏入宫为太后祝贺，太后留胡氏于宫，经月方出。胡氏本甚有美色，刘琰疑其与后主有私，便命五百军士以履挝挞胡氏之面数十。后主闻此大怒，命有司议其罪，刘琰因罪下狱，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁夫人> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁夫人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "袁夫人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权夫人。袁术之女。有节行而无子。权数以诸姬之子过继给她抚养，皆不育。及步夫人死，权欲立以为后，夫人以无子故，固辞不受，曾遭潘夫人谄害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹琬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹琬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹琬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹琬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹琬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹琬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏王公。樊安公均之子。黄初三年（222），诏奉曹昂后，封中都公。其年徙封长子公。嘉平六年（254），以琬袭昂爵为丰王。卒后，谥曰恭王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缪祎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "缪祎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缪祎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "繆禕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缪祎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缪祎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任选曹尚书，刚直不阿。孙皓时，为群小所构，贬为衡阳太守。寻又被诬，下狱，徙桂阳郡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞皇后[曹奂妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卞皇后[曹奂妻]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞皇后[曹奂妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "卞皇後"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞皇后[曹奂妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞皇后[曹奂妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏陈留王曹奂皇后。卞琳女。景元四年（263年）秋九月癸卯，立为皇后。咸熙二年（265）十二月壬戌，曹奂禅位于晋王司马炎，卞后随曹奂逊居邺（今河北临漳），计在位3年。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#留赞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "留赞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#留赞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "正明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#留赞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#留赞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少为郡吏，与黄巾贼帅吴桓战，手斩得桓。赞一足被创，遂屈不伸。然性烈，好读兵书及三史，每览古良将战攻之势，辄对书独叹。凌统请与相见，甚奇之，乃表荐赞，遂被试用。累有战功，稍迁屯骑校尉。赞为将，临敌必先被发叫天，因抗音而歌，左右应之，毕乃..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#留赞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "大帝孙权崩，魏军袭，赞受诸葛恪命迎之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯承> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯承"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文子"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾在荆州任职。步骘以为贤才而推荐给孙权。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈元[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈元[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈元[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "长孙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈元[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈元[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉初学者。从父学习《左氏春秋》，少传父业，为之训诂。建武初，与桓谭、杜林、郑兴俱为学者所宗。上疏请立左氏学，又请勿令司隶校尉督察三公，光武帝皆从之。以才高著名，辟司空李通府。后数陈便宜不用，以病去，年老，卒于家。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈矫> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈矫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈矫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季弼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈矫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈矫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "本姓刘氏，因过继与母族而改姓陈，初为郡功曹，郡为孙权所围，求救于曹操，设伏大破吴军。曹操辟为司空掾属，累迁至魏郡太守。时系囚千数，历时甚长，娇一一览其罪状，迅速了结。后从征汉中，还为尚书。曹操死后，力主曹丕不须诏命而速即王位，并为之具..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈矫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "與曹仁一起鎮守南郡，但是敗在諸葛亮的妙計之下。後來成為尚書，對曹丕即皇帝位有所貢獻。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭旦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "彭旦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭旦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彭旦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭旦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭旦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄龙五年（233），聚众举事，次年为陆逊讨破。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董荼那> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董荼那"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董荼那> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "董荼那"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董荼那> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董荼那> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董荼那> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "南蛮王孟获的属下，第二洞元帥。与阿会喃一起担任孟获的援军出征，但是被俘虏。后被诸葛亮释放。二次出征时遇见马岱，被训斥的面红耳赤而退兵，反被孟获打了一百军棍，后设计绑送孟获给诸葛亮。孟获回到本寨，先伏刀斧手于帐下，差心腹人到董荼那、阿会..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#詹晏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "詹晏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#詹晏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "詹晏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#詹晏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#詹晏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安二十四年（219），晏为吴大将陆逊所败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙资> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙资"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙资> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦龙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙资> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙资> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三岁时父母俱亡，为兄嫂所养。在曹操手下历任县令，参丞相军事，于魏国初建之际与刘放俱任秘书郎。曹丕继位后，魏改秘书为中书，孙资任中书令，同中书监刘放一同掌握机密。曹睿继位后，刘放、孙资二人更加被宠信，不断加官进爵。曹睿病危时，原意招燕王..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙资> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义第96回登场，魏尚书。诸葛亮第一次北伐撤退后，司马懿欲伐蜀，孙资出面劝阻，建议魏国据险防守，待吴蜀自相攻伐，司马懿赞同，遂依计而行。孙资后任侍中、光禄大夫，于魏明帝曹睿病危之际同刘放同掌枢密院一切事务。曹睿又任燕王曹宇为大将军，佐..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍光> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "霍光"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子孟"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "政治家，麒麟阁十一功臣之首，名将霍去病异母弟，昭帝上官皇后外祖父，宣帝霍皇后之父。先后任郎官，曹官、侍中、奉车都尉、光禄大夫、大司马、大将军等职位，封博陆侯，谥号为宣成，是以又被尊称为博陆宣成侯。历经汉武帝、汉昭帝、汉宣帝三朝，期间曾..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张遵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张遵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張遵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张飞之孙，刘禅末年官至尚书。景耀六年，遵随诸葛瞻于绵竹，与魏征西将军邓艾战，死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "景耀六年，魏攻蜀，围蜀将诸葛瞻于绵竹。瞻见救兵不至，遂留子尚与遵守城，瞻自杀出。后瞻败死，尚欲出，遵劝止，不从。后尚亦亡，遵、黄崇、李球三人，各引一军杀出。蜀兵寡，魏兵众，三人亦皆战死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴巨> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴巨"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴巨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吴巨"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴巨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴巨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "表遣巨领苍梧太守，与赖恭俱至。后巨与恭相失，举兵逐恭，恭走还零陵。初，刘备为曹公所攻，至夏口，备与巨有旧，欲往投之。建安十五年，孙权遣步骘为交州刺史。骘到，燮率兄弟奉承节度。而吴巨怀异心，骘斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴巨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉苍梧太守。演义其名误为吴臣。刘备为曹公所攻，至夏口，备与巨有旧，欲往投之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑礼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑礼"@zh .
