<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾参与制定吴国朝仪。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘琬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉琬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝建安初，受命使吴，封孙策为吴侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘琬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "“小霸王怒斩于吉　碧眼儿坐领江东”一章中，昔汉使刘琬入吴，见孙家诸昆仲，因语人曰：“吾，遍观孙氏兄弟，虽各才气秀达，然皆禄祚不永。惟仲谋形貌奇伟，骨格非常，乃大贵之表，又亨高年，众皆不及也。”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙方> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "公孙方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公孫方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉末人。曾与崔琰一起就郑玄受学。早卒。"@zh .
