<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梅乾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾与雷绪、陈兰等聚众数万，起事于江淮间，为扬州刺史刘馥所安抚。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士仁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "士仁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士仁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "君义"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士仁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士仁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "原本为蜀将。为将军，住公安，统属关羽，与羽有隙，吕蒙到南郡，士仁，糜芳皆叛迎孙权。黄武二年六月，仁、刘邵、鲜于丹随将军贺齐收复蕲春，俘初叛吴之戏口守将晋宗。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#士仁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "关羽部将。刘备入川时，仁与关羽、糜芳共守荆州。东吴白衣渡江攻打关羽时，仁杀死关羽的催粮使者并诱使糜芳一起投降东吴，致使关羽失去援助而死亡。建安二十五年（公元220年）刘备征伐东吴时，仁和糜芳杀死东吴将军马忠，复投降刘备，后被刘备所杀。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘翥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "潘翥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘翥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文龙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘翥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘翥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "潘濬长子。字文龙，初拜骑都尉。父卒，代领兵。早卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#骆秀> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "骆秀"@zh .
