<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#骆秀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "骆统之子。曾任司盐校尉。景帝永安七年（264），海盐为海盗攻破，秀被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张仪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张仪"@zh .
