<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏国大梁（今河南开封）人，魏国贵族后裔，著名的政治家、外交家和谋略家。张仪曾与苏秦同师从于鬼谷子先生，学习权谋纵横之术，饱读诗书，满腹韬略，连苏秦都自叹才能在张仪之下。张仪曾两次为秦相，前后共11年，亦曾两次为魏国国相，第一次4年，第..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "战国时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘备母> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘备母"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘备母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘备母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘备母亲，刘备父亲早亡，与母亲贩屦织席为业。在刘备十五岁的时候，其母使其游学。与刘德然、公孙瓒等师从卢植。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘备母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "刘备母亲，刘备父亲早亡，与母亲贩屦织席为业。在刘备十五岁的时候，其母使其游学。尝师事郑玄、卢植，与公孙瓒等为友。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#萧何> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "萧何"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#萧何> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蕭何"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#萧何> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#萧何> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "早年任秦沛县狱吏，秦末辅佐刘邦起义。攻克咸阳后，他接收了秦丞相、御史府所藏的律令、图书，掌握了全国的山川险要、郡县户口，对日后制定政策和取得楚汉战争胜利起了重要作用。楚汉战争时，他留守关中，使关中成为汉军的巩固后方，不断地输送士卒粮饷..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#萧何> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
