<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鹿磐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鹿磐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太和元年（227），西平麴英反，磐与郝昭讨斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘桢> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘桢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘桢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公干"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘桢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘桢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安七子之一。博学有才，与魏文帝友善。后以不敬罪被刑，刑后署吏。所作五言诗，风格遒劲，语言质朴，重名于世，今有《刘公干集》。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沐仪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "沐仪"@zh .
