<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张憙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十三年（208），曹操征荆州，与刘备、孙权联军战于赤壁。孙权率军围合肥，以牵制曹操兵力。操遣憙单将千骑，过领汝南兵以解围。权闻憙至，乃退兵。其名又写作“张喜”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张牛角> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张牛角"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张牛角> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張牛角"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张牛角> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张牛角> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末年黑山农民军的领袖之一，又称青牛角。与当时乘黄巾之乱而起的褚燕（即张燕）聚众起事，被褚燕推举为首领，后来张牛角在战场上被箭射伤，不治身亡，临死前召集部下，要求以褚燕为新领袖。"@zh .
