<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李云> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "好学问，通阴阳。初举孝廉，后为白马令。延熹二年（159），桓帝以诛权臣梁冀功封宦官单超等五人为列侯，政治日趋腐败。云露布上书极谏，并以副本上三公府，因而触怒桓帝，下狱死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐璆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐璆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐璆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孟玉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐璆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐璆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父徐淑，度辽将军，有名于边。璆少博学，辟公府，举高第。稍迁荆州刺史。时，董太后姊子张忠为南阳太守，因势放滥，臧罢数亿。璆临当之部，太后遣中常侍以忠属璆。璆对曰：“臣身为国，不敢闻命。”太后怒，遽征忠为司隶校尉，以相威临。中平元年，与中..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐璆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁术僭号，曹公讨伐之。及术亡，侄胤将灵柩及妻子奔庐江来，为璆尽杀之。璆夺得玉玺，赴许都献于曹公。公大喜，封璆为高陵太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习氏[庞林妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "习氏[庞林妻]"@zh .
