<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习氏[庞林妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习氏[庞林妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "习祯妹。嫁庞林，曹操破荆州，习氏与林分隔，守养弱女十余年。后林随黄权降魏，始复集聚。曹丕闻而贤之，赐床帐衣服，以显其义节。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜保> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜保"@zh .
