<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜保> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建武中，为越骑司马，性豪侠好义，忧人之忧，乐人之乐。因仇人上书讼其“为行浮薄，乱群惑众”，诏免官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周浚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周浚"@zh .
