<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周浚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "以才理知名。初为魏国尚书郎、御史中丞、折衝将军、扬州刺史，拜射阳侯。伐吴有功，封成武侯。后为晋武帝侍中、少府领将作大匠，又为都督扬州诸军事，拜安东将军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乃太原> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "乃太原"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乃太原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "乃太原"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乃太原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乃太原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "管辂同乡。辂乡里乃太原问辂：“君往者为王府君论怪，云老书佐为蛇，老铃下为乌，此本皆人，何化之微贱乎？为见於爻象，出君意乎？”辂言：“苟非性与天道，何由背爻象而任胸心者乎？夫万物之化，无有常形，人之变异，无有常体，或大为小，或小为大，固..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡渊> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "胡渊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡渊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "世元"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡渊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡渊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父烈，晋秦州刺史。渊小字鹞鸱，魏时，从钟会伐蜀。及蜀定，会反，父烈与诸将皆被闭。渊时年十八，为士卒先，攻杀会，名驰远近。后赵王伦篡位，三王兴义，伦使渊与张泓将兵御齐王，屡破齐军。会成都战克，渊乃归降伏法。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡渊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "钟会平蜀，阴反之，监渊父护军烈与诸将。时渊领兵在外，会心腹将丘建为烈旧部，烈泣求其透一消息。建暗令烈亲信送密书与渊。渊大惊，遂遍示诸营知之。渊定计，于正月十八日中，可骤入内。监军卫瓘深喜胡渊之谋，即整顿了人马。及会即姜维领武士往杀众魏..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#安阳公主> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "安阳公主"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#安阳公主> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "安陽公主"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#安阳公主> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#安阳公主> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虎贲中郎将荀恽妻，曹操之女。献帝建安中嫁给荀恽，后称安阳公主。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛悌> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "薛悌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛悌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝威"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛悌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛悌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "悌与王思、郤嘉俱从微起，官位略等。三人中，悌差挟儒术，所在名为间省。年二十二，以兗州从事为泰山太守。陈矫为郡功曹，使过泰山。悌异之，结为亲友。戏谓矫曰：“以郡吏而交二千石，邻国君屈从陪臣游，不亦可乎！”兖州叛应张邈，悌助程昱守鄄城、范..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛悌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "将军张辽失皖城，回合淝，心中愁闷。忽太祖差悌送木匣与辽，内有秘计。后辽闻吴主权在濡须将欲兴兵进取，恐合淝兵少难以抵敌，急令悌星夜往汉中，报知太祖，求请救兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵昂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵昂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伟章"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为羌道令，建安中转参军事徒居州治冀城。建安十八年，马超围冀城多天，城中饥困，凉州刺史韦康不愿百姓再受苦而欲降，赵昂进劝但不为所纳。后马超背信弃义杀韦康並劫其子赵月为人质，把他送至南郑。欲以此要迫使赵昂为己所用。后与梁宽、赵衢、庞恭、..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "历城统兵校尉。马超战冀城后，灭刺史韦康家。参军杨阜借故逃出，与抚彝将军姜叙、赵昂等商议。其子赵月为马超裨将，在昂举兵后被马超斩杀。马超血洗历城，赵昂全家除妻子王异外皆被杀，夏侯渊领大军至，超遂弃城，投奔张鲁。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨陵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨陵"@zh .
