<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨陵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨陵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "少府阜族弟也。蜀相亮攻魏，擒安定太守崔谅，陵欲将计就计，只推献城门，赚蜀兵入，却就城中杀之。后为亮识破，于城门前为蜀将关兴所杀。"@zh .
