<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宗宝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "北海相孔融部将。黄巾余党管亥引兵困北海，与融要粮，融斥之。亥大怒，拍马舞刀，直取融，融将宝挺枪出马；战不数合，被管亥一刀，砍宗宝于马下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔骃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "崔骃"@zh .
