<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王思> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "先为西曹令史，后任豫州刺史。正始中，迁大司农，封列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#明元皇后> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "明元皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#明元皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "明元皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#明元皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#明元皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏明帝皇后。出身大族。黄初中入宫，为明帝宠爱，先拜为夫人，后帝病重，立为皇后。齐王立，尊为皇太后。时值三主幼弱、宰辅统政，每遇大事，皆先问于太后而后行。死后葬于高平陵西。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#明元皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹叡宠爱郭夫人，毛后失宠。一日，曹叡与郭夫人在园中赏花饮酒。曹叡传谕宫娥，不许令毛后知道。曹叡得知有人告知毛后，喝令宫官将所有侍奉的人全部斩了。毛后大惊，回到宫中，曹叡赐死毛皇后，立郭夫人为皇后。朝臣都不敢进谏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李俊> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李俊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李俊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十八年（213），马超攻占陇上郡县，破冀城。凉州从事杨阜遂与俊等结谋，起兵击败马超，迫使他南投张鲁。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任先> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "任先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任先> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "任先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任先> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任先> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "长水校尉任峻长子。建安九年（204），嗣父为都亭侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜宽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜宽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜宽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "务叔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜宽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜宽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "杜畿三子、杜恕之弟。清虚玄静，敏而好古。以名臣门户，少长京师，而笃志博学，绝於世务，其意欲探赜索隐，由此显名，当涂之士多交焉。举孝廉，除郎中。年四十二而卒。经传之义，多所论駮，皆草创未就，惟删集礼记及春秋左氏传解，今存于世。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#瞿恭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "瞿恭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#瞿恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "瞿恭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#瞿恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#瞿恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末农民起义军首领。活动于阳安郡。建安初，为李通所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙异> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙异"@zh .
