<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张既> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张既> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "年十六为郡小吏。举茂才，除新丰令，治为三辅第一。既授命说马腾与繇会击高干、郭援叛，大破之。又会腾等败张晟等，斩卫固、张琰。召马腾于关中，定关西叛。为京兆尹抚民兴政。魏初，为尚书，出为雍州刺史。从征张鲁，说曹操拔汉中民实长安三辅。协曹洪..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张既> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "夏侯渊保举冯翊高陵人姓张名既字德容为京兆尹，与渊同守长安。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王芬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王芬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王芬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王芬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王芬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王芬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "冀州刺史。曾与许攸、周旌等连结豪杰，谋废灵帝，立合肥侯为帝，为曹操拒绝。后败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#栗攀> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "栗攀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#栗攀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "栗攀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#栗攀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#栗攀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任魏郡太守。后为部卒所害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑玄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑玄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "康成"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "著名学者。少为乡啬夫，不乐为吏，遂入太学受业。先后从第五元先、张恭祖、卢植、马融学今古文经，游学十余年，始归乡里，客耕东莱（今山东龙口南），聚徒讲学，生徒达数百千人。后因党锢事被禁，遂潜心著述，杜门不出。灵帝末，党禁解，朝臣屡辟举不就..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "经学大师，曾为刘备致书于袁绍。后随袁绍征战官渡之战，于路上病死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏续> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "魏续"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏续> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "魏續"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏续> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏续> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与吕布有亲，布将高顺兵归续管。献帝建安三年（198），曹操率军攻布，围之三月。续与侯成、宋宪缚陈宫，降曹。布被迫降，被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏续> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "因吕布听妻妾言，不从将计，而与侯成、宋宪一起背叛吕布、投降曹操。白马之战中宋宪被颜良斩落马下，魏续曰：“杀我同伴，愿去报仇！”操许之。续上马持矛，径出阵前，大骂颜良。良更不打话，交马一合，照头一刀，劈魏续于马下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕昭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕昭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子展"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "镇北将军。昭才实仕进，明帝时为镇北将军领冀州。时桓范为冀州牧，耻在昭下，故称疾不赴任。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金乡公主> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "金乡公主"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金乡公主> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "金鄉公主"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金乡公主> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金乡公主> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏公主。曹操女儿。何晏妻。公主贤，曾问其母：“晏为恶日甚，将何保身？”其母不以为然。后晏果罪死，司马懿嘉公主有先见之明，不杀其子。另有一说是沛王曹林的女儿。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆延> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陆延"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陸延"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陆逊长子，早夭。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏昭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏昭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "夏昭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁绍集团将领，绍死。在袁绍外甥高干手下为将。高干投降曹操后复叛，执上党太守。夏昭被高干委为上党城守将，为操攻克。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁谭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁谭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁谭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "显思"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁谭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁谭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁绍长子，守青州。绍卒，幼弟袁尚袭绍爵。谭为长子，不得立。谭自称车骑将军，出军黎阳。曹操度河攻谭，谭告急于尚，尚自将助谭，与操相拒于黎阳。自九月至明年二月，大战城下，谭、尚败退。后与尚失和，引兵攻尚，战败。王修、刘表书劝袁氏兄弟勿相攻..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁谭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "青州刺史。袁紹死後，由于小弟袁尚自行繼位，與袁尚爭鋒，失敗。求得曹操的援助，戰勝了袁尚，但是自己最終也被曹操殺死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高寿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高寿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高寿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "高壽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高寿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高寿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权黄武四年（225）冬，魏文帝曹丕率大军至广陵，见江水浩荡，乃叹而退还。寿受孙韶之命率敢死士五百人于径路袭击曹丕，获副车羽盖以还。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏[孙和嫡妃]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张氏[孙和嫡妃]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏[孙和嫡妃]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏[孙和嫡妃]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张氏[孙和嫡妃]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张昭孙女，张承女，三国时吴孙和嫡妃。建兴二年（253），孙亮赐和死，张氏亦自杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩范> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩范"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "韓範"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "事袁尚，任易阳令。献帝建安九年（204），曹操率军围邺，破邯郸。范举县降，赐爵关内侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宗预> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "宗预"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宗预> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "德艳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宗预> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宗预> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安中，随张飞入蜀，建兴初，诸葛亮任其为主簿，迁参军右中郎将。后迁为侍中，徒尚书。延熙十年（247），为屯骑校尉，受命聘吴，归来拜征西大将军，赐爵关内侯。景耀元年（258），以疾还成都。后任镇军大将军，领兖州刺史。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宗预> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "却说后主回到成都，忽近臣奏曰：“边庭报来，东吴令全琮引兵数万，屯于巴丘界口，未知何意。”后主惊曰：“丞相新亡，东吴负盟侵界，如之奈何？”蒋琬奏曰：“臣敢保王平、张嶷引兵数万屯于永安，以防不测。陛下再命一人去东吴报丧，以探其动静。”后主..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#北斗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "北斗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#北斗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#北斗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "星神，北斗七星君是道教崇奉的七位星神，即北斗七星。被《正统道藏》列为众经之首，万法之宗的《度人经》，据说是三国吴时太极徐真人传下，在里边即有提到：“北斗注生，南斗注死。” "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#北斗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "星神，北斗七星君是道教崇奉的七位星神，即北斗七星。被《正统道藏》列为众经之首，万法之宗的《度人经》，据说是三国吴时太极徐真人传下，在里边即有提到：“北斗注生，南斗注死。”  演义中在介绍管辂事迹时有提到北斗。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨戏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨戏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨戏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文然"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨戏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨戏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少知名。戏每推祁以为冠首，丞相亮深识之。戏年二十馀，从州书佐为督军从事，职典刑狱，论法决疑，号为平当，府辟为属主簿。亮卒，为尚书右选部郎，刺史蒋琬请为治中从事史。琬以大将军开府，又辟为东曹掾，迁南中郎参军，副二庲降都督，领建宁太守。以..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寇氏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "寇氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寇氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "寇氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寇氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寇氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末官吏。封罗侯，刘备养子刘封之生父。史失其名。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱桓> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱桓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱桓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "休穆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱桓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱桓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权统事，朱桓成为余姚长，为当地人民解决瘟疫，又招募士卒，讨伐当地山贼，所到之处，山贼都平定。后来代替周泰成为濡须督。夷陵之战后，曹仁率领几万步骑出征濡须，扬声攻打羡溪，朱桓分兵救羡溪，军队出发之后，才突然得知曹仁要进军濡须，但要追回..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱桓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "黄武元年，魏主丕伐吴，桓驻濡须御曹仁，退仁军。黄武七年，鄱阳太守周鲂计诱魏大司马曹休军入皖成，桓、全琮随陆逊应敌，桓献策断休归路，尽杀休兵，而后直入寿春，逊不从。后仍大败魏军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙豹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "公孙豹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙豹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公孫豹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙豹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙豹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "时玄菟太守公孙琙，子豹，年十八岁，早死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹琮> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹琮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹琮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹琮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹琮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹琮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "宛侯据之子。曹冲病卒，曹操命琮奉冲后。建安二十二年（217），封琮为邓侯。黄初三年（222），进琮爵，徙封冠军公。四年，徙封己氏公。景初元年（237），坐于中尚方作禁物，削户，贬爵为都乡侯。三年，复为己氏公，正始七年（246），转封平阳公。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲜于辅> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲜于辅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲜于辅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鮮于輔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲜于辅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲜于辅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为刘虞从事，公孙瓒破虞，辅以燕国阎柔素有恩信，推为乌桓司马。柔招诱胡汉数万人，与瓒所置渔阳太守邹丹战于潞北，斩丹等四千余级。乌桓峭王感虞恩德，率种人及鲜卑七千余骑，共辅南迎虞子和，与袁绍将麴义合兵十万，共攻瓒。代郡、广阳、上谷、右北..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁忠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "正甫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与同郡范滂为友。初平中为沛相，以清亮见称。后弃官避地上虞，及孙策破会稽，忠浮海至交阯避之。献帝征为卫尉，未至而卒。一说忠任沛相时欲办曹操，及操富贵，遂逃往交州避难。操遣使喻太守士夑，族之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#干宝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "干宝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#干宝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "令升"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#干宝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#干宝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少勤奋好学，博览群籍，以才器诏为佐著作郎。后参与镇压以杜弢为首的荆湘流民起义，赐爵关内侯。东晋初，经王导推荐，领修国史，著《晋纪》二十卷，另有《春秋左氏义外传》、注《周易》、《周官》等数十篇，今均失传。又搜集古今神怪轶闻，成《搜神记》..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王熙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王熙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王熙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔和"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王熙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王熙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "著名医学家、医书编纂家。王叔和幼年时代是在缺衣少食的贫寒中度过的。严酷的生活现实，使他从小就养成了勤奋好学，谦虚沉静的性格。他特别喜爱医学，读了不少古代医学典籍，并渐渐学会了诊脉治病的医术。他在开始行医的时候，因为家境贫穷，衣衫破旧，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈谌> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈谌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈谌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈谌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈谌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末名士陈寔之子。献帝初为司空掾。父寔、兄纪并有高名，世人以谌配之，号曰“三君”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#屈晃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "屈晃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#屈晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "屈晃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#屈晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#屈晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权时任尚书仆射。因固谏立太子孙和，被杖一百，斥还田里。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴玄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "裴玄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦黄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#裴玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "有学行，曾与严畯、张承论管仲、子路，与其子裴钦评齐桓、晋文等人优劣，各有文理。官至太中大夫。著有《新言》，今佚。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄邵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄邵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "黃邵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末农民起义军首领。建安元年（196），曹操率兵征伐，邵为操部将于禁所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中作“黄劭”，青州黄巾贼首。劭与何仪作乱，曹公讨之，为许褚生擒，后为曹公斩首。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毕轨> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "毕轨"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毕轨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "昭先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毕轨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毕轨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "以才能，少有名声。魏明帝在东宫时，在文学中。黄初末，出为长史。明帝即位，入为黄门郎，子尚公主，居处殷富。迁并州刺史。至正始中，入为中护军，转侍中、尚书，迁司隶校尉。与曹爽等谋削司马懿之权，嘉平元年被杀，夷三族。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毕轨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹爽门客，为司马懿斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卑弥弓呼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卑弥弓呼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卑弥弓呼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "卑彌弓呼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卑弥弓呼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卑弥弓呼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东夷狗奴国男王。 倭国女王卑弥呼和狗奴国男王卑弥弓呼一向不和睦。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卓膺> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卓膺"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卓膺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "卓膺"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卓膺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卓膺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "先主入蜀，刘璋敕关戍诸将文书勿复关通先主。先主大怒，召璋白水军督杨怀，责以无礼，斩之。建安十七年（212），乃使膺、黄忠勒兵向璋。先主径至关中，质诸将并士卒妻子，引兵与忠、膺等进到涪，据其城。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卓膺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初仕益州牧刘璋。先主入蜀，膺同张任引军迎之。后雒城之战张任被俘，膺遂降先主。及蜀定，膺与张飞往守巴西。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙辅> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙辅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙辅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "国仪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙辅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙辅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙贲之弟。以扬武校尉辅佐孙策平定三郡。孙策征伐丹杨七县，派辅屯守历阳以拒袁术。又从策西袭庐江太守刘勋，辅身先士卒，有功，策遂立辅为庐陵太守。后迁平南将军，假节领交州刺史。后因遣使与曹操私通，被孙权幽禁。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王赟> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王赟"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王赟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王贇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王赟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王赟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "明帝景初二年（238），蜀阴平太守廖惇反。雍州刺史郭淮遣王赟等讨惇，赟为流矢所中死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭汜妻> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭汜妻"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭汜妻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭汜妻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "郭汜的妻子，因害怕李傕送婢妾给郭汜而夺己之爱，就想挑拨他们的关系。一次李傕送酒菜给郭汜，郭汜妻子把菜中的豆豉说成是毒药，郭汜食用前郭妻把豆豉挑出来给郭汜看，并说了李傕很多坏话，使郭汜起了疑心。从而引发了李傕郭汜两人的火并。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭汜妻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "郭汜的妻子，中了杨彪夫人的离间计，挑拨了李傕和郭汜的关系，从而引发了李傕郭汜两人的火并。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹安民> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹安民"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹安民> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "安民"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹安民> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹安民> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操兄子。建安二年春正月，太祖到宛。张绣降，既而悔之，复反。与战，军败，为流矢所中，安民、太祖长子昂遇害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹安民> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操兄子。建安二年，太祖到宛，张绣降。太祖欲寻妓女，安民乃引绣之叔张济妻邹氏，使操纳之。后为绣所闻，怒反之，夜袭曹军营寨，太祖狼狈逃走，安民被追兵赶上，砍为肉泥。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔烈> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "崔烈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "威考"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "有重名于北州，历位郡守、九卿。灵帝中平二年（185），开鸿都门榜卖官爵，烈因傅母入钱五百万，从廷尉升为司徒。四年，为太尉，旋罢。献帝初，子崔钧与袁绍俱起兵山东，董卓以是收烈付郿狱，锢之，锒铛铁锁。卓既诛，拜烈城门校尉。及李傕入长安，为..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "先为灵帝朝司徒。后李傕郭汜之乱死于国难。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏代> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苏代"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏代> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蘇代"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏代> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏代> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "领长沙太守，拥兵自固。后为刘表所破。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱据> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱据"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱据> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子范"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱据> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱据> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴骠骑将军、新都郡丞，朱桓从弟。黄武初，徵拜五官郎中，补侍御史。权咨嗟将卒，发愤叹息，追思吕蒙、张温，以为据才兼文武，可以继之，自是拜建义校尉，领兵屯湖孰。黄龙元年，权迁都建业，徵据尚公主，拜左将军，封云阳侯。赤乌九年，迁骠骑将军。遭..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨稷> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨稷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨稷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊稷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨稷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨稷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "交阯太守马融病卒，南中监军霍弋又遣稷代融。吴遣虞汜为监军，薛珝为威南将军、大都督，陶璜为苍梧太守，距稷，战于分水。璜败，退保合浦，亡其二将。初，弋遣稷、毛炅等戍，与之誓曰：“若贼围城，未百日而降者，家属诛；若过百日而城没者，刺史受其罪..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛仙公> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "葛仙公"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛仙公> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "葛仙公"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛仙公> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛仙公> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "术士。每饮酒醉，常入人家门前陂水中卧，竟日乃出。曾从吴主别，船沉水中，第二天从水中出，面有酒色。自称与伍子胥在水中喝了一夜酒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张美人[曹芳妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张美人[曹芳妻]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张美人[曹芳妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張美人"@zh .
