<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹演> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏将领。曹纯之子。纯卒，演嗣侯。官至领军将军，正元中进封平乐乡侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈化> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈化"@zh .
