<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈化> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为郎中令，出使于魏，善于辞令。归国后拜犍为太守。顷之，迁太常，兼尚书令。年过七十，辞官居章安，卒于家。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆玄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陆玄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陸玄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陆抗之子。抗卒，玄兄弟五人分领抗兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥瑁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "桥瑁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥瑁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元伟"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥瑁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥瑁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太尉桥玄族子。灵帝末，为兖州刺史，迁东郡太守。初平元年春正月，瑁乃诈作三公移书，传驿州郡，说董卓罪恶，天子危逼，企望义兵，以释国难。以袁绍为盟主，绍屯河内，瑁、张邈、刘岱、袁遗屯酸枣。后刘岱与桥瑁相恶，岱杀瑁，以王肱领东郡太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥瑁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "随袁绍起兵讨董卓，吕布至虎牢关，绍命瑁等八路诸侯迎敌。王匡军败，幸得瑁、袁遗两军皆至，救匡，布方退。后兖州太守刘岱，问瑁借粮。瑁推辞不与，岱引军突入瑁营，杀瑁，尽降其众。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#闵贡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "闵贡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#闵贡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲叔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#闵贡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#闵贡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "家贫，有操守、性恬静。不受无功之禄，自惭口腹之累。世称节士。汉末为河南中部掾。十常侍之乱救驾有功，进郎中, 封都亭侯。周党与仲叔同郡，与闵贡交好，也是“贞介士”．（见逸人传）．“党每过仲叔，共唅菽（泛指豆类）饮水，无菜茹 ”。皇甫谧在..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#闵贡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "十常侍之乱中张让、段珪劫拥少帝及陈留王，冒烟突火，连夜奔走至北邙山。约二更时分，后面喊声大举，人马赶至；当前河南中部掾吏闵贡，大呼“逆贼休走！”张让见事急，遂投河而死。帝与陈留王未知虚实，不敢高声，伏于河边乱草之内。军马四散去赶，不知..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张修[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张修[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张修[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張脩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张修[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张修[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "益州牧刘焉以鲁为督义司马，与别部司马张修将兵击汉中太守苏固，鲁遂袭修杀之，夺其众。熹平中，妖贼大起，三辅有骆曜。光和中，东方有张角，汉中有张修。骆曜教民缅匿法，角为太平道，修为五斗米道。太平道者，师持九节杖为符祝，教病人叩头思过，因以..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩忠[黄巾军]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩忠[黄巾军]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩忠[黄巾军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "韓忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩忠[黄巾军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩忠[黄巾军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄巾渠帅。忠复据宛拒隽。隽兵少不敌，乃张围结垒，起土山以临城内，因鸣鼓攻其西南，贼悉众赴之。隽自将精卒五千，掩其东北，乘城而入。忠乃退保小城，惶惧乞降。司马张超及徐璆、秦颉皆欲听之。隽不许。因急攻，连战不克。隽诈解围，忠果出战，隽因击..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩忠[黄巾军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "韩忠乃黄巾余党。张角亡，与赵弘、孙仲，聚众数万，望风烧劫，称与张角报仇，聚众宛城。中郎将朱隽引军攻之，贼众大败。城中断粮，韩忠使人出城投降，朱隽不许并与刘备商议撤东南二面军马，一齐攻打西北。韩忠果然引军弃城而奔，朱隽引刘、关、张掩杀，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞秉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卞秉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞秉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "卞秉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞秉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卞秉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏武帝曹操卞皇后弟。以功封都乡侯。文帝黄初七年（226）进封开阳侯，邑千二百户，为昭烈将军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#滕皇后> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "滕皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#滕皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "滕皇後"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#滕皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#滕皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙皓之妻，故太常滕胤族女。滕胤被诛，夫人父滕牧流放边郡。孙休时起用为五官中郎。孙皓封乌程侯时聘牧女为妃，即帝位后立为皇后。此后夫人恩宠渐衰，但终未被废。吴灭后随孙皓迁往洛阳。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#岳飞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "岳飞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#岳飞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鹏举"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#岳飞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#岳飞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "他一生与来自于北疆境外的侵略者女真人建立的金国作战，为宋王朝抵御异族侵略，但是最后由于受到南宋统治者的猜忌而被监禁、杀害。宋孝宗淳熙六年（1169年）追谥武穆，宋宁宗嘉定四年（1211年）追封鄂王，故后人也称“岳武穆”或“岳王”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#岳飞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "南宋时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#北宫玉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "北宫玉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#北宫玉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "北宫玉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#北宫玉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#北宫玉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "以中国西北部为据点的藏系游牧民羌族的首领。与韩遂联合发动了叛乱。在资治通鉴里的记载，他被韩遂杀死，领地也被夺去了。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李丰[蜀]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李丰[蜀]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李丰[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李豐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李丰[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李丰[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "李严之子。建兴八年（230），诸葛亮命李严赴汉中拒魏曹真，表丰为江州都督督军，典掌其父所职都督江州事。次年，李严罢官流放，诸葛亮表丰为江州都督。后官至朱提太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李丰[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "父亲李严因补给军粮不利被免官后，由他代任父职。被任命为长史，储备粮草。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱绩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱绩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱绩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公绪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱绩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱绩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "朱然子。以父任为郎，后拜建忠都尉。随太常潘濬讨“五溪蛮”，以胆力称。父亡袭业，拜平魏将军，乐乡督；太平二年拜骠骑将军。孙綝专权，大臣疑贰，乃密书结蜀，使为并兼之虑。永安初，迁上大将军、都护督，元兴元年（264）拜左大司马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑袤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑袤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑袤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "林叔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑袤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑袤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉著名学者郑众后。父郑泰早卒，依叔父郑浑避难淮南。初为临菑侯曹植文学，累迁至光禄大夫，封广昌亭侯、安城乡侯、密陵伯。晋泰始七年（271），拜司空，以寝疾十余年，固辞不受，遂以侯就第。九年卒，年八十五。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑袤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "师领大军屯于襄阳，聚文武于帐下商议。光禄勋郑袤曰：“毌丘俭好谋而无断，文钦有勇而无智，令大将出其不意，江淮之卒锐气正盛，不可轻敌，只宜深沟高垒，以挫其锐，此亚夫之长策也。”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王经> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王经"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王经> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦纬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王经> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王经> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初任江夏太守，后升为尚书。甘露五年（260），坐高贵乡公事诛。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王经> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "雍州刺史。败给背水作战的姜维，但是被陈泰、邓艾救下。后来成为尚书令，在曹髦起兵欲诛伐司马昭时，他和母亲一起被处斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王充> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王充"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王充> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲任"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王充> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王充> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "出身“细族孤门”，少时游学洛阳，拜班彪为师。曾任州县小官。后罢职归乡里，从事著述活动。代表作是《论衡》，共八十五篇（今缺《招致》一篇），二十余万言。此书系统地阐述了他的朴素唯物主义思想，认为天地由“气”形成，“气”是万物的基本元素，从..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阿会喃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阿会喃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阿会喃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "阿會喃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阿会喃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
