<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩琼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "韩德第三子，韩瑛、韩瑶之弟。使一杆方天戟。在凤鸣山之战中被赵云所杀。  "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#舒邵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "舒邵"@zh .
