<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#舒邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初，其兄伯膺亲友为人所杀，邵为之报怨。事觉，兄弟争死，皆得免。袁术时，邵为阜陵长。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹昂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹昂"@zh .
