<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#史迹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "潘璋部将。孙刘交兵时史迹欺黄忠年老，挺枪出战；斗不三合，被忠一刀斩于马下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#岑彭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "岑彭"@zh .
