<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李华> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李华> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "宫廷女官。齐王曹芳嘉平中，魏国大权落入司马氏之手。曹芳不理政事，沉湎女色，使华等女官与优人郭怀、袁信等淫乱。清商令令狐景呵之。后华等多次谗毁令狐景。"@zh .
