<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张步> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张步> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "新莽之末，聚众数千，转攻旁县，下数城，自为五威将军，遂据本郡。梁王刘永承制拜步辅汉大将军、忠节侯，督青徐二州，后又拜步为齐王。建武五年（29）冬，光武帝部将耿弇破步将费邑，进拔临淄，步大败。后降光武帝，封安丘侯。八年夏，逃奔临淮，乘船..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄子廉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄子廉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄子廉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "黄子廉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄子廉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄子廉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉官吏。曾为南阳太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张球> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张球"@zh .
