<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张球> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张球> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张球> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "明帝闻东吴分兵三路而来，亦起兵三路迎之，满宠献策劫寨，帝然之。令骁将球领五千兵，各带火具，从湖口攻之。是夜二更时分，球、宠各引军悄悄望湖口进发；将近水寨，一齐呐喊杀入。吴兵慌乱，不战而走；被魏军四下举火，烧毁战船、粮草、器具不计其数。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵昱> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵昱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵昱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元达"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵昱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵昱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陶谦置广陵太守。昱年十三，母尝病，经涉三月。昱惨戚消瘠，至目不交睫，握粟出卜，祈祷泣血，乡党称其孝。就处士东莞綦毌君受公羊传，兼该群业。至历年潜志，不窥园圃，亲簄希见其面。时入定省父母，须臾即还。高絜廉正，抱礼而立，清英俨恪，莫干其志..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯朝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "冯朝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯朝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "馮朝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯朝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯朝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙亮五凤年间为卫尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王累> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王累"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王累> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王累"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王累> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王累> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "益州从事，曾倒悬于城门劝谏刘璋不要迎接刘备入蜀，然而不被听从。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王累> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义第60回登场，曾倒悬于城门劝谏刘璋不要迎接刘备入蜀，然而不被听从，于是王累自断绳索，摔死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任光> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "任光"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "任光"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "在鄮县主簿任上时，身当白刃，济君于难，为学者虞翻所称道。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙瑜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙瑜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙瑜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲异"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙瑜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙瑜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙坚之侄，昭义中郎将孙静第二子。初为恭义校尉。后领丹杨太守，得众万余人，加绥远将军。建安十一年（204）与周瑜共克麻、保二屯。后从孙权拒曹操于濡须（今安徽无为附近），迁奋威将军，后转屯牛渚，招降魏兵。又在军中立学，请马普为师。孙瑜喜好..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙瑜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙权的堂弟，东吴的宗室成员，于三国演义第57回登场。周瑜以取蜀为借口，欲取荆州时，孙瑜受孙权派遣，率兵前来会合，支援周瑜。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金奇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "金奇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "金奇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十三年（208）反，以万户屯安勒山。遭孙权部将贺齐讨伐，败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘巴[征南将军]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘巴[征南将军]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘巴[征南将军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉巴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘巴[征南将军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘巴[征南将军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀国征南将军，诸葛亮的公文中提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘巴[征南将军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "诸葛亮第一次北伐时，调拨诸将，其中有刘巴。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴良> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "戴良"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔鸾"@zh .
