<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戴良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄武五年（226），吕岱表分海南三郡为交州，以良为刺史，后良助岱讨平士徽。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙慎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙慎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙慎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫慎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙慎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙慎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙俊次子，孙河之孙。任镇南将军，又为夏口督。天纪元年（277）从江夏、汝南出兵，烧略居民。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨祚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨祚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨祚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊祚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨祚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨祚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "公孙渊之将。渊反魏，自号燕王，改元绍汉元年，并遣大将军祚、卑衍等步骑数万屯辽隧，围堑二十馀里。与司马懿战，败，祚等降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨祚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "令大将军卑衍为元帅，祚为先锋，起辽兵十五万，杀奔中原来。渊令卑衍，祚分八万兵屯于辽隧，围堑二十余里，环绕鹿角，甚是严密。胡遵令人报知司马懿。懿命向襄平进发，衍与杨祚急来救时，中了埋伏。左有夏侯霸、右有夏侯威，一齐杀出。卑、杨二人，无心..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王钦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王钦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王欽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "长广太守何夔部下官吏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#山涛> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "山涛"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#山涛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "巨源"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#山涛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#山涛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与嵇康、阮籍等相善，为“竹林七贤”之一。晋右仆射、光禄大夫、侍中。父曜，宛句令。涛早孤，居贫，少有器量，介然不群。性好《庄》《老》，每隐身自晦。与嵇康、吕安善，后遇阮籍，便为竹林之交，著忘言之契。涛年四十，始为郡主簿、功曹、上计掾。举..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#山涛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏臣。文王受封晋王，欲立次子司马攸为世子。时攸已过继与景王。涛谏曰：“废长立幼，违礼不祥。”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马俱> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马俱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马俱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "司馬懼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马俱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马俱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "济南、乐安黄巾徐和、司马俱等攻城，杀长吏，渊将泰山、齐、平原郡兵击，大破之，斩和，平诸县，收其粮谷以给军士。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谷利> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "谷利"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谷利> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "谷利"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谷利> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谷利> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴左右给使。本左右给使也，以谨直为亲近监，性忠果亮烈，言不苟且，吴主权爱信之。时权攻合肥，与凌统、甘宁等在津北为魏将张辽所袭，乘骏马上津桥，桥南已见彻，丈馀无版。谷利在马后，使权持鞍缓控，利於后著鞭，以助马势，遂得超度。权既得免，即拜..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谷利> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙权攻合肥，中曹军张辽、李典埋伏，兵败。孙权纵马上桥，桥南已折丈余，并无一片板，惊得手足无措。谷利大呼曰：“主公可约马退后，再放马向前，跳过桥去。”孙权乃跳过桥南。谷利、凌统抵住张辽。众将保护孙权回营，权乃重赏谷利、凌统。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柯最> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "柯最"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柯最> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "柯最"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柯最> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柯最> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末鲜卑部落大人。居住于右北平以西至上谷一带（属今河北），为檀石槐部的大帅之一。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缪斐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "缪斐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缪斐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文雅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缪斐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缪斐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "博览经传，为当时名儒。征博士，六辟公府。献帝在长安时，公卿举名儒，以斐为侍中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘干> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘干"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉幹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为蜀盐府校尉王连所辟，任典曹都尉，后累迁至巴西（今四川阆中西）太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙楞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙楞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙楞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫楞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙楞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙楞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "五凤二年（255），随左将军留赞袭魏国寿春，为魏诸葛诞部将蒋班所败，被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#眭固> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "眭固"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#眭固> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "白兔"@zh .
