<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴胜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "麴胜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴胜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "麴勝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴胜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴胜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操时，胜袭杀祖厉长刘雋。县吏张绣伺机杀胜。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王观> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王观"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王观> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伟台"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王观> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王观> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少孤贫励志，太祖召为丞相文学掾，出为高唐、阳泉、酂、任令，所在称治。文帝践阼，入为尚书郎、廷尉监，出为南阳、涿郡太守。涿北接鲜卑，数有寇盗，观守御有备，寇钞以息。明帝即位，下诏书使郡县条为剧、中、平者。观言为外剧郡，后送任子诣鄴。时观..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王观> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "太仆。太傅司马懿诛大将军曹爽，令观行中领军事，据曹羲营。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文虎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "文虎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文虎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "文钦三子、文鸯之弟。初钦协毌丘俭举兵反，讨司马师。 后丘俭事败身死，虎与弟鸯随钦归吴。及寿春诸葛诞举兵叛司马昭，谴子为质，结以吴援，虎鸯钦等人率军突入城而守。诞素与钦有隙，以他事诛钦于内，虎、鸯怒勒兵赴之，众不为动，乃逾城出，降司马昭..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "随父文钦协同毌丘俭举兵在寿春反叛，讨伐司马师。后败投吴，诸葛诞在寿春反叛司马昭，文钦率子救助，协同诸葛诞共守寿春城，诸葛诞在城中将文钦杀死，文虎和文鸯从城上跳下投靠司马昭，司马昭加封他为偏将军，关内侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高慎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高慎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高慎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝甫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高慎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高慎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "敦厚少华，有深沉之量。抚育亡兄的五个孤子，恩义甚笃。琅邪相何英嘉其行，以女妻之。后历任二县令、东莱太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#解俊> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "解俊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#解俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "解俊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#解俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#解俊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "文帝时随同田豫负责处理鲜卑事务。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴质> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴质"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴质> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季重"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴质> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴质> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "以文才出众而为曹丕所亲善。吴质为朝歌长时，杨修与丁仪兄弟皆欲使曹植为曹操继嗣。曹丕深以为患，便以车载废簏，内藏吴质入府共谋对策。杨修以此告曹操，未及推验。曹丕甚惧，告之于吴质，吴质道：又有何患？明日可再置绢于簏中以车运以惑之，杨修必再..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴质> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "官任朝歌县长，乃曹丕心腹亲信，于演义第七十二回登场。其时曹操欲立曹植为世子继嗣。曹丕深以为患，便以车载废簏内藏吴质入府共谋对策。主簿杨修乃曹植心腹，便以此告曹操，未及推验。曹丕甚惧，告之于吴质，吴质道：「又有何患？明日可再置绢于簏中以..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈骞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈骞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈骞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "休渊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈骞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈骞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏司徒陈矫子。初为魏尚书郎，迁中山、安平太守，又征为相国司马、长史、御史中丞，迁尚书，封安国亭侯。有军功，升为征南大将军。晋朝建立，以佐命之勋，进车骑将军，封高平郡公，迁侍中、大将军。出为都督扬州诸军事，攻拔吴枳里城，破涂中屯戍。咸宁..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈骞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏国安东将军。诸葛诞因司马昭欺君罔上，兴兵讨之。昭闻之，大怒。遂起兵征剿，任陈骞为副先锋，与呼应诸葛诞的吴军作战，获得胜利。司马炎即位晋王时，他被封为车骑将军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈敖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈敖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈敖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳敖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈敖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈敖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陈表之子。表卒，敖拜别部司马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马义> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马义"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "馬义"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀名将马忠之孙。任晋建宁太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹鉴> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹鉴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹鉴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹鑒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹鉴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹鉴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹丕之子。黄初六年（225），立为东武阳王。其年卒，谥曰怀王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙嘿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙嘿"@zh .
