<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙嘿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙嘿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任中书令。诸葛恪辅政时，数攻魏国新城不下，士卒伤病死亡甚众，帝孙亮乃下诏令班师。恪归入府馆，即召中书令嘿厉声责之：“你等怎敢妄自作退兵诏书？”嘿惶惧，借病辞官还乡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#治元多> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "治元多"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#治元多> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "治元多"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#治元多> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#治元多> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏文帝初置涼州他与涼州卢水胡伊健妓妾等反，大扰河西。黄初二年（221），文帝命张既等进讨，大破之，河西遂平。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#承宫> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "承宫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#承宫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "少子"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#承宫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#承宫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾在蒙阴山耕种禾黍。临熟，有人认地，便弃禾黍而去。于是有名。位至左中郎将、侍中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高昌> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高昌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高昌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "高昌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高昌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高昌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与弟高赐并为刺史、郡守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#嵇喜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "嵇喜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#嵇喜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公穆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#嵇喜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#嵇喜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父昭，治书侍御史。喜有当世才，然不为清流所重。阮籍能为青白眼，见礼俗之士，以白眼对之。及喜来吊，籍作白眼，喜不怿而退。喜弟康闻之，乃赍酒挟琴造焉，籍大悦，乃见青眼。吕安尝从康，或遇其行，喜拭席而待之，弗顾，独坐车中。安於题门上作“凤”..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#颜连> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "颜连"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#颜连> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "顏連"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#颜连> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#颜连> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "丹杨太守孙瑜任其为居巢长，使招纳庐江二郡，二郡遂归吴。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨雄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨雄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨雄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子云"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨雄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨雄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "成都人，本姓杨，扬雄好奇，特自标新，易姓为扬。汉族。继司马相如之后，西汉最著名的辞赋家。西汉官吏、学者。口吃，不善言谈，而好深思。家贫，不慕富贵。40岁后，始游京师。大司马王音召为门下史，推荐为待诏。后经蜀人杨庄引荐，被喜爱辞赋的成帝..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨雄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙泰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙泰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙泰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫泰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙泰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙泰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权之侄，孙匡之子。曾任长水校尉。嘉禾三年（234）从权围魏之新城，中流矢而亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于夫罗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "于夫罗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于夫罗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "於夫羅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于夫罗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于夫罗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "匈奴单于。单于羌渠子，右贤王。前赵刘元海之祖。于东汉中平年间带兵来到中原协助东汉政府镇压起义，赶上本国叛乱，其父单于被杀，于是留在中原，与白波军联合，在太原、河东等地劫掠。汉末军阀混战之际，于夫罗先后与袁绍、张杨、袁术等人联合，两次与..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁京> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁京"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁京> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲誉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁京> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁京> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁绍曾祖父。少隐居本县之五里山，后人因名袁山。习孟氏《易》，作《难记》三十万言。初拜郎中，渐迁至侍中，出为蜀郡太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘恢> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘恢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘恢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉恢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘恢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘恢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘恢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "玄德乃取印绶，挂于督邮之颈，责之曰：据汝害民，本当杀却；今姑饶汝命。吾缴还印绶，从此去矣。”督邮归告定州太守，太守申文省府，差人捕捉。玄德、关、张三人往代州投刘恢。恢见玄德乃汉室宗亲，留匿在家不题。代州刘恢以书荐玄德见虞。虞大喜，令玄..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘若> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘若"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘若> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉若"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘若> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘若> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾拜辅国将军，封清苑亭侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张乔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张乔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张乔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張喬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张乔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张乔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "成阳都尉。晋大举伐吴，王浑率师出横江，遣参军陈慎、都尉张乔攻寻阳濑乡，又击吴牙门将孔忠，皆破之。吴丞相军师张悌、护军孙震、丹杨太守沈莹帅众三万济江，围乔于杨荷桥，众才七千，闭栅自守，举白接告降。吴副军师诸葛靓欲屠之，悌不从，抚之而进。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨乔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨乔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨乔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "圣达"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨乔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨乔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "桓帝时尚书。乔才貌双全，数上言政事。桓帝欲妻以公主，乔固辞不从，遂不食而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘巴[蜀]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘巴[蜀]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘巴[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子初"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘巴[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘巴[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀国尚书令。祖父曜，苍梧太守。父祥，江夏太守、荡寇将军。荆州牧刘表素不善祥，拘巴，欲杀之，数遣祥故所亲信人密诈谓巴曰：“刘牧欲相危害，可相随逃之。”如此再三，巴辄不应。具以报表，表乃不杀巴。年十八，郡署户曹史主记主簿。表连辟，及举茂才..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘巴[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "征南将军。初仕益州牧刘璋，先主入蜀，璋欲以助之以军马钱粮，巴力言不可。后成都被围，谯周主降，巴、黄权闻言皆大怒，欲斩之。后璋降，先主入成都，巴闭门不出。众将忿怒，欲往杀之。先主亲自登门，请巴出仕。巴感玄德恩礼，乃出。蜀定，以巴为左将军..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成得臣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "成得臣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成得臣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子玉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成得臣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成得臣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "芈姓，成氏，名得臣，字子玉，斗伯比之子，子文之弟。若敖氏后裔。春秋时楚令尹。楚成王三十五年（前637年），因战功被子文推荐为令尹。成王三十八年，率楚军灭夔（今秭归境），又北征背楚亲晋的宋国。次年冬，再围宋，与救宋之晋、齐、秦联军战于城..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成得臣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "春秋时楚令尹，三国演义中有提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹娥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹娥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹娥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹娥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹娥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹娥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉孝女。父曹盱为巫祝，入江迎神时溺死，不见尸骸，娥时年十四，乃沿江号哭，遂投江而死。后县长度尚改葬娥于江南道傍，为立碑，即“曹娥碑”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹娥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "在演义中，蔡琰向曹操讲述曹娥十四岁时，父堕江而死。曹娥绕江啼哭七昼夜，跳入波中。后五日，负父之尸，浮于江面。里人葬之江边。以及上虞令度尚奏闻朝廷，表为孝女。度尚令邯郸淳作文，镌碑纪念的事。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊能> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "樊能"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊能> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "樊能"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊能> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊能> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "繇为扬州刺史，州旧治寿春。寿春，术已据之，繇乃渡江治曲阿。术图为僭逆，攻没诸郡县。繇遣能、于麋陈横江，张英屯当利口，以距术。术乃自置扬州刺史，与吴景、孙贲并力攻能、英等，岁馀不下。及孙策东渡，攻繇牛渚营，尽得邸阁粮谷、战具。能、麋等复..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊能> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙策为救老母家小，向袁术借兵来击刘繇。两阵对圆，孙策生擒刘繇部将于麋，拨马回阵。樊能见捉了于糜，挺枪来赶。那枪刚搠到孙策后心，孙策阵上军士大叫：“背后有人暗算！”孙策回头，忽见樊能马到，乃大喝一声，声如巨雷。樊能惊骇，倒翻身撞下马来，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李尚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李尚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "茂仲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "平阳太守李重之弟。永嘉中为郡守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冷苞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "冷苞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冷苞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "冷苞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冷苞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冷苞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十六年，刘备取益州，璋遣苞、刘璝、张任、邓贤等拒先主於涪，皆破败，退保绵竹。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冷苞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "苞为蜀中名将，血气方刚。璋欲引刘备入川，苞等一班文武官皆以为不可，璋不从。后备军师庞统命魏延於宴中舞剑，取璋性命，苞、张任等知其意，与之共舞。建安十六年，备取益州，璋遣苞、刘璝、张任、邓贤等点五万大军，星夜往守雒县，以拒备。苞与邓贤於..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙嵩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙嵩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙嵩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宾硕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙嵩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙嵩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾因救助赵岐而名闻天下。初，赵岐侄子赵息忤怒宦官唐衡兄弟，遭天族之祸，仅岐得以逃至北海贩饼，孙宾硕见其不凡，遂载回藏入复壁中。唐衡死后，赵岐官为郡守、刺史、太仆，而孙宾硕也官至豫州刺史。后宾硕客居荆州，刘表益敬之。不久病亡。《三国志·..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫谧> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "皇甫谧"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫谧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "士安"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫谧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫谧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "号玄晏先生。汉太尉嵩曾孙。年二十余始力学，受业于乡人席坦，有志著述，屡征不就。后得风痹疾，犹手不释卷。著有《帝王世纪》、《列女传》、《逸士传》、《甲乙经》等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#繁钦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "繁钦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#繁钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "休伯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#繁钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#繁钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "文学家。少时以文章才辩得名，长于书记，又善诗赋。曾为丞相曹操主簿。与路粹等齐名。建安二十三年（218），卒。原有集，后失传。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马朗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马朗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯达"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "京兆尹司马防之子，司马懿之兄。司马朗年少时就表现得很有见识，汉末动乱之际，受父命带领家属逃离董卓，又迁往黎阳，成功躲避战乱。曹操任司空后，司马朗被辟为司空属官，又历任成皋令、堂阳长、元城令、丞相主簿、兖州刺史等职，所在皆有政绩，深受百..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司马懿之兄，京兆尹司马防之子。在曹操手下任主簿，三国演义第39回中提及。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张先> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张先> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张先> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张先> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张先> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "张绣手下一名部将。曹操征伐刘表时，张先被许褚斩于南阳。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘循> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘循"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘循> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉循"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘循> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘循> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "奉车中郎将、昔益州刺史刘璋长子。先主伐蜀，璋遣张任、刘璝率精兵拒捍先主於涪，为先主所破，退与璋子循守雒城。先主进军围雒，时循守城，被攻且一年。后蜀定，璋时从庞羲启留循，先主以为奉车中郎将。孙权杀关羽，取荆州，璋及次子阐归吴，循留。是以..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘循> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "益州刺史刘璋长子。先主伐蜀，向父请命与吴懿共守雒城。后城破，刘循开西门走脱，投成都去了。后随父降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊耽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "羊耽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊耽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "羊耽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊耽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
