<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阴修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝初，任少府。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许游> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "许游"@zh .
