<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许游> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许游> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "许靖之孙。景耀中为尚书。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘岳> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "潘岳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘岳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "安仁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘岳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘岳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋给事黄门侍郎、著名文学家。小字檀奴。岳美姿仪，辞藻绝丽，尤善为哀诔之文。少时常挟弹出洛阳道，妇人遇之者，皆连手萦绕，投之以果，遂满车而归。岳少以才颖见称，乡邑号为奇童，谓终贾之俦也。早辟司空太尉府，举秀才。魏咸熙二年，父芘为琅耶内史..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑泰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑泰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑泰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公业"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑泰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑泰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "扬州刺史。曾祖父众，众父兴，皆为名儒。少有少略。灵帝末，知天下将乱，阴交结豪杰。家富于财，有田四百顷，而食常不足，名闻山东。初，举孝廉，三府辟，公车征，皆不就。及大将军何进辅政，征用名士，以泰为尚书待郎，迁待御史。进将诛阉官，欲召并州..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑泰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "灵帝崩，泰随大将军何进立少帝。进谋诛宦官，欲引董卓进京，泰以卓豺狼也，引入京城，必食人劝止之。进不从，泰弃官而去。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宗承> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "宗承"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宗承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "世林"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宗承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宗承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "名士。袁术欲杀何颙，承赞颙为英俊之士，劝术弃宿怨，好待颙。术乃止。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马勋> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马勋"@zh .
