<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘璋时为州书佐，刘备定蜀，辟为左将军属，后转州别驾从事。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔顺> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孔顺"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔顺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孔順"@zh .
