<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔顺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末世族豪强袁绍部下，奸佞小人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘邠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘邠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘邠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "令元"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘邠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘邠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "犯晋太子讳，改为邠。好《易》，与当时名术士管辂相善。历官平原太守、太子仆等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯玄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯玄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "太初"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "夏侯尚之子，曹爽的亲族，受曹爽提拔官至征西将军，假节都督雍、凉州诸军事。夏侯玄曾伙同曹爽伐蜀，结果惨遭失败。后曹爽一族被司马懿剿灭，夏侯玄转任为大鸿胪、太常。中书令李丰、光禄大夫张辑等人欲发动政变，诛杀专权的司马师，改立夏侯玄为大将军..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹爽的亲族，魏征西将军，镇守雍州。曹爽被杀后，夏侯玄被司马懿调回洛阳，改任太常。后司马师专权，魏帝曹芳将血诏偷偷授予夏侯玄、李丰、张缉三人，图谋征讨司马师。三人在宫门处被司马师带人拦截，搜出诏书，皆被腰斩于市，夷灭三族，不久魏帝曹芳也..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦琪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "秦琪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦琪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "秦琪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦琪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦琪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦琪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "属夏侯惇部、蔡阳外甥，据守黄河渡口关隘。关羽欲渡黄河寻刘备，琪不给予船，纵马提刀，直取羽。二马相交，只一合，羽刀起，琪头落。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段煨> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "段煨"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段煨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "忠明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段煨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段煨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝时以将军屯华阴，修农事，不虏略。后为大鸿胪光禄大夫。建安十四年（209），以寿终。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段煨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "献帝时任将军，驻军华阴。后献帝东还洛阳经华阴驻跸，段煨具衣服饮膳上献。后来杀李傕并将李傕合族老小二百余口，活解入许都。段煨被封为荡寇将军，引兵镇守长安。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛衡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "葛衡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "思真"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#葛衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "术士。明达天官，能为机巧，作浑天，使地居于中，以机动之，天转而地止，以上应晷度。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙高> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙高"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙高> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫高"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙高> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙高> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权弟孙翊部将。孙翊被杀，祸首妫览、戴员欲降魏国，孙高与傅婴等设计诛杀之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[陆景妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙氏[陆景妻]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[陆景妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[陆景妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[陆景妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时吴帝孙皓妹。陆景妻。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#边韶> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "边韶"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#边韶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#边韶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#边韶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "文学家。字孝先，以文章知名，教授数百人。善口辩，通经义。桓帝时历任临颍侯相、太中大夫、北地太守、尚书令。后为陈相，卒官。著诗、颂、碑、铭、书、策十五篇，今佚。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹琨> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹琨"@zh .
