<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭伯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭伯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "董卓欲立陈留王刘协为帝，卢植反驳，董卓欲杀之。侍中蔡邕、议郎彭伯劝谏说：“卢尚书海内人望，今先害之，恐天下震怖。”董卓才没有杀害卢植。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄德> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "甄德"@zh .
