<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马秉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "马良之子，马谡之侄，夷陵之战中阵亡后，刘备在其父死后后拜其为骑都尉。没有太突出的功绩记载在书，但是因父亲功绩极其受宠。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#范慎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "范慎"@zh .
