<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#檀柘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末三国时匈奴余部首领。匈奴衰亡后，被匈奴征服的种族奴婢部落，亡匿于黑水，西河一带，有众数万，游牧为生。檀柘为其大人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田丰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "田丰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田丰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元皓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田丰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田丰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "也说是渤海人。博览多识，权略多奇，曾在朝中任侍御史，因不满宦官专权，弃官归家。袁紹起兵讨伐董卓，应其邀请，出任别驾，以图匡救王室之志。后袁绍用田丰谋略，消灭公孙瓒，平定河北，虎据四州。田丰曾劝袁绍早日图许，奉迎天子，占据政治上的主动，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田丰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁绍领冀州，以田丰、沮授、许攸、逢纪分掌州事。袁绍消灭公孙瓒，平定河北，便欲与曹操争霸，田丰建议先通王路，争取政治上的主动，然后稳打稳扎，逐步取胜，袁绍恃其强盛，执意兴师，但在曹操东征刘备时，却以幼子生病为由，不听田丰的趁虚袭许之计，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨修> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨修"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "德祖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操主簿。好学，有俊才，为丞相曹操主簿，用事曹氏。及操自平汉中，欲因讨刘备而不得进，欲守之又难为功，护军不知进止何依。操于是出教，唯曰：“鸡肋”而已。外曹莫能晓，修独曰：“夫鸡肋，食之则无所得，弃之则如可惜，公归计决矣。”乃令外白稍严..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉太尉杨彪之子。虽有才，但是被曹操疏远。一说因他是袁术之侄，又有一说是他曾给曹植出主意之故。数犯曹操之忌。后随操出兵汉中，时与刘备对峙中，修言口令“鸡肋”有退兵之意，被操以扰乱军心处斩。后曹操果败，得以厚葬。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周亚夫> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周亚夫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周亚夫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "周亞夫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周亚夫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周亚夫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "军事家。周勃之子。文帝廿二年（前158年），匈奴犯边，周亚夫被任命为将军，军队纪律严明。汉文帝认为他治军有方，任命他为中尉（负责首都禁卫军的军事首长）。汉景帝时期，他统帅汉军，平定了七国之乱，却得罪了梁王刘武。七国之乱平定后，周亚夫继..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周亚夫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙邵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙邵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "长绪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "原为北海太守孔融的功曹，被孔融称赞为可任朝廷要职的人才，后随刘繇到达江东，继而辅佐孙权。孙权称吴王后，孙邵成为吴国首任丞相，数年后病逝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛玠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "毛玠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛玠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛玠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛玠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少为县吏，以清公称。将避乱荆州，未至，闻刘表政令不明，遂往鲁阳。太祖临兗州，辟为治中从事。玠语太祖天下大计，太祖敬纳其言，转幕府功曹。太祖为司空丞相，玠尝为东曹掾，与崔琰并典选举。其所举用，皆清正之士，虽於时有盛名而行不由本者，终莫得..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛玠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "太祖在兖州，玠来投。太祖都许，迁为典农中郎将，催督钱粮。太祖任丞相，为东曹椽。赤壁之战，太祖中计误杀蔡瑁、张允，以玠、于禁代任水军都督。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁买> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁买"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁买> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "袁買"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁买> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁买> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁绍之子。兄袁尚失败后，与尚俱逃辽东。一说买是尚兄子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈应[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈应[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈应[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳應"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈应[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈应[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末沛相陈珪之子。袁术以应为质，胁迫陈珪助其争夺天下，遭陈珪拒绝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭槐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭槐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭槐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "媛韶"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭槐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭槐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "郭配之女。贾充妻李氏因李丰之罪流徙后嫁与贾充。干练有才识，常帮贾充出谋划策，晋代魏后郭槐帮助贾充重新勘定律令。女儿贾南风为晋惠帝司马衷皇后。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#万彧> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "万彧"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#万彧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "萬彧"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#万彧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#万彧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为乌程令，与帝皓相善，称皓才识明断，是长沙桓王之畴也，又加之好学，奉遵法度，屡言之于丞相濮阳兴、左将军张布。兴、布乃立皓为帝。后累迁左典军、散骑中常侍。宝鼎元年八月，以陆凯为左丞相，彧为右丞相。二年，彧上镇巴丘。建衡二年春，彧还建业..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#万彧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "右丞相。初为左典军，景帝崩，彧及张布、濮阳兴立皓为帝。宝鼎元年，以陆凯为左丞相、彧右丞相。后彧、将军留平、大司农楼玄三人见帝皓无道，直言苦谏，皆被所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张白骑> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张白骑"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张白骑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張白騎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张白骑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张白骑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黑山贼。因骑白马，谓之为张白骑。白骑叛于弘农，马腾校尉庞德随腾征之，破白骑于两肴间。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨训> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨训"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨训> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊訓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨训> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨训> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虽才好不足，而清贞守道。由崔琰荐举，曹操礼辟之。曾撰发表文，称赞曹操功德，时人以为浮伪。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#龚都> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "龚都"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#龚都> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "龔都"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#龚都> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#龚都> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末农民起义军首领，其部活动在汝南（治今河南上蔡西南）一带。建安六年（201）袁绍遣先主将本兵复至汝南，与都等合，众数千人。曹操遣蔡阳来攻，为他所破。后曹操亲自南征，刘备投奔刘表，其部散去。三国志中记载为共都。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#龚都> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "龚都初为黃巾军，与刘辟率军据汝南，甚猖獗。后归顺袁绍，相助攻曹。关羽攻汝南，龚都告其刘备下落。乃诈败，让汝南。待关羽回兵，龚都与刘辟复夺汝南。及关羽千里寻兄古城聚义后，恰好刘辟、龚都差人来请，刘备就率军往汝南驻扎。曹操攻汝南，龚都运粮..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹偃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹偃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹偃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹偃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹偃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹偃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏王公。沛愍王潜之子。青龙元年（233），潜卒，偃嗣爵。四年卒，谥曰怀王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵青龙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵青龙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵青龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "赵青龍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵青龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵青龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾聚众起兵，杀左内史程休，后为郑浑击败斩首。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周忠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "周忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任太尉。敬慕大司农士孙瑞，每三公缺，皆辞拜让瑞。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王方> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "董卓集团部曲。初平三年，随卓余党李傕、郭汜与卓故部曲樊稠、李蒙等合围长安城，杀人无数。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王方> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "校尉。李傕、郭汜反，劫帝把持朝政，表奏方、李蒙等，各为校尉。后马腾、韩遂举义，二将请缨出击。方欺腾子超年幼，跃马迎战。战不到数合，为超一枪刺于马下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘陶[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘陶[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘陶[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季治"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘陶[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘陶[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘晔少子。初为选部郎，后出为平原（今山东平原南）太守，寻被斩。为人善论纵横，好为大言，故致杀身。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成就> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "成就"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成就> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "成就"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成就> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成就> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "桓帝时为凉州刺史。他曾征辟董卓为从事，使领兵骑，讨捕胡人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹纯> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹纯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子和"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹仁的弟弟，从曹操起兵时便跟随他南征北战。曹纯以议郎的身份参议司空军事，统领曹军的精锐骑兵部队虎豹骑，在南皮斩杀了袁谭，在乌桓擒获了单于蹹顿，多次立下功劳。曹纯后来随曹操南征，在长坂追击刘备，赤壁战后回到谯郡，数年后病逝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹仁的弟弟。作为曹仁的部将跟随曹仁一起防守南郡，受派遣，与牛金一起去救援曹洪，成功将吴将甘宁围困在彝陵，直至周瑜亲自前来解围。后来，曹仁全军偷袭周瑜大营，曹纯与曹洪同为合后，中计兵败，接应曹仁弃城而逃。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝臂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "祝臂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝臂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "祝臂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝臂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝臂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末(氵隐)强义军首领，后为曹洪、徐晃所破。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郃阳君> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郃阳君"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郃阳君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郃陽君"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郃阳君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郃阳君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "杜氏，魏明帝太后母。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马干> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马干"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子良"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "（232-311）晋宗室。字子良，司马懿子，司马昭同母弟。魏时封安阳亭侯，迁抚军中郎将，进爵平阳乡侯。晋武帝立国，封平原王。惠帝即位，进左光禄大夫。后为侍中，加太保。怀帝永嘉五年（311）卒，年八十。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周生> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周生"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周生> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "周生"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周生> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周生> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾欲谋害司马懿，为胡昭劝止。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘谌> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘谌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘谌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉諶"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘谌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘谌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘禅第五子，被封为北地王。刘禅向魏将邓艾投降时，刘谌坚决反对，请求守城决以死战，不被听从。刘禅送出玉玺投降的当天，刘谌来到昭烈庙，先杀死妻子和儿女，而后自杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘谌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "刘禅第五子，被封为北地王，三国演义第118回登场。蜀亡时，刘谌与妻子崔夫人诀别，崔夫人自杀，刘谌亲手杀死三个儿子，来到昭烈庙，哭拜后自刎而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#句安> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "句安"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#句安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "句安"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#句安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#句安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为蜀国牙门将，延熙十二年秋，卫将军姜维出攻雍州，不克而还。安、李歆降魏将郭淮、陈泰於翅上。后镇西将军钟会伐蜀，以安等蹑蜀军后。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#句安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏将。初仕蜀，延熙十二年秋八月，卫将军姜维先差安、李歆同引一万五千兵，往麹山前连筑二城：安守东城，歆守西城。魏雍州刺史郭淮命副将陈泰领兵攻之，安、歆各引一军出迎，因兵少不能抵敌，退入城中。泰令兵四面围住攻打，又以兵断其汉中粮道。安、歆..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘繇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘繇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘繇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "正礼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘繇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘繇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉扬州牧、振武将军。齐孝王少子封牟平侯，子孙家焉。繇伯父宠，为汉太尉。兄岱，历位侍中，兖州刺吏。繇年十九，从父韪为贼所劫质，繇篡取以归，由是显名。举孝廉，为郎中，除下邑长。时郡守以贵三国志卷戚讬之，遂弃官去。州辟部济南，济南相中常侍子..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘繇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉室宗亲，太尉刘宠之侄，兖州刺史刘岱之弟。属下有其同乡勇将太史慈，却不能尽其才能。 遭孙策攻击，战败，落荒逃往豫章。刘繇避乱到淮浦县，朝廷任命他为扬州刺史。袁术称帝时，刘繇率军抵抗袁术，后被孙策打败，逃往豫章，不久病死。  "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#步阐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "步阐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#步阐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲思"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#步阐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#步阐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "卫将军、侍中，交州牧。吴丞相骘次子。骘薨，继业为西陵督，加昭武将军，封西亭侯。凤皇元年，召为绕帐督。阐累世在西陵，卒被徵命，自以失职，又惧有谗祸，於是据城降晋。遣侄玑与弟璿诣洛阳为任，晋以阐为都督西陵诸军事、卫将军、仪同三司，加侍中，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#步阐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西陵太守。初为吴将，据西陵城降晋。未逮，为吴将陆抗所陷，阐等被斩，晋将羊祜亦救之无及。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙干> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙干"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫幹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙綝之弟。吴帝孙亮亲政，綝称疾不朝，而以诸弟分屯诸营，控制局势。孙綝废吴帝孙亮后，迎立孙休为帝，綝及其四弟恩、据、干、闿皆任要职，握重兵，出现了“一门五侯”的局面。干自偏将军迁杂号将军，封亭侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "（孙亮）虽然聪明，却被孙綝把持，不能主张，綝令弟威远将军孙据入苍龙宿卫，武卫将军孙恩、偏将军孙干、长水校尉孙闿分屯诸营。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张霸[吴]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张霸[吴]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张霸[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張霸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张霸[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张霸[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄武五年（226），与诸葛瑾等进攻曹魏之襄阳，为魏将司马懿所拒破，被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张尚[西晋]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张尚[西晋]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张尚[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張尚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张尚[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张尚[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张尚[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "晋都督杜预兵出江陵，陆景在船上，望见江南岸上一片火起，巴山上风飘出一面大旗，上书：“晋镇南大将军杜预”。陆景大惊，欲上岸逃命，被晋将张尚马到斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#昌豨> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "昌豨"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#昌豨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "昌豨"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#昌豨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#昌豨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操之东海郡守。豨一名霸，初为泰山寇，臧霸仕陶谦，破黄巾，与豨、孙观、吴敦、尹礼各聚众。后从吕布，及布败死，降太祖，以为东海郡守。建安五年，豨反，郡县多叛太祖为刘备，众数万人，太祖遣刘岱、王忠击之，不克，亲往破之。及袁绍破，豨又反，张..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#昌豨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初，与孙观、吴敦、尹礼为泰山寇。吕布使陈宫、臧霸与之结连，攻山东兖州诸郡。于萧关附近遇曹军，操令许褚迎战，四将一齐出马，许褚奋力死战。四将抵敌不住，各自败走。后来吕布兵败身死，臧霸降，霸又招安孙观、吴敦、尹礼来降，独豨未肯归顺。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁成> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁成"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文开"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁绍养父。曾任左中郎将。贵戚权豪自梁冀以下都与他结好，言无不从。早卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕岱> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕岱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕岱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "定公"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕岱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕岱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴大司马。为郡县吏，避乱南渡。孙权统事，岱诣幕府，出守吴丞。会稽东冶五县贼吕合、秦狼等为乱，权以岱为督军校尉，与将军蒋钦等将兵讨之，遂禽合、狼，五县平定，拜昭信中郎将。建安二十年，督孙茂等十将从取长沙三郡。权留岱镇长沙。安成长吴砀及中..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕岱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "吴主孙权临崩，托后事於岱及太傅诸葛恪。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁夫人> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "丁夫人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "丁夫人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操妻。建安初，废。死后葬许城南。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "丁夫人乃曹操大妻，因为无出被黜。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹节[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹节[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹节[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "汉丰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹节[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹节[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "宦官、尚书令。顺帝初，以西园骑迁小黄门。桓帝时，迁中常侍，奉车都尉。建宁元年，因迎立灵帝有功，封长安乡侯。时窦太后临朝，大将军窦武与太傅陈蕃谋诛杀，事败为节所杀，又鸩杀窦太后。后节把持朝政多年，淫暴无道。光和四年卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹节[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "中常侍。同张让、赵忠、段珪等为“十常侍”，为灵帝所宠。节等专权乱政、卖官索财，朝野皆痛恨之。及灵帝崩，大将军何进欲杀宦官，让、节等阴结何太后，招进入宫，斩杀之。进部将袁绍引兵攻之，尽诛节等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金虎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "金虎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "金虎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "即王金虎，三国时魏官吏王淩子。才武过人。嘉平中，因父罪，被司马懿灭族而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严峻> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "严峻"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "嚴峻"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "宦官。庐江人左慈知补导之术，峻曾从其问受。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阮籍> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阮籍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阮籍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "嗣宗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阮籍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阮籍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "阮瑀之子。博览群书，尤好老、庄，为“竹林七贤”之一，与嵇康齐名。曾为步兵校尉。高贵乡公曹髦在位时，受封关内侯，任散骑侍郎。他蔑视礼教，与当权司马氏有矛盾。性嗜酒，常纵酒佯狂避祸。有《咏怀诗》八十二首，词语隐约，对现实多所讥讽。原有集十..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苌奴> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苌奴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苌奴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "萇奴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苌奴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苌奴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁术部将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈翔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈翔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈翔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲麟"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈翔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈翔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与刘表，范滂等共八人，号曰“八友”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈翔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中介绍江夏八俊时，提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#齐周> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "齐周"@zh .
