<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#齐周> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#齐周> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "幽州刺史从事。刘虞为公孙瓒所诬杀，他与同僚伐公孙瓒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁绍> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "梁绍"@zh .
