<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许攸[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "许攸[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许攸[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "許攸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许攸[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许攸[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "拥部曲，不附曹操，操欲伐之。后操听从杜袭建议，招抚之，攸即归服。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盖勋> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "盖勋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盖勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元固"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盖勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盖勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "盖勋字元固，后汉敦煌广至人也。家世二千石。初举孝廉，为汉阳长史。时，武威太守倚恃权势，恣行贪横，从事武都苏正和案致其罪。凉州刺史梁鹄畏惧贵戚，欲杀正和以免其负，乃访之于勋。勋素与正和有仇，或劝勋可因此报隙。勋曰：“不可。谋事杀良，非忠..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朴胡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朴胡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朴胡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "朴胡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朴胡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朴胡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末巴郡七姓夷王。建安二十年（215），附曹操，被委以巴东太守，封列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华表> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "华表"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华表> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伟容"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华表> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华表> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太中大夫。父歆，魏太尉。表年二十，拜散骑黄门郎，累迁侍中。正元初，石苞来朝，盛称高贵乡公，以为魏武更生。时闻者流汗沾背，表惧祸作，频称疾归下舍，故免于大难。后迁尚书。五等建，封观阳伯。坐供给丧事不整，免。泰始中，拜太子少傅，转光禄勋。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑遂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑遂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑遂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄭遂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑遂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑遂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任城相。献帝初平三年（192），为黄巾农民起义军所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫兹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卫兹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫兹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子许"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫兹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫兹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张邈部将。兹弱冠称盛德，后举孝廉，为车骑将军何苗所辟，司徒杨彪再加旌命，终不应三公之辟。中平六年，董卓作乱，汉室倾荡，曹公到陈留，始与兹相见，遂同盟，计兴武事。兹以家财资公，使起兵，众有五千人。初平元年，陈留太守张邈遣兹分兵随公，到荥..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫兹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "陈留孝廉。演义中名弘，疏财仗义，其家巨富。时董卓作乱，曹公置酒张筵，拜请弘到家，计兴武事。弘感其大义，将家资相助。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐霸> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐霸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐霸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐霸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐霸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐霸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "徐晃之孙，徐盖之子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩琪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩琪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩琪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "韓琪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩琪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩琪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩琪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西凉大将韩德第四子。随父引西羌兵来助夏侯楙,取路至凤鸣山，正遇蜀兵。在阵上见两兄长战赵云不下，纵马抡两口日月刀而来，围住赵云。云在中央独战三将。少时，韩琪中枪落马，韩阵中偏将急出救去。 回营伤重身死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张统> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张统"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张统> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張統"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张统> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张统> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张辽之孙。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伏完> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "伏完"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伏完> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伏完"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伏完> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伏完> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "伏皇后之父。建安十四年，曹操废后伏寿及两个皇子杀伏完、伏德等伏氏宗亲百余人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伏完> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "伏皇后之父。因许田射鹿之事见曹操专横，曾向献帝举荐车骑将军国舅董承讨贼。后來，伏完接到伏皇后讨伐曹操的密书。于是作求密诏的回书，不幸被曹操发现，满门遭抄斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦始皇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "秦始皇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦始皇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "秦始皇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦始皇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦始皇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "因生于赵都邯郸（今属河北）。政治家、战略家、军事统帅。首位完成中国统一的秦朝的开国皇帝，秦庄襄王之子，十三岁即王位，三十九岁称皇帝，在位共三十七年。秦始皇建立皇帝制度，中央实施三公九卿，地方废除分封制，代以郡县制，为建立专制主义中央集..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦始皇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "秦朝时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王氏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏将领郭淮妻，王淩妹。淩后谋废曹芳，事泄，服毒死。王氏连坐。淮以书致司马懿，懿宥之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁原> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "丁原"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "建阳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "本出自寒家，为人粗略，有武勇，善骑射。为南县吏，受使不辞难，有警急，追寇虏，辄在其前。裁知书，少有吏用。迁并州刺史，任为骑都尉，屯河内，以吕布为主簿，大见亲待。灵帝崩，原将兵诣洛阳。与何进谋诛诸黄门，拜执金吾。进败，董卓入京都，将为乱..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "荆州刺史、吕布义父。董卓入京都，欲废少帝，原怒之，愤而离席。次日，原引军城外搦战，大胜之。后卓遣虎贲中郎将李肃说原义子吕布杀原，割首献卓。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王考> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王考"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王考> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文祖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王考> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王考> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末大臣，家世冠族。王考少时清直有学行，为人轻财仗义，性格刚烈，疾恶如仇，甚有威惠，为中官所忌，官至冀州刺史。后遭受党锢之祸，名列“八厨”。党锢事起，王考被收执狱中，后被赦归田里，禁锢长达十九年。三国志中未有记载，出自后汉书。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文俶> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "文俶"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文俶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "次骞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文俶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文俶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴将领文钦中子，小名阿鸯，也称文鸯，演义中作“文淑”。勇力绝人。毌丘俭和文钦在寿春起兵讨伐司马师。文俶随父文钦袭击乐嘉，发现司马师大军，提议父亲兵分两路连夜进军。文俶先到，大声鼓噪，吓得司马师眼睛都突了出来。但是文钦未能呼应，文俶只好..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文俶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中作“文淑”，文钦中子，小名阿鸯，也称文鸯。文钦协同毌丘俭举兵在寿春反叛，讨伐司马师。文鸯与父文钦请命保守乐嘉城，协议与文钦兵分两路，夜晚袭击司马师的城西军营，文鸯在司马师的大寨里往来冲杀，吓得司马师眼珠迸出，直杀到天明，寻不见父..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈纪[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈纪[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈纪[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈纪[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈纪[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉末名士陈寔之子。名重于世，遭党锢之祸，发愤著书数万言，号曰《陈子》。后历位平原相、侍中、大鸿胪。年七十一，卒于官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹腾> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹腾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹腾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季兴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹腾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹腾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "宦官。安帝时，授黄门从官。顺帝即位，为小黄门，迁中常侍。质帝被杀后，与长乐太仆州辅等七人，以定策功，皆封亭侯，腾为费亭侯，迁大长秋，加位特进。用事省闼三十余年，奉事四帝，对海内名人，有所进达。魏明帝太和三年（229），追尊为高皇帝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹腾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "中常侍。收曹操之父曹嵩为养子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘宪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘宪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉憲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "东汉时期人，演义中曾提到此人广陵侯刘哀之子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨锋> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨锋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨锋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊鋒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨锋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨锋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨锋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "南蛮洞后迤西银冶洞二十一洞的洞主，与孟获相邻。率领本洞三万人马增援与蜀汉军作战的孟获。可是，在欢迎援军的宴会中设计擒住孟获，并将他交给了诸葛亮。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李肃[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李肃[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李肃[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李肅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李肃[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李肃[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉骑都尉。永汉三年四月，司徒王允、尚书仆射士孙瑞、卓将吕布共谋诛卓。是时，天子有疾新愈，大会未央殿。布使同郡骑都尉肃等，将亲兵十馀人，伪著卫士服守掖门。布怀诏书。卓至，肃等格卓。卓惊呼布所在。布曰“有诏”，遂杀卓，夷三族。后卓女婿中郎..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李肃[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初为董卓帐下虎贲中郎将，因与吕布同郡，及卓欲收布，肃自荐往说降之。及诸侯伐卓，肃同华雄共守汜水关，献策败孙坚部。后司徒王允、布共谋诛卓，时肃因久不升迁，甚是怀怨。与布公谋杀卓。后卓余党反，布以肃为先锋，击卓婿牛辅，兵败，为布所诛。"@zh .
