<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许贡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "欲送密信给曹操，要曹操注意孙策，却被孙策发现而被杀。后来他的三名食客袭击了孙策，使孙策受了重伤。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙恭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙恭"@zh .
