<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邹丹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "公孙瓒之渔阳太守。公孙瓒灭幽州牧刘虞，虞旧部鲜于辅等推阎柔为乌丸司马。兴平二年，柔与丹战於潞北，斩丹等四千余级。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘永> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘永"@zh .
