<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨柏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨柏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨柏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "张鲁麾下大将，杨松之弟。监视以张鲁属下身份出征的马超。在马超归顺刘备时，被马超杀死，以证明其归顺之意。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张梁[起义军]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张梁[起义军]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张梁[起义军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張梁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张梁[起义军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张梁[起义军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末农民起义首领。张角、张宝的弟弟，熹平年间，张角创太平道，梁与角同在河北一带传教，秘密进行组织工作。中平元年（184）黄巾起义时，号称“人公将军”，协同张角击败卢植、董卓进攻。角病死，东汉政府增调左中郎将皇甫嵩往攻，梁坚守广宗，英..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张梁[起义军]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "张梁，张角、张宝的弟弟，同兄弟一起发动黄巾起义，在曲阳被皇甫嵩和曹操围攻，连败七阵，被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王经母> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王经母"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王经母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王經母"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王经母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王经母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏国尚书王经之母，在曹髦起兵诛伐司马昭的事件中，王经因维护曹髦，被司马昭收王经及其家属付廷尉。经谢其母，母颜色不变，笑而应曰：“人谁不死，正恐不得其所”以此并命，何恨之有！”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王经母> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏国尚书王经之母，在曹髦起兵诛伐司马昭的事件中，王经因维护曹髦，被司马昭收王经全家下狱。王经正在廷尉厅下，忽见缚其母至，经叩头大哭曰：“不孝子累及慈母矣！”母大笑曰：“人谁不死？正恐不得死所耳！以此弃命，何恨之有！”次日，王经全家皆押..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔桂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孔桂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔桂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔林"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔桂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔桂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "因善于逢迎谄媚，为曹操所喜，拜骑都尉，出入随从。后亲附临菑侯曹植。魏文帝黄初元年（220）转拜驸马都尉。因私受西域货赂事发被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈纪[袁术]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈纪[袁术]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈纪[袁术]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳紀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈纪[袁术]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈纪[袁术]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "九江太守。初，术初许孙策为九江太守，已而更用纪。后术欲攻徐州，从庐江太守陆康求米三万斛不成，因策与之有怨。术遣策攻康，谓曰：“前错用陈纪，每恨本意不遂。今若得康，庐江真卿有也。”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈纪[袁术]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁术上将。术称帝，七路大军征徐州，纪为第三路居右。纪引一军取沂都，吕布使陈宫引军敌之。袁术兵败，奔回淮南。曹操会合吕布、刘备、孙策四面攻术，术留陈纪、李丰、乐就、梁刚四人分兵十万，坚守寿春。及城破，陈纪、李丰、乐就、梁刚都被生擒，操令..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄道> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "甄道"@zh .
