<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#勾践> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "勾践（又写作句践；在出土文物“越王勾践剑”里写为鸠浅；司马贞《史记索隐》引《纪年》作菼执），是中国春秋时代后期的越国君主。有关他的先世，有说“其先禹之苗裔”，亦有说“先世无所考”，也有说他是“祝融之后”并且是楚国的芈姓，众说纷纭。父亲..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#勾践> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "春秋时代后期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙谦[孙和子]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙谦[孙和子]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙谦[孙和子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫謙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙谦[孙和子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙谦[孙和子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙皓之弟。封永安侯。后被永安义军施但等劫持，欲至建业立为帝，沿途以谦命招降将士，为丁固、诸葛靓击溃。孙谦被俘，为孙皓毒杀，并及其母。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹氏[吕布妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹氏[吕布妻]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹氏[吕布妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹氏[吕布妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹氏[吕布妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹氏[吕布妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "原来吕布有二妻一妾,先娶严氏为正妻，后娶貂蝉为妾；居小沛时，又娶曹豹之女为次妻。曹氏先亡无出，貂蝉亦无所出，惟严氏生一女，布最钟爱。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯尚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯尚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯仁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "夏侯渊从子，与曹丕亲近友好，曹操时期历任军司马、五官将文学、黄门侍郎，曾随曹彰远征乌桓，得胜归来。魏文帝继位后，夏侯尚升为征南将军，领荆州刺史，假节都督南方诸军事，攻击蜀国上庸，平定三郡九县，升为征南大将军；又在江陵击败吴将诸葛瑾，升..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "夏侯尚，夏侯惇之侄，随曹洪出兵汉中，同韩浩一起被派往支援张郃，为蜀将黄忠所败，改投定军山夏侯渊军，在交战中被黄忠生擒，后被夏侯渊用俘虏的蜀将陈式换回。徐晃解救樊城之围后，夏侯尚同徐晃镇守襄阳，又随徐晃攻取上庸。后来夏侯尚又参与三路伐吴..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩融> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩融"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元长"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "中平五年，融与荀爽、陈纪等十四人并博士征，不至。明年，董卓废立，融等复俱公车征。初平元年六月，融为大鸿胪，卓遣其与少府阴脩、执金吾胡母班、将作大匠吴修、越骑校尉王瑰安集关东，后将军袁术、河内太守王匡各执而杀之，唯融以名德获免。后李傕、..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "李傕、郭汜劫百官。融哭拜天子，愿舍命去说二贼罢兵。二贼后从其言，放百官及宫人归。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜义> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜义"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "杜義"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建兴中，官至参军、裨将军，曾与众臣议免中都护李平官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀国裨将军。随诸葛亮伐魏。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙恭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "公孙恭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公孫恭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏辽东太守、公孙度次子，公孙康之弟。度死，子康嗣位，以永宁乡侯封弟恭。后康死，子晃、渊等皆小，众立恭为辽东太守。文帝践阼，遣使即拜恭为车骑将军、假节，封平郭侯。初，恭病阴消为阉人，劣弱不能治国。太和二年，渊胁夺恭位。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "辽东太守公孙度之子，公孙康之弟。曾劝公孙康杀掉袁熙、袁尚结好曹操。继承公孙康的爵位，为车骑将军。但后来由于患病成为阉人，其兄长子渊因而夺取其位。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟绅> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "钟绅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟绅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鍾紳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟绅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟绅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟绅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操部将。与兄缙属夏侯惇。长坂坡之战，绅、缙二人拦住刘备将赵云厮杀。缙为云刺死，绅持戟赶来，马尾相衔，那枝戟只在云后心内弄影。云急拨转马头，恰好两胸相拍。云左手持枪隔过画戟，右手拔出青釭宝剑砍去，带盔连脑，砍去一半，绅落马而死，余众奔散。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王政> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王政"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王政> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王政"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王政> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王政> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "叛将张纯部下。后杀纯，送首诣幽州牧刘虞，被封为列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张怿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张怿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张怿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張懌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张怿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张怿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "长沙太守张羡之子。羡病死，众复立为怿为太守，后其地为刘表所攻并。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高定> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高定"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "高定"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "越嶲夷王。后主建兴元年（223）夏叛乱，遣军围新道县，被蜀将李严击走。后为诸葛亮平息。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "越隽太守。与雍闿一起发动叛乱，可是，中了诸葛亮的离间计，投降蜀国。因为斩杀雍闿、朱褒有功，被任命为益州太守，总摄三郡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐勋> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐勋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐勳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任从事中郎。曾受命遣曹操迎立汉献帝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "时冀州方有北鄙之警，匪遑离局，故使从事中郎徐勋，就发遣操，使缮修郊庙，翊卫幼主。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜袭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜袭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜袭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子绪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜袭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜袭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾祖父安，祖父根，著名前世。袭避乱荆州，刘表待以宾礼。同郡繁钦数见奇於表，袭遂南適长沙。建安初，太祖迎天子都许。袭逃还乡里，太祖以为西鄂长。县滨南境，寇贼纵横。袭身执矢石，率与戮力。临陈斩数百级，而袭众死者三十馀人，其馀十八人尽被创，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜袭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "征西将军夏侯渊部将。定军山之战，袭败逃。张郃与袭引败兵到汉水扎营，接应曹操。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶濬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陶濬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶濬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陶濬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶濬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶濬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陶璜之弟。初为徐陵督，合浦太守修允部曲督郭马反，帝皓遣徐陵督濬将七千人从西道，命交州牧兄璜部伍所领及合浦、郁林诸郡兵，当与东西军共击马。天纪元年冬，晋向江陵，龙骧将军王浚，广武将军唐彬浮江东下，太尉贾充为大都督，量宜处要，尽军势之中。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶濬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "天纪元年，晋攻吴，濬以水军迎之。然一夜之间，二万兵士皆散，故军不战而败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成济> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "成济"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "成濟"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "甘露中为太子舍人，党于司马昭。甘露五年（260），曹髦率殿中宿卫苍头官僮讨司马昭。他与兄骑督成倅从中护军贾充迎战。贾充命其与成倅杀曹髦。事后，司马昭诿罪于其兄弟，杀之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "贾充心腹,在贾充的指使下杀死曹髦,反被司马昭杀."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙晃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "公孙晃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公孫晃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "地方割据首领公孙康子，公孙渊兄。因公孙渊叛，为魏所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙晃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "襄平侯公孙康之长子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔钧> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "崔钧"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔钧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔钧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔钧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "崔烈之子。灵帝时为虎贲中郎将，对其父以钱买官当面评议有“铜臭”。后为西河太守。献帝初，与袁绍俱起兵山东，反抗董卓。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高沛> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高沛"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高沛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "高沛"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高沛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高沛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "白水军督。庞统为刘备计曰：“杨怀、高沛，璋之名将，各仗强兵，据守关头，闻数有笺谏璋，使发遣将军还荆州。将军未至，遣与相闻，说荆州有急，欲还救之，并使装束，外作归形；此二子既服将军英名，又喜将军之去，计必乘轻骑来见，将军因此执之，进取其..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高沛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "同杨怀共守涪水关。二将谋刺刘备，然为庞统所觉，定计斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾范> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "贾范"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "賈範"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "公孙渊部将。景初二年，渊将反，将军范、纶直等苦谏，渊皆杀之。后渊败死，司马懿封范等之墓，显其遗嗣。（资料取自晋书，三国志未记载此人）"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#贾范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "渊将反，范谏曰：“中原待主公以上公之爵，不为卑贱；今若背反，实为不顺。更兼司马懿善能用兵，西蜀诸葛武侯且不能取胜，何况主公乎？”渊大怒，叱武士绑范斩于市。后渊败死，司马懿封其墓而荣其子孙。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔勇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "崔勇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔勇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "崔勇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔勇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔勇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔勇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "郭汜部将。李傕、郭汜劫驾，杨奉率军来救。崔勇出马，大骂杨奉“反贼”。奉大怒，命徐晃出战。晃手执大斧，飞骤骅骝，直取崔勇。两马相交，只一合，斩崔勇于马下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁睦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲁睦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁睦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "魯睦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁睦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁睦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "鲁肃之孙。父昭武将军、武昌督鲁淑卒后，袭爵，领兵马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅巽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "傅巽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅巽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公悌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅巽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅巽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "瑰伟博达，有知人之鉴。初辟于公府，拜尚书郎，后作客于荆州。建安十三年，曹操军到襄阳，傅巽时任东曹掾，与蒯越、韩嵩等游说刘琮归降曹操。刘琮举州往降，以傅巽说降刘琮有功，赐爵关内侯。文帝时为侍中尚书，太和年中逝世。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅巽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "乃荆州牧刘表幕官。建安十三年，曹操军到襄阳，傅巽时任东曹掾，与蒯越、王粲等游说刘琮归降曹操。刘琮举州往降，以傅巽说降刘琮有功，赐爵关内侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓阶> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "桓阶"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓阶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯绪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓阶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓阶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初任长沙郡功曹，太守孙坚举为孝廉，除尚书郎。坚战死，冒难诣表乞坚丧，表义而与之。后阶为荆州从事祭酒，侍张羡。阶与太守张羡暗结曹操，及操定荆州，遂以桓为丞相掾主簿，升赵郡太守。魏国初建，授虎贲中郎将侍中。数陈词议立曹丕为王储。文帝践祚，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓阶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙坚军吏。坚为刘表攻杀，其尸在彼。阶因与表有旧，自往以黄祖换坚尸。事毕，为表送回。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严畯> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "严畯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严畯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曼才"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严畯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严畯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少耽学，善《诗》、《书》、《三礼》，又好《说文》。避乱江东，与诸葛瑾、步骘齐名友善。性情忠厚，待人以诚。张昭进之于孙权，权以为骑都尉、从事中郎。横江将军鲁肃卒，权欲以畯代之，畯前后固辞，乃听焉。权为吴王，及称尊号，畯尝为卫尉，使至蜀，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严畯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙权麾下之臣。与出任同盟使者来访的诸葛亮舌战，反而自取其辱。孙权即帝位后，被任命为卫尉，后来作了尚书令。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁虔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "梁虔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁虔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "梁虔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁虔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁虔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "大长秋。兄绪，蜀大鸿胪。虔初为魏天水主记，后随姜维降蜀。官至大长秋。先蜀亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁虔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "上邽令。兄绪，蜀天水太守。虔初为魏天水主记，守羌胡城，中蜀相亮之计，误以姜维投降，大骂之。后为兄绪招降，投蜀。亮封之为上邽令。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜祺> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜祺"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜祺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "杜祺"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜祺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜祺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时蜀官吏。南阳（治今河南南阳）人。刘备据益州，所置司盐校尉王连拔擢祺等为典曹都尉。后祺历郡守、监军及大将军司马，为时人所称。建兴中，官至参军、武略中郎将，曾与众臣议免中都护李平官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜祺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀国武略中郎将，随诸葛亮伐魏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全绪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "全绪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "全緒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "全琮长子，年幼知名，奉朝廷诏请，出授以军兵，稍后迁扬武将军、牛渚督。孙亮即位时，迁镇北将军。东关之役，全绪与丁奉建议引兵先出，以破魏军，封一子亭侯，四十四岁逝世（《吴书》）。其子全祎、全仪留建业。至太平二年十一月，二人携母降魏，皆历郡..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹奉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "尹奉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "次曾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为历城统兵校尉，马超叛，杀凉州刺史韦康，奉与梁宽、赵衢、姜隐、赵昂、姚琼、孔信、李俊、王灵等结谋，借以为康报仇，举兵讨超。超血洗历城，杀奉全家。夏侯渊领大军至，超遂弃城，投张鲁。文帝践祚，敦煌太守马艾卒，黄华、张进等反，文帝迁奉为敦..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "马超战冀城后，灭刺史韦康家。参军杨阜借故逃出，与抚彝将军姜叙、赵昂、奉等商议。马超血洗历城，奉、赵昂全家皆被杀，夏侯渊领大军至，马超遂弃城，投张鲁。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田景> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "田景"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "田景"@zh .
