<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任主簿。献帝初平三年（192），司徒王允与吕布杀董卓，景亦死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶应> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陶应"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶应> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陶應"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶应> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
