<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆骏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陆逊之父。淳懿信厚，为邦族所怀。官至九江都尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹楷> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "尹楷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹楷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "尹楷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹楷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹楷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安九年，曹公进军到洹水。楷屯毛城，通上党粮道。夏四月，留曹洪攻鄴，公自将击楷，破之而还。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹楷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹军运粮入白沟，将攻冀州。尚发檄使楷屯毛城，通上党运粮道。曹公令曹洪先进兵攻邺，公自引一军来攻尹楷。兵临本境，楷引军来迎。楷出马，许褚纵马直取楷。楷措手不及，为褚一刀斩于马下，余众奔溃。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马日磾> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马日磾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马日磾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "翁叔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马日磾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马日磾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉太傅，马融族孙。传融业，以才学进。与杨彪、卢植、蔡邕等典校中书，历位九卿，遂登台辅。为太尉，司徒王允欲杀蔡邕，因劝之，未果。秋七月庚子，迁日磾为太傅，录尚书事。八月，遣日磾及太仆赵岐，持节尉抚天下。卒于寿春。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马日磾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "东汉太傅。奉丞相董卓之命，为交战的袁绍和公孫瓒调停。卓死后，蔡邕被认为与董卓同党，因而被下狱待斩，他欲救邕向王允求情，遭拒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋斌> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蒋斌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋斌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蔣斌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋斌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋斌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀绥武将军、汉城护军。父琬，大将军、大司马。魏镇西将军钟会至汉城，与斌书曰：“巴蜀贤智文武之士多矣，至于足下、诸葛思远，譬诸草木，吾气类也。桑梓之敬，古今所敦。西到，欲奉瞻尊大君公侯墓，当洒扫坟茔，奉祠致敬。愿告其所在!”斌答书曰：“..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋斌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀将。大将军姜维令斌、王含同领左军，二将谨慎，因立寨未定，恐魏兵来劫寨，不敢解甲而寝。后魏将邓艾遣副将郑伦，引五百掘子军，於当夜二更，径从地道直至左营，於帐后地下拥出。是夜中军大乱，二将急绰兵器上的马时，寨外邓忠引兵杀到。内外夹攻，王..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀霬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀霬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀霬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "荀霬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀霬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀霬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "荀彧孙，荀恽子。以魏文帝外甥故得宠。官至中领军。死后谥贞侯，追赠骠骑将军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵月> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵月"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵月> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "赵月"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵月> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵月> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "凉州从事赵昂之子，马超欲用赵昂，以赵月为质。后昂反，超杀月。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵月> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "马超裨将，抚彝将军姜叙账下统兵校尉赵昂之子。杨阜诈降马超后请假，至历城与姜叙，赵昂，尹奉密谋杀超，因赵月担心儿子安危，妻王氏骂曰：“雪君父之大耻，虽丧身亦不惜，何况一子乎！君若顾子而不行，吾当先死矣！\"赵昂乃决。马超闻姜叙、杨阜会合尹..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田氏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "田氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "田氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁暐的《献帝春秋》上说：“曹操包围濮阳，濮阳的大姓田氏是细作，曹操得以进入濮阳。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#田氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "在吕布与曹操争夺兖州的战役中，先为吕布所用，引诱曹操入城中伏，导致曹操险些被捉。后来背叛吕布，献濮阳与曹操，得到曹操宽恕。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑伦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑伦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑伦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄭倫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑伦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑伦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑伦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "邓艾副将。姜维伐魏，邓艾先度了地脉，故留蜀兵下寨之地；地中自祁山寨直至蜀寨，早挖了地道，待蜀兵至时，于中取事。此时姜维至谷口分作三寨，地道正在左寨之中，乃王含、蒋斌下寨之处。邓艾唤子邓忠，与师纂各引一万兵，为左右冲击；却唤副将郑伦，引..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁遗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁遗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁遗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯业"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁遗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁遗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁绍堂兄。为长安令。绍后用遗为扬州刺史，为袁术所败。败军之际为士卒做杀。昔河间张超尝荐遗于太尉朱鉨，称遗“有冠世之懿，干时之量。其忠允亮直，固天所纵；若乃包罗载籍，管综百氏，登高能赋，鷪物知名，求之今日，邈焉靡俦。”事在超集。太祖称“..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁遗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉山阳太守。参加反董卓同盟第八镇诸侯。虎牢关之役时从军，营救了败给吕布军的王匡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许劭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "许劭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许劭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子将"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许劭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许劭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘繇幕僚。少峻名节，好人伦，多所赏识。若樊子昭、和阳士者，并显名于世。故天下言拔士者，咸称许、郭。初为郡功曹，太守徐璆甚敬之。陈蕃丧妻还葬，乡人毕至，而邵独不往。曹操微时，常卑辞厚礼，求为己目。劭鄙其人而不肯对，操乃伺隙胁劭，劭不得已..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许劭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "有知人之名。曹操往见之，问曰：“我何如人？”劭不答。又问，劭曰：“子治世之能臣，乱世之奸雄也。”操闻言大喜。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹冲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹冲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹冲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仓舒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹冲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹冲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操之子，环夫人所生。曹冲从小聪明仁爱，与众不同，深受曹操喜爱。曹操几次对群臣夸耀他，有让他继嗣的意思。不过曹冲还未成年就病逝，年仅十三岁。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀勖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀勖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀勖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公曾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀勖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀勖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "目录学家。魏末，参司马昭军事。晋武帝立国，连任中书监、侍中、尚书令，优宠有加。曾与贾充等制定晋律。又领秘书监，与张华整理典籍，著《中经新簿》，开创图书四部分类法，将群书分成甲乙丙丁四类，即经子史集四部。司马炎欲废太子衷夫妇，他极力谏止..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀勖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏臣，参司马昭军事，劝司马昭不要用刺客刺杀姜维，趁蜀国君臣不和，起兵灭蜀，司马昭从其言。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩嵩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩嵩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩嵩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "德高"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩嵩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩嵩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少时好学，虽贫而不改易其操守。韩嵩知世将乱，故不应三公之命，只与同好数人隐居于郦西山中。黄巾乱起，韩嵩避难南方，刘表逼其以为别驾，转从事中郎。刘表郊祀天地，韩嵩正谏不从，渐见违忤。后又奉使到许都见曹操，以观虚实。韩嵩回来后，深陈曹操威..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩嵩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "刘表手下从事中郎将。袁绍与曹操均派使至刘表处，韩嵩进谏归附曹操。刘表便命其到许都，以观虚实。韩嵩在出发前先表明，若天子赐其官职，则自己不再为刘表所用。后果如所言，天子拜韩嵩为侍中，迁零陵太守。回来后不断称道朝廷、曹操之德。刘表却以为其..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毌丘俭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "毌丘俭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毌丘俭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲恭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毌丘俭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毌丘俭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "镇南将军、杨州刺史。俭袭父兴爵，为平原侯文学。明帝即位，为尚书郎，迁羽林监。以东宫之旧，甚见亲待。出为洛阳典农。迁荆州刺史。青龙中，帝图讨辽东，以俭有幹策，徙为幽州刺史，加度辽将军，使持节，护乌丸校尉。公孙渊逆与俭战，不利，引还。明年..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毌丘俭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "扬州都督、镇东将军。魏闻孙权崩，起兵伐吴，与吴太傅诸葛恪战。俭引兵十万攻武昌，大破之，吴兵大败而归。正元二年正月，毌丘俭闻司马师擅行废立之事，心中大怒，与文钦起兵反。大将军司马师亲讨之，俭大败，前至慎县城下，县令宋白开门接入，设席待之..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑度> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郑度"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄭度"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "仕刘璋官至州从事。刘备攻陷雒城。刘璋聚众官商议。郑度说璋曰：“左将军县军袭我，兵不满万，士众未附，野谷是资，军无辎重。其计莫若尽驱巴西、梓潼民内涪水以西，其仓廪野谷，一皆烧除，高垒深沟，静以待之。彼至，请战，勿许，久无所资，不过百日，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郑度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "刘备攻打雒城，刘循逃回见父，说雒城已陷，刘璋慌聚众官商议。从事郑度献策曰：“今刘备虽攻城夺地，然兵不甚多，士众未附，野谷是资，军无辎重。不如尽驱巴西、梓潼民过涪水以西，其仓廪野谷尽皆烧除，深沟高垒，静以待之。彼至请战，勿许，久无所资，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘濬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "潘濬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘濬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "承明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘濬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘濬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "弱冠从宋仲子受学，年未三十，荆州牧刘表辟为部江夏从事。时沙羡长赃秽不脩，濬按杀之，一郡震竦。后为湘乡令，治甚有名。刘备领荆州，以濬为治中从事。备入蜀，留典州事。孙权杀关羽，并荆土，拜濬辅军中郎将，授以兵。迁奋威将军，封常迁亭侯。权称尊..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘濬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "濬初在蜀，为治中，随前将军关羽守荆州，羽攻樊城，留濬总督荆州。随军司马王甫言濬平生多忌而好利，不可任用，羽不从。后吴将吕蒙夜袭荆州，濬降。吴主孙权慰劳毕，仍命濬为治中，掌荆州事。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓贤[刘璋]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邓贤[刘璋]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓贤[刘璋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄧賢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓贤[刘璋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓贤[刘璋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "益州牧刘璋部将。建安十六年，刘备取益州，璋遣贤、冷苞、刘璝、张任等拒先主於涪，皆破败，退保绵竹。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓贤[刘璋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "贤为蜀中名将。刘璋欲引刘备入川，邓贤等一班文武官皆以为不可，璋不从。后刘备军师庞统命魏延于宴中舞剑，欲取刘璋性命，邓贤、冷苞、张任等知其意，与之共舞。建安十六年，刘备取益州，刘璋遣邓贤、冷苞、张任、刘璝等点五万大军，往守雒县，以拒刘备..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩起> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩起"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩起> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "韓起"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩起> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩起> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "公孙渊部将。魏明帝时，渊遣使通孙权，往来赂遗。渊恐吴远不可恃，且又贪其货物，遂遣起等率军至沓津，劫吴使，攻杀吴互市者数百人，得其印绶与货物。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈珪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈珪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈珪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "汉瑜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈珪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈珪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吕布之沛相。从父球，汉光禄大夫。珪与袁术俱公族子孙，少共交游。术图篡逆，以书招珪，珪中子应时在下邳，术并胁质应，图必致珪，珪书斥之。及吕布袭徐州，术欲结布为援，乃为子索布女，布许之。术遣使韩胤以僭号议告布，并求迎妇。珪恐术、布成婚，则..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈珪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "素怀忧国之志，吕布袭徐州，与子登侍布。因见布暴虐，使子登诣曹公，公增珪秩中二千石。后为曹公内应，布出城，珪、麋竺献城於曹公。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟光> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孟光"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝裕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝迁都长安，遂逃入蜀，刘焉父子待以客礼。博物识古，无书不览，尤锐意三史，长於汉家旧典。好公羊春秋而讥呵左氏，每与来敏争此二义。先主定益州，拜为议郎，与许慈等并掌制度。后主践阼，为符节令、屯骑校尉、长乐少府，迁大司农。延熙九年秋，大赦..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟光> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初为谏议郎，先主践祚，军师诸葛亮令光、博士许慈掌礼，筑坛于成都武担之南。后丞相亮北伐，留光、来敏为祭酒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛靓> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "诸葛靓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛靓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲思"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛靓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛靓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏大将军诸葛诞之子。魏高贵乡公甘露二年（257），诞叛魏归吴，受父命为质于吴。诞兵败被杀，遂仕吴为大司马。吴亡，隐居不出，晋武帝与之有旧，诏以为侍中，固辞不拜，归乡里。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛靓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "赴东吴作人质，因父亲战死，遂为东吴效力，成为东吴右将军，迎击晋国的进攻，但后来战败。其子诸葛恢在晋国为官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛珝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "薛珝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛珝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "薛珝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛珝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛珝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任吴匠作大将，受命建造清厅的内殿正殿。孙休时，以五官中郎将至蜀求马。及还，休问蜀政得失，珝言蜀祸之将及、国之将亡。不久，蜀果然为魏所灭。269年，同虞汜、陶璜一起率军攻入交趾。归途中病逝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛珝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "在株杀孙綝后蜀汉前来贺喜后，作为使者回访蜀汉。返回后向吴帝孙休报告，蜀汉宦官黄皓专权，国势衰微。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何真> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "何真"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何真> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "何真"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何真> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何真> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "大将军何进之父。他死后，女儿入掖庭，有宠，光和中被灵帝立为皇后，他被追封为车骑将军、舞阳宣德侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴敦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴敦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴敦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吴敦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴敦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴敦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "利城太守。黄巾起，臧霸仕陶谦，收兵于徐州，敦、与尹礼、孙观等并聚众，以霸为帅，屯于开阳。太祖之讨吕布也，敦等将兵助布。太祖募索得霸，见而悦之，使霸招敦、尹礼、孙观、观兄康等，皆诣太祖。以敦为利城太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴敦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初为泰山寇，吕布与太祖战，先使陈宫、臧霸、结连敦、尹礼、孙观、昌豨，东取山东兖州诸郡，后为太祖所败。及布亡，霸降。太祖使霸招安敦等，并加其官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶升> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陶升"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶升> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陶升"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶升> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶升> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为县小吏。初平四年（193），魏郡兵反，升与焉，自号“平汉将军”。时袁绍出师在外，家眷在邺城，升保护绍家及诸衣冠在州内者，送至斥丘。绍自河北还，以升为建义中郎将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋义渠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蒋义渠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋义渠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蔣義渠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋义渠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋义渠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国演义中的虚构人物。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋义渠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁紹麾下之將。在黎陽郡迎接在官渡大敗給曹操的袁紹，並且召集散兵，將袁紹平安送回冀州。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐商> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐商"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐商> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐商"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐商> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐商> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "关羽围樊，太祖遣将军商、吕建等诣徐晃，令曰：“须兵马集至，乃俱前。”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐商> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "徐晃副将，关羽围樊城，晃差商及吕建假着晃旗号，前赴偃城与关平交战。晃却自引精兵五百，循沔水去袭偃城之后。两阵对圆，平出马，与商交锋，只三合，商大败而走。平乘胜追杀二十余里，忽报城中火起。平知中计，急勒兵回救偃城。后平劫寨，商等引伏兵出..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛评> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "辛评"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛评> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲治"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛评> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛评> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "辛评、郭图与审配、逢纪争权，配、纪与尚比，评、图与谭比。众以谭长，欲立之。配等恐谭立而评等为己害，缘绍素意，乃奉尚代绍位。后谭败走，皆呼评弟毗、郭图家得出，而评家独被收。及配兄子开城门内兵，时配在城东南角楼上，望见太祖兵入，忿辛、郭坏..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛评> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "韩馥麾下大臣。韩馥逃亡后，为袁氏效力，担任袁谭的参谋，表现活跃。出任使者去面见曹操时，被劝说留下，但他坚辞未从。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙昭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙昭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫昭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "平南将军孙辅之子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵范> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵范"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "趙範"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾任桂阳太守。刘备平江南，范降。以赵云为偏将军，领桂阳太守，代范。范寡嫂曰樊氏，有国色，范欲以配云。云辞曰：“相与同姓，卿兄犹我兄。”固辞不许。时有人劝云纳之，云曰：“范迫降耳，心未可测；天下女不少。”遂不取。后范逃走。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵范> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "先主平江南，以赵云攻桂阳。部将陈应、鲍隆欲战，范不许。范寡嫂曰樊氏，有国色，范欲以配云。云不许，范有相害之意，云打倒范而走。后应、隆阴欲杀云，云觉，斩之。云赚开城门，擒范。后诸葛亮释之，命之仍为桂阳太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎圃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阎圃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎圃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "閻圃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎圃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎圃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张鲁功曹。群下欲尊鲁为汉宁王。圃谏鲁曰：“汉川之民，户出十万，财富土沃，四面险固；上匡天子，则为桓、文，次及窦融，不失富贵。今承制署置，势足斩断，不烦于王。原且不称，勿为祸先。”鲁闻阳平已陷，将稽颡，圃又曰：“今以迫往，功必轻；不如依..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎圃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "张鲁谋。士担任鲁的参谋，提出各种建议。张鲁听信杨松的谗言欲斩庞德时，他出面阻止。张鲁投降曹操后，被封为列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#温峤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "温峤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#温峤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "泰真"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#温峤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#温峤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "性聪敏，有识量，博学能属文，少以孝悌称于邦族。西晋末官至上党太守、加建威将军，督护前锋军事。刘琨讨石勒、刘聪，峤为琨谋主。司马睿初镇江左，琨命峤南下劝进，被留用。除散骑侍郎，历骠骑王导长史，迁太子中庶子。明帝时，拜侍中，转中书令，参与..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨凤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨凤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨凤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊鳳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨凤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨凤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末农民起义首领。凤与雷公、白波等起兵，灵帝不能讨，乃遣使拜凤为黑山校尉，得举孝廉计吏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘邦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘邦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘邦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘邦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘邦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西汉开国皇帝。字季（一说原名季），沛郡丰邑中阳里（今江苏丰县）人。出身平民阶级，秦朝时曾担任泗水亭长，起兵于沛（今江苏沛县），称沛公。秦亡后被封为汉王。后于楚汉战争中打败西楚霸王项羽，成为汉朝（西汉）开国皇帝，庙号为高祖，汉景帝时改为..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘邦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉开国皇帝，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱芳> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱芳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱芳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "朱芳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱芳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱芳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱芳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "雍州刺史王经的部将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#隗嚣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "隗嚣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#隗嚣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季孟"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#隗嚣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#隗嚣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少仕州郡，后为王莽国师刘歆引誉为士。歆死，归乡里，起兵应汉，据有天水、武都、金城等地。一度依附刘玄，任为御史大夫。光武即位，因谋劫刘玄归光武，事泄，亡归天水，自称西州上将军。后助光武镇压赤眉军，不久叛降割据四川的公孙述。建武九年（33..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹兴> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹兴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹興"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹肇之子。肇卒，兴嗣爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡烈> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "胡烈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "玄武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "秦州刺史。父遵，魏卫将军。为将伐蜀。钟会之反也，烈与诸将皆被闭。烈子渊，时年十八，为士卒先，攻杀会，名驰远近。烈为秦州刺史，及凉州叛，烈屯于万斛堆，为虏所围，无援，遇害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏国钟会帐前护军。钟会谋反，囚魏诸将。其心腹丘建原先为胡烈旧部，丘建将钟会之谋告胡烈。胡烈之子胡渊在外领军，胡烈通过丘建帮助，将钟会谋反之事暗告渊，后渊献策，引军杀钟会，姜维见计不成，自刎而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程秉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "程秉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程秉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "德枢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程秉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程秉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "逮事郑玄，后避乱交州，与刘熙考论大义，遂博通五经。士燮命为长史。权闻其名儒，以礼徵秉，既到，拜太子太傅。病卒官。著周易摘、尚书駮、论语弼，凡三万馀言。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程秉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "程秉在孙策死后投江东孙权，赤壁之战前诸葛亮舌战群儒曾令他言不能对。后出任使者，去与前來为关羽仇的蜀军讲和，并将张飞的首级送回。可是刘备伐吴的意志非常坚决，讲和因而失败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张茂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张茂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦林"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "明帝青龙中，为太子舍人。以明帝盛兴宫室，留意玩饰，赐与无度，帑藏空竭；又录夺士女前已嫁为吏民妻者，还以配士，既听以生口自赎，又简选其有姿色者纳之掖庭，遂上书切谏。但明帝无动于衷，以事付散骑而已。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏主在许昌大兴土木，建盖宫殿。时有太子舍人张茂字彦材，亦上表切谏。睿命斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜琼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜琼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜琼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯瑜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜琼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜琼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少受学於任安，精究安术。刘璋时辟为从事。先主定益州，领牧，以琼为议曹从事。后主践阼，拜谏议大夫，迁左中郎将、大鸿胪、太常。为人静默少言，阖门自守，不与世事。蒋琬、费祎等皆器重之。虽学业入深，初不视天文有所论说。后进通儒谯周常问其意，琼..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜琼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "丞相诸葛亮北伐，留琼为谏议大夫。后亮三番北伐，令琼、魏延、张嶷、陈式出箕谷，后中计，兵败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔州平> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "崔州平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔州平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "州平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔州平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔州平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉太尉崔烈子，西河太守崔均之弟。字州平，名不详。与徐庶、石韬、孟建皆与亮友善，谓为信然。诸葛亮出山前，每自比于管仲、乐毅，时人以为夸饰之言，惟州平与徐庶以为亮所言不虚。亮亦甚重州平，曰：“初交州平，屡闻得失。”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔州平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "荆州名士、诸葛亮之友。亮与州平、颍川石广元、汝南孟公威与徐元直四人为密友。此四人务于精纯，惟孔明独观其大略。先主来隆中见亮，忽见州平容貌轩昂，丰姿俊爽，头戴逍遥巾，身穿皂布袍，杖藜从山僻小路而来。先主与语大悦，即请同归，州平以己无意功..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛礼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "薛礼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "薛禮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任彭城相，奉扬州刺史刘繇为盟主，据秣陵城。献帝兴平二年（195），孙策渡江攻礼，礼败走。后为笮融所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛礼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "刘繇帐下谋士。刘繇被孙策击败而奔逃，薛礼镇守秣陵。孙策假装中箭身死，引薛礼出战，以伏兵大胜之，薛礼与原刘繇部将张英、陈横俱阵亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张羡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张羡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张羡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張羡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张羡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张羡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾作零陵、桂阳长，甚得江、湘间民心。建安初年，为长沙太守。五年（200），叛刘表而与曹操相结。表急攻羡，羡病死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔禹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "崔禹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔禹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "崔禹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔禹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔禹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔禹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "朱然部将。刘备攻孙权时，蜀将吴班、冯习、张南共定劫营之计，先使小兵诈降，朱然欲自出，崔禹曰：“小卒之言，未可深信。倘有疏虞，水陆二军尽皆休矣。将军只宜稳守水寨，某愿 替将军一行。”然从之，遂令崔禹引一万军前去。后禹果中埋伏，为张苞所擒..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕威璜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕威璜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕威璜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吕威璜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕威璜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕威璜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任骑督。建安五年（200），曹操和袁绍两军相持于官渡，他从将军淳于琼率兵万余运粮，在乌巢为曹军袭杀，粮尽焚。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕威璜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "担任淳于琼的副将之一守卫乌巢的粮仓。淳于琼酒醉之时遭到曹操军的袭击，这一失策与官渡之战的失败有很大的关系。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邻戴> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邻戴"@zh .
