<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊徽瑜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊徽瑜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "司马师夫人。晋朝建立，居弘训宫，号弘训太后。咸宁四年（278）卒，谥号景献皇后，祔葬峻平陵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆纡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陆纡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆纡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔盤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆纡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆纡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陆逊祖父。敏淑有思学，守城门校尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟节> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孟节"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟节> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孟節"@zh .
