<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟节> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟节> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "万安隐者。弟获，为南蛮王。获等反，蜀相亮伐之，军士因误饮哑泉之水失语。土人告亮，节草庵后有一泉，名安乐泉。人若中毒，汲其水饮之即愈。有人或生疥癞，或感瘴气，于万安溪内浴之，自然无事，更兼庵前有一等草，名曰薤叶芸香。人若口含一叶，则瘴气..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苗泽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苗泽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苗泽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "苗澤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苗泽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苗泽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苗泽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "黄奎与进京的马腾密议欲除曹操，为苗泽所知，因苗泽与黄奎侍妾李春香私通，遂将此事密报曹操，因此事机败露，黄奎与马腾被曹操处死，同时黄奎全家老小以及马腾之子马休、马铁亦被杀。苗泽向曹操求得李春香为妻，却被曹操斥为“不义之人”，与李春香皆被..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔琰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "崔琰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔琰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季珪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔琰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔琰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "声姿高暢，眉目疏朗，须长四尺，甚有威重，少好击剑，尚武事。及长，诵论语、韩诗。结公孙方等，师丛郑玄。袁绍辟之。绍出兵黎阳袭许都，琰谏阻，绍不听。未几，果败于官渡。绍卒，二子交争，争欲得琰。琰称疾固辞，获罪，赖阴夔、陈琳救得免。太祖破袁..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔琰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初为袁绍谋事。袁绍败亡后，曹操辟他为官。琰刚正不阿，官做到尚书。后来反对曹操进位魏王而入狱。狱中大骂曹操欺君奸贼，被曹操下令杖杀于狱中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张裔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张裔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张裔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "君嗣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张裔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张裔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "辅汉将军、丞相长史。治《公羊春秋》，博涉《史记》、《汉书》。汉刘璋时，举孝廉，为鱼复长，还州署从事，领帐下司马。张飞自荆州由垫江入，璋授裔兵，拒张飞于德阳陌下，军败，还成都。为璋奉使诣先主，先主许以礼其君而安其人也，裔还，城门乃开。先..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张裔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初为偏将军，与众臣共推先主续汉统。后丞相诸葛亮伐魏，留裔为长史，掌丞相府事。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡忠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "胡忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "胡忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "在“司马懿占北原渭桥　诸葛亮造木牛流马”一章中杜睿、胡忠二人奉诸葛亮之命，在上方谷监督工匠造木牛流马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习凿齿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "习凿齿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习凿齿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦威"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习凿齿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#习凿齿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "（？-约383）东晋史学家。字彦威，襄阳（治今湖北襄樊）人。少有志气，博学洽闻，以文笔著称。荆州刺史桓温辟为从事，转西曹主簿，累迁别驾。温出征伐，凿齿或随或守，所在任职，每处机要。后以忤旨，左迁户曹参军，出为荥阳太守。既罢，归本郡，著..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏越> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "魏越"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏越> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "魏越"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏越> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏越> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吕布部将。作战勇敢，冲锋陷阵，曾从吕布破张燕于常山。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨彪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨彪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨彪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨彪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨彪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "杨震之后，杨赐之子，世代忠烈。任京兆尹时毅然处死巨宦王甫。献帝时为太尉，董卓欲迁都长安，百官无敢异议者，唯其力争，免官。卓死复为太尉，李郭之乱中尽节护主。后为曹操所忌，诬以大逆，孔融力救始免。后其子杨修为曹操所杀，闭门不仕十余年。杨彪..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨彪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司徒，后为太尉。建议流亡中的献帝依靠曹操。因为与袁术有亲戚关系，被曹操打入大牢，经孔融斡旋才得以保命。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅祗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "傅祗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅祗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子庄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅祗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅祗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋武帝始建东宫，起家太子舍人。累迁散骑黄门郎，赐爵关内侯。为荥阳太守，造沈莱堰，解决水患之灾。寻表兼廷尉，迁常侍、左军将军。武帝卒，入为侍中。迁司隶校尉。八王之乱中，官位屡变。永嘉五年（311），官至司徒。以暴疾卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋钦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蒋钦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公奕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙策袭袁术，钦随从事。与策定三郡、豫章。平盗贼，迁西部都尉。讨会稽贼吕合、秦狼等，徙讨越中郎将。与贺齐并力，黟贼平定。从征合肥，钦因功迁荡寇将军，领濡须督。后召还都拜右护军，典领辞讼。钦贵守约，母妾布衣。性豁达，昔解隙徐盛，论者美焉。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "原本是盗寇，孙策征讨刘繇，蒋钦举众相投。随孙策征战，平定江东。取南郡被曹仁杀败。濡须口战役罢兵，蒋钦留守濡须。后随吕蒙袭取了荆州。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜远> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜远"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜远> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "杜遠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜远> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜远> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜远> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "黄巾余党。因世乱流落江湖，与廖化聚众五百余人，劫掠为生。关羽千里寻兄，远时下山巡哨，将二夫人劫掠上山。远欲与化各分一人为妻。化问起根由，好生拜敬，远出言不逊，为化所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓义> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邓义"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄧義"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为荆州牧刘表治中，后进谏不听，辞疾而退，终表之世不复出。献帝建安十三年（208），曹操并荆州，徵为侍中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "为刘表部下治中。刘表死，蔡瑁遂立刘琮为主。蔡氏宗族，分领荆州之兵，令治中邓义、别驾刘先守荆州，蔡夫人自与刘琮前赴襄阳驻扎，以防刘琦、刘备。后曹操引军来襄阳，蔡氏、刘琮降曹，献荆襄，随后即被斩。荆州治中邓义、别驾刘先已备知襄阳之事，料不..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱褒> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱褒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱褒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "朱褒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱褒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱褒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "素有异志。益州从事常房巡视牂牁，被他攻杀并诬以谋反。先主薨，建兴元年夏，牂牁太守褒拥郡反。时高定恣睢于越巂，雍闿跋扈于建宁。三年，丞相亮遂南征，讨平之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱褒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "建兴三年，蛮王孟获，大起蛮兵十万，结连建宁太守雍闿犯境侵掠。牂牁郡太守褒、越巂郡太守高定，二人献了城。丞相亮反间三人，使定与褒相攻，褒为定所骂，褒目瞪口呆，不能回答。忽然定将鄂焕于马后转过，一戟刺褒于马下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐氏[吕安妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐氏[吕安妻]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐氏[吕安妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐氏[吕安妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐氏[吕安妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吕安之妻。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马孚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马孚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马孚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔达"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马孚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马孚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "司马懿之弟，自曹操时代起，就任文学掾，而后历仕魏国五代皇帝，累迁至太傅。司马孚在“高平陵事变”之际，协助司马懿控制京师，诛杀曹爽一党，后又督军成功防御吴、蜀的进攻，为司马氏政权的稳固多有功劳，但他性格十分谨慎，自司马懿执掌大权起，便逐..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马孚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "于演义第78回登场，而后多次出现：曹操去世时，司马孚任中庶子，劝曹丕节哀，早登王位；司马懿发动政变诛杀曹爽之际，司马孚任尚书令，与太尉蒋济共同做表，弹劾曹爽；魏帝曹芳被废后，司马孚赞同太后之言，主立曹髦为帝；曹髦被杀后，司马孚枕尸痛哭..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王弥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王弥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王弥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王彌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王弥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王弥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "玄菟太守王颀孙。少游侠京都。惠帝末，从刘伯根起兵。伯根死，聚徒海渚，号为飞豹，有众数万。后归附刘元海，以战功进征东大将军，封东莱公，与刘曜、石勒破京师，纵兵大掠。后为石勒所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈耽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈耽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈耽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "汉公"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈耽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈耽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉灵帝时历任太常、太尉、司空、司徒，为人忠正刚直。以直言公卿勾结宦官，率举私党，遭诬陷下狱死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈耽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司徒，为十常侍所害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄承彦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄承彦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄承彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "承彦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄承彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄承彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "沔南名士。承彦高爽开列，其女嫁予诸葛亮为妻。根据《黄承彦碑》拓本推测，其卒于建安二十三年。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄承彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "诸葛亮岳父。先主二顾茅庐遇之。夷陵之战后，陆逊困于鱼腹浦八阵图，在承彦指引下才得以出阵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀顗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀顗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀顗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "景倩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀顗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀顗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太子太傅、侍中、太尉。魏太尉彧之第六子也。幼为姊婿陈群所赏。性至孝，总角知名，博学洽闻，理思周密。魏时以父勋除中郎。宣帝辅政，见顗奇之，擢拜散骑侍郎，累迁侍中。为魏少帝执经，拜骑都尉，赐爵关内侯。难钟会《易》无互体，又与扶风王骏论仁孝..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀顗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司马。初为司空，司马文王欲立世子，顗及太尉王祥劝立长子，文王从之。后为司马，及文王病危，顗及诸大臣入宫问安，文王不能言，以手指太子而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#位居> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "位居"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#位居> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "位居"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#位居> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#位居> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时夫余国官吏。夫余王麻余时任大使。轻财好施。受国人拥戴，每年遣使向魏贡献。正始中，幽州刺史毌丘俭遣兵攻打高句丽，他派官员迎接并供给军粮。叔父为牛加，有二心。他杀叔父及其子，籍没财物，遣使送官府。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张顗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张顗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张顗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張顗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张顗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张顗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁氏兄弟交战。审配出兵城北，欲与袁尚对决围。太祖逆击之，败还，尚亦破走，依曲漳为营，太祖遂围之。未合，尚惧，遣阴夔、陈琳乞降，不听。尚还走滥口，进复围之急，其将马延、张顗等临陈降，觽大溃，尚奔中山。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张顗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "与马延共为先锋。为降曹的吕旷、吕翔二将招降。后随曹操出兵赤壁。时值曹军败北，延、顗二将率三千北地军马保护曹操逃命。二将飞骑前行，中埋伏，顗挺枪来迎，宁大喝一声，顗措手不及，被宁手起一刀，翻身落马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#壹与> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "壹与"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#壹与> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "壹與"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#壹与> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#壹与> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏正始末年即位，时年十三。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖山> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "祖山"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖山> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "祖山"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖山> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖山> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十三年（208）孙策部将贺齐征讨黟县，山即率本县二万户屯守林历山，终为攻破，死七千余人，余皆被俘虏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡遵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "胡遵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "胡遵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "卫将军。景初二年，辽东公孙渊反，司马懿遣遵等击破其将卑衍、杨祚。嘉平四年冬十一月，诏征南大将军王昶、征东将军遵、镇南将军毌丘俭等征吴。十二月，吴大将军诸葛恪拒战，大破众军于东关。不利而还。正元二年七月，以遵为卫将军。甘露元年秋七月己卯..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "征东将军。景初二年，辽东公孙渊反，遵随司马懿讨灭之。嘉平四年，司马师令征南大将军王昶引兵十万攻南郡，征东将军遵引兵十万攻东兴，镇南都督毋丘俭引兵十万攻武昌：三路进发。后昭又令遵为先锋，然为吴将丁奉所败。正元二年，俭反，师命遵，领青州诸..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍出> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲍出"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍出> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文才"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍出> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍出> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "有的文献里说字交才，是后汉时京兆人，天生魁伟，生性至孝。一天他不在家，一伙强盗把他母亲劫走。鲍出闻讯后，怒发冲冠，抄起一把刀就不顾一切地追下去。沿途杀了十几个贼人，终于追上了劫掠他母亲的强盗，远远看见母亲和邻居老妪被绑在一起。他大吼一..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#满宠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "满宠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#满宠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯宁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#满宠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#满宠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "年十八，为郡督邮。时郡内李朔等各拥部曲，害于平民，太守使宠纠焉。朔等请罪，不复钞略。守高平令,后弃官归。太祖临兗州，辟为从事。及为大将军，辟署西曹属，为许令。故太尉杨彪收付县狱，宠使太祖即日赦出彪。后以宠为汝南太守。得户二万，兵二千人..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#满宠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初，为刘晔所荐，投太祖，为军中从事。及汉帝东归，宠说杨奉将徐晃来投。太祖与袁绍战，宠助夏侯惇守汝南，以防刘表。关羽围樊城，时大水至，宠劝曹仁守之，以待援军。周鲂定计赚曹休，宠为前将军，属贾逵，后兵败。蜀六次伐魏，吴亦分兵三路伐魏，宠设..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邹他> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邹他"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邹他> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄒他"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邹他> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邹他> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "地方势力首领。他与钱铜等各聚众万余，被孙策攻破。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵叡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵叡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵叡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "趙叡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵叡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵叡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安五年，绍与曹公战，叡助将军淳于琼守乌巢。公引军至，围屯，大放火，营中惊乱。大破之，尽燔其粮谷宝货，斩叡、韩莒子、吕威璜、督将眭元进等首。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵叡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁绍督将。建安五年，绍与曹公战，绍遣叡、眭元进、韩莒子、吕威璜，随大将淳于琼，引二万人马，守乌巢。是夜，曹公引军烧放火，叡、元进运粮方回，见屯上火起，急来救应。一霎时，火焰四起，烟迷太空。赵、眭二将驱兵来救，操弓勒马回战。二将抵敌不住..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫晏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "皇甫晏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫晏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "皇甫晏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫晏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫晏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾以家财收葬尚书王经及经母。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张虎[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张虎[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张虎[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張虎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张虎[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张虎[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "偏将军、前将军张辽之子。辽薨，子虎嗣。为偏将军，薨。子统嗣。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张虎[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "前将军张辽之子。诸葛亮北伐，曹真以虎为先锋、乐进子乐綝为副先锋，为亮所败。亮与司马懿斗阵，虎更与綝、戴陵陷阵被捉，涂面放归。后虎、綝受懿计，引二千弓弩手伏于渭水浮桥北岸，乱箭射死吴班。亮造木牛流马，虎、綝夺之。司马父子困于上方谷，为虎..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍延> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "伍延"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伍延"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任江陵督。天纪三年（279），晋镇南将军杜预进军江陵。次年春，江陵危，延伪请降而列兵登陴，杜预功克之，斩延。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍延> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "天纪四年，晋军侵吴。吴帝皓以车骑将军延为都督，进兵江陵，迎敌杜预。后延出陆路，为晋军所败。延见各军皆败，乃弃城走，被伏兵捉住，缚见预。预曰：“留之无用！”叱令武士斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖弼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "祖弼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖弼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "祖弼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖弼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖弼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖弼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉献帝时期的符宝郎（掌管玉玺的官位）。当曹丕篡位之时，曹洪、曹休向他索要玉玺，却被他厉声斥责，于是曹洪下令将其处死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于麋> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "于麋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于麋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "于麋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于麋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于麋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘繇部将。东汉扬州刺史刘繇遣樊能、于麋东屯横江津，张英屯当利口，以距袁术。兴平二年孙策渡江攻刘繇的牛渚营，尽得邸阁粮谷、战具后，正当孙策攻笮融和薛礼之时，樊能、于麋等复攻谋夺回牛渚屯。孙策得知后，回军还破樊能等，获男女万余人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于麋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "扬州刺史刘繇麾下之将。虽奋力抵抗来犯的孙策，但不出三回合便被生擒。并被孙策夹在腋下归营，最后被其怪力绞杀而亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丘本> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "丘本"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丘本> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "丘本"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丘本> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丘本> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丘本> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "263年任监军，协助邓艾伐蜀。邓艾兵至绵竹，为诸葛瞻所阻，不得进。监军丘本曰：“何不作一书以诱之？”艾从言遂作书一封，遣使送人蜀寨。守门将引至帐下，呈上其书。瞻拆封视之。书曰：“征西将军邓艾，致书于行军护卫将军诸葛思远麾下：切观近代贤..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎芝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阎芝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎芝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "閻芝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎芝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎芝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任蜀国巴西太守。刘备兵败夷陵时，芝征发诸县五千兵以助备。诸葛亮镇汉中后，卒。诸葛亮《后出师表》中亦提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎芝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "诸葛亮《后出师表》中提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜叙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "姜叙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜叙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯奕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜叙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜叙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十七年（212），任抚夷将军，与杨阜等起兵反抗马超，母为超所杀。后南奔，陇右平定。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜叙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "与杨阜是姑表兄弟，叙之母是阜之姑。先，杨阜为冀城参军，诈降于马超。后至历城说叙起兵抗超。叙联结梁宽、赵衢、尹奉、赵昂起事，大败超，杀超妻子并至亲十余口，夺冀城。马超败走历城，尽洗城中百姓，杀姜叙老母及尹奉、赵昂全家老幼。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋果> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "宋果"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋果> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲乙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋果> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋果> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末董卓部将李傕军吏。董卓死后，其旧部李傕，郭汜等法战于长安，果与杨奉等谋杀傕，事泄，遂叛催。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#句扶> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "句扶"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#句扶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝兴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#句扶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#句扶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀左将军。忠勇宽厚，数有战功，功名爵位亚镇北大将军王平，官至左将军，封宕渠侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王彪之> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王彪之"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王彪之> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔虎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王彪之> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王彪之> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "穆帝永和中任廷尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#方悦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "方悦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#方悦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "方悅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#方悦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#方悦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#方悦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "河内太守王匡部将。初平元年，随王匡起兵讨董卓。诸侯军至虎牢关，董卓将吕布出马，王匡回头问曰：“谁敢出战？”方悦纵马挺枪而出。战无五合，被吕布一戟刺于马下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王元姬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王元姬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王元姬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王元姬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王元姬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王元姬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋文帝司马昭皇后。王肃女，晋武帝司马炎母。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王元姬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "晋文帝司马昭皇后。王肃女，晋武帝司马炎母。演义中有提及此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯恩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯恩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯恩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "夏侯恩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯恩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯恩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。据说原型为夏侯惇之弟夏侯廉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯恩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操部将，于三国演义第41回登场。夏侯恩为背剑官，为曹操背负宝剑“青釭”，在长坂之战时遭遇赵云，被赵云一枪刺死，宝剑也被赵云抢走。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张昭[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张昭[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张昭[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張昭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张昭[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张昭[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张范弟。献帝初为议郎。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张春华> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张春华"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张春华> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張春華"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张春华> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张春华> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋宣帝司马懿之妻，晋景帝司马师、晋文帝司马昭之母。后被追尊为皇后。少有德行，智识过人。司马懿当初拒曹操之召而以己有风痹推辞。一天忽下起暴雨，他想起外面晒了书，便不自觉蹭地收书。但被一个婢子看见了，张春华恐泄密便亲自杀人灭口，事后司马懿..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱然> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱然"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱然> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "义封"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱然> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱然> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙策遵从朱治的意思礼召朱然，从而朱然成为了朱治的子嗣，并且在读书期间和孙权结恩爱。孙权统事后曾任山阴令，临川太守，受到孙权赏识，有平定山贼的战绩。后来跟随吕蒙讨伐关羽并且捉拿关羽父子。吕蒙死后，代替吕蒙镇守江陵。刘备东征，朱然与陆逊合..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱然> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "吕蒙白衣渡江取荆州，朱然协助潘璋捉住了关羽。黄武元年，刘备兵伐东吴，朱然与孙桓抵抗刘备大军，后又参加夷陵战役，率兵断刘备的归路，被来接应刘备的大将赵云一枪刺死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘秀> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘秀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘秀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文叔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘秀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘秀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉开国皇帝，中国历史上著名的拨乱之主。西汉末年，海内分崩，天下大乱，身为一介布衣却有前朝血统的皇族成员在家乡乘势起兵。公元25年，刘秀与更始政权公开决裂，于河北登基称帝，为表刘氏重兴之意，仍以“汉”为其国号，史称“东汉”或“后汉”。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓济> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邓济"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄧濟"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝建安2年（197），为魏公曹操所擒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫继> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卫继"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫继> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子业"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫继> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫继> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "继为儿时，与兄弟随父游戏庭寺中，县长蜀郡成都张君无子，数命功曹呼其子省弄，甚怜爱之。张因言宴之间，语功曹欲乞继，功曹即许之，遂养为子。继敏达夙成，学识通博，进仕州郡，历职清显。而其余兄弟四人，各无堪当世者，父恆言己之将衰，张明府将盛也..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁尚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁尚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "显甫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁绍三子。貌美，后妻刘有宠，而偏爱尚，数称于绍，绍亦奇其姿容，欲使传嗣。绍卒，审配、逢纪缘绍素意，乃奉尚代绍位。长兄谭至，不得立，自号车骑将军。由是谭、尚有隙。曹操南征荆州，军至西平。谭、尚遂举兵相攻，谭败奔平原。后熙、尚、买为其将焦..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "长相俊秀，因此得到了袁绍的宠爱。临阵射杀史涣。袁绍死后，与兄长袁谭争。败给曹操后，便投奔身为幽州刺史的二哥袁熙。后二袁战败，投奔辽东公孙康，被康所杀，将头送往许都。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴义> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "麴义"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "麴義"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "久在凉州，晓习羌斗，兵皆骁锐，从韩馥为部将。初平二年，麹义叛韩馥，并败之，因与袁绍相结，协迫韩馥，遂使袁绍领冀州牧。南匈奴单于劫张杨以叛，袁绍使麹义追于邺南，击破之。界桥之战，麹义先登与瓚战，生擒严纲，拔其牙门，瓚军败走勃海。公孙瓒杀..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴义> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "磐河之战，袁绍令麴义引八百弓手，步兵一万五千，列于阵中，自引马步军于后接应。公孙瓒遣大将严纲为先锋，鼓噪前来，义军一齐俱发，麴义拍马舞刀，斩严纲于马下，直杀过界桥，击败公孙瓒，斩将夺旗，复引军冲瓒后军，正撞着赵云，战不数合，被赵云一枪..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寿良> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "寿良"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寿良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文淑"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寿良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#寿良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父、祖二世犍为太守。良少与犍为张微、费缉并知名，治《春秋》三传，贯通五经，澡身贞素。州从事、散骑、黄门侍郎。受经罗宪推荐为魏臣。编有《诸葛亮集》，与陈寿所集颇不同。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍去病> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "霍去病"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍去病> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "霍去病"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍去病> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍去病> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "军事家。汉代名将卫青的外甥，好骑射。经典之战：决战漠北。他用兵灵活，注重方略，不拘古法，勇猛果断，善于长途奔袭，每战皆胜，深得武帝信任。元狩六年（前117）病卒，年仅24岁。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#霍去病> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓嘉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "桓嘉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "桓嘉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "乐安太守。父阶，太常。嗣子兄桓祐病卒，嘉嗣爵。尚升迁亭公主，会嘉平中，以乐安太守与吴战於东关，军败，没，谥曰壮侯。子翊嗣。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓嘉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "随胡遵伐吴，攻南郡。吴将丁奉上岸，砍入魏寨，嘉从左边转出，忙绰枪刺奉，被奉挟住枪杆。嘉弃枪而走，奉一刀飞去，正中左肩，嘉望后便倒。奉赶上，就以枪刺之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#顾谭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "顾谭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#顾谭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子默"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#顾谭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#顾谭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴太常、平尚书事。顾雍之孙，顾邵长子。弱冠，与诸葛恪等为太子四友。从中庶子转辅正都尉。赤乌中，代恪为左节度。薛综为选曹尚书，固让于谭。祖父雍卒数月，拜太常，代雍平尚书事。后与鲁王霸有隙，又以压长公主婿卫将军全综子绪端征魏功，为所构陷，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张南[蜀]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张南[蜀]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张南[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文进"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张南[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张南[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "自荆州随先主入蜀，领兵从先主征吴，以南为前部。猇亭军败，吴将陆逊通率诸军同时俱攻，斩南、冯习及胡王沙摩柯等首，破其四十余营。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张南[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "领兵从先主伐吴，与吴班、冯习攻夷陵。后为吴将陆逊火攻，大败。南等往救先主，为吴所攻，力战而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马隽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马隽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马隽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "司馬隽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马隽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马隽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "司马懿之祖父。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马隽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司马懿之祖父。演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马防> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马防"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马防> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "建公"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马防> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马防> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "司马懿之父，性格秉直公正，年青时在州郡任官，历官升至洛阳令、京兆尹，年老后转拜骑都尉，养志闾巷，阖门自守，于219年逝世。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马防> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉京兆尹，司马懿之父，三国演义第39回中提及。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕伯奢> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕伯奢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕伯奢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯奢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕伯奢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕伯奢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操故友。董卓表曹公为骁骑校尉，欲与计事。公以卓终必覆败，遂不就拜，逃归乡里。从数骑过故人伯奢，伯奢不在，其子与宾客共劫公，取马及物，公手刃击杀数人。既而凄怆曰：“宁我负人，毋人负我！”遂行。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕伯奢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹氏故人。与曹公父嵩为结义弟兄，曹公谋刺董卓未遂，遁走。后为中牟县令陈宫擒，宫义之，与共走。行至成皋，投伯奢家。后伯奢往沽酒，良久不归。公等闻庄后有磨刀之声，又言缚杀，以人图之，杀死八口。搜至厨下，却见缚一猪欲杀。公等急出庄上马而行，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹蕤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹蕤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹蕤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹蕤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹蕤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹蕤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹丕之子。明帝即位，立为阳平县王。太和六年（232），改封北海。青龙元年（233）卒，谥曰悼王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王如> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王如"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王如> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王如"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王如> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王如> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西晋时流民起义领袖。初为州武吏，西晋末，他率流民攻下襄城，聚众四五万，自号大将军，领司、雍二州牧。怀帝永嘉六年（312），因严重缺粮，内部分裂，降于晋将王敦。后为王敦所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙度> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "公孙度"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "升济"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "辽东太守。度父延，避吏居玄菟，任度为郡吏。时玄菟太守公孙琙，子豹，年十八岁，早死。度少时名豹，又与琙子同年，琙见而亲爱之，遣就师学，为取妻。后举有道，除尚书郎，稍迁冀州刺史，以谣言免。同郡徐荣为董卓中郎将，荐度为辽东太守。度起玄菟小吏..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "武威将军公孙度，乃是辽东太守公孙康之父。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李恢> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李恢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李恢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "德昂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李恢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李恢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "仕郡督邮，姑夫爨习为建伶令，有违犯之事，恢坐习免官。太守董和以习方土大姓，寝而不许。后恢知璋之必败，先主必成，乃投先主。先主嘉之，从至雒城，遣恢至汉中交好马超，超遂从命。成都既定，先主领益州牧，以恢为功曹书佐主簿。后为亡虏所诬，引恢谋..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李恢> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初仕刘璋，赵云荐与先主。时先主正欲令一人往说马超来降，恢自荐往之。马超初不欲降，恢以理说之，超遂斩监军杨柏，将首极共恢一同上关来降先主。及益州定，恢为先主擢用。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王国[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王国[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王国[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王國"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王国[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王国[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操定冀州，以其与薛悌为左右长史。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹节[献穆皇后]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹节[献穆皇后]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹节[献穆皇后]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹節"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹节[献穆皇后]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹节[献穆皇后]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "山阳公夫人。魏公之中女。建安十八年，曹公进三女宪、节、华为夫人，聘以束帛玄纁五万匹，小者待年于国。十九年，并拜为贵人。及伏皇后被弑，明年，立节为皇后。魏受禅，遣使求玺绶，后怒不与。如此数辈，后乃呼使者人，亲数让之，以玺抵轩下，因涕泣横..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹节[献穆皇后]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操之女。伏皇后死后，汉献帝立为皇后。曹丕篡汉，曹后大怒曰：“吾兄奈何为此乱逆之事耶！”言未已，只见曹洪、曹休带剑而入，请帝出殿。曹后大骂曰：“俱是汝等乱贼，希图富贵，共造逆谋！吾父功盖寰区，威震天下，然且不敢篡窃神器。今吾兄嗣位未几..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟获> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孟获"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟获> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孟獲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟获> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟获> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "先主崩，获随雍闿反。蜀相诸葛亮亲征，百战百捷。闻得有孟获，向为本地的夷、汉所服，与之战，擒之于盘东。亮纳参军马谡策，赦孟获以服南方。后南中平，获随亮归成都，任御史中丞。终亮之世，南方不敢复反。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟获> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "南蛮大王。建兴三年，获大起蛮兵十万造反。丞相诸葛亮引军五月渡泸，深入不毛之地，智破蛮军，七擒获。获自知羞惭，遂举族拜降，永不复反。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴演> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "麴演"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴演> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "麴演"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴演> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#麴演> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "出生死亡日期不详（大约在三国中期，晚期左右死亡），曾同时与武威颜俊、张掖和鸾、酒泉黄华造反，曹操负责攻击他们。麹演后投奔征西将军韩遂。献帝建安二十年（215），与蒋石等共斩送韩遂首。曹操卒，演叛，自称护羌校尉。苏则领兵讨之，演恐，乞降..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭浮> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭浮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭浮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郭浮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭浮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭浮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "文德郭皇后之兄。官至高唐令。魏明帝青龙四年（236），追封谥为梁里亭戴侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘宏[汉灵帝]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘宏[汉灵帝]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘宏[汉灵帝]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉宏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘宏[汉灵帝]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘宏[汉灵帝]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉孝灵皇帝。肃宗玄孙也，曾祖河间孝王开，祖淑，父苌。世封解渎亭侯，帝袭侯爵。母董夫人。桓帝崩，无子，皇太后与父城门校尉窦武定策禁中，使守光禄大夫刘儵持节，将左右羽林至河间奉迎。建宁元年春正月壬午，城门校尉窦武为大将军。己亥，帝到夏门亭..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘宏[汉灵帝]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉孝灵皇帝。汉末国衰，推其致乱之由，殆始于桓、灵二帝。桓帝禁锢善类，崇信宦官。及桓帝崩，灵帝即位，大将军窦武、太傅陈蕃，共相辅佐。时有宦官曹节等弄权，窦武、陈蕃谋诛之，机事不密，反为所害，中涓自此愈横。帝宠信十常侍，不问政事。帝尊信张..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#党均> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "党均"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#党均> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "黨均"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#党均> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#党均> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#党均> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏军为蜀军所困，邓艾从司马望反间计，欲以金玉结好蜀宦官黄皓。均自荐，艾大喜，即令均赍金珠宝物，径到成都结连皓，布散流言，说姜维怨望天子，不久投魏。事成，均回祁山寨中，报知此事。艾就令均入洛阳，报知司马昭。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶商> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陶商"@zh .
