<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶商> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陶谦之子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴修> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴修"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吴脩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴修> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝时任将作大匠。初平元年（190），关东州郡起兵讨董卓，以袁绍为盟主。董卓派遣他与执金吾胡母班前去安抚袁绍，袁绍指使河内太守王匡将其杀死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐楷> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐楷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐楷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐楷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐楷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐楷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "故安东将军徐盛之子。盛卒，楷袭爵领兵。"@zh .
