<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#凌烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#凌烈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "凌统之子。统卒时，烈与弟封仅数岁，孙权内养于宫，爱待与诸子同。后追录统功，封烈亭侯，还其故兵。后以罪免。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹宇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹宇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹宇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彭祖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹宇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹宇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操之子，环氏所生，在魏文帝、魏明帝时期累受封爵，至燕王。魏明帝曹睿与曹宇特别友善，病危时立曹宇为大将军，欲属以后事。曹宇谦恭，坚辞不受，于是曹睿改立曹爽为大将军，同司马懿共同辅政，曹宇则免官回家。后来，曹宇之子曹奂于魏帝曹髦死后，被..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹宇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操之子，封燕王。魏明帝曹睿病危时立曹宇为大将军，欲属以后事。曹宇谦恭，坚辞不受，于是曹睿改立曹爽为大将军，同司马懿共同辅政。后来，曹宇之子曹奂于魏帝曹髦死后，被立为魏国皇帝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐元> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐元"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐元> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐元"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐元> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐元> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权弟孙翊部将。降将妫览、戴员谋杀孙翊后，孙河前往怒责，又遭杀戮。徐元与孙高、傅婴等以计诛死妫、戴。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩馥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩馥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩馥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文节"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩馥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩馥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为御史中丞，董卓举其为冀州牧。初平元年，馥与袁术等共推袁绍为盟主。馥与绍谋立幽州牧刘虞为帝，而虞不敢居帝位。次年，袁绍胁馥，取冀州，以馥为奋威将军。馥自怀猜惧。辞绍，往依张邈。后绍遣使诣邈，耳语议事，馥时在坐，以为他们图谋害己，遂自杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩馥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "冀州牧。作为十八路诸侯之一曾率军讨伐董卓。后被袁绍用计夺了冀州，抛下妻儿去投奔张邈。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐氏[孙翊妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐氏[孙翊妻]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐氏[孙翊妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐氏[孙翊妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐氏[孙翊妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "夫翊，大帝之弟也。翊大都督妫览、郡丞戴员亲近翊边洪左右等，数为翊所困，常欲叛逆，因吴主权出征，遂其奸计。时诸县令长并会见翊，翊以妻徐氏颇晓卜，翊入语徐：“吾明日欲为长吏作主人，卿试卜之。”徐言：“卦不能佳，可须异日。”翊以长吏来久，宜..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐氏[孙翊妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "偏将军孙翊之妻。夫翊，大帝之弟也。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨奉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨奉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊奉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "本白波贼帅，后为李傕部将。傕、郭汜交兵，奉乃将兵救傕，于是汜众乃退。帝亦思旧京，因遣使求东归。以奉为兴义将军。汜等并侍送乘舆。汜遂复欲胁帝幸眉阝，定、奉、承不听。张济与杨奉、董承不相平，乃反合傕、汜，共追乘舆，大战于弘农东涧。承、奉军..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "是李傕的属下，因为对奖赏不满而逃走。协助献帝逃出长安有功。与曹操争夺权势失败，逃走去投奔袁术。后又为吕布策反，袭击袁术。后因骚扰百姓，为刘备诱杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆郁生> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陆郁生"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆郁生> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陸鬱生"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆郁生> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陆郁生> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "陆绩之女。于郁林所生女，故名曰郁生，少履贞特之行，幼立匪石之节，年始十三，適同郡张温弟白。侍庙三月，妇礼未卒，白遭罹家祸，迁死异郡。郁生抗声昭节，义形於色，冠盖交横，誓而不许，奉白姊妹嶮巇之中，蹈履水火，志怀霜雪，义心固於金石，体信贯..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张子谦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张子谦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张子谦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張子謙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张子谦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
