<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "鲁国陬邑（今中国山东省曲阜市南辛镇）人。思想家和教育家，儒家的创始人。孔子集华夏上古文化之大成，在世时已被誉为“天纵之圣”、“天之木铎”，是当时社会上最博学者之一，并且被后世统治者尊为孔圣人、至圣先师、万世师表。孔子和儒家思想对中国和..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孔子> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "春秋时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成廉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "成廉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成廉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "成廉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成廉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成廉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吕布亲近骁将。随布、魏越等讨张燕，陷锋突陈，遂破燕军。后曹公进至下邳，布自将骑逆击。操大破之，获廉。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成廉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "吕布六健将之一，为张辽统领。濮阳大败曹公，然廉为乐进一箭射死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李条> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李条"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李条> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李條"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李条> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李条> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "在东莱起事，曹操遣泰山太守吕虔前往镇压。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#官雝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "官雝"@zh .
