<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#官雝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀国典军中郎将。随诸葛亮出师伐魏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛宪英> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "辛宪英"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛宪英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宪英"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛宪英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛宪英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "辛毗之女、辛敞之姊。聪朗有才鉴。初，魏文帝得立为太子，抱毗项谓之曰：“辛君知我喜不？”毗以告宪英，宪英叹曰：“太子，代君主宗庙社稷者也。代君不可以不戚，主国不可以不惧，宜戚而喜，何以能久！魏其不昌乎？”弟敞为大将军曹爽参军，宣帝将诛爽..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛宪英> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "辛敞之姊。宣帝将诛爽，因其从魏帝出而闭城门，爽司马鲁芝率府兵斩关赴爽，呼敞同去。敞惧，问宪英，宪英劝敞尽职，敞遂出。宣帝果诛爽。懿以各为其主，乃义人也，复各人旧职。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘弘[西晋]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘弘[西晋]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘弘[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "和季"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘弘[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘弘[西晋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西晋大臣。少与晋武帝同里，又同年，情款甚密。以旧恩起家太子门大夫，晋重臣张华甚重之，由是累迁至宁朔将军、假节、监幽州诸军事，领乌丸校尉，史称其到任后，寇盗屏迹，百姓称颂。遂封宣城公。惠帝太安（302-303）中，为使持节、南蛮校尉、荆..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任夔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "任夔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任夔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "任夔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任夔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任夔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "属吴兰部。建安二十二年（217），刘备进兵争汉中，遣吴兰与张飞、马超等屯下辩，曹操遣曹洪迎战。次年春，曹洪破吴兰，夔被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任夔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "建安二十三年，先主攻汉中。马超兵至下辨，令吴兰为先锋，领军哨出，正与魏将曹洪军遇。兰欲退，夔曰：“贼兵初至，若不先挫其锐气，何颜见孟起乎？”于是骤马挺枪搦洪战。洪自提刀跃马而出。交锋三合，斩夔于马下，乘势掩杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈平> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西汉阳武户牖乡（今河南省兰考县）人，以谋略见长。在楚汉相争时，初在项羽手下做谋士。早期被项羽重用，因得罪亚父范增，逃归汉王刘邦帐下。曾多次出计策助刘邦。西汉建立后，任右丞相，后迁左丞相，曾先后受封户牖侯，曲逆侯（今河北顺平东），死后谥..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈蕃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈蕃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈蕃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲举"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈蕃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈蕃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初仕郡，举孝廉，除郎中。母忧弃官。州辟别驾从事，复弃去。公府举方正，不就。徵拜议郎，再迁乐安太守，以忤梁冀，左转修武令，迁尚书，出为豫章太守。徵拜尚书令，迁大鸿胪，坐救李云免。复徵拜议郎，迁光禄动，免。徵为尚书仆射，转太中大夫，代杨秉..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈蕃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "及桓帝崩，灵帝即位，大将军窦武、太傅陈蕃，共相辅佐。时有宦官曹节等弄权，窦武、陈蕃谋诛之，机事不密，反为所害，中涓自此愈横。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#然人> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "然人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#然人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "然人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#然人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#然人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末高句骊官吏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#俄何> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "俄何"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#俄何> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "俄何"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#俄何> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#俄何> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "正始八年，陇西、南安、金城、西平诸羌饿何、烧戈、伐同、蛾遮塞等相结叛乱，攻围城邑，南招蜀兵，凉州名胡治无戴复叛应之。讨蜀护军夏侯霸督诸军屯为翅。郭淮退姜维，维遁退。进讨叛羌，斩饿何、烧戈，降服者万馀落。演义中作俄何烧戈，是误将俄何和烧..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#俄何> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中作俄何烧戈，是误将俄何和烧戈当做了一个人。奉迷当大王之命助蜀，以五万军攻南安。然中魏将陈泰之计，俄何烧戈骤马挺枪入寨之时，连人带马，跌在陷坑里。泰兵从后面杀来，郭淮从左边杀来，羌兵大乱，自相践踏，死者无数，生者尽降。俄何烧戈自刎而死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王悦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王悦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王悦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王悦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王悦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王悦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自花关索传。为卢塘寨盗贼王令公之长女。以武艺与美貌而闻名。败给寻父途中的关索后与妹妹王桃一同嫁给关索。在四川境内也有流传三人一同守关的传说。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王嗣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王嗣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王嗣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "承宗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王嗣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王嗣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "举孝廉，为汶山太守，加安远将军。与羌、胡实行友好政策，蜀北境安宁。后随姜维北征，中流矢卒。羌、胡号呼涕泣为之送葬，与其子弟亲如骨肉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石韬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "石韬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石韬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "广元"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石韬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石韬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "韬与同郡徐庶相亲爱。初平中，中州兵起，韬乃与庶南客荆州，到，又与诸葛亮特相善。及荆州内附，亮与刘备相随去，韬与庶俱来北。至黄初中，韬仕历郡守、典农校尉。逮大和中，诸葛亮出陇右，闻韬、庶仕财如此，叹曰：“魏殊多士邪！何彼二人不见用乎？”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石韬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "与诸葛亮、崔州平、孟公威、徐元直为友。刘备二顾茅庐，韬与孟公威凭桌对饮，备欲请二人同往卧龙庄上一谈。韬以己等皆山野慵懒之徒，不省治国安民之事，不劳下问。请备自上马，寻访诸葛亮。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李衡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李衡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末入吴为武昌庶民。孙权时，校事吕壹弄权，大臣共荐衡为郎，孙权引见，衡口陈吕壹奸短。及吕壹被诛，衡破格擢升。建兴初，为执政大将军诸葛恪的司马，理府事；使蜀说姜维同举兵北伐。建兴二年（253），诸葛恪被杀，衡求为丹阳太守。时孙休在郡治..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢道荣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邢道荣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢道荣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "邢道榮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢道荣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢道荣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邢道荣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "零陵太守上将。刘备攻零陵，太守刘度子贤以道荣力敌万人，可以抵对。两阵对圆，道荣出马，手使开山大斧，直取诸葛亮，为张飞接住。道荣轮大斧来迎，战不数合，气力不加，拨马便走，却为赵云拦住去路。道荣料敌不过，又无处奔走，只得下马请降。亮识其诈..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#干休> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "干休"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#干休> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "干休"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#干休> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#干休> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#干休> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙綝行废立事，以孙休为帝。休行至曲阿，有一老人，自称姓干，名休，叩头言曰：“事久必变，愿殿下速行。”休谢之。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱儁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱儁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱儁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公伟"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱儁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱儁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少孤，母尝贩缯为业。隽以孝养致名，为县门下书佐，好义轻财，乡闾敬之。本县长山阳度尚见而奇之，荐于太守韦毅，稍历郡职。后太守尹端以俊为主簿。后太守徐珪举隽孝廉，再迁除兰陵令，政有异能，为东海相所表。及黄巾起，公卿多荐隽有才略，拜为右中郎..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱儁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "黃巾反，引军讨伐之，屡立功绩，迁车骑将军，河南尹。及董卓卒，卓余党李傕、郭汜当政。后二贼乱政，掠夺公卿，隽哀汉衰微，归家病逝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅佥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "傅佥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅佥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "傅僉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅佥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅佥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "关中都督。章武二年，先主为吴破，父肜战死。佥初为左中郎，后为关中都督。景耀六年，魏伐蜀，钟会攻围汉、乐二城，遣别将进攻关口。佥临危授命，与蒋舒守。舒出关降魏胡烈军，烈乘机袭城，佥力战格斗而亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅佥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "大将军姜维在汉中，选川将两员，每日操练人马：一是蒋舒，一是傅佥。二人颇有胆勇，姜维甚爱之。景耀元年，傅佥随姜维北伐。献计取长城，姜维深然之。长城鏖兵，傅佥活捉魏将王真、简打李鹏。姜维屯田避祸，魏伐蜀，钟会兵发汉中，傅佥、蒋舒守阳平关。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯紞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "冯紞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯紞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "少胄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯紞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯紞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "冯紞年轻时博览经史典籍，有才学而擅於辩论。曾任魏郡太守、步兵校尉和越骑校尉。及後冯紞得到晋武帝司马炎的宠信，升任左卫将军。因为冯紞特意讨好司马炎，令司马炎极为宠信，而其他司马炎宠臣如贾充和荀顗都亲近他，组成一个朋党。泰始七年（271年..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯紞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "羊祜上表伐吴，司马炎观表，大喜，便令兴师。贾充、荀顗、冯紞三人，力言不可，炎因此不行。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程奂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "程奂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程奂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "程奂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程奂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程奂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "韩馥从事。馥遣都督从事奂、赵浮将强弩万张屯河阳。奂等闻馥欲以冀州与袁绍，自孟津驰东下。时绍尚在朝歌清水口，奂等从后来，船数百艘，众万馀人，整兵鼓夜过绍营，绍甚恶之。奂等到，劝谏馥以兵拒绍，不为所采。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵娥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵娥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵娥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "趙娥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵娥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵娥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "赵安之长女。庞子夏之妻。庞淯之母。烈女庞娥亲者，表氏庞子夏之妻，禄福赵君安之女也。君安为同县李寿所杀，娥亲有男弟三人，皆欲报仇，寿深以为备。会遭灾疫，三人皆死。寿闻大喜，防备懈弛。娥亲子淯出行，闻寿此言，还以启娥亲。娥亲既素有报仇之心..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周处> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周处"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周处> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子隐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周处> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周处> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父鲂，吴鄱阳太守。处少孤，未弱冠，膂力绝人，好驰骋田猎，不修细行，纵情肆欲，州曲患之。父老以南山白额猛兽，长桥下蛟，并处为三害。处往除二害，人谓死，皆相庆贺。反，闻乡里相庆，始知人患己之甚，乃入吴寻二陆。处遂励志好学，有文思，志存义烈..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡邕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蔡邕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡邕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯喈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡邕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡邕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "性笃孝，少博学多闻，好辞章、数术、天文，妙操音律。建宁三年，辟司徒桥玄府，玄甚敬待之。召拜郎中，校书东观。迁议郎。熹平四年，奏求正定《六经》文字。灵帝时因上书论朝政阙失，遭到诬陷，流放朔方。中平六年，灵帝崩，董卓为司空，闻邕名高，辟之..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡邕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "后汉侍郎。因上书十常侍乱政而削职回乡。因董卓赏识其才能，不得已而为董卓效力，卓待之甚厚，一月三迁其官。卓亡，被王允认为是董卓一党，下狱杀之。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿武> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "耿武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文威"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "韩馥长史。馥欲举冀州以让袁绍，武、别驾闵纯、治中李历谏馥，不从，乃让绍。绍至，馥从事十人弃馥去，唯恐在后，独武、纯杖刀拒，兵不能禁，绍后令田丰杀此二人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "冀州牧韩馥长史。韩馥听信荀谌、辛评之言，欲让袁绍参与州事，耿武谏阻，不从。耿武叹曰：“冀州休矣！”于是弃职而去者三十余人。耿武与关纯伏于城外，以待袁绍。数日后，绍引兵至。耿武、关纯拔刀而出，欲刺杀绍。绍将颜良立斩耿武，文丑砍死关纯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛综> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "薛综"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛综> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "敬文"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛综> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛综> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少时避乱至交州，从刘熙学。士燮附孙权，召其为五官中郎将，除合浦、交阯太守。后从征至九真，还都守谒者仆射。迁尚书仆射。赤乌三年（240），徙选曹尚书。五年，为太子少傅，领选职如故。六年卒。综为当时名儒，著有诗赋难论数万言，集为《私载》，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛综> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "被孙权召请，辅佐孙权。曾舌战诸葛亮，说汉天数将终。曹公已有天下三分之二，人皆归心。刘豫州不识天时，强欲与争，正如以卵击石，安得不败乎？”被诸葛亮骂为无父无君之人,满面羞惭。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周仓> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周仓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周仓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元福"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周仓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周仓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚拟人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周仓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "关羽副将。初为黄巾张宝将，张宝死，同裴元绍啸聚卧牛山。仓两臂有千斤之力，多曾与元绍说关羽盛名，恨无门路相见。羽千里寻兄，先遇元绍，后见仓持枪乘马而来，仓自此相随。后元绍欲舵赵云马匹，为云所杀，仓为云连胜数次，身中三枪。仓随羽转战天下，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩当> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩当"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "义公"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "擅长弓马骑射，有过人的体力，得以跟随孙坚，四处征战，多次以身犯险，陷入敌阵擒敌兵将，被任命为别部司马。孙策东渡长江，韩当跟随孙策征讨丹阳、吴、会稽三郡，之后被任命为先登校尉。韩当跟随孙策征讨刘勋，又击破黄祖，又征讨鄱阳贼寇，被任命为乐..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "是东吴的开国老将，初随孙坚转战南北，后从孙策平定江东。扶佐孙权，多负勤劳。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盛勃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "盛勃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盛勃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "盛勃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盛勃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盛勃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾为行参军绥戎都尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盛勃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孔明受诏归府，唤诸将听令。其中之一就是绥军都尉盛勃。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李进> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李进"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李进> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李進"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李进> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李进> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "兴平元年（194），曹操与吕布相攻，粮尽各引去。吕布到乘氏，为进所败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛珪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "诸葛珪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛珪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "君贡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛珪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛珪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太山郡丞。诸葛亮之父，早卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛珪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "（徐）庶曰：“此人乃琅琊阳都人，复姓诸葛，名亮，字孔明，乃汉司隶校尉诸葛丰之后。其父名珪字子贡，为泰山郡丞，早卒。亮从其叔玄。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢雄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "谢雄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢雄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "謝雄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢雄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢雄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢雄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "随丞相亮北伐，时魏虎威将军、前部大先锋王双引军至，亮问谁可迎之，雄应声而出，亮与三千军去了。雄引军前行，正遇王双；战不三合，被双一刀劈死，蜀兵败走。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈氏[刘琦母]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈氏[刘琦母]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈氏[刘琦母]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈氏[刘琦母]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈氏[刘琦母]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘琦之母，正史无记载。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈氏[刘琦母]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "“蔡夫人隔屏听密语，刘皇叔跃马过檀溪”一章中刘表前妻陈氏所生长子琦，为人虽贤，而柔懦不足立事；后妻蔡氏所生少子琮，颇聪明。刘表欲废长立幼。刘备劝其不可，自古废长立幼，取乱之道。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王颀[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王颀[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王颀[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孔硕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王颀[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王颀[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任玄菟太守。正始六年（245），随毌丘俭征高句骊，过沃沮千有余里，至肃慎氏南界，刻石纪功。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王颀[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "天水太守。按照鄧艾的指示，參加討伐蜀國。綿竹關之戰中打敗蜀將諸葛瞻，攻陷綿竹城。蜀漢滅亡後，返回原任地天水郡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓朗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邓朗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄧朗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "邓艾长孙。初为丹水令，又迁定陵令。怀帝永嘉（307-313）中，迁新都太守，未之官，在襄阳失火，举家烧死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁双> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "梁双"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁双> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "梁雙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁双> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁双> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾起兵攻破州郡，后又与州郡和。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辟邪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "辟邪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辟邪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "辟邪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辟邪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辟邪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "宫廷使者。奉魏明帝令，常给司马宣王送诏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄逸> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "甄逸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄逸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "甄逸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄逸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄逸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏文帝甄皇后父。东汉末曾为上蔡令。生三男五女：长豫、次俨、次尧；长女姜、次脱、次道、次荣及甄后。明帝太和元年（227），追封外祖父为安城乡侯，谥敬候。四年又改封魏昌县侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[钟繇妾]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙氏[钟繇妾]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[钟繇妾]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[钟繇妾]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[钟繇妾]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏太傅钟繇妾。性好妒，能言善辩。常于钟繇前谗毁正妻张氏，然终不能得逞。后因在张氏怀孕时下药碗中，被钟繇逐出家门。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛宗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "毛宗"@zh .
