<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#毛宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "行相国永寿少府。曾为魏王曹丕使者奉书献汉献帝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王定> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王定"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王定"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王定> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾得玉印，文曰“（刘）虞为天子”。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张汎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张汎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张汎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張汎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张汎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张汎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张辽之兄。以辽功高，封列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐彬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "唐彬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐彬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "儒宗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐彬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐彬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少便弓马，好游猎，身长八尺，走及奔鹿，强力兼人。晚乃敦悦经史，尤明《易经》，随师受业，还家教授，恆数百人。初为郡门下掾，转主簿。刺史王沈集诸参佐，盛论距吴之策，以问九郡吏。彬与谯郡主张恽俱陈吴有可兼之势，沈善其对。又使彬难言吴未可伐者..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐彬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "晋广武将军。太康元年正月，晋攻吴，大都督杜预命彬浮江东下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔林> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "崔林"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔林> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "德儒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔林> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#崔林> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "崔琰从弟。少时晚成，宗族莫知，惟从兄琰异之。太祖定冀州，召除邬长，贫无车马，单步之官。太祖征壶关，擢为冀州主簿，徙署别驾、丞相掾属。魏国既建，稍迁御史中丞。文帝践阼，拜尚书，出为幽州刺史。在官一期，寇窃寝息；犹以不事上司，左迁河间太守..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文昭皇后> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "文昭皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文昭皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文昭皇後"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文昭皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文昭皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏文帝皇后，谥号“文昭甄皇后”。甄后从小就不喜欢戏耍而喜欢读书识字，知道做贤惠的女子就要认识历史来告诫自己的道理。兄长甄俨逝世，甄后悲痛不已，对待变成寡妇的二嫂十分谦敬，帮忙抚养亡兄的儿子，又劝谏母亲应该像爱女儿一样对待二嫂。甄后十多..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文昭皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "甄氏初期嫁与袁绍次子袁熙，袁熙带兵出外征战，留下甄氏独身照顾婆婆，袁氏败亡后，曹操之子曹丕见其美艳动人，便纳为己有。黄初年间，魏文帝曹丕新纳的宠妾郭后栽赃甄后，诬陷她埋木偶诅咒文帝。文帝曹丕大怒，将甄后赐死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯氏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "冯氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "馮氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "司隶校尉冯方之女，献帝初避乱扬州，袁术见而悦之，遂纳焉，甚爱幸。诸妇人害其宠，共绞杀之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司隶校尉冯方之女，被袁术立为后。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#法真> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "法真"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#法真> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "高卿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#法真> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#法真> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "法正祖父。有清节高名，屡不就官。友人郭正等美之，号曰玄德先生。年八十九卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#法真> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "在演义里是西川刘璋部属法正的父亲。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈造> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈造"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈造> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳造"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈造> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈造> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物。出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈造> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀相亮攻魏，造随大都督曹真迎之，为先锋。蜀因参军马谡失街亭而退兵，真闻之，急引兵追赶。山背后一声炮响，蜀兵漫山遍野而来：为首大将，乃是姜维、马岱。真大惊，急退军时，造已被马岱所斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨昂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨昂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊昂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张鲁将。马超叛，尽兼陇右之众，而张鲁又遣大将昂以助之，凡万余人，攻城。刺史、太守卒遣人请和，开城门迎超。超入，拘岳于冀，使昂杀刺史、太守。建安二十年，曹公西征鲁。七月，公至阳平。鲁使弟卫与昂等据阳平关，横山筑城十余里，攻之不能拔，乃引..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨昂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "建安二十年，曹公西征鲁，鲁遣弟卫、任、杨昂守阳平关。是夜，任等截曹军寨，大败夏侯渊、张郃。后曹公亲讨，任等仍大败之。后曹军诈退，昂欲乘势击之，任以曹公诡计苦谏，昂不从，追曹公冲入雾中，为渊、郃夹击，昂欲突阵而出，正撞着郃，两个交手，为..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊稠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "樊稠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊稠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "樊稠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊稠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊稠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "董卓被杀后，樊稠无所依附，于是伙同李傕、郭汜、张济等人攻向长安，击败吕布，杀死王允等人，占领长安，把持朝廷大权。后马腾与李傕有隙，相互攻打，樊稠同郭汜、李利等率军击败了马腾、韩遂军，樊稠追韩遂至陈仓，与韩遂交谈良久后罢兵，因此被李傕所..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊稠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "在诸侯联军伐董卓之际，跟随董卓、吕布等镇守虎牢关，董卓迁都长安之后，又同李傕、郭汜、张济一同镇守郿坞。董卓被杀后，樊稠等人逃往陕地，得不到赦免，于是采用贾诩之谋，纠集部队一起攻往长安，败吕布，杀王允，占领长安，把持朝政，又击败前来勤王..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马岱> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马岱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马岱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "馬岱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马岱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马岱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "马超从弟。随丞相诸葛亮伐魏。建兴十二年，亮薨。魏延反，长使杨仪遣岱追斩之。岱位至平北将军，进爵陈仓侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马岱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "平北将军、骠骑将军马超从弟。曹公假诏马腾入朝，从子岱随之。及腾并子被杀，岱乔装逃出。马超起兵，岱随之周旋。建安十九年，岱随超归先主。后主践阼，跟随丞相诸葛亮南征孟获和北伐曹魏，马岱久经沙场、多负辛劳，作战冷静而勇猛，深得诸葛亮信任。诸..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦朗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "秦朗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "乃吕布手下秦宜禄之子。因其母杜氏被曹操所纳，所以成为了曹操的养子，很得曹操的喜爱。在曹操、曹丕当政时游历各处，增长见识；明帝曹叡时为官，每车驾出入，朗常随从。朗曾带兵抵御边寇，有战功，明帝性多疑，喜发举，经常杀害犯了小错的人，秦朗不加..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦朗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "前将军，随司马懿迎战诸葛亮的北伐军，因魏将郑文诈降计被诸葛亮识破，将计就计，以致魏军大败；朗死于乱军中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沮鹄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "沮鹄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沮鹄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "沮鵠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沮鹄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沮鹄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁尚将。父授，袁绍监军、奋威将军。及绍亡，鹄为其子尚守邯郸。建安九年四月，曹公击鹄于邯郸，拔之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沮鹄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁尚将。父授，袁绍监军。鹄守邯郸，曹公将张辽出马，与鹄交锋。战不三合，鹄大败，辽从后追赶。两马相离不远，辽急取弓射之，应弦落马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘度> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘度"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉度"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀零陵太守。先主攻零陵，度献郡来降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘度> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "零陵太守。与前来进攻的刘备军对抗，命令其子刘贤和邢道荣迎战。因为刘贤败北而投降。后仍以太守身份受命留任。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯令女> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯令女"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯令女> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "夏侯令女"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯令女> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯令女> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "“烈女”。曹爽从弟文叔之妻、夏侯文宁之女。文叔早死，服阕，自以年少无子，恐家必嫁己，乃断发以为信。其后，家果欲嫁之，令女闻，即复以刀截两耳，居止常依爽。及爽被诛，曹氏尽死。令女叔父上书与曹氏绝婚，强迎令女归。时文宁为梁相，怜其少，执义..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯令女> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹爽从弟文叔之妻。早寡而无子，其父欲改嫁之，女截耳自誓。及爽被诛，其父复将嫁之，女又断去其鼻。其家惊惶，谓之曰：“人生世间，如轻尘栖弱草，何至自苦如此？且夫家又被司马氏诛戮已尽，守此欲谁为哉？”女泣曰：“吾闻‘仁者’不以盛衰改节，义者..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#檀敷> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "檀敷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#檀敷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文友"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#檀敷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#檀敷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与刘表、陈翔、范滂、孔昱、苑康、张俭、岑晊为八友。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#檀敷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中介绍江夏八俊时，提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏舒> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "魏舒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏舒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "阳元"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏舒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏舒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少孤，为外祖母家收养。年四十余，始仕为渑池长，迁浚仪令，入为尚书郎。因善射而为将军钟毓所重，转相国参军，封剧阳子。杂条小事，废兴大事，舒皆有出众之议。司马昭深器重之，以为人之领袖。历宜阳、荥阳二郡太守、散骑常侍、冀州刺史、尚书，皆有政..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程仲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "程仲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程仲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孔礼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程仲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程仲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "《魏书》记载：程仲有志行。明帝青龙三年征，不就。景初二年、正始五年征，又不就。晋武帝太始三年卒，封元乡亭侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢氏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卢氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "盧氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卢氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "卢毓女。嫁平原高唐人华廙为妻。华廙晋太康中为城门校尉，卢氏因称华城门夫人。得疾，经年不治。后有甲卒见卢毓言能治女疾。先用散药，后用丸药，寻有效。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张颍> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张颍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张颍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張潁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张颍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张颍> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "守合淝新城。青龙二年，孙权攻新城，颍等拒守力战，权退兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍三娘> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲍三娘"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍三娘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鮑三娘"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍三娘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍三娘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自花关索传。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹叡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹叡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹叡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元仲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹叡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹叡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹丕之子，小时候表现得很聪明，深受曹操喜爱。曹丕去世后，曹叡继位为帝，开始表现得很勤勉，指挥曹真、司马懿等人成功防御了吴、蜀的多次攻伐。但自蜀相诸葛亮去世之后，蜀国一时没有大规模的北伐行动，曹叡便放松下来，开始大修宫殿，消耗了大量人力..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹叡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中为曹睿。曹丕之子，于曹丕之后继位成为魏国皇帝。曹睿登基之初，便中蜀国马谡离间之计，怀疑司马懿谋反，将其免职，但不久面对蜀国的北伐强攻，不得不再次启用司马懿。在司马懿等人的努力下，魏国成功防御了吴、蜀的多次进攻。后诸葛亮病逝，天下..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张时> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张时"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张时> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張時"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张时> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张时> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安中为京兆尹。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏双> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苏双"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏双> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蘇雙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏双> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏双> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "商人。双、张世平等赀累千金，贩马周旋于涿郡，见刘备而异之，乃多与之金财。备由是得用合徒众。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏双> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "刘备、关羽、张飞三人结拜毕，来日收拾军器，但恨无马匹可乘。正思虑间，人报有两个客人，引一伙伴当，赶一群马，投庄上来。三人出庄迎接。乃双同张世平，每年往北贩马，近因寇发而回。备请二人到庄，置酒管待，诉说欲讨贼安民之意。二客大喜，愿将良马..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#应余> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "应余"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#应余> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子正"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#应余> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#应余> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝建安二十三年（218）为南阳郡功曹。十月，宛守将侯音等反。余与太守东里衮乘乱逃出，叛军追及，乱箭射衮，余遮衮，以身挡箭，衮免于难，余遇害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘翊> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘翊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘翊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子相"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘翊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘翊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "家世丰产，乐善好施，然守志卧疾，不谋仕宦。河南种拂为颍川太守，慕名仕为功曹。后举孝廉，不就。灵帝末，为汝南太守。献帝兴平元年（194）后，至长安朝见，遂迁陈留太守。东归途中，因济困扶危而饿死。《后汉书》有传。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#侯选> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "侯选"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#侯选> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "侯選"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#侯选> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#侯选> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "于兴平年间起兵作乱，有部众数千家。后侯选联合马超、韩遂、程银、李堪、张横、梁兴、成宜、马玩、杨秋共十部势力起兵反抗曹操，被击败，逃入汉中。曹操平定汉中后，侯选投降，被封官赐爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#侯选> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "韩遂手下八部兵马将领之一，跟随马超、韩遂一起兴兵雪恨，讨伐曹操。后马超中曹操离间计，与韩遂火并。侯选等五将步战围攻马超，不能取胜，被马超砍死二人，侯选逃窜，投降于曹操，被封为列侯，守渭口。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈兰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈兰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳蘭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "反贼。初从袁术，术前为吕布所破，后为曹公所败，奔其部曲兰、雷薄于灊山，复为所拒。及术败，兰、雷绪、梅成等聚众数万在江、淮间，郡县残破。建安十四年，兰及成以氐六县叛，曹公遣于禁、臧霸等讨成，张辽督张郃、牛盖等讨兰。成举众三千余人伪降禁，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初为袁术上将，术攻徐州，兰随之。及术称帝，以兰为副将，取碣石。后术奢侈太过，兰、雷薄皆投嵩山去了。术兵败，又被兰、薄劫去钱粮草料。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关靖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "关靖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关靖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "士起"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关靖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关靖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "公孙瓒长史。建安四年，绍悉军围瓒。瓒遣子求救于黑山贼，复欲自将突骑直出，傍西南山，拥黑山之众，陆梁冀州，横断绍后。靖说瓒曰：“今将军将士，皆已土崩瓦解，其所以能相守持者，顾恋其居处老小，以将军为主耳。将军坚守旷日，袁绍要当自退；自退之..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#单经> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "单经"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#单经> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "單經"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#单经> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#单经> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "公孙瓒置兖州刺史。瓒进军界桥，以经为兖州、严纲为冀州，田楷为青州。后袁术与袁绍有隙，术求援於瓒，瓒使经屯平原，刘备屯高唐，陶谦屯发干，以逼绍。曹公与绍会击，皆破之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石苞> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "石苞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石苞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲容"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石苞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石苞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏明帝青龙中，贩铁于长安，得见司马懿，任为尚书郎，历青州刺史、镇东将军，封东光侯。司马炎代魏建立晋朝，迁大司马，进封乐浪郡公，加侍中。泰始八年（272）卒，谥日武。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石苞> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "讨伐发动叛乱的诸葛诞时，率领伏兵表现活跃。后来被晋主司马炎封为骠骑将军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨氏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "马超之妻。建安十六年，超攻凉州，破历城。超杀凉州刺史韦康，统兵校尉赵昂等结谋，借口为康报仇，欲举兵诛超。超妻杨氏闻昂妻王异节行，请与宴终日。异欲信昂于超以济其谋，谓杨曰：“昔管仲入齐，立九合之功；由余適秦，穆公成霸。方今社稷初定，治乱..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "建安十六年，超攻凉州，破历城，杀刺史韦康家。参军杨阜等诈降，后反，将超妻杨氏从城上一刀砍了，撇下尸首来；又将马超幼子三人，并至亲十余口，都从城上一刀一个，剁将下来。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨厚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨厚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨厚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲桓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨厚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨厚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "博通经术，弟子有董扶、任安、周群。安帝时与黄琼俱公车征。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦松> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "秦松"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文表"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙策谋士。后事孙权。赤壁大战前与张昭共为计议，犹豫不决。早卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙河> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙河"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙河> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯海"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙河> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙河> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "本姓俞，孙策赐姓孙。一说孙河为孙坚族子，随姑俞氏为姓，后复姓孙。河质性忠直，讷言敏行，有气干，能服勤。少从坚征讨，常为前驱，后领左右兵，典知内事，待以腹心之任。孙策爱之，赐姓为孙，列之属籍。坚卒，策与河、吕范依策舅吴景，合众共讨泾县山..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙河> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "桓字叔武，其父名河，本姓俞氏；孙策爱之，赐姓孙，因此亦系吴王宗族。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭脱> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "彭脱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭脱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彭脱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭脱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭脱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄巾渠帅。汉将皇甫嵩、朱隽乘胜进讨汝南、陈国黄巾，追波才于阳翟，击脱于西华，并破之。余贼降散，三郡悉平。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩胤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩胤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "韓胤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "术欲结吕布为援，乃为子索布女，布许之。术遣使韩胤以僭号议告布，并求迎妇。沛相陈珪恐术、布成婚，则徐、扬合从，将为国难，於是往说布。布亦怨术初不己受也，女已在涂，追还绝婚，械送韩胤，枭首许市。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩胤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁术欲使吕布擒刘备，具粟二十万斛，令韩胤赍密书往见布。布喜，重待胤，胤回告袁术。后袁术遣胤为媒，赍礼物往徐州求亲，布应允。袁术即备聘礼，仍令胤送至徐州。次日，陈宫往馆驿内拜望韩胤，道破和亲内幕，并愿与之同谋促布速嫁女，布从之。时陈元龙..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁纲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "梁纲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁纲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "梁綱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁纲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁纲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安二年，术称帝於淮南。秋九月，术侵陈，曹公东征之。术闻公自来，弃军走，留其将纲、乐就、桥蕤、李丰。公到，击破就等，皆斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁纲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "建安二年，术称帝於淮南。术起兵功曹公，术自引军三万，使纲、乐就、李丰为催进使，接应七路之兵。后术用纲、乐就、陈纪、李丰四人分兵十万，坚守寿春。及城破，就等受擒，公令皆斩于市。演义中为梁刚。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司蕃> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司蕃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司蕃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "司蕃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司蕃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司蕃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "门候司蕃，故范举吏也，范呼之，举手中版以示之，矫曰：“有诏召我，卿促开门！”蕃欲求见诏书，范呵之，言“卿非我故吏邪，何以敢尔？”乃开之。范出城，顾谓蕃曰：“太傅图逆，卿从我去！”蕃徒行不能及，遂避侧。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司蕃> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "懿恐桓范亦走，急令人召之。范与其子商议。其子曰：“车驾在外，不如南出。”范从其言，乃上马至平昌门。城门已闭，把门将乃桓范旧吏司蕃也。范袖中取出一竹版曰：“太后有诏，可即开门。”司蕃曰：“请诏验之。”范叱曰：“汝是吾故吏，何敢如此！”蕃..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#俞涉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "俞涉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#俞涉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "俞涉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#俞涉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#俞涉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#俞涉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "时董卓专权，诸侯讨之。军至汜水关，卓将华雄引铁骑下关，来寨前大骂搦战。”袁绍曰：“谁敢去战？”袁术背后转出骁俞涉曰：“小将愿往。”绍喜，便著俞涉出马。即时报来：“俞涉与华雄战不三合，被华雄斩了。”众大惊。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳甫> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "柳甫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳甫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "柳甫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳甫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳甫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "朝廷闻师遇雨，咸请召还。天子曰：“司马公临危制变，计日擒之矣。”既而雨止，遂合围。起土山地道，楯橹钩橦，发矢石雨下，昼夜攻之。时有长星，色白，有芒鬣，自襄平城西南流于东北，坠于梁水，城中震慑。文懿大惧，乃使其所署相国王建、御史大夫柳甫..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳甫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司马懿伐公孙渊，渊令其与相国王建往魏寨请降。懿不许，将二人斩之。首级付与从人，令其回报公孙渊。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高干> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "高干"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元才"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁绍之甥，曾与荀谌游说韩馥，使袁绍领冀州牧。河北平定，袁绍以高干为并州刺史，并其三子各领一州。官渡之战，高干在西线配合，因曹军早有准备而无进展。袁绍病死，袁谭、袁尚与曹操大战，遣高干、郭援略取平阳，被钟繇率关中诸将所败，郭援被斩。袁尚..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "高干乃是袁绍外甥。袁绍官渡战败，高干引兵至冀州助战，袁军再败仓亭，高干也被箭伤，仍回并州，收拾人马。曹操击溃汝南刘备，回师河北，高干复至黎阳参战，然屡战屡败。后高干回并州，曹操遣乐进、李典和张燕攻之而不能下，遂自勒兵前往，遣吕旷、吕翔..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟仁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孟仁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟仁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "恭武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟仁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟仁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "本名宗，避孙皓字而改仁。吴司空。少孤、母老病笃。多月思笋煮羹食。宗无计可得。乃往竹林中。抱竹而泣。孝感天地。须臾地裂。出笋数茎。归持。作羹奉母。食毕疾愈。从南阳李肃学，宗日夜不懈，肃甚奇之，以宗有丞相之器。后为骠骑将军朱据军吏，置母营..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟仁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "永安元年冬十二月，孙綝遣中书郎孟宗，拨与中营所管精兵一万五千，出屯武昌。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅婴> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "傅婴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅婴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "傅嬰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅婴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅婴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴牙门将。与孙高、徐元同为丹阳太守孙翊亲近旧将。为初，吴主权杀吴郡太守盛宪，宪故孝廉妫览、戴员亡匿山中，权弟翊为丹杨，皆礼致之。览、员亲近边洪等，数为翊所困，常欲叛逆，因吴主出征，遂其奸计。洪杀翊，翊妻徐氏购募追捕，中宿乃得，览、员归..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅婴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "与孙高同为丹阳太守孙翊旧将。丹阳督将妫览、郡丞戴员二人与孙翊从人边洪结为心腹，共谋杀翊。妫览贪翊妻徐氏美色，欲纳之。徐氏乃与傅婴、孙高密谋杀之报仇。至晦日，徐氏先召婴、高二人，伏于密室帏幕之中，然后设祭于堂上。祭毕，即除去孝服，沐浴薰..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴班> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴班"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴班> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元雄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴班> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴班> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父匡，汉大将军何进官属。以豪侠称，官位常与壹相亚。先主时，为领军。初，先主忿孙权之袭关羽，将东征，秋七月，遂帅诸军伐吴。孙权遣书请和，先主盛怒不许，吴将陆议、李异、刘阿等屯巫、秭归；将军吴班、冯习自巫攻破异等，军次秭归，武陵五溪蛮夷遣..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴班> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初属车骑将军张飞部，飞为张达、范疆所杀后，命其子苞前往成都告先主。及先主讨吴，班为先锋，于夷陵围孙桓。后从丞相亮北伐，为魏将张虎、乐琳射杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈横> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈横"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈横> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳橫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈横> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈横> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈横> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "扬州刺史刘繇的部将。与薛礼、张英一起守卫秣陵（建业），后来被前来进攻的孙策麾下大将蒋钦射杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞涣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庞涣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞涣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "世文"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞涣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞涣> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "庞德公子。晋武帝太康中任牂牁太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟毓> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "钟毓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟毓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "稚叔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟毓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟毓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "钟繇子，年十四为散骑侍郎。魏明帝太和初，迁黄门侍郎。曾上疏罢役兴农。齐王芳正始中，为散骑常侍。后失曹爽意，徒侍中，出为魏郡太守。爽被诛，入为御史中丞、侍中廷尉。高贵乡公正元中，为尚书。后为青州刺史，加后将军，迁都督徐州军事，假节。又转..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟毓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "繇尝率二子见文帝，会时年七岁，其兄毓，年八岁。毓见帝惶惧，汗流满面。帝问毓曰：‘卿何以汗？’毓对曰：‘战战惶惶，汗出如浆。’"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王乂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王乂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王乂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王乂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王乂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王乂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "官至平北将军。魏幽州刺史王雄子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘璋> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "潘璋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘璋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文珪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘璋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘璋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "年轻时家贫，跟随孙权后得到其赏识，加上其作战勇猛，不断升迁，其一生为孙权东征西讨，在合肥战役、追擒关羽、夷陵之战、江陵保卫战中多次立下战功。但其为人奢侈贪财。经常设立军市，又劫杀将士以获得财物，但孙权念其有功未予深究。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘璋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙策死后，孙权广纳贤士，东郡人潘璋也来投奔，征讨黄祖时，潘璋生擒苏飞。赤壁之战时，潘璋领三千兵接应董袭，从江中攻击曹操。刘备完婚逃离东吴时，孙权令潘璋、陈武带五百精兵追赶，但为孙夫人所拒。后孙权偷袭荆州，潘璋跟随吕蒙奇袭烽火台。后来于..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白寿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "白寿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白寿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "白壽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白寿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白寿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "诸葛亮《后出师表》中提到此人。原文：自臣（诸葛亮）到汉中，中间期年耳，然丧赵云、阳群、马玉、阎芝、丁立、白寿、刘郃、邓铜等及曲长屯将七十馀人。由于后出师表是否为诸葛亮所写存在争议，故文中所提人名是否真实，也有待考证。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白寿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "诸葛亮《后出师表》中提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶丘洪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陶丘洪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶丘洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陶丘洪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶丘洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陶丘洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "有名于世，以俊秀为后进冠盖。同郡陶丘洪亦知名，自以明见过歆。时王芬与豪杰谋废灵帝。语在武纪。芬阴呼歆、洪共定计，洪欲行，歆止之曰：“夫废立大事，伊、霍之所难。芬性疏而不武，此必无成，而祸将及族。子其无往！”洪从歆言而止。后芬果败，洪乃..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐咨> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "唐咨"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐咨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "唐咨"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐咨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐咨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初在魏，黄初中，利城郡反，杀太守徐箕，推咨为主。文帝遣诸军讨破之，咨走入海，遂亡至吴，官至左将军，封侯、持节。建兴元年，魏将胡遵、诸葛诞等率众七万欲攻围两坞，图坏堤遏。恪兴军四万，晨夜赴救。诸葛恪遣将军咨、留赞、吕据、丁奉为前部，大胜..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#唐咨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "太平二年，魏将诸葛诞据寿春来降，孙峻遣大将全怿、全端为主将，于诠为合后，朱异、唐咨为先锋，文钦为向导，起兵七万，分三队而进。后兵败，咨降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周慎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周慎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周慎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "周慎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周慎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周慎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "灵帝时为荡寇将军。中平元年（184），与董卓西讨北宫伯玉及边章、韩遂，破美阳。慎不用孙坚之计，反被章、遂断其运道，弃车重而败退。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩德> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩德"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩德> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "韓德"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩德> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩德> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩德> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西凉大将，善使开山大斧，有万夫不当之勇，引西羌诸路兵八万到来助夏侯楙,被命为先锋。有四子,长子韩英,次子韩瑶,三子韩琼,四子韩琪,都有万夫不当之勇.五人战赵云,四子皆战亡。 后德怒与赵云单挑，战不三合被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹彦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹彦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹彥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏散骑常侍侍讲。父真，大司马。真薨，封真五子皆为列侯。兄爽当权，封彦散骑常侍侍讲。正始十年，司马懿免爽兄弟权，以侯还第。后皆伏诛，夷三族。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹彦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏散骑常侍。父真，大司马。真薨，兄爽当权，封彦散骑常侍。正始十年，爽兄弟等及御林军，随魏主芳，出城谒明帝墓，就去畋猎。司马懿就夺其劝，后皆伏诛，夷三族。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关兴> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "关兴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "安国"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "关羽次子，于羽死后袭爵。少有令问，丞相诸葛亮深器异之。弱冠为侍中、中监军，数岁卒。子统嗣。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "诸葛亮的帐前左护卫使、龙骧将军，关羽的次子。关兴原随父在荆州，水淹七军后，关兴前往汉中报喜。后荆州失陷，关羽被杀。关兴与张飞子张苞拜为弟兄，随刘备伐吴，杀吴将潘璋，夺回青龙堰月刀。后随诸葛亮北伐，屡立战功，于六出祁山前病亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华歆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "华歆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华歆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子鱼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华歆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华歆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉灵帝末举孝廉，除郎中，献帝初为尚书郎。诏拜豫章太守，为政清静不烦，吏民感而爱之。孙策略地江东，歆幅巾奉迎，策执子弟之礼，礼为上宾。每策大会，歆能剧饮，至石余不乱，众人微察，常以其齐整衣冠为异，江南号之曰“华独坐”。建安五年（200）..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华歆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "华歆原效力江南，后奉诏归属曹操。华歆囚禁伏皇后、鸠杀皇子，逼迫献帝禅让、鼓动曹丕篡汉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文武> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "文武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "文聘养子文休之子。嗣列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#费瑶> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "费瑶"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#费瑶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "費瑶"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#费瑶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#费瑶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太和二年（228），蜀诸葛亮出祁山伐魏，瑶与张郃破其前锋。四年（230），为后将军，蜀魏延西入羌中，瑶与雍州刺史郭淮同延战于阳溪，为延所破。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#申仪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "申仪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#申仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "申儀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#申仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#申仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "申耽之弟。初在西平、上庸间聚众数千家，后与张鲁通，又遣使降太祖。至建安末，为蜀所攻，以其郡西属。封建信将军、西城太守。后申仪与兄申耽判刘封。黄初中，仪复来还，诏即以兄故号加仪，因拜魏兴太守，封真乡侯，屯洵口。太和中，仪与孟达不和，数上..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#申仪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "同孟达降魏，任金城太守。达欲归蜀，与兄密告司马懿，灭达。后随懿征进，困马谡并汲水道，大胜蜀军。后与耽守列柳城。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张勋> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张勋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張勛"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "术称帝，为大将军。孙策投袁术，桥蕤、勋皆倾心敬焉。建安二年，术僭号，乃遣使以窃号告吕布，并为子娉布女。布执术使送许。术大怒，遣其将勋、桥蕤攻布，大败而还。曹操征术，术闻大骇，即走度淮，留张勋、桥蕤于蕲阳，以拒操。操击破斩蕤，共击勋等于..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁术称帝后，被封为大将军。统帅二十万大军与吕布军交战，但是大败而回。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蹋顿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蹋顿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蹋顿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蹋頓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蹋顿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蹋顿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末乌丸首领。有武略。初平中，单于丘力居死，子楼班年少，从子蹋顿有武略，代立，总摄三部，众皆从其号令。建安初，冀州牧袁绍与前将军公孙瓒相持不决，蹋顿遣使诣绍求和亲，遂遣兵助击瓒，破之。绍矫制赐蹋顿、难楼、苏仆延、乌延等，皆以单于印绶..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蹋顿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "三国演义中，将蹋顿误记为冒顿。冀州牧袁绍子熙、尚败走投蹋顿。建安十二年，曹公讨之，令张辽引许褚、于禁、徐晃分四路下山，奋力急攻，蹋顿大乱。辽拍马斩蹋顿于马下，余众皆降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全静> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "全静"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全静> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "全靜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全静> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全静> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "全琮之孙，全绪之子。原本为吴将领。太平二年（257），随全怿、全端率兵救援寿春受困的魏叛将诸葛诞，后与全怿等委城降魏，受魏官爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓当> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邓当"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄧當"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓当> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吕蒙的姐夫。吕蒙少时，南渡长江，依附邓当。时邓当为孙策的部将，数次征伐山越。吕蒙年仅十五、六岁，也私自随邓当作战。后为邓当发现，大惊，厉声喝叱也无法阻止。作战归来，邓当将此事告吕母。吕母生气，欲责罚吕蒙，吕蒙说：“贫贱难可居，脱误有功..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘壹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘壹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘壹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉壹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘壹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘壹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末官吏。献帝时，为豫章太守华歆功曹。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白绕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "白绕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白绕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "白繞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白绕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白绕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末年的黑山贼。初平二年（191年），黑山贼白绕、于毒、眭固等，十馀万众略魏郡、东郡，东郡太守王肱不能御，曹操引兵入东郡，击白绕于濮阳，破之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#敬哀皇后> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "敬哀皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#敬哀皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "敬哀皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#敬哀皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#敬哀皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘禅的皇后。车骑将军张飞的长女。章武元年（221）纳为太子妃。建兴元年（223）立为皇后，十五年薨，葬南陵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#敬哀皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "父飞，车骑将军。甚贤，年十七岁，丞相亮上言后主纳为正宫皇后。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伯乐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "伯乐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伯乐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯樂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伯乐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伯乐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "春秋秦穆公时人，本名孙阳，善相马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伯乐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "春秋秦穆公时人，本名孙阳，善相马。演义中有提及此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周朝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周朝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周朝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "周朝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周朝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周朝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "反贼。长沙贼区星自称将军，众万馀人，攻围城邑。朝、郭石亦帅徒众起於零、桂，与星相应。长沙太守孙坚遂越境寻讨，三郡肃然。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙鲁班> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙鲁班"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙鲁班> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "大虎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙鲁班> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙鲁班> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴公主。为吴大帝长女，鲁班前配周瑜子循，后配全琮。与太子不睦，鲁班尝谮太子和子母。大帝将立王夫人为后，而鲁班素憎夫人，稍稍谮毁。及权寝疾，言有喜色，由是权深责怒，以忧死。帝亮时，朱据二子熊、损各复领兵，为鲁班所谮，皆死。丞相、大将军孙..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙鲁班> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "太子和因与公主不睦，被公主所谮，权废之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞松> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "虞松"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔茂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "九江太守边让外孙。弱冠有才，从司马宣王征辽东，宣王命作檄，及破贼，作露布。宣王辟为掾，时年二十四，迁中书郎，遂至太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "恪令兵四面围定。早有流星马报入洛阳。主簿虞松告司马师曰：“今诸葛恪围新城，且未可与战。吴兵远来，人多粮少，粮尽自走矣。待其将走，然后击之，必得全胜。但恐蜀兵犯境，不可不防。”师然其言，遂令司马昭引一军助郭淮防姜维，毌丘俭、胡遵拒住吴兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹华> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹华"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹华> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹華"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹华> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹华> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹公第三女。献帝建安十八年（213），与姊宪、节同被汉献帝聘为夫人。次年，拜为贵人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛绪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "诸葛绪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "諸葛緒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴大将军孙峻等号十万众，将渡江，镇东将军诸葛诞遣艾据肥阳，艾以与贼势相远，非要害之地，辄移屯附亭，遣泰山太守诸葛绪等于黎浆拒战，遂走之。后绪入晋为太常崇礼卫尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#诸葛绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中情节基本同史，仕魏历太山太守、雍州刺史。曾参与灭蜀之战，其间被钟会诬陷而收其军队。入晋为太常、卫尉等官。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雷薄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "雷薄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雷薄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "雷薄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雷薄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雷薄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末袁术部将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雷薄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁术麾下大将。离开称帝后昏庸奢侈的袁术，与陈兰一起占据嵩山为山贼。后来袭击兵败的袁术，抢夺财宝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫瓘> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卫瓘"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫瓘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯玉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫瓘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫瓘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "卫凯之子。魏末为监军随钟会、邓艾伐蜀。蜀灭，处二强之中，无兵无粮的他计收邓艾父子，智除手握重兵有心害己的钟会，姜维。不过，因事后他在明知邓艾无辜的情况下，为专平蜀之功和防止邓艾报复竟追杀之而为人诟病。后为晋重臣，因忠心晋室而得罪贾南风..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫瓘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "邓艾父子居功自傲，卫瓘曾用计杀死邓艾父子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹冏[曹叡子]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹冏[曹叡子]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹冏[曹叡子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹冏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹冏[曹叡子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹冏[曹叡子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "明帝之子。明帝即位，立为清河王。当年卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阳虎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阳虎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阳虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陽虎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阳虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阳虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "姬姓，季孙氏家臣。他以季孙家臣之身，毫无雄厚家底与政治背景，却能够跻身鲁国卿大夫行列，从而指挥三桓，执政鲁国，开鲁国“陪臣执国政”的先河。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阳虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "春秋时期鲁国人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#施朔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "施朔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#施朔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "施朔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#施朔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#施朔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "朔告“綝欲反有徵”。景帝密问张布，布与丁奉谋于会杀綝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#施朔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙綝专权，景帝与老将丁奉谋诛之。后奉、朔、魏邈等，擒孙綝兄弟至，休命尽斩于市。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严纲[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "严纲[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严纲[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "嚴綱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严纲[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严纲[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "公孙瓒部属公孙瓒以纲为冀州，田楷为青州，单经为兗州，置诸郡县。永汉二年冬，瓒与袁绍战，绍军广川，令将麹义先登与瓒战，瓒轻其兵少，纵骑腾之，义兵伏楯下，一时同发，瓒军大败，斩纲，获甲首千余级。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严纲[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "瓒与袁绍战于界桥，瓒遣为先锋。绍将麹义令弓手皆伏于遮箭牌下，只听炮响发箭。纲鼓噪呐喊，直取义。义军见纲兵来，都伏而不动；直到来得至近，一声炮响，八百弓弩手一齐俱发。纲急待回，被义拍马舞刀，斩于马下，瓒军大败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#淳于导> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "淳于导"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#淳于导> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "淳于導"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#淳于导> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#淳于导> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#淳于导> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "属曹仁，在长阪坡拿住麋竺，正要解去献功，为赵云发现，一枪刺死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈毖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈毖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈毖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陳毖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈毖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈毖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴国人。五凤二年（255），聚集山民起义，为陆凱所斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关宁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "关宁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关宁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "關寧"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关宁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关宁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关宁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "关定长子、关平之兄。自幼学文，关羽出古城寻兄，至此投宿，关定命二子出见。后次子关平拜关羽为父，随羽从征。关宁留家中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[全尚妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙氏[全尚妻]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[全尚妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[全尚妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[全尚妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时吴大臣孙峻姐。全尚妻。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[全尚妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "三国时吴大臣孙峻姐。全尚妻。三国演义中有提及此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白居易> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "白居易"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白居易> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "乐天"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白居易> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白居易> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "号香山居士，祖籍山西太原。晚年曾官至太子少傅。到了其曾祖父时，又迁居下邽（音guī）（今陕西渭南北）。与李白、杜甫并称“李杜白”。现实派诗人，作品影响极大。重要的诗歌有《长恨歌》、《琵琶行》等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#白居易> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "唐朝著名诗人。三国演义写诸葛亮病死五丈原，引用了他的诗词。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹亮> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹亮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹亮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹亮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹亮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹亮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "平乐乡侯曹演子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹彪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹彪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹彪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "朱虎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹彪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹彪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操之子。建安二十一年（216），封寿春侯。黄初二年（221），进爵，徙封汝阳公。三年，封弋阳王。其年徙封吴王。五年，改封寿春县。七年，徙封白马。太和六年（232），改封楚。嘉平元年（249），兖州刺史令孤愚与太尉王凌谋迎彪都许昌。谋..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜预> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜预"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜预> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元凯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜预> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜预> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "出身在忠于曹魏政权的官宦世家，从小博学多通，但由于司马氏的专政和排挤使杜预受到牵连，年过三十仍未出仕。司马昭执政后杜预渐受重用，先后参与了伐蜀和《晋律》的修订。晋代魏后，杜预多次被晋武帝启用出镇边关，在任期间杜预提出了五十多项安边兴国..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜预> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "为人老成，好学不倦，最喜读左氏《春秋传》，时人谓之《左传》癖。在羊祜临终前被举荐，晋主司马炎遂拜预为镇南大将军都督荆州事。不久杜预同王濬等人上表伐吴，晋主下决心出兵，杜预被命为大都督，引兵十万出江陵。在之后的战斗中夜袭乐乡，计取江陵，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张苞[蜀]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张苞[蜀]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张苞[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張苞"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张苞[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张苞[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张飞的长子，早夭。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张苞[蜀]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "三国演义第81回登场。张飞被杀后，张苞与关羽之子关兴结拜为兄弟，一起随刘备伐吴，手持蛇矛，作战勇猛。张苞后随诸葛亮北伐，屡立战功，于诸葛亮第三次北伐之际不慎跌落山下，头部受伤，被送回成都养病，后不治而亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周鲂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周鲂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周鲂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子鱼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周鲂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周鲂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父宾，为咨议参军。少好学，举孝廉，为宁国长，转在怀安。钱唐大帅彭式等蚁聚为寇，以鲂为钱唐侯相，旬月之间，斩式首及其支党，迁丹杨西部都尉。黄武中，鄱阳大帅彭绮作乱，攻没属城，乃以鲂为鄱阳太守，与胡综戮力攻讨，遂生禽绮，送诣武昌，加昭义校..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周鲂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "谲挑魏大司马扬州牧曹休，暗陈七事相约攻吴。休疑，鲂割发置地，休遂不疑。鲂诱休至石亭，自隐去。陆逊谴诸将杀出，大胜之。逊闻胜大喜，即同太守周鲂并诸将班师还吴。权见周鲂无发，慰劳曰：“卿断发成此大事，功名当书于竹帛也。”即封周鲂为关内侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿纪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "耿纪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季行"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉少府。少有美名，为丞相掾，曹公甚敬异之，迁侍中，守少府。建安二十三年春正月甲子，纪同丞相司直韦晃、汉太医令吉本等起兵谋诛曹公，攻许，烧丞相长史王必营。必等收纪、晃等，将斩之，纪呼公名曰：“恨吾不自生意，竟为群兒所误耳！”夷三族。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "洛阳人。旧为丞相府掾，后迁侍中少府，与司直韦晃甚厚。见曹操进封王爵，出入用天子车服，心甚不平。建安二十三年春正月，纪与晃、金祎、太医吉平二子五人密议讨曹操。正月十五日夜间，城中大张灯火，庆赏元宵。耿纪等烧丞相长史王必营，于城内四下放火..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管宁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "管宁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管宁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "幼安"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管宁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管宁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "管仲后人，与平原华歆、同县邴原号为一龙，宁为龙头。当时的名士，后因厌恶华歆为人而传有割席而坐的佳话。一生讲学，居辽东。三国时，魏国多次征召，委以太中大夫、太尉、光禄勋等重职，宁固辞不受。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管宁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "管宁与华歆、邴原友善。见华歆爱慕荣华，遂鄙歆之为人，割席分坐，不复与之为友。后避居辽东，终身不肯仕魏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁淑> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲁淑"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁淑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "魯淑"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁淑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁淑> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "鲁肃之子。吴昭武将军、夏口督。吴横江将军、鲁肃遗腹子。淑既壮，濡须督张承谓终当到至。永安中，为昭武将军、都亭侯、武昌督。建衡中，假节，迁夏口督。所在严整，有方干。凤皇三年卒。子睦袭爵，领兵马。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢旌> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "谢旌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢旌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "謝旌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢旌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢旌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安二十四年，陆逊遣将军旌、李异等将三千人，攻蜀将詹晏、陈凤。异将水军，旌将步兵，断绝险要，即破晏等，生降得凤。又攻房陵太守邓辅、南乡太守郭睦，大破之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢旌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "旌、李异有万夫不当之勇，属武卫都尉孙桓。蜀主备攻吴，旌、李异随桓迎之。两军相遇，蜀将张苞直取桓，旌，骤马来迎。两将战有三十余合，旌败走。次日，桓又引军来，苞奋勇当先，杀入吴军，正遇旌，为苞一矛刺死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#怀嬴> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "怀嬴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#怀嬴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "懷嬴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#怀嬴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#怀嬴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "秦穆公的小女儿。开始的时候晋怀公（晋惠公的儿子）在秦国当人质，秦穆公就把小女儿嫁给了他，史称怀嬴，后来晋惠公病危的时候，晋怀公偷偷跑了，回到晋国做了国君，秦穆公很生气。后来重耳（晋文公）流落到秦国，秦穆公就把怀嬴嫁给了重耳，后来重耳做..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#怀嬴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "秦穆公之女。演义中，法正在劝说刘备纳吴夫人时，有提及此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楼玄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "楼玄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楼玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "承先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楼玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楼玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "骑中常侍、会稽太守、大司农、宫下镇禁中候。景帝时为监农御史。帝皓即位，与王蕃、郭逴、万彧俱为散骑中常侍，出为会稽太守，入为大司农。旧禁中主者自用亲近人作之，彧陈亲密近识，宜用好人，皓因敕有司，求忠清之士，以应其选，遂用玄为宫下镇禁中候..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#楼玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "大司农。玄及丞相万彧、将军留平三人见帝皓无道，直言苦谏，皆被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎浮> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阎浮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎浮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "閻浮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎浮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎浮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时魏将领。曾欲归东吴。因联络不周，未及接应，被魏军平定，败亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#穆顺[张杨]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "穆顺[张杨]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#穆顺[张杨]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "穆順"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#穆顺[张杨]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#穆顺[张杨]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#穆顺[张杨]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "上党太守张杨部将。随杨从诸侯讨董卓，军至虎牢关。顺出马挺枪迎战吕布，被布手起一戟，刺于马下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭女王> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭女王"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭女王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "女王"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭女王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭女王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "早失二亲，没在铜鞮侯家。父郭永，汉末官至南郡太守，谥敬侯。母董氏。曹操为魏公时，得入东宫。曹丕即王位，为夫人。登常位，为贵嫔。甄皇后死，于黄初三年（222）立为皇后。明帝即位后，尊为皇太后，称永安宫。青龙三年（235）卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭女王> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "文帝又纳安平广宗人郭永之女为贵妃，甚有颜色；其父尝曰：“吾女乃女中之王也。”故号为“女王”。自文帝纳为贵妃，因甄夫人失宠，郭贵妃欲谋为后，却与幸臣张韬商议。时文帝有疾，韬乃诈称于甄夫人宫中掘得桐木偶人，上书天子年月日时，为魇镇之事。文..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙休> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙休"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙休> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子烈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙休> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙休> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "大帝孙权第六子。年十三，从中书郎射慈、郎中盛冲受学。太元二年正月，封琅邪王，居虎林。四月，权薨，休弟亮承统，诸葛恪秉政，徙休于丹杨。太守李衡数以事侵休，休上书乞徙他郡，诏徙会稽。孙亮废，己未，孙綝使宗正孙楷与中书郎董朝迎休。即日，御正..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙休> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "大将军孙綝废亮，立休为帝。后与老将丁奉谋诛孙綝。永安五年薨，托太子單于丞相濮阳兴。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马台> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马台"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马台> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "馬臺"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马台> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马台> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与同郡孙礼友善。初丧乱时，礼与母相失，同郡马台求得礼母，礼推家财尽以与台。台后坐法当死，礼私导令逾狱自首，既而曰：“臣无逃亡之义。”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈震> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈震"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈震> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝起"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈震> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈震> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "在刘备领荆州牧时期出仕任从事一职，后随刘备入川，历任蜀郡北部都尉、汶山太守、尚书、尚书令，奉命出使东吴。孙权称帝后又封使吴的陈震为卫尉，与他在武昌升坛歃盟，宣誓与蜀汉二分天下。陈震回蜀后被封城阳亭侯，他性格忠纯，“老而益笃”，为诸葛亮..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈震> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义第26回登场，原为袁绍手下谋士，曾为刘备联络关羽。袁绍死后，陈震投奔刘备，后随刘备东征，并为刘备寻访李意。刘禅为帝时期，陈震在蜀官至太尉，曾出使东吴，缔结吴蜀同盟。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋建> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "宋建"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宋建"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "地方割据首领。光和中，乘涼州乱，自号河首平汉王，据枹罕，改元，置百官，统治长达三十余年。建安十九年（214），曹操遣夏侯渊率张郃等将领讨之，屠枹罕，斩建。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#花鬘> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "花鬘"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#花鬘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "花鬘"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#花鬘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#花鬘> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自古典戏曲《龙凤巾》（一名《化外奇缘》）。（在《三国志》、《三国演义》以及其他三国史方面的书籍中均未有记载），戏曲以蜀国宰相诸葛亮南征云南为背景。花鬘当时和父母，即孟获与祝融夫人一同迎战蜀军，但不幸被关羽之子关索所俘，遂与..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹寅> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹寅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹寅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹寅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹寅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹寅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝初为武陵太守，被孙坚所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏平> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "魏平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "魏平"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "屯守金城。河西曲演、张进、黄华等叛。平受诏不得西度。后苏则平定叛乱。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏平> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "张郃见蜀兵退去，恐有计策，不敢来追，乃引兵往见司马懿曰：“今蜀兵退去，不知何意。”懿曰：“孔明诡计极多，不可轻动。不如坚守，待他粮尽，自然退去。”大将魏平出曰：“蜀兵拔祁山之营而退，正可乘势追之。都督按兵不动，畏蜀如虎，奈天下笑何！”..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏姬> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苏姬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏姬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蘇姬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏姬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏姬> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹丕妃。生子邯郸怀王邕。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董承> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董承"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "董承"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉灵帝母董太后之姪，献帝的岳父。曾任车骑将军。董卓乱京，承送献帝回洛阳。曹操专权，承密谋诛操，将献帝的密诏带给刘备，事泄，为操所斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董承> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "车骑将军。献帝之舅。献帝授与命他诛杀佞臣曹操的玉带。图谋杀曹操的事被下仆秦庆童发现后告密，遭处斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#火德星君> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "火德星君"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#火德星君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "火德星君"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#火德星君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#火德星君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "即火神，汉代即有关于四方神之说：“东方青龙、西方白虎、北方玄武、南方朱雀。天之四灵，以正四方”。古时人们认为南方之神主火。经历代演变，人们逐渐将火神作为灶神奉祀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#火德星君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "传说中的南方火神。曾化身为一个妇人搭救过麋竺的财物。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍忠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲍忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鮑忠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍忠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉济北相鲍信之弟。诸侯讨董卓，以孙坚为前部。众诸侯内有济北相鲍信，寻思坚既为前部，怕他夺了头功，暗拨其弟鲍忠，先将马步军三千，径抄小路，直到关下搦战。卓将华雄引铁骑五百，飞下关来，大喝：“贼将休走！”忠急待退，被雄手起刀落，斩于马下，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李严> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李严"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李严> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "正方"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李严> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李严> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "以办事干练著称，在各处势力任职都受到器重，刘备伐蜀其间，李严率领部队投降刘备，任地方官，表现出其出色能力。施政上，李严是历任犍为太守中成绩最好的一位。军事上，曾两度平定地方上的叛乱。章武二年任尚书令。章武三年与诸葛亮同为辅命大臣，任中..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李严> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "刘备伐蜀时，李严受刘璋妻弟费观举保一同镇守锦竹，又与黄忠单挑数十回合而不分胜负，后中诸葛亮之计归降。刘备死后，受诸葛亮之命留驻永安拒孟达、防陆逊，诸葛亮五出祁山时，李严为掩饰自己运粮不济之过，假托东吴举兵入川，骗取诸葛亮回师，又妄奏后..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阚泽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阚泽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阚泽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "德润"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阚泽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阚泽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时期的学者，性谦恭笃慎，家世农夫，至泽好学，居贫无资，常为人佣书，以供纸笔，所写既毕，诵读亦遍。追师论讲，究览群籍，兼通历数，由是显名。孙权为骠骑将军，辟补西曹掾；及称尊号，以泽为尚书；禾时为中书令、侍中，赤乌时为太子太傅，去世后..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阚泽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙权谋士,第一个识破周瑜打黄盖是苦肉计，后自告奋勇向曹操献诈降书，曹操识破后面不改色，哈哈大笑，一番妙言让曹操相信了诈降书，是苦肉计中的关键人物。后于刘备御驾亲征东吴时，向孙权举荐陆逊为都督，间接上挽救了东吴的命运。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邵悌> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邵悌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邵悌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元伯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邵悌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邵悌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋王司马昭欲遣钟会伐蜀，悌以会率十余万众伐蜀，谓会单身无重任，不若使余人行。昭笑言已知之。及会白邓艾不轨，昭将西，悌复言。昭又安其心。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邵悌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西曹掾。晋王司马昭欲以镇西将军钟会伐蜀，悌料会有反志，告昭。昭言已知之。及会白邓艾不轨，昭将西，悌复言。昭从之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘彻> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘彻"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘彻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉徹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘彻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘彻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "即汉世宗孝武皇帝。汉朝的第五位皇帝，政治家、战略家。刘彻是刘邦的重孙、汉景帝刘启的第十子。七岁时被册立为皇太子，十六岁登基，在位五十四年（前141年－前87年），在位期间数次大破匈奴、吞并朝鲜、遣使出使西域。独尊儒术，首创年号。他开拓..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘彻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西汉时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严政> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "严政"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严政> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "嚴政"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严政> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严政> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严政> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "黃巾贼、张宝部将。在朱隽等官军的攻勢下，固守在阳城。政刺杀张宝，献首投降。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨潭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨潭"@zh .
