<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "为大司马曹真副将，同往与蜀战。真令良引五千兵哨探，良领命，引兵刚到谷口，哨见蜀兵退去。良急引兵赶来，行到五六十里，不见蜀兵，心下疑惑，教军士下马歇息。忽哨马报说：“前面有蜀兵埋伏。”良上马看时，只见山中尘土大起，急令军士提防。不一时，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#仇连> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "仇连"@zh .
