<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#仇连> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "任右都督，随司马懿征辽东。因劝司马懿移营高处，被斩，悬首于辕门外。"@zh .
