<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#缪尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "事张杨，任河内太守。献帝建安四年（199），守射屯城，待袁绍。曹操军围城，率众降，封为列侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱符> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱符"@zh .
