<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱符> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱符> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "交趾刺史，名臣朱儁子。为土著所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盛暹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "盛暹"@zh .
