<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#盛暹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "时有荐同郡盛暹于权者，以为梗概大节，有过于统，权曰：“且令如统足矣。”后召暹夜至，时统已卧，闻之，摄衣出门，执其手以入。其爱善不害如此。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李大目> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李大目"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李大目> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李大目"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李大目> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李大目> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄巾军余部首领。因眼大，故以大目为称号。初平四年（193），为袁绍击败，其屯驻营垒遭屠杀。黑山、黄巾诸帅，本非冠盖，自相号字，谓骑白马者为张白骑，谓轻捷者为张飞燕，谓声大者为张雷公，其饶须者则自称于羝根，其眼大者自称李大目。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#来历> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来历"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#来历> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯珍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#来历> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#来历> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "来歙孙，武安公主子，少袭爵。和帝时，任侍中、监羽林右骑、射声校尉。安帝延光元年（122）为太仆。谏不可废太子，连日不肯去，安帝怒，削国租，黜公主。顺帝即位，迁为卫尉，拜车骑将军，后为大鸿胪，死于官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡才> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "胡才"@zh .
