<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡才> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾奉令与李傕、郭汜大战，失败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡才> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "河东故白波帅之一。李傕、郭汜合兵追帝，杨奉、董承密传圣旨往河东，急召故白波帅韩暹、李乐、胡才三处军兵，前来救应。胡才被乱军所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜路> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜路"@zh .
