<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜路> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜路> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "章武二年（222），刘备败于猇亭，路与刘宁等部将穷迫困厄，向吴求降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜路> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "随刘备伐吴。陆逊营烧七百里，蜀军败，杜路降吴。"@zh .
