<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓发> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "桓邻之侄。士徽据交阯叛时，桓邻谏阻被杀。发乃合家兵击徽，久攻不下，遂相约和解，各自罢兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#奚泥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "奚泥"@zh .
