<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓训> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "邓训是太傅高密侯邓禹第六子。少有大志，厌文尚武，邓禹骂他不肖。汉明帝初年（58年）为郎中，邓训能与士卒同甘苦，士大夫多附之。汉章帝时，邓训任乌桓校尉。历官张掖太守。永元元年（89年），取代张纡为护羌校尉，进驻临羌城（今黄源县城东），离..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀正> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀正"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀正> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "荀正"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀正> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀正> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀正> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁术部将。术攻徐州牧刘备，以上将纪灵为主将、正为副将，起兵十万杀弃徐州。两军会于盱眙，灵与备将关羽战，三十合后退走。灵遣正出马，正以羽无名下将，非灵对手，惹得羽大怒，直取正，交马一合，砍正于马下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄俨> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "甄俨"@zh .
