<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄俨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄俨> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏文帝甄皇后父甄逸次子。曾举孝廉，辟为大将军掾，任曲梁长。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥蕤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "桥蕤"@zh .
