<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金旋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "武陵太守、金日磾之后。历位黄门郎，汉阳太守，征拜议郎，领武陵太守，为刘备攻劫死。子祎谋杀曹操，事败被株。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金旋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "武陵太守。刘备南征，遣张飞攻武陵，金旋出城迎战，为其从事巩志所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#岑述> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "岑述"@zh .
