<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯文宁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯文宁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾为梁相。其女夏侯令女为丈夫曹文叔守节，文宁托人劝其改嫁，令女则割鼻毁面，不从。"@zh .
