<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李异[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李異"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李异[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李异[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安二十四年，陆逊遣将军异、谢旌等将三千人，攻蜀将詹晏、陈凤。异将水军，旌将步兵，断绝险要，即破晏等，生降得凤。又攻房陵太守邓辅、南乡太守郭睦，大破之。后蜀主备攻吴，吴遣异、刘阿等踵蹑先主军，屯驻南山。后累败，吴主权遣书请和，蜀主盛怒..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李异[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "异、谢旌有万夫不当之勇，属武卫都尉孙桓。蜀主备攻吴，旌、李异随桓迎之。两军相遇，蜀将张苞与旌战有三十余合，旌败走。异见旌败，慌忙拍马轮斧接战。苞与战二十余合，不分胜负。苞马中箭，将苞掀在地上。异急向前轮起大斧，望苞头砍。蜀将关兴见苞马..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张燕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张燕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张燕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張燕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张燕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张燕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏平北将军。本姓褚。黄巾起，燕合聚少年为群盗，在山泽间转攻，还真定，众万余人。博陵张牛角亦起众，自号将兵从事，与燕合。燕推牛角为帅，俱攻瘿陶。牛角为飞矢所中。被创且死，令众奉燕，告曰：“必以燕为帅。”牛角死，众奉燕，故改姓张。燕剽捍捷..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张燕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏平北将军。初为黑山贼，为袁绍、吕布所败。后太祖斩袁谭，燕引军十万来降，操封为平北将军。使李典、乐进会合燕，打并州，攻高干，然干守住壶关口，不能下。后太祖班师回许都，使燕守北寨。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严纲[吴]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "严纲[吴]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严纲[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "嚴綱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严纲[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严纲[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为临贺太守。赤乌二年（239），将军蒋秘南讨夷人，纲为秘部下叛将廖式所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴兰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴兰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吴蘭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安二十二年（217），刘备进兵争汉中，遣兰与张飞、马超等屯下辩（今甘肃成县西北），曹操命曹洪拒敌。次年，曹洪破兰，斩其将任虁；张飞、马超走汉中，兰后为阴平氐强端斩杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初从益州牧刘璋，先主伐蜀，璋将吴懿保铜、吴兰为副将，点二万军马往雒城。冷苞往决江，为先主破之，铜、兰往来接应，被黄忠一军杀退。二将退守雒城，困魏延，忠又杀败之，二将乃随刘璝夺先主寨。先主攻雒城，铜、兰敌住延、忠。二将追之，中先主埋伏，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳孚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "柳孚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳孚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "柳孚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳孚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#柳孚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "贾逵妻兄。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅干> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "傅干"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦材"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十九年秋七月，公征孙权。干为参军,谏曰：“治天下之大具有二，文与武也；用武则先威，用文则先德，威德足以相济，而后王道备矣。往者天下大乱，上下失序，明公用武攘之，十平其九。今未承王命者，吴与蜀也，吴有长江之险，蜀有崇山之阻，难以威服..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#傅干> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "建安十九年，曹操将欲起程南征，傅干为参军，上书谏之。曹操览之，遂罢南征，兴设学校，延礼文士。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡和> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蔡和"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡和> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蔡和"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡和> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡和> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡和> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "荆将蔡瑁的族弟。刘备依附荆州时，蔡瑁深忌刘备，设计欲于宴会上构杀之，蔡和奉命守把襄阳东门岘山大路。后来刘琮举荆州降魏，蔡氏随降。蔡瑁因善养水军而见封水军大都督，蔡和亦从为副将。周瑜设反间计，使曹操杀掉蔡瑁、张允，曹操遂使蔡和、蔡中往吴..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯博> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯博"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯博> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "夏侯博"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯博> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯博> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘备部将。建安五年春正月，董承等谋泄，皆伏诛。汉献帝建安五年（200），曹公将自东征先主，破之，生禽其将博。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#明悼皇后> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "明悼皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#明悼皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "明明悼皇後"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#明悼皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#明悼皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄初中，选入东宫，见宠。明帝初封为贵嫔，太和元年（227），立为皇后。后宠衰。景初元年（237），因争宠，帝怒，赐死，葬愍陵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁宽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "梁宽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁宽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "梁寬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁宽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁宽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十七年（212），协助姜叙、杨阜等逐马超于陇右。后官至黄门侍郎。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阴溥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阴溥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阴溥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "陰溥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阴溥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阴溥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "璋闻曹公征荆州，已定汉（中）[南]，遣河内阴溥致敬于曹公。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜夔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杜夔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜夔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公良"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜夔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杜夔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "太乐令、协律都尉。以知音为雅乐郎，中平五年，疾去官。州郡司徒礼辟，以世乱奔荆州。荆州牧刘表令与孟曜为汉主合雅乐，乐备，表欲庭观之，夔谏曰：“今将军号不为天子合乐，而庭作之，无乃不可乎！”表纳其言而止。后表子琮降太祖，太祖以夔为军谋祭酒..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨玩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨玩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨玩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊玩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨玩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨玩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任主簿。常播以冤下狱，玩与播辞同，证明所冤，使播得以清白。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李异[刘璋]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李异[刘璋]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李异[刘璋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李異"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李异[刘璋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李异[刘璋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初隶刘璋所置征东中郎将赵韪。从赵韪起兵击刘璋。兵败，异遂与庞乐反戈，杀韪。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严舆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "严舆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严舆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "嚴輿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严舆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严舆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "严白虎之弟，有勇力，受兄长派遣与孙策讲和，在席间被孙策投掷手戟击中而死。不久，严白虎被孙策击败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严舆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义第15回登场。孙策进攻严白虎，严舆受派遣来与孙策讲和，席间严舆提出要与孙策平分江东，孙策大怒，飞剑将严舆砍死，随后严白虎被孙策击败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苑康> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苑康"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苑康> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲真"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苑康> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苑康> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少受业太学，与郭泰亲善，举孝廉，历颍阴令。有能声，迁太山太守，豪强莫敢犯。为侯览所诬，徙日南。后颍阴人及太山羊陟等为讼冤，还本郡，卒于家。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苑康> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义第六回写江夏八俊时，提及苑康，作范康。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐盖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐盖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐盖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "徐蓋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐盖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐盖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "徐晃之子，晃死，盖嗣。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李遗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李遗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李遗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李遺"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李遗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李遗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建宁太守、汉兴亭侯李恢子。建兴九年（231），父死嗣爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭安> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "彭安"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彭安"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁谭引兵出城，与曹军相敌。两阵对圆，操出马以鞭指谭而骂曰：“吾厚待汝，汝何生异心？”谭曰：“汝犯吾境界，夺吾城池，赖吾妻子，反说我有异心耶！”操大怒，使徐晃出马。谭使彭安接战。两马相交，不数合，晃斩彭安于马下。谭军败走，退入南皮。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关彝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "关彝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关彝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "關彜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关彝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关彝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "关兴的庶子，于兄长关统去世后继承爵位。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关彝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "关彝，关羽的后代，继嗣为汉寿亭侯，在演义钟会之乱中被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曾夏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曾夏"@zh .
