<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤正> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郤正"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤正> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "令先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤正> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤正> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "祖父郤俭，灵帝末为益州刺史，为盗贼所杀。会天下大乱，故正父揖因留蜀。正本名纂。少以父死母嫁，单茕只立，而安贫好学，博览坟籍。弱冠能属文，入为秘书吏，转为令史，迁郎，至令。性澹于荣利，而尤耽意文章。自在内职，与宦人黄皓比屋周旋，经三十年..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郤正> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀诸葛亮出师北伐，以郤正为秘书，与蜀中众臣同理后方事务。姜维第二次北伐，以郤正为使，以金珠结好羌王，约以共同出兵。姜维由于宦官黄皓的谗言，受到后主猜忌，郤正出主意要姜维沓中屯田避祸。邓艾伐蜀，下江油，郤正保举诸葛瞻迎敌邓艾。司马昭迁后..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿夔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "耿夔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿夔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "定公"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿夔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿夔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "耿弇之侄。和帝时为大将军左校尉，随窦宪北征匈奴，仅率八百精骑出居延塞，直捣北单于廷，斩阏氏、名王以下五千余级，唯单于与数骑得脱，尽获匈奴珍宝财畜，去塞五千里而还，自汉出师而未尝达此远者。受封为粟邑侯。后历任中郎将、长水校尉、五原太守和..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#来敏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "来敏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#来敏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "敬达"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#来敏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#来敏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀执慎将军。父艳，为汉司空。汉末大乱，敏随姊奔荆州，姊夫黄琬是刘璋祖母之侄，故益州牧刘璋遣迎琬妻，敏遂俱与姊入蜀，常为璋宾客。涉猎书籍，善左氏春秋，尤精於仓、雅训诂，好是正文字。先主定益州，署敏典学校尉，及立太子，以为家令。后主践阼，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#来敏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀祭酒。丞相亮北伐，留敏为祭酒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全端> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "全端"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全端> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "全端"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全端> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全端> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "全琮之从子。建兴元年，太傅诸葛恪率军遏巢湖。守城于东兴，使将军全端守西城。太平二年五月，魏征东大将军诸葛诞以淮南之众保守寿春城，并遣将军朱成向吴称臣上疏，又遣儿子诸葛靓、长史吴纲诸牙门之子为人质入吴。东吴孙琳使全端与全怿、文钦、唐咨等..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全端> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "建兴元年，魏军三路伐吴，太傅诸葛恪率军遏巢湖。守城于东兴，全端将守西城。太平二年五月，魏征东大将军诸葛诞以淮南之众保守寿春城，并遣儿子诸葛靓为人质入吴。东吴孙琳使全端与全怿为大将，引文钦、唐咨、于诠等起兵七万救诞，却屡为魏军所败。全怿..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马迁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马迁"@zh .
