<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#高升> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "黄巾军将领，张宝的副将。在曲阳之战中，高升与刘备军交锋，数合内被张飞刺死。"@zh .
