<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#胡综> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "偏将军，左执法，领辞讼。少孤，母将避难江东。孙策领会稽太守，综年十四，为门下循行，留吴与孙权共读书。策薨，权为讨虏将军，以综为金曹从事，从讨黄祖，拜鄂长。及权称帝，综为侍中，进封乡侯，兼左右领军。时魏降人或云魏都督河北振威将军吴质，颇..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈群> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈群"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈群> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "长文"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈群> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈群> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "其祖父陈寔、父陈纪、叔陈谌皆望族名士。陈群为人清尚有仪，雅好结友，有知人之明。先为刘备所用，后刘备被吕布所袭，陈群与父避居徐州；及吕布破后，方归曹操，历任司空西曹掾属、治书侍御史、御史中丞等职。后转为侍中，领丞相东西曹掾。曹丕即王位，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈群> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操杀掉马腾后，有言刘备将兴兵取川，曹操因而深表畏忌；陈群时为治书侍御史，向曹操献策，建议起大军南征孙权，而刘备意在两川，必不救权，故能一举得江东，其后徐图西进，吞荆并川，以定天下。曹操对其策极表赞同。可惜诸葛亮派人赍书西凉，使马超兴..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#区星> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "区星"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#区星> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "區星"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#区星> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#区星> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉灵帝时农民起义首领。自称将军，众万余人，攻围城邑。孙坚为长沙太守，到郡亲率将士，施设方略，旬月之间，克破星等。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#区星> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "反贼。星作乱长沙，十常侍假帝诏以坚为长沙太守，讨星，不五十日，报捷，江夏平。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨秋> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨秋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨秋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊秋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨秋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨秋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "关中将领，拥兵割据一方。后杨秋联合马超、韩遂、侯选、程银、李堪、张横、梁兴、马玩共十部势力起兵反抗曹操，被击败，逃至安定自守。曹操从长安出兵北征杨秋，包围安定，杨秋投降。曹操保留杨秋的爵位，让他留在安定安抚部下。曹丕继承王位时，杨秋为..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨秋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "韩遂手下八部兵马将领之一，同马超、韩遂一起起兵反抗曹操。后马超中曹操离间之计，与韩遂火并，杨秋等五将步战围攻马超，不能取胜，被马超砍死二人，杨秋逃窜，投降于曹操，被封为列侯，守渭口。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关银屏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "关银屏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关银屏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "關銀屏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关银屏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关银屏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "历史上关羽生有一女，孙权曾欲为子娶之，但被关羽以“虎女安嫁犬子”拒绝。以此为原型，出现了关银屏其人其事，但该名字不见史书记载，仅在民间传说中出现，因在关羽的四个子女中排行第三，故又被称作“关三小姐”、“关氏三姐”或“关羽三小姐”。在传..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#关银屏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "关羽之女，孙权曾欲为子娶之，但被关羽以“虎女安嫁犬子”拒绝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐盛> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "徐盛"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐盛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文向"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐盛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐盛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "安东将军。遭乱，客居吴，以勇气闻。孙权统事，以为别部司马，授兵五百人，守柴桑长，拒黄祖。祖子射，尝率数千人下攻盛。盛时吏士不满二百，与相拒击，伤射吏士千余人。已乃开门出战，大破之。射遂绝迹不复为寇。权以为校尉、芜湖令。复讨临城南阿山贼..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#徐盛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙策薨，弟权统众。权招贤纳士，盛投之。同丁奉为大都督周瑜帐前护军校尉。随瑜与曹公战于赤壁，刘备军事诸葛亮借东风，瑜命盛、奉二将杀亮，然亮已归。后同瑜往夺南郡，瑜施美人计，以权妹嫁备，及备等归荆州，瑜命二将阻之，为夫人呵退。后随权与魏将..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谯周> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "谯周"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谯周> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "允南"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谯周> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谯周> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀国官吏。幼孤，与母兄同居。既长，耽古笃学，家贫未尝问产业，诵读典籍，欣然独笑，以忘寝食。研精六经，尤善书札。颇晓天文，而不以留意；诸子文章非心所存，不悉遍视也。身长八尺，体貌素朴，性推诚不饰，无造次辩论之才，然潜识内敏。建兴中，丞相..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谯周> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "本是益州牧刘璋手下，刘备围成都，谯周论天命，力劝刘璋投降，投降后被刘备任用。曹丕废献帝自立，谯周与诸葛亮、许靖等商议，谯周言天象祥瑞，乃与群臣共同推戴汉中王刘备为帝。诸葛亮北伐，谯周言天象，以为不宜北伐。诸葛亮以谯周为太史，与蜀中众臣..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍琼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "伍琼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍琼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "德瑜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍琼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍琼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "官城门校尉、侍中，为董卓所信任。曾说董卓用袁绍为勃海太守，袁绍遂以勃海起兵反董卓。董卓用琼所举韩馥等出宰州郡，至官后皆合兵讨董卓，董卓疑琼卖己，将他处死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#伍琼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "且说董卓欲杀袁绍，李儒止之曰：“事未可定，不可妄杀。”袁绍手提宝剑刀，辞别百官而出，悬节东门，奔冀州去了。卓谓太傅袁隗曰：“汝侄无礼，吾看汝面，姑恕之。废立之事若何？”隗曰：“太尉所见是也。”卓曰：“敢有阻大议者，以军法从事。”群臣震..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#爨习> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "爨习"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#爨习> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "爨習"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#爨习> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#爨习> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "当地大姓。刘璋时为建伶长。刘备入蜀称帝，习累迁至行参军、偏将军，后官至领军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#爨习> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀国偏将军。随诸葛亮出师伐魏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘艾> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘艾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘艾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉艾"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘艾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘艾> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "献帝时，曾任宗正、侍中、长史等官。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#晏明> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "晏明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#晏明> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "晏明"@zh .
