<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#晏明> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#晏明> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "明属曹洪部，于长坂坡追刘备军。时，备将赵云寻得阿斗，明引一队步军至，持三尖两刃刀来战云。不三合，被云一枪刺倒，杀散众军，冲开一条路。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙瓒> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "公孙瓒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙瓒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯圭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙瓒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙瓒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉前将军。书佐出身，从卢植学。依己才逐升中郎将，以强硬的态度对抗北方少数民族，做战勇猛，威震边疆。瓒好战，与主张以怀柔政策对待少数民族的上司刘虞不和，二人矛盾逐渐激化，发展到互相攻打，公孙瓒靠自己的军事才能以少胜多，杀死了刘虞，并挟持..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙瓒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "东汉末年北平太守。与刘备为友。刘备起兵平黄巾之乱，瓒多有举荐。及董卓乱政，瓒响应曹操讨董卓檄文，起兵伐逆。后退守北方，因冀州地与袁绍争，交战多次，终为所败，于易京楼中引火自焚。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雅丹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "雅丹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雅丹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "雅丹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雅丹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雅丹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雅丹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "西羌丞相。蜀相诸葛亮伐魏，魏都督曹真驰书赴羌，先来见雅丹丞相，送了礼物，具言求救之意。雅丹引见国王，呈上书礼。国王彻里吉即命雅丹与越吉元帅起羌兵一十五万、并战车直扣西平关。雅丹中亮计，与越吉为蜀伏兵围困，雅丹早被马岱活捉，解投大寨来。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张邈[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张邈[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张邈[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孟卓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张邈[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张邈[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "年少时就以行侠仗义闻名乡里，结交了袁绍，曹操等大批官宦子弟。后来为陈留太守，与曹操一道起兵讨伐董卓，双方关系相当紧密。起初其地位是曹操的上司，后来转为其下属，加上并非曹操嫡系，所以虽然受曹操信任和善待，仍然自疑不已。曹操攻打陶谦时他在..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张邈[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "陈留太守，讨伐董卓的第六镇诸侯。本来与曹操是好友，可是经陈宫劝说后，背叛曹操。劝吕布攻打兖州，但是失败了。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞昺> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "虞昺"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞昺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "世文"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞昺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞昺> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虞翻第八子。少有倜傥之志，仕吴黄门郎，以捷对见异，超拜尚书侍中。后归晋。任济阴太守，抑强扶弱，甚著威风。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓彝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "桓彝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓彝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "桓彝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓彝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桓彝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏尚书令桓阶之弟。孙綝发动宫廷政变，废吴帝孙亮，令群臣署名，彝坚辞不署，被綝杀害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#岑威> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "岑威"@zh .
