<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#岑威> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏将，曾引军驱木牛流马，装载粮米，然途遇王平，被斩。官至镇远将军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋奇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蒋奇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蔣奇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "冀州割据者袁绍部将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋奇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "领兵救乌巢时，为张辽所斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#灵思皇后> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "灵思皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#灵思皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "靈思皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#灵思皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#灵思皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "异母兄进，汉大将军、同母兄苗，汉车骑将军。家本屠者，以选入掖庭。长七尺一寸。生皇子辩，养于史道人家，号曰史侯。拜后为贵人，甚有宠幸。性强忌，后宫莫不震慑。光和三年，立为皇后。明年，追号后父真为车骑将军、舞阳宣德侯，因封后母兴为舞阳君。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#灵思皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "异母兄进，汉大将军、同母兄苗，汉车骑将军。入宫为贵人，生皇子辩，遂立为皇后。帝又宠幸王美人，生皇子协。何后嫉妒，鸩杀王美人。因欲立子辩为太子，而与董太后不和。后进鸩杀董太后。及灵帝崩，进立辩为帝。何进欲诛宦官，因何后袒护而不成。后何后..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹嵩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹嵩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹嵩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "巨高"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹嵩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹嵩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父曹褒，为颖川太守。叔父腾为中常侍，乞兄子继之，既嵩也。年二十二，为敦煌太守赵咨举孝廉，任荥阳令。咨复拜东海相，之官，道经荥阳，嵩迎路谒候，咨不为留。嵩送至亭次，望尘不及，谓主簿曰：“赵君名重，今过界不见，必为天下笑！”即弃印绶，追至..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹嵩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操之父。本姓夏侯氏，因继与中常侍曹腾，故冒姓曹。后嵩自陈留避难，隐居琅琊。及子操得青州，取父及家人，徐州牧陶谦遣部将张闿护送，闿贪其钱财，尽杀嵩家。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘阳> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘阳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘阳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉陽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘阳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘阳> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "名士。为莒（今山东莒县）令，年三十而卒。曾欲暗杀曹操，以求拯救汉室，然几番伺机均未成。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞钦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "虞钦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "虞欽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞钦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "赤乌八年（245），外部督马茂，符节令朱贞，无难督虞钦，另有牙门将朱志，合谋图孙权，事觉，皆诛族。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕玲绮> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕玲绮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕玲绮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "呂玲綺"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕玲绮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕玲绮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吕布之女，虚构人物，出自三国演义。吕玲绮这个名字，出自三国志游戏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕玲绮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中仅为吕布之女。无名字可考。为吕布与严氏所生之女孩。虽与袁术之子曾有政治婚姻之谈，但於前往寿春途中被带回。当吕布於下邳遭曹操包围之时，婚事再次浮上台面，但却为曹操及刘备所阻止。吕布死後，家族迁往许昌。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊岐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "樊岐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊岐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "樊岐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊岐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊岐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时蜀中郎将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#樊岐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀国武略中郎将，随诸葛亮出师伐魏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛明> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "辛明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛明> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "辛明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛明> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛明> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#辛明> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁绍部下将领，参与了官渡之战。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞授> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "虞授"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞授> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "虞授"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞授> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#虞授> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任广州督，天纪三年（279），郭马等反将杀授。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙俊[孙河子]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙俊[孙河子]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙俊[孙河子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔英"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙俊[孙河子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙俊[孙河子]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙河幼子，性度恢弘，才经文武，为定武中郎将，屯戍薄落，赤乌十三年卒。长子建袭爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钱铜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "钱铜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钱铜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "錢銅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钱铜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钱铜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "时天下大乱，铜聚众万人自保。后为孙策攻破，诛族。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄渊> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄渊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄渊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "黄淵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄渊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄渊> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄武元年（222），与吾粲等以舟师拒魏将曹休于洞口。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王国[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王国[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王国[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王國"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王国[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王国[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "起兵反，劫阎忠为主，统三十六部。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周昕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周昕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周昕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "大明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周昕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周昕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少游京师，师事太傅陈蕃，博览群书，明于风角，善推灾异。辟太尉府，举高第，稍迁丹杨太守。曹公起义兵，昕前后遣兵万馀人助公征伐。袁术之在淮南也，昕恶其淫虐，绝不与通。袁术遣吴景攻昕，未拔，景乃募百姓敢从周昕者死不赦。昕曰：“我则不德，百姓..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周昕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "会稽太守王朗麾下之将。增援王朗与孙策军的太史慈作战，但是背後被袭，逃入城中。与严白虎出城追击时中计，被斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马岐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马岐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马岐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "司馬岐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马岐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马岐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "大司农司马芝子，官至廷尉。后以疾去官，年三十五卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭和> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "彭和"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭和> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彭和"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭和> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭和> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#彭和> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "邓艾伐蜀，兵至绵竹，为诸葛瞻所阻，不得进。后艾用伏兵，将绵竹围的铁桶相似。诸葛瞻在城中，见事势已迫，乃令彭和赍书杀出，往东吴求救。和至东吴，见了吴主孙休，呈上告急之书。吴主看罢，与群臣计议曰：“既蜀中危急，孤岂可坐视不救。”即令老将丁..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨颙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨颙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨颙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子昭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨颙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨颙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "是杨仪同宗族人。杨颙入蜀时，为巴郡太守，亦是丞相诸葛亮的主簿。诸葛亮常常自校书簿，杨颙谏道：「为治有体，上下不可相侵，我现在希望为明公作一譬喻。话说如今有一个人，他使男奴执耕稼之务，婢女负责炊事，鸡主司晨，犬主吠盗，牛负重载，马涉远路..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨颙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中作杨颗，北伐时为丞相主簿，于第一百零三回登场。其时丞相诸葛亮总揽军国之务，事无大小，必亲力亲为。杨颙认为「为治有体，上下不可相侵」，举主人治家，分付劳役与奴婢，主人但只高枕饮食为例，又以「丙吉但忧牛喘，而不问横道死人；陈平不知钱..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈温[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈温[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈温[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元悌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈温[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈温[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初平年间为扬州刺史。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金尚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "金尚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元休"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "与同郡韦休甫、第五文休俱著名，号为“三休”。献帝初为兖州刺史。曹操兵临兖州，他南依袁术，术僭号，欲以尚为太尉，尚不受。后为术所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#巴祗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "巴祗"@zh .
