<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#巴祗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#巴祗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国志中记载，他在徐州刺史任上时，曾上表赞扬赵昱的功绩。谢承的《后汉书》中，记载他为扬州刺史，为人廉洁，在任上的时候不将妻子孩子接来同住，自己的日常开支也严格控制在俸禄范围之内，黑色的头巾毁坏了，也不换掉，而是用水混黑胶修补继续使用，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋宪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "宋宪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宋憲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吕布部将。建安三年（198），曹操攻吕布，与刘备围下邳。宪与魏续等执吕布的谋士陈宫，献城降，曹操遂擒杀吕布。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "吕布麾下大将。见同僚侯成因为皮毛小事而遭棒责，与侯成、魏续一起投降了曹操。后来与袁绍军交战时，死在猛将颜良刀下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周宣> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周宣"@zh .
