<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段珪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "段珪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段珪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "段珪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段珪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段珪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为小黄门，珪在济阴，与中常侍侯览并立田业，近济北界，仆从宾客侵犯百姓，劫掠行旅。济北相滕延一切收捕，杀数十人，陈尸路衢。览、珪大怨，以事诉帝，延坐多杀无辜，征诣廷尉，免。后珪等为中常侍，封侯贵宠，父兄子弟布列州郡，所在贪贱，为人蠹害..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#段珪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "同张让、赵忠、曹节等为“十常侍”，为灵帝所宠。珪等专权乱政、卖官索财，朝野皆痛恨之。及灵帝崩，大将军何进欲杀让等，珪阴结何太后，招进入宫，斩杀之。进部将袁绍引兵攻珪，珪等劫帝走河上，后珪与帝走散，为河南中部掾吏闵贡拿住，贡杀珪，悬头于..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马武> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子张"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "云台二十八将”之一。初入绿林军，为新市兵将领，后归刘秀，东汉建立后，任捕虏将军，封杨虚侯。马武少年时为避仇家，客居江夏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尚弘> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "尚弘"@zh .
