<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘禅降魏前为太常。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "艾拜后主为骠骑将军，其余文武，各随高下拜官。请后主还宫，出榜安民，交割仓库。又令太常张峻、益州别驾张绍招安各郡军民。又令人说姜维归降，一面遣人赴洛阳报捷。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#武宣皇后> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "武宣皇后"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#武宣皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "武宣皇後"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#武宣皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#武宣皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "出身于娼家。二十岁时被曹操在谯纳为妾，并随他到了洛阳。到董卓为乱时，曹操弃官，微服东出避难。袁术传曹操凶讯，曹操身旁的人都欲逃回，卞后识断精明，制止了众人的莽撞行动。后来曹操听说后十分赞赏。丁夫人薨，曹操就将卞后扶正。曹丕当太子后，左..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#武宣皇后> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "卞后为魏武帝曹操妻，生四子：文皇帝丕、任城威王彰、陈思王植、萧怀王熊。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石虎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "石虎"@zh .
