<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#石虎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "河南尹李胜部下受符吏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#爰邵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "爰邵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#爰邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "爰邵"@zh .
