<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#爰邵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "却说邓艾在陇西，既受伐蜀之诏，一面令司马望往遏羌人，又遣雍州刺史诸葛绪，天水太守王颀、陇西太守牵弘，金城太守杨欣各调本部兵，前来听令。比及军马云集，邓艾夜作一梦，梦见登高山，望汉中，忽于脚下迸出一泉，水势上涌，须臾惊觉，浑身汗流，遂坐..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛勤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "薛勤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛勤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "薛勤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛勤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛勤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任山阳太守。丧妻不哭，时人讥之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛兰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "薛兰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "薛蘭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吕布部将。献帝兴平二年（195），屯钜野，曹操率军围攻，败被杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#薛兰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操班师，曹仁、夏侯惇接见，言近日细作报说：兖州薛兰、李封军士皆出掳掠，城邑空虚，可引得胜之兵攻之，一鼓可下。操遂引军，径奔兖州。薛兰、李封出其不意，只得引兵出城迎战。许褚曰：“某愿取此二人，以为贽见之礼。”操大喜，遂令出战。李封使画..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋济> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蒋济"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子通"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末年，仕郡计吏、州别驾，迁丹阳太守，为曹操心腹谋士之一。曹丕称帝，出为东中郎将，未几，入为散骑常侍。明帝即位，赐爵关内侯，迁中护军。齐王芳即位，徙领军将军，进爵昌陵亭侯，迁太尉。不久，以从司马懿诛曹爽等，进封都乡侯，邑七百户，固辞..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蒋济> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "谋士，于三国演义第75回登场。蒋济曾任曹操的主簿，劝阻过曹操迁都；后来曹丕伐吴，蒋济与刘晔同为参谋官；魏帝曹芳时期，蒋济官至太尉，随司马懿发动政变，出兵落水浮桥，写信劝说曹爽投降，最终导致曹爽一族灭亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周氏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "周氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周氏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴太子孙登妃。周瑜女。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#向宠> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "向宠"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#向宠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "向寵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#向宠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#向宠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "跟随刘备伐吴，秭归之战刘备军惨败退回，部队中唯有向宠之营保存最完好，受到刘备的称赞。刘禅即位后向宠负责管理宫廷宿卫军。诸葛亮北行汉中前，特意在《出师表》中向刘禅推荐向宠，后任中领军，深受部下爱戴，在延熙三年平定汉嘉少数民族叛乱时不幸遇害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#向宠> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "诸葛亮北伐前，上《前出师表》，特意提到“将军向宠，性行淑均，晓暢军事，试用於昔，先帝称之曰能，是以众论举宠为督。愚以为营中之事，悉以咨之，必能使行陈和睦，优劣得所也” 。后留向宠为大将，总督御林兵马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘勖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "潘勖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘勖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元茂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘勖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘勖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "官至尚书左丞，献帝建安二十年（215）病卒，年五十余。"@zh .
