<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞林> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "庞统弟。初事蜀，任荆州治中从事。章武二年（222），林随黄权征吴，夷陵大败，归路断绝。林从权降魏，被封侯，官至钜鹿太守。林先与妻分隔十余年，降魏时始聚。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍隆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲍隆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鮑隆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "桂阳管军校尉。出身桂阳岭山乡猎户，曾射杀双虎。赤壁之战后，刘备命赵云攻去桂阳，鲍隆与陈应恃勇而战，被赵云所败。太守赵范纳降后，嫁嫂不成恼羞成怒，鲍隆与陈应至赵云营中诈降，为赵云识破所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乌桓触> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "乌桓触"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乌桓触> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "烏桓觸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乌桓触> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乌桓触> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国演义引用后汉书时，将“煕、尙为其将焦触、张南所攻，奔辽西乌桓。触自号幽州刺史”一句，断句错误弄出的人名。其人是不存在的。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乌桓触> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中的幽州刺史，在袁氏兄弟战败后，乌桓触引军降曹操。操大喜，加为镇北将军。然而其人是不存在的，三国演义引用后汉书时，将“煕、尙为其将焦触、张南所攻，奔辽西乌桓。触自号幽州刺史”一句，断句错误弄出的人名。三国演义将这个错误的人名虚构了..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐綝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "乐綝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐綝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "樂綝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐綝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐綝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父进，右将军。建安二十三年，进薨，子綝嗣。綝果毅有父风，官至扬州刺史。甘露二年，司马昭疑诸葛诞，徵为司空。诞言不遣使者，健步赍书，使以兵付乐綝，此必綝所为。乃将左右数百人至扬州，扬州人欲闭门，诞叱曰：“卿非我故吏邪！”乐綝闻之，闭州门..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#乐綝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "扬州刺史。父进，右将军。诸葛亮北伐，曹真以张虎为先锋、綝为副先锋，为亮所败。亮与司马懿斗阵，綝更与虎、戴陵陷阵被捉，涂面放归。后虎、綝受懿计，引二千弓弩手伏于渭水浮桥北岸，乱箭射死吴班。亮造木牛流马，虎、綝夺之。司马父子困于上方谷，为..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭智> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭智"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭智> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郭智"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭智> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭智> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏初为东安太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄盖[吴]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄盖[吴]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄盖[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公覆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄盖[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄盖[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为郡吏，察孝廉，辟公府。孙坚举义兵，盖从之。坚南破山贼，北走董卓，拜盖别部司马。坚薨，盖随策及权，擐甲周旋，蹈刃屠城。诸山越不宾，有寇难之县，辄用盖为守长，以严法治之，县中震栗。后转春谷长，寻阳令。凡守九县，所在平定。迁丹杨都尉，抑..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄盖[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "善使一条铁鞭，先从孙坚起兵，盖与程普等同为宿将。从击刘表，败表将蔡瑁。坚薨，又从孙策、孙权。赤壁战前黄盖见为粮官，力主战。诸葛亮舌战江东群儒，盖厉责诸儒。随周瑜抗曹，建策火攻，又受苦肉计，献诈降书以赚曹操。后为先锋，火烧曹军。然为张辽..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#车胄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "车胄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#车胄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "車胄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#车胄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#车胄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操置车骑将军、徐州刺史。太祖灭吕布，后任胄为车骑将军、徐州刺史。建安五年，左将军刘备杀冑，据沛以背太祖。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#车胄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操灭吕布，路过徐州，使车骑将军车胄权领徐州。刘备以截杀袁术之名，脱离许都，来到徐州。后来曹操见刘备留下军马不回，大怒。荀彧出谋写书与车胄，就内图之。操从其计，暗使人来见车胄，传曹操钧旨。胄随即请陈登商议此事，欲在瓮城边刺杀刘备。可是..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任尚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "任尚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "任尚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "和帝永元初以司马随窦宪破匈奴北单于，遂为窦宪爪牙。迁中郎将，护乌桓校尉，屡破匈奴。永元十四年（102）代班超为西域都护。延平元年（106）西域反，坐罪免。安帝永初中，以征西校尉副车骑将军邓骘击先零羌，屯陇西，以军功封乐亭侯；复坐罪免。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏邈> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "魏邈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏邈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "魏邈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏邈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏邈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙休时，孙琳将出屯武昌。邈告休曰，琳居外必有变。休遂施计，使张布、丁奉谋杀琳。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏邈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙綝遣中书郎孟宗拨与中营所管精兵一万五千，出屯武昌；又尽将武库内军器与之。于是将军魏邈、武卫士施朔二人密奏孙休曰：“綝调兵在外，又搬尽武库内军器，早晚必为变矣！”休大惊，急召张布计议。布奏曰：“老将丁奉计略过人，能断大事，可与议之。”..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫闿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "皇甫闿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫闿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "皇甫闓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫闿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫闿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "景元四年，闿随镇西将军钟会伐蜀，会谴闿、将军王买等从涪南出冲蜀军腹，会据涪县为东西势援。闿等令分兵据势，广张罗罔，南杜走吴之道，西塞成都之路，北绝越逸之径，四面云集，首尾并进，蹊路断绝，走伏无地。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#皇甫闿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "景元四年，镇西将军钟会伐蜀，时有监军卫瓘，护军胡烈，大将闿、田续、庞会、田章、爰青彡、丘建、夏侯咸、王买、句安等八十余员。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#步夫人> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "步夫人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#步夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "步夫人"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#步夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#步夫人> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "由其母携带徙庐江。庐江为孙策所破，皆东渡江。以美貌得幸于孙权，宠冠后庭。生有鲁班、鲁育二女。孙权为吴王及称帝，意欲立为后，而群臣请立徐夫人，孙权迟疑不决十余年。赤乌元年卒，追赠皇后。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#纪灵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "纪灵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#纪灵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "紀靈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#纪灵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#纪灵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾带兵攻打刘备，但在吕布调解下退兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#纪灵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "山东人，擅使六十五斤重三尖两刃刀。刘备进攻袁术时，他提兵迎战，同关羽大战三十合未见胜负。后提兵十万，攻打小沛，但在吕布的调解下退兵。袁术称帝后，分兵七路下徐州，任命纪灵为救应使，但未能挽回袁术兵败的命运。后袁术在北上投靠袁绍的途中，遭..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹恒> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹恒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹恒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹恒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹恒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹恒> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "悼公壹之子。壹卒，恒嗣爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘遂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "潘遂"@zh .
