<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#潘遂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "“赵子龙力斩五将　诸葛亮智取三城”一章中诱赵云出战。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭泰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭泰"@zh .
