<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭泰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭泰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "家世贫贱，少好学，博通典籍，善谈论，美音制。游于洛阳，河南尹李膺大奇之，遂相友善，名震京师。归乡里后，司徒黄琼辟，太常赵典举有道，皆不应。性明知人，好奖训士类，士争归之。遭母丧，以至孝称。善人伦而不危言覈论，宦官擅政亦不能伤之。党锢之..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨任> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨任"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨任> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊任"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨任> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨任> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "张鲁将。建安二十年，曹公西征鲁，鲁使弟卫与将杨昂等据阳平关，横山筑城十余里，攻之不能拔，乃引军还。贼见大军退，其守备解散。公乃密遣高祚等乘险夜袭，大破之，斩任。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨任> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "建安二十年，曹公西征鲁，鲁遣弟卫、任、杨昂守阳平关。是夜，任等截曹军寨，大败夏侯渊、张郃。后曹公亲讨，任等仍大败之。后曹军诈退，昂欲乘势击之，任以曹公诡计苦谏，昂不从。昂后败死，任杀条大路，奔回南郑。任后立军令状，引二万军离南郑下寨。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宁随> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "宁随"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宁随> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "寧隨"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宁随> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宁随> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宁随> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "为大将军姜维副将。景耀六年，时魏军困蜀军，雍州刺史诸葛绪又断了归路，随曰：“魏兵虽断阴平桥头，雍州必然兵少，将军若从孔函谷，径取雍州，诸葛绪必撤阴平之兵救雍州，将军却引兵奔剑阁守之，则汉中可复矣。”维从之，即发兵入孔函谷，诈取雍州。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹默> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "尹默"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹默> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "思潜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹默> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹默> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "益部多贵今文而不崇章句，默知其不博，乃远游荆州，从司马德操、宋仲子等受古学。皆通诸经史，又专精於左氏春秋，自刘歆条例，郑众、贾逵父子、陈元方，服虔注说，咸略诵述，不复按本。先主定益州，领牧，以为劝学从事，及立太子，以默为仆，以左氏传授..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#尹默> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹丕篡汉后，在诸葛亮的领导下，以学士的身份与太傅许靖等共同推戴汉中王刘备即皇帝位。诸葛亮北伐，以尹默为博士，与蜀中众臣同领后方事务，也教授过劉禪。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成倅> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "成倅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成倅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "成倅"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成倅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成倅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "甘露中为骑督，党于司马昭。甘露五年（260），曹髦率殿中宿卫苍头官僮讨司马昭。他与弟太子舍人成济从中护军贾充迎战。贾充命其与成济杀曹髦。事后，司马昭诿罪于其兄弟，杀之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成倅> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏主曹髦领数百人伐司马昭，遇到贾充戎服乘马，左有成倅，右有成济，引数千铁甲禁兵，呐喊杀来。成济听贾充之命弑君，事后，司马昭却诿罪于其身，命将剐之。弟成倅亦斩于市，尽灭三族。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋白> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "宋白"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋白> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宋白"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋白> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋白> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宋白> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "县令。毋丘俭反，司马景王讨之，俭兵败，引十余骑夺路而走。前至慎县城下，县令白开门接入，设席待之。俭大醉，被白令人杀了，将头献与魏兵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓贤[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邓贤[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓贤[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄧賢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓贤[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓贤[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "新城太守孟达外甥。明帝太和元年（227），孟达叛魏，司马懿收买邓贤等人，致使孟达反叛失败。此处的邓贤一说与刘璋部将邓贤为一人，随孟达叛蜀入魏。但根据推理，刘备入蜀时，孟达与法正叛刘璋而迎刘备，二刘反目时，刘璋派遣邓贤、冷苞、刘璝、张任..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓贤[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孟达外甥。孟达被诸葛亮策反，准备反魏，邓贤告发了孟达，导致司马懿出兵平定了孟达的叛乱。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦宓> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "秦宓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦宓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子敕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦宓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦宓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "有才学，州郡辟命，辄称疾不往。刘璋时，宓同郡王商为治中从事。先主既定益州，广汉太守夏侯纂请宓为师友祭酒，领五官掾，称曰仲父。益州辟宓为从事祭酒。先主既称尊号，将东征吴，宓陈天时必无其利，坐下狱幽闭，然后贷出。建兴二年，丞相亮领益州牧，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#秦宓> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初仕益州牧刘璋，璋降。先主遣责简雍为使，雍傲慢无礼，宓怒斥之。先主称帝，以宓为学士。孙权袭荆州，杀关羽。先主怒欲伐之，宓苦劝不从，口出不吉之言，先主叱武士推出斩之，众官皆为秦宓告免，乃暂且囚下。丞相诸葛亮上表救秦宓，先主掷表于地。后蜀..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯楷> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "冯楷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯楷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "馮楷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯楷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯楷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十三年（208），曾随曹操征荆州。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁立> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "丁立"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁立> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "丁立"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁立> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁立> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "诸葛亮《后出师表》中提到此人。原文：自臣（诸葛亮）到汉中，中间期年耳，然丧赵云、阳群、马玉、阎芝、丁立、白寿、刘郃、邓铜等及曲长屯将七十馀人。由于后出师表是否为诸葛亮所写存在争议，故文中所提人名是否真实，也有待考证。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁立> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "诸葛亮《后出师表》中提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁咸> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "丁咸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁咸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "丁咸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁咸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁咸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "行左护军笃信中郎将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁咸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "诸葛亮伐魏时任笃信中郎将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕常[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕常[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕常[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吕常"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕常[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕常[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏横海将军、襄阳太守。常以中勇，显名州司，试守雉长，执戈秉戎，慎守易，兵不顿于敌国，坠不侵于四邻，拜武猛都尉厉节中郎将裨将军，封关内侯。王师南征，与充军从，奄有江汉，舍爵册勋，封阴德亭侯，领郡。鸠集荒散，为民统纪，三考有成，转拜平狄将..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕常[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "助曹仁守襄阳，蜀将关羽来攻，常请缨半渡而击羽，然大败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈莹> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "沈莹"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈莹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "沈瑩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈莹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈莹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "天纪四年，晋攻吴。帝皓使丞相张悌督莹、诸葛靓、孙震帅众三万济江。至牛渚，莹曰：“晋治水军于蜀久矣，今倾国大举，万里齐力，必悉益州之众浮江而下。我上流诸军，无有戒备，名将皆死，幼少当任，恐边江诸城，尽莫能御也。晋之水军，必至于此矣！宜畜..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沈莹> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "天纪四年，晋攻吴。帝皓使丞相张悌督莹、诸葛靓引兵十万，出兵牛渚，接应诸路军马。后迎晋兵，莹谓靓曰：“上流诸军不作提防，吾料晋军必至此，宜尽力以敌之。若幸得胜，江南自安。今渡江与战，不幸而败，则大事去矣。”靓从之。言未毕，人报晋兵顺流而..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕公> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吕公"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕公> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吕公"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕公> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕公> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初平二年，孙坚与表战，公将兵缘山向坚，坚轻骑寻山讨公。公兵下石。中坚头，应时脑出物故。一说孙坚为黄祖军士射杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吕公> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙坚与表战，坚分兵四面，围住襄阳攻打。表欲致书袁绍，求其相助，问谁敢突围而出，公应声愿往。公用蒯良计，将兵缘山向坚，坚轻骑寻山讨公。坚方欲上山，公兵山上石子乱下，林中乱箭齐发。坚体中石、箭，脑浆迸流，人马皆死于岘山之内。坚将程普保着坚..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓程> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邓程"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓程> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄧程"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓程> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓程> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓程> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "大将军孙綝欲废吴主孙亮，命令中书郎李崇夺其玺绶，令邓程收之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李鹏> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李鹏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李鹏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李鵬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李鹏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李鹏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李鹏> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "甘露三年，蜀军提兵径取骆谷，度沈岭，望长城而来。长城镇守将军司马望急与鹏、王真二将，引兵离城二十里下寨。次日，蜀兵来到，望引二将出阵。及交战，鹏见真为傅佥所擒，大怒，纵马轮刀来救。佥故意放慢，等鹏将近，努力掷真于地，暗掣四楞铁简在手；..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡氏[刘表妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蔡氏[刘表妻]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡氏[刘表妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蔡氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡氏[刘表妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡氏[刘表妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末荆州割据者刘表后妻。《襄阳耆旧记》记载：蔡氏，瑁之姊也。初刘表遣韩嵩诣操，观望虚实。嵩归，称朝廷、曹操之德。表大怒，以为怀贰，欲斩之，蔡氏知嵩贤，谏止之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡氏[刘表妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "荆州刺史刘表后妻、刘琮生母、蔡瑁之姐。心肠恶毒，因先主劝刘表立长子琦为嗣，深恨之，数次欲加害于琦。后表亡，借兄瑁之力，立子琮为主。操军到襄阳，蔡氏随子琮举州请降。操命琮为青州刺史，上任途中，命于禁将其母子二人灭口。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何宗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "何宗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦英"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何宗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "事广汉任安学，精究安术，与杜琼同师而名问过之。刘璋时，为犍为太守。先主定益州，领牧，辟为从事祭酒。后援引图、谶，劝先主即尊号。践阼之后，迁为大鸿胪。建兴中卒。子双，字汉偶。滑稽谈笑，有淳于髡、东方朔之风。为双柏长。早卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周循> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周循"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周循> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "周循"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周循> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周循> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "周瑜长子。其妻为孙权与步夫人之女孙鲁班。史书上说他有其父的风范，但是早卒。官拜骑都尉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周循> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "名将周瑜的长子，在周瑜去世后为孙权所厚待（三国演义第57回中提及）。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董超> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董超"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董超> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "董超"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董超> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董超> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安二十四年，随庞德、于禁讨蜀将关羽。后羽水淹七军，超及将军董衡等欲降，德皆收斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董超> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "董超、董衡身为领军将校随庞德、于禁讨蜀将关羽。后关羽水淹七军，庞德并二董及成何，与步卒五百人，皆无衣甲，立在堤上。及关羽来，董超、董衡见势危欲降，庞德亲斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李典> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李典"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李典> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曼成"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李典> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李典> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "早年跟随从父李乾效力于曹操，在吕曹交战期间，李乾因不肯降敌被吕布手下薛兰，李封所杀，李典助堂弟李整杀敌报仇，李整死后不久李典就被曹操任为离狐太守、中郎将，此后战役中李典多负责粮运后勤，直到任夏侯惇副将讨刘备后才逐渐调到前线作战。李典向..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李典> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "典随太祖破青州黄巾，战吕布，破袁绍，多有功劳。赤壁之战后，典随张辽守合肥，典、辽素不睦。然典不计私怨，同张辽、乐进在两次合之战中皆败孙权。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李歆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李歆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李歆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李歆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李歆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李歆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "先为蜀牙门将，延熙十二年秋，卫将军姜维出攻雍州，不克而还。歆、句安降魏将郭淮、陈泰於翅上。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李歆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初仕蜀，延熙十二年秋八月，卫将军姜维先差歆、句安同引一万五千兵，往麹山前连筑二城：歆守西城句，安守东城。魏雍州刺史郭淮命副将陈泰领兵攻之，歆、安各引一军出迎，因兵少不能抵敌，退入城中。泰令兵四面围住攻打，又以兵断其汉中粮道。歆、安城中..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱异> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱异"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱异> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季文"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱异> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱异> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "朱桓之子。以父任授郎，后拜骑都尉，代父领兵。赤乌中，随朱然攻魏樊城，破魏将文钦，迁扬武将军。建兴初迁镇南将军。太平二年（257），假节为大都督，救寿春围，不解。败归，为执政孙綝所害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱异> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "诸葛诞叛乱之时，奉丞相孙綝之命担任援军的先锋。接连打败仗，惹得孙綝大怒，败给司马昭后被处斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许慈> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "许慈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许慈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仁笃"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许慈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许慈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "师事刘熙，善郑氏学，治易、尚书、三礼、毛诗、论语。建安中，与许靖等俱自交州入蜀。先主定蜀，承丧乱历纪，学业衰废，乃鸠合典籍，沙汰众学，慈、胡潜并为学士，与孟光、来敏等典掌旧文。值庶事草创，动多疑议，慈、潜更相克伐，谤讟忿争，形于声色；..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许慈> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "军师诸葛亮率众臣推先主为帝，命慈、谏议郎孟光掌礼，筑坛于成都武担之南。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何曼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "何曼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何曼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "何曼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何曼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何曼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "黄巾渠帅。建安元年，汝南、颍川黄巾何仪、刘辟、黄邵及曼等，众各数万，初应袁术，又附孙坚。二月，曹公进军讨破之，斩辟、邵等，仪及其众皆降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何曼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "黄巾将，号截天夜叉。曹操讨汝南、颍川的黄巾何仪、黄邵。两军对阵，黄邵部下何曼步行出战，头裹黄巾，身披绿袄，手提铁棒，与曹洪步战。厮杀四五十合，胜负不分。洪诈败而走，曼赶来，被洪用拖刀背砍计杀死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟建> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孟建"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公威"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "《魏略》载：诸葛亮在荆州，于建安初年，与颍川石广元（名韬）、徐元直（名庶）、汝南孟公威等一同游学，孟、石、徐三人求学皆务要精熟，只有诸葛亮能观其大略。每至晨夜闲时，常共抱膝长啸，诸葛亮谓三人道：「卿等三人的仕进，官位可至刺史、郡守。」..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟建> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "生得清奇古貌，并与诸葛亮、徐庶、博陵崔州平、颍川石广元四人为密友。诸葛亮曾指孟公威等四人道：「公等仕进可至刺史、郡守。」于演义第三十七回登场。其时刘、关、张三人正第二次往隆中寻访卧龙诸葛亮，是日大雪，三人将近茅庐，忽闻路傍酒店中有人作..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈寿> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈寿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈寿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "承祚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈寿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈寿> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少好学，师事同郡谯周，仕蜀为观阁令史。宦人黄皓专弄威权，大臣皆曲意附之，寿独不为之屈，由是屡被谴黜。遭父丧，有疾，使婢丸药，客往见之，乡党以为贬议。及蜀平，坐是沈滞者累年。司空张华爱其才，以寿虽不远嫌，原情不至贬废，举为孝廉，除佐著作..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李福> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李福"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李福> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孙德"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李福> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李福> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父权，临邛长，为益州牧刘焉所杀。先主定益州后，以福为书佐、西充国长、成都令。建兴元年，徙巴西太守，为江州督、杨威将军，入为尚书仆射，封平阳亭侯。后丞相亮於武功病笃，后主遣福省侍，遂因谘以国家大计。福往具宣圣旨，听亮所言，至别去数日，忽..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李福> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "建兴十二年，丞相亮病笃，后主急命福星夜至军中问安，兼询后事。问安毕，福领了亮遗表，匆匆辞去。后亮不省人事，福又至。亮曰：“吾已知公复来之意。福谢曰：“福奉天子命，问丞相百年后，谁可任大事者。适因匆遽，失于谘请，故复来耳。”亮曰：“吾死..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡氏[刘表妻妹]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蔡氏[刘表妻妹]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡氏[刘表妻妹]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蔡氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡氏[刘表妻妹]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡氏[刘表妻妹]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末荆州割据者刘表妻妹。表欲将其嫁当时名士桓阶，未成。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周景> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周景"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲向"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "周瑜从祖父。好贤爱士。初在梁冀府中任将军，后为豫州刺史，河内太守。梁冀被诛，曾免官禁锢。不久，拜尚书令，官至司空。时宦官充塞列位，景与太尉杨秉奏诸奸猾，使宦官免除五十多人。死后，追封安阳乡侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓龙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邓龙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "鄧龍"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "江夏太守黄祖部将。献帝建安五年（200），与吴将周瑜战，战败被擒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邓龙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "邓龙是黄祖帐下先锋，在与东吴军交战时被甘宁飞上艨艟砍死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马良> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马良"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季常"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "兄弟五人，并有才名，乡里为之谚曰：“马氏五常，白眉最良。”良眉中有白毛，故以称之。先主领荆州，辟为从事。及先主入蜀，诸葛亮亦从后往，良留荆州，先主辟良为左将军掾。后遣使吴，权敬待之。先主称尊号，以良为侍中。及东征吴，遣良入武陵招纳五溪..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马良> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "先主领荆州，伊籍荐良。良至，先主优礼相待，请问保守荆襄之策。与语大悦，遂用良为从事。及先主伐蜀地，军师亮特遣良奉书报之庞统凶兆。后统亡，亮往蜀地，留良等助关羽。后吴都督鲁肃设宴请羽，良以有诈谏之，不从。及先主为汉中王，羽讨魏，以良、伊..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李斯> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李斯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李斯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李斯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李斯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李斯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "著名的政治家、文学家和书法家。在诸子百家中，李斯和韩非师从荀子学习帝王之术。秦朝丞相，协助秦始皇帝统一天下。秦统一之后，参与制定了法律，统一车轨、文字、度量衡制度。秦始皇死后与赵高合谋立少子胡亥为二世皇帝，为赵高所忌，腰斩于市。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李斯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "秦朝时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿纯> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "耿纯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯山"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#耿纯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾学于长安，授予纳言士。刘玄称帝，为骑都尉。后率宗族宾客二千余人归刘秀，封耿乡侯，转战河北各地，平邯郸，破铜马，积功为前将军。刘秀即帝位，封为高阳侯，攻克定陶，计斩刘扬，又封东光侯。后调任东郡太守，镇压当地农民起义军。卒于官，谥曰成侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王允> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王允"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王允> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子师"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王允> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王允> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉司徒、尚书令。世仕州郡为冠盖。年十九，为郡吏，时，小黄门晋阳赵津贪横放恣，为一县巨患，允讨捕杀之。而津兄弟谄事宦官，因缘谮诉，桓帝震怒，杀太守，送丧还平原，终毕三年，然后归家。复还仕，剌史邓盛闻而驰传辟为别驾从事。允少好大节，有志于..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王允> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉司徒。董卓专权，允聚众臣欲杀之，曹操自荐刺卓。然事败，操奔走。后允进义女貂禅，间卓及子吕布，二人反目。允假诏帝禅位于卓，卓欣喜来奔，布突而杀之。允灭其族、并其党。蔡邕哭之，允亦杀之，朝野唏嘘。后卓部曲将李傕、郭汜等先将兵为乱，攻围长..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#廖立> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "廖立"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#廖立> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公渊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#廖立> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#廖立> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "长水校尉。先主领荆州牧，辟为从事，年未三十，擢为长沙太守。建安二十年，权遣吕蒙奄袭南三郡，立脱身走，自归先主。先主素识待之，不深责也，以为巴郡太守。二十四年，先主为汉中王，徵立为侍中。后主袭位，徙长水校尉。立本意，自谓才名宜为诸葛亮之..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#廖立> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "长水校尉。初，立自谓才名宜为孔明之副，尝以职位闲散，怏怏不平，怨谤无已。于是孔明废之为庶人，徒之汶山。及闻孔明亡，乃垂泣曰：“吾终为左衽矣！"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张松[刘璋]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张松[刘璋]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张松[刘璋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子乔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张松[刘璋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张松[刘璋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "益州别驾，为人短小，放荡不治节操，然而很有才干；他认为刘璋暗弱，在他手下不足以发挥自己的才能，经常叹息。赤壁之战前夕，张松奉命出使结交曹操，不被礼遇，因此怀恨曹操，劝刘璋改为结交刘备。进而，张松与好友法正一同密谋出卖刘璋，将益州献给刘..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张松[刘璋]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义第60回登场。张松长得额钁头尖，鼻偃齿露，身短不满五尺，言语有若铜钟，但很有才干，可过目不忘。张松奉命出使许都，结果不被曹操礼遇，言语顶撞曹操，被乱棍打出。张松归蜀时途经荆州，为刘备所厚待，于是将西川地理图献予刘备，劝刘备取益州，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯习> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "冯习"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯习> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "休元"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯习> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯习> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "随刘备入蜀。刘备东征吴，习为领军，统诸军，大败于猇亭，为吴将潘璋部下所斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#冯习> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "讨伐东吴为关羽报仇时，出任副将随军参战。包围了吴将孙桓，但是被陆逊火攻，战败，与同僚张南一起战死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄像> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "甄像"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄像> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "甄像"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄像> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#甄像> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏明帝太和元年（227），追封甄后父甄逸为安城乡侯，以嫡孙甄像袭爵。曾任虎贲中郎将，兼太尉，迁散骑常侍，伏波将军。孙吴侵扬州，甄像持节东征，还为射声校尉。太和三年卒，追赠卫将军，改封魏昌县侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程银> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "程银"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程银> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "程銀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程银> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程银> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "关中将领。于兴平年间起兵作乱，有部众数千家。后程银联合马超、韩遂、侯选、李堪、张横、梁兴、成宜、马玩、杨秋共十部势力起兵反抗曹操，被击败，逃入汉中。曹操平定汉中后，程银投降，被封官赐爵。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程银> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "韩遂手下八部兵马将领之一，追随马超、韩遂一起兴兵雪恨，征伐曹操。跟韩遂、庞德等人夜袭曹操营寨，中埋伏，战死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁绥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁绥"@zh .
