<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张敦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张敦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "有德行气量，清虚淡泊，又善文辞。孙权为车骑将军，辟为西曹掾，转主簿。出补海昏令，有政绩。年三十二卒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孟玖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孟玖"@zh .
