<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁芝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁芝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为大将军曹爽司马，齐王芳嘉平元年（249），太傅司马懿谋诛曹爽，艺即率府兵赴难救爽。爽诛，擢御史中丞。官至特进光禄大夫。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲁芝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "爽手下司马，在司马懿谋诛曹爽之时，辛敞、司马鲁芝引军向曹爽报告，曹爽被诛杀，鲁芝照旧复职。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁奉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "丁奉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "承渊"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晓勇而有计谋。他年轻时作小将，多次跟随其他将领征伐，经常勇冠三军。孙亮继位后，丁奉升为冠军将军，参加了吴魏龙兴之战，大破敌人先头部队，立下了大功，升为灭寇将军。孙休继位后，丁奉帮助孙休用计诛杀了权臣孙綝，升为大将军，加封左右都护。后来..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#丁奉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "由孙权所设“招贤馆”登用，早期同徐盛共为周瑜帐前护军校尉，护卫周瑜，随周瑜参加了赤壁之战、南郡争夺战，后随吕蒙参加了袭荆州之战，随陆逊参加了彝陵之战。吴国大大小小的战斗，丁奉多有涉及，屡立战功，特别是在吴魏东兴之战中，丁奉“雪中奋短兵..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张宝> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张宝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张宝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張寶"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张宝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张宝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉末农民起义首领。张角之弟。熹平年间，张角创太平道，宝与角同在河北一带传教，秘密进行组织工作。中平元年（184），发动黄巾起义，号称“地公将军”。张梁战败牺牲，宝率军在下曲阳继续抗击皇甫嵩，英勇战死，全军十余万人亦壮烈牺牲。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张宝> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "张角之弟，张梁之兄，同兄弟一起发动黄巾起义，于阳城与朱俊军对抗。后刘备兄弟率军前来，帮助朱俊与张宝交战，张宝使用妖术，一度获胜，但不久就被破解，张宝被刘备射伤，逃入阳城坚守。朱俊等加紧围攻，张宝的部下严政刺杀了张宝，献首投降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙观> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙观"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙观> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲台"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙观> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙观> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初与臧霸俱起，从陶谦讨黄巾，拜骑都尉。太祖破吕布，使霸招观兄弟，皆厚遇之。与霸俱战伐，观常为先登，征定青、徐群贼，功次于霸，封吕都亭侯。康亦以功封列侯。与太祖会南皮，遣子弟入居鄴，拜观偏将军，迁青州刺史。从征孙权于濡须口，假节。攻权，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙观> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初为泰山寇，吕布使陈宫、臧霸、结连泰山寇孙观、吴敦、尹礼、昌豨，东取山东兖州诸郡。为曹操打败，后臧霸又招安观等，孙观等亦各加官，令守青、徐沿海地面。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎象> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阎象"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎象> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "閻象"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎象> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎象> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任主簿。献帝兴平二年（195），术欲称帝，问于部下。众不敢对，独象进言反对。术嘿然不悦，仍称帝，寻败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎象> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "手执玉玺的袁术要称帝时，引用周文王虽拥有三分之二的天下还向殷称臣的故事进行劝谏。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱灵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "朱灵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱灵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文博"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱灵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱灵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为袁绍部将。曹操征陶谦时，袁绍使朱灵都督三营军队以助曹操，搏战有功。战后袁绍所遣之诸将各各罢归，惟有朱灵道：「我观人可谓多矣，无一人能比曹公，这才是真明主啊。今既已相遇，我还要求甚么呢？」于是留而不返。他所带领的士卒俱倾慕曹操，亦随..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#朱灵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "于演义第二十一回登场。其时刘备与曹操同在朝中，刘备深感掣肘，欲求脱计。适时袁术以淮南甚乱，欲北投族兄袁绍。刘备以其必从徐州过，向曹操请兵击之；曹操准其议，就遣朱灵、路昭与刘备同行，并以朱、路二人监督刘备。大军到徐州，大败袁术；不久袁术..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈武> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "陈武"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子烈"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙策在寿春，武往脩谒，时年十八，长七尺七寸，因从渡江，征讨有功，拜别部司马。策破刘勋，多得庐江人，料其精锐，乃以武为督，所向无前。及权统事，转督五校。仁厚好施，乡里远方客多依讬之。尤为权所亲爱，数至其家。累有功劳，进位偏将军。建安二十..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#陈武> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙策攻刘繇，武往助之。武身长七尺，面黄眼赤，形容古怪。策甚爱之，拜为校尉，使作先锋。以十数骑兵力杀敌五十余人。后于赤壁等役屡立功勋。权与曹公战于合肥，武引兵于江岸巡视，与庞德战。武为德赶至山谷口，树林从密，武欲回身交战，被树枝挂住袍角..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊祜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "羊祜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊祜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔子"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊祜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊祜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蔡邕外孙，司马师的妻弟。西晋开国元勋，博学能文，清廉正直，娶夏侯霸之女为妻。曾拒绝曹爽和司马昭的多次征辟，后为朝廷公车征拜。司马昭建五等爵制时以功封为钜平子，与荀勖一起共掌机密。晋代魏后司马炎有吞吴之心，乃命羊祜坐镇襄阳都督荆州诸军事..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#羊祜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙皓即位后暴虐无道，更听信妖言不自量力地令陆抗部兵屯江口，以图襄阳。晋武帝司马炎即降诏宣谕羊祜整点军马，预备迎敌。在之后的两军对垒时期，羊祜屯田积粮，怀柔招徕，深得东吴军民之心，并同陆抗互通使节，发展私交，两人结下了深厚的情谊。孙皓知..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张卫> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张卫"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张卫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公则"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张卫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张卫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉宁太守张鲁弟。建安二十年，太祖乃自散关出武都征之，至阳平关。鲁欲举汉中降，其弟卫不肯，率众数万人拒关坚守。太祖攻破之，遂入蜀。初，鲁遣五官掾降，弟卫横山筑阳平城以拒，王师不得进。鲁走巴中。军粮尽，太祖将还。西曹掾东郡郭谌曰：“不可。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张卫> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹操进攻汉中的时，主张彻底抵抗。后逃往巴中，与许褚交战，被斩。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李通[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李通[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李通[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文达"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李通[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李通[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汝南太守。早年以游侠闻名于江汝，在率众补充曹操兵源有功拜为阳安都尉，其间不因私而忘公，不因其妻子的求请而过问扏法者。官渡之战不但不被利诱，在当时许都以南民心不稳，唯李通的阳安犹存。准备救援曹仁于南郡时死于途中。谥曰刚侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李通[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏镇威中郎将。在贾诩劝刘张联军于兵败后再追击时，曹操未至的情况下李通率军救援以减低伤亡。后于关之战中在马超先败杀败于禁和张郃的情况下与马超交战数合被一枪刺死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马攸> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马攸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马攸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "大猷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马攸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马攸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少而岐嶷。及长，清和平允，亲贤好施，爱经籍，能属文，善尺牍，为世所楷。才望出武帝之右，宣帝每器之。景帝无子，命攸为嗣。从征王凌，封长乐亭侯。及景帝崩，攸年十岁，哀动左右，大见称叹。袭封舞阳侯。复历散骑常侍、步兵校尉，时年十八，绥抚营部..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马攸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司马昭次子。因兄司马师无子，故将攸过继。攸性温和，昭欲立其为世子，因恐乱长幼之序，作罢。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马炎> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马炎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马炎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "安世"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马炎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马炎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋武帝。文帝司马昭长子，魏嘉平中，封北平亭侯，历给事中、奉车都尉、中垒将军，加散骑常侍，累迁中护军、假节。迎常道乡公于东武阳，迁中抚军，进封新昌乡侯。及晋国建，立为世子，拜抚军大将军，开府、副贰相国。咸熙二年五月，立为晋王太子。八月辛..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马炎> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "文帝为晋王，以炎为世子。及昭崩，嗣。咸熙二年，逼魏主降诏禅位，炎初以礼让，魏朝公卿固请，乃从之。泰始元年冬十二月丙寅，设坛于南郊，大赦，改元。羊祜病危，炎亲往视之，及薨，纳其策，起兵平吴。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭大贤> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭大贤"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭大贤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郭大賢"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭大贤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭大贤> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末年起义军将领，被袁绍打败。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙续> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "公孙续"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙续> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公孫續"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙续> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#公孙续> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "公孙瓒之子。公孙瓒被袁绍军围困易京之时，写信给公孙续，约定举火为号，内外夹攻袁绍军。不料书信被袁绍军截获，袁绍军遂举火诱公孙瓒出击，大败公孙瓒。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡琰> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蔡琰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡琰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文姬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡琰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡琰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉末女诗人，蔡邕之女。博学有才辩，通音律。初嫁河东卫仲道。夫亡，归母家。汉末大乱，为南匈奴所虏，归南匈奴左贤王，居匈奴十二年。曹操念蔡邕无后，以金璧赎回，再嫁董祀。后董祀犯事将死，蔡琰妙答救回丈夫一命。曹操其后一次闲谈善慕她家以前的四..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡琰> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉末女诗人，蔡邕之女。初嫁河东卫仲道。后为北方虏走，归南匈奴左贤王，居匈奴十二年。期间生二子，作《胡笳十八拍》。曹操念蔡邕无后，以千金赎回，再嫁董祀。汉中之战时，增援中的曹操路过蓝田的蔡邕庄，念及蔡邕便入庄。至堂，曹操见壁间悬一碑文图..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖茂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "祖茂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "大荣"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙坚之亲近将。坚常著赤罽帻，乃脱帻令亲近将祖茂著之。卓骑争逐茂，故坚从间道得免。茂困迫，下马，以帻冠冢闲烧柱，因伏草中。卓骑望见，围绕数重，定近觉是柱，乃去。三国演义中说祖茂字大荣，三国志中未记载。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祖茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "讨伐董卓时，换上败走的孙坚的红头巾，吸引敌军，让被华雄军包围的孙坚逃脱。茂将红头巾挂在木桩上吸引华雄，自己从树丛中杀出，不幸被华雄斩杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王敦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王敦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王敦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "处仲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王敦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王敦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋武帝女婿。西晋永嘉时任扬州刺史。两晋之际，官至镇东大将军，都督江、扬、荆、湘、交、广六州诸军事。东晋建立后，任大将军、荆州牧。后因司马睿排挤王氏势力，于永昌元年（322）自武昌举兵东下，攻入建康。太守二年（324），晋明帝乘其病危，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴五> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴五"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴五> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吴五"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴五> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴五> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东南一带地方武装集团首领。建安中，孙策遣南部都尉贺齐进兵建安，他与洪明、邹临等率众分别驻守大潭汉兴、盖竹，以拒贺齐。齐破汉兴，转击盖竹，军向大潭，五投降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏讽> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "魏讽"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏讽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子京"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏讽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#魏讽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任西曹掾。有惑众才，倾动邺都，自卿相以下皆倾心交之，相国钟繇因而辟之。讽乘大军离邺，潜结徒党，又与长乐卫尉陈祎谋袭邺。举事前，祎惧，告发于太子。诛讽，坐死者数十人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王谋> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王谋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王谋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元泰"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王谋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王谋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "有容止操行。刘璋时，为巴郡太守，还为州治中从事。先主定益州，领牧，以为别驾。先主为汉中王，用荆楚宿士零陵赖恭为太常，南阳黄柱为光禄勋，谋为少府；建兴初，赐爵关内侯，后代赖恭为太常。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王谋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "建安二十二年，魏篡汉。谋等众臣请先主嗣大统。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#忙牙长> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "忙牙长"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#忙牙长> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "忙牙長"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#忙牙长> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#忙牙长> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#忙牙长> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "南蛮王孟获的部将。使一口截头大刀，骑一匹黄骠马。率军与蜀军交战，战败王平。后为平北将军马岱斩杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨松> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨松"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊鬆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨松> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "张鲁谋士。马超与其弟杨柏不和，柏与兄松商议，亦有图马超之心。松极贪贿赂，先主用金银结好杨松，用计招降马超矣。曹公平汉中，松先害庞德使之投曹，后又为曹操内应，城破，因卖主求荣，操即命斩之于市曹示众。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧霸> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "臧霸"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧霸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宣高"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧霸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧霸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "执金吾、特进。霸一名奴寇。父戒，为县狱掾，据法不听太守欲所私杀。太守大怒，令收戒诣府，时送者百余人。霸年十八，将客数十人径于费西山中要夺之，送者莫敢动，因与父俱亡命东海，由是以勇壮闻。黄巾起，霸从陶谦击破之，拜骑都尉。遂收兵于徐州，与..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#臧霸> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "琅邪相。初仕吕布，太祖讨步，霸与乐进战，不分胜败。数从布击曹军，勇猛善战。及布败死，霸遂降，封琅邪相，镇青、徐二州。后太祖伐吴，军中传西凉马腾、韩遂等欲袭中原，太祖甚忧。时徐庶自荐愿往之，太祖喜，以霸为先锋，与庶星夜赴散关把守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨琦> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨琦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨琦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "楊琦"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨琦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨琦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "时李傕有所不恭，献帝大怒，琦劝忍之。保护献帝，躲避郭汜之乱。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨琦> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "李傕郭汜交兵时李傕劫天子。帝令人问傕取米五斛，牛骨五具，以赐左右。傕怒曰：“朝夕上饭，何又他求？”乃以腐肉朽粮与之，皆臭不可食。帝骂曰：“逆贼直如此相欺！”杨琦急奏曰：“傕性残暴。事势至此，陛下且忍之，不可撄其锋也。”帝乃低头无语，泪..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫仲道> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "卫仲道"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫仲道> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲道"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫仲道> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫仲道> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蔡文姬夫。两人婚后不久，他即病亡，无子。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#卫仲道> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "操在马上望见一簇林木，极其茂盛，问近侍曰：“此何处也？”答曰：“此名蓝田。林木之间，乃蔡邕庄也。今邕女蔡琰与其夫董祀居此。”原来操素与蔡邕相善。先时其女蔡琰乃卫仲道之妻，后被北方掳去，于北地生二子，作《胡笳十八拍》，流入中原。操深怜之..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金环三结> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "金环三结"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金环三结> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "金環三結"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金环三结> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金环三结> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国演义中的虚构人物。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#金环三结> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "南蛮孟获属下大将，第一洞元帅。为了迎击蜀汉军马，与阿会喃、董荼那一起出洞。遭到夜袭，混乱之中被赵云一枪刺死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李密> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李密"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李密> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "令伯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李密> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李密> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "密祖父光，朱提太守。父早亡。母何氏，更適人。密见养于祖母。治春秋左氏传，博览多所通涉，机警辩捷。事祖母以孝闻，其侍疾则泣涕侧息，日夜不解带，膳饮汤药，必自口尝。本郡礼命不应，州辟从事尚书郎，大将军主簿，太子洗马，数使吴，有才辩，吴人称..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#康植> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "康植"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#康植> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "康植"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#康植> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#康植> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时凉州少数民族将帅。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邴原> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "邴原"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邴原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "根矩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邴原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邴原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹操之五官将长史。原十一而丧父，家贫，早孤。少与管宁俱以操尚称，州府辟命皆不就。黄巾起，原将家属入海，住郁洲山中。时孔融为北海相，举原有道。原以黄巾方盛，遂至辽东，与同郡刘政俱有勇略雄气。原在辽东，一年中往归原居者数百家，游学之士，教..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#邴原> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏名士。与华歆、管宁相友善。时人称三人为一龙：歆为龙头，原为龙腹，宁为龙尾。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭常> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭常"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭常> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郭常"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭常> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭常> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭常> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "关羽过五关斩六将后，寻找其兄长刘备。路遇大雨，于一老人家里借宿，此老人即为郭常。其子不务正业，半夜偷盗赤兔马，被人抓住，关羽看在郭常的面子上饶了他。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董重> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董重"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董重> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "董重"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董重> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董重> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董重> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉灵帝生母董太后的侄子，曾任骠骑将军。后被何进围剿，自刎于后堂。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张虎[刘表]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张虎[刘表]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张虎[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張虎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张虎[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张虎[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "江夏贼。初平元年，诏书以表为荆州刺史，遣人诱宗贼帅，至者十五人，皆斩之而袭取其众。唯张虎与陈生拥众据襄阳，刘表使蒯越与庞季单骑往说，乃降。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张虎[刘表]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "属江夏太守黄祖。时孙坚引军攻江夏，祖引虎、陈生出马。祖令虎搦战，坚阵内韩当出迎。两骑相交，战二十余合，生见虎力怯，飞马来助。坚子策望见，按住手中枪，扯弓搭箭，正射中生面门，应弦落马。虎见生坠地，吃了一惊，措手不及，被当一刀，削去半个脑袋。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙亮> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙亮"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙亮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙亮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙亮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权少子。赤乌中被立为太子。权死继位。大将军孙綝擅政，亮恶其专恣，谋诛之，事泄被废为会稽王，后又降为候官侯，遣送至其封国，途中自杀。孙亮在位共六年，年号为建兴、五凤、太平。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙亮> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙权的三子（正史为七子），吴国的第二代皇帝。他是个聪明的皇帝，看到孙綝专横，图谋杀之，但最终失败。帝位被废，沦为会稽王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#南华老仙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "南华老仙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#南华老仙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "南華老仙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#南华老仙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#南华老仙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "涉及章节共1回涉及年代0时巨鹿郡有兄弟三人，一名张角，一名张宝，一名张梁。那张角本是个不第秀才，因入 山采药，遇一老人，碧眼童颜，手执藜杖，唤角至一洞中，以天书三卷授之，曰：“此名《 太平要术》，汝得之，当代天宣化，普救世人；若萌异心..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#区景> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "区景"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#区景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "區景"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#区景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#区景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曾为交州刺史张津属将，后杀津。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[朱纪妻]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙氏[朱纪妻]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[朱纪妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫氏"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[朱纪妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙氏[朱纪妻]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时吴公主。孙策女，朱纪妻。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文恭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "文恭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲宝"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#文恭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蜀汉官吏。以才干为治中从事、丞相参军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟离牧> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "钟离牧"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟离牧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子干"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟离牧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#钟离牧> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉鲁相意七世孙也。少爰居永兴，躬自垦田，种稻二十馀亩，后牧发名。赤乌五年，从郎中补太子辅义都尉，迁南海太守，数破贼寇。在郡四年，以疾去职。还为丞相长史，转司直，迁中书令。会建安、鄱阳、新都三郡山民作乱，出牧为监军使者，讨平之。贼帅黄乱..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏由> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苏由"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏由> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "蘇由"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏由> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏由> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁尚部将。袁尚使审配、苏由守邺，复攻袁谭平原。太祖进军将攻邺，到洹水，去邺五十里，由欲为内应，谋泄，与配战城中，败，出奔太祖。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苏由> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁尚部将。与审配一起守邺城，欲投降曹操被审配发现后双方激战于城中，兵败后出城投奔曹操。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董祀> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董祀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董祀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "董祀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董祀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董祀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "蔡文姬之后夫。犯法当死，以文姬求情，曹操乃免其罪。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董祀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "董祀乃蔡文姬之后夫。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹遵> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹遵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹遵"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏臣。少与宗人大司马曹真、真乡人朱赞并事太祖。遵、赞早亡，真愍之，乞分所食邑封遵、赞子。真请分真邑赐遵、赞子爵关内侯，各百户。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹遵> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏将。为大司马曹真宗弟。蜀军侵魏，真以遵为先锋。副都督郭淮命二将抄出祁山之后，去劫蜀寨。然中蜀相亮计，二人夺路而逃。后复中计，遵为蜀将魏延所拦，遵拍马交锋，不三合，被延一刀斩于马下。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于吉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "于吉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于吉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "于吉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于吉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于吉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "宫崇诣阙上师。吉先寓居东方，往来吴会，立精舍，烧香读道书，制作符水以治病，吴会人多事之。孙策尝於郡城门楼上，集会诸将宾客，吉乃盛服杖小函，漆画之，名为仙人铧，趋度门下。诸将宾客三分之二下楼迎拜之，掌宾者禁呵不能止。策即令收之。诸事之者..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于吉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "道士。在吴郡、会稽一带为百姓治病，甚得人心。孙策怒之，以惑人心为由斩之。后策常受吉咒，死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩祯> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩祯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩祯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "韓禎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩祯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩祯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩祯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "蜀国西平关守将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙鲁育> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙鲁育"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙鲁育> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "小虎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙鲁育> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙鲁育> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "吴公主。孙权次女。初嫁朱据、后配刘纂。五凤二年（255）将军孙仪等谋杀权臣孙峻，事泄，或自杀，或被杀，死者数十人，公主鲁育亦在其中。孙休时，掘孙峻棺，为鲁育复仇。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢谭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "谢谭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢谭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "謝譚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢谭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#谢谭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "孙权黄武元年（222），吾粲召谭为功曹，谭以疾固辞。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王祥> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王祥"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王祥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "休征"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王祥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王祥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋大臣。性至孝。汉末大乱，与母、弟避地庐江，隐居三十余年，不应州郡之命。母终，始出仕。徐州刺史吕虔辟为别驾，后迁大司农。魏高贵乡公曹髦即位，封关内侯，拜光禄勋，转司隶校尉。讨毌丘俭有功，迁太常，封万岁亭侯。后直至司空、太尉、侍中，进封..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王祥> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "却说钟会出师之时，有百官送出城外，旌旗蔽日，铠甲凝霜，人强马壮，威风凛然。人皆称羡，惟有相国参军刘寔微笑不语。太尉王祥见寔冷笑，就马上握其手而问曰：“邓、钟二人，此去可平蜀乎？”寔曰：“破蜀必矣，但恐皆不得还都耳！”王祥问其故，刘寔但..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张曼成> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张曼成"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张曼成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張曼成"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张曼成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张曼成> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末南阳黄巾军首领。灵帝中平元年（184）率众起义，称“神上使”，聚众数万，杀南阳郡守褚贡。屯宛下百余日，后为太守秦颉击杀。（资料取自后汉书，三国志中未有记载。）"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#那楼> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "那楼"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#那楼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "那樓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#那楼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#那楼> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末乌桓首领。建安中，为行单于。十二年（207），曾率其部名王向曹操朝贺。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭凯> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "郭凯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭凯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "郭凱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭凯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#郭凯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "桓谭、蔡邕擅长音乐，冯翊的山子道、王九真、郭凯等擅长围棋，曹操和他们棋艺差不多。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李蒙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李蒙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李蒙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李蒙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李蒙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李蒙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "董卓部曲，长沙太守孙坚率豫州诸群兵讨卓，卓先遣将蒙、徐荣四出虏掠。初平三年，蒙随卓余党李傕、郭汜与卓故部曲樊稠、王方等合围长安城。后为李傕所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李蒙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "卓死，卓将李傕、郭汜反，劫帝持政，表奏蒙、王方等，各为校尉。后马腾、韩遂起兵，二将请缨出击。蒙见王方为腾子超刺死，一骑马从超背后赶来。超只做不知。待到赶近，超生擒蒙。腾、遂乘势追杀，大获胜捷，直逼隘口下寨，将蒙斩首号令。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍勋> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鲍勋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "叔业"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鲍勋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "魏宫正。汉司隶校尉鲍宣九世孙，勋父信，汉济北相。建安十七年，太祖追录信功，表封勋兄邵新都亭侯，辟勋丞相掾。二十二年，立太子，以勋为中庶子。徙黄门侍郎，出为魏郡西部都尉。郡界休兵有失期者，密敕中尉奏免勋官。久之，拜侍御史。延康元年，太祖..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张裕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张裕"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张裕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "南和"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张裕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张裕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "善相，晓占候。蜀初为益州后部司马。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴景> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴景"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吴景"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "乃孙坚妻弟。随坚征伐有功，受骑都尉。袁术上表吴景为丹杨太守，攻故丹阳太守周昕，占领了丹杨。其甥孙策与孙河、吕范与之合力，大破泾县贼帅祖郎。但被刘繇逼迫，又北投袁术。袁术用他为督军中郎将，与孙贲讨伐樊能、于糜，又击笮融、薛礼。当孙策在牛..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴景> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙策之舅，丹阳太守，助孙策创业。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#舞阳君> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "舞阳君"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#舞阳君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "舞陽君"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#舞阳君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#舞阳君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "车骑将军何苗母。为董卓所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#舞阳君> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "张让、段珪见董后一枝已废，遂皆以金珠玩好结构何进弟何苗，并其母舞阳君，令早晚入何太后处，善言遮蔽。因此，十常侍又得近幸。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#逢纪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "逢纪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#逢纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "元图"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#逢纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#逢纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "袁绍去董卓出奔，逢纪与之俱诣冀州，甚受亲信，更为之定计，胁迫韩馥，遂使袁绍领冀州牧。袁绍以审配、逢纪统军事，与曹操决战。官渡战败，逢纪更谮田丰，使绍羞而杀之，却不因与审配不睦，为其开脱。袁绍病死，逢纪等矫诏立袁尚为嗣，袁谭出军黎阳，袁..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#逢纪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁绍用逢纪之计，胁迫韩馥，遂领冀州，以田丰、沮授、许攸、逢纪分掌州事。平定河北，又以审配、逢纪为统军，兴兵讨曹。连战皆败，袁绍病死，逢纪等立袁尚为嗣，袁谭争位，郭图定谋，计赚逢纪同赴谭军。后谭与曹军战于黎阳，大败。遣人求救于尚。尚与审..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于禁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "于禁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于禁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "文则"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于禁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于禁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "最早随鲍信起兵，鲍信死后归附曹操，被任为官军司马。从此跟随曹操四处征战。曹操兵败宛城，曹军的青州兵四处抢劫，被于禁追杀后就去告发于禁叛变，恰好此时张绣追兵来攻，于禁就先扎下营寨才去见曹操，曹操问他怎么不先来解释，于禁认为分辩事小，退敌..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#于禁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "太祖于兖州招兵买马，于禁引军数百人来投，命为点军司马。曹操常赞其能，跟从历数战。曹操征张绣败于宛城，青州兵四处抢劫，于禁杀之，不申辩，下寨拒追兵。为曹操赏识，称其有将军之才。后曹操拜为征南将军，遣于禁解曹仁之围于樊城，因忌庞德立大功而..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宫崇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "宫崇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宫崇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "宫崇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宫崇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#宫崇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "道士。顺帝时，上其师于吉拾到的神书《太平清领书》，有司奏崇所上书妖妄不经，乃收藏之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎行> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "阎行"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎行> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎行> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#阎行> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "犍为太守。少有健名，始为小将，随韩遂。建安初，遂与马腾相攻击。行尝刺超，矛折，因以折矛挝超项，几杀之。十四年，为遂所使诣太祖，太祖表犍为太守厚遇之。昔宣曹操语与韩遂，曰以宜早辅国朝。又言止韩遂不与超合，行与遂以行父有隙，遂强以少女妻行..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全尚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "全尚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子真"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "皇后全氏之父。时大将军孙綝以吴主孙亮始亲政事，常向其多所问难，孙亮甚惧其人。孙綝后还建业，称疾不入朝，筑私室于朱雀桥之南，并使其弟威远将军孙据为苍龙宿卫，又令武卫将军孙恩、偏将军孙干、长水校尉孙闿分屯诸营，欲自固势力以专朝政。孙亮深忌..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#全尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "黄门侍郎全纪与皇后全氏之父。时大将军孙綝以吴主孙亮始亲政事，常向其多所问难。孙綝为人专恣，孙亮甚惧其人，与全纪密谋诛除孙綝，并约全尚、将军刘丞谋诛孙綝。全纪承诏，以之告父全尚，不料全尚心无远虑，将事告知其妻。全纪妻是孙綝之姊，当下便使..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程普> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "程普"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程普> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "德谋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程普> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程普> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初为州郡吏，有容貌计略，善於应对。从孙坚征伐，讨黄巾於宛、邓，破董卓於阳人，攻城野战，身被创夷。坚薨，复随孙策在淮南，从攻庐江，拔之，还俱东渡。策入会稽，以普为吴郡都尉，治钱唐。后徙丹杨都尉，居石城。复讨宣城、泾、安吴、陵阳、春谷诸贼..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#程普> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "孙氏麾下宿将，善使铁脊蛇矛。初从孙坚，于汜水关杀死卓将胡轸。后坚得国玺，普述其源流，并劝坚回江东，观时局以应天命。后坚击刘表，普败蔡瑁、杀吕公。坚亡，普随孙策，讨王朗、严白虎，攻刘繇、黄祖，周旋江、淮，咸积功劳。后曹公南下，权以普、周..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴硕[吴]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴硕[吴]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴硕[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吴碩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴硕[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴硕[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "都护征虏将军孙皎督夏口，委以军旅之事。皎卒，孙奂以扬武中郎将领江夏太守，礼待之而纳其善。黄武五年（226），孙权攻石阳，硕随孙奂为前锋，以军功拜裨将军，封关内侯。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#边章> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "边章"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#边章> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "邊章"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#边章> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#边章> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "反贼。原名边允，初为督军从事，中平元年，凉州宋扬、北宫玉、李文侯等反，举章、遂韩为主，杀刺史郡守以叛，众十馀万，天下骚动。二年春，诏以副左车骑将军皇甫嵩征之。嵩以无功免归，而章、遂等大盛。中平三年，遣司空张温行车骑将军，西讨章等。章、..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#大乔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "大乔"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#大乔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "大喬"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#大乔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#大乔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "父桥国老德尊于时。大乔国色流离、资貌绝伦。建安三年，孙策攻皖，拔之。纳大桥。后人谓英雄美女，天做之合。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#大乔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "江东乔国老有二女，大乔和小乔。大乔有沉鱼落雁之资，倾国倾城之容。孙策征讨江东，攻取皖城，娶大乔为妻。自古美女配英雄，伯符大乔堪绝配。曹操赤壁鏖兵，虎视江东，曾有揽二乔娱暮年，还足平生之愿。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何茂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "何茂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "何茂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#何茂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "原本为袁绍部将。建安五年（200），曹操部下于禁、乐进率军从延津攻至获嘉、汲县，他与王摩等二十余人降操。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴硕[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴硕[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴硕[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吴碩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴硕[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴硕[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任议郎。建安中，车骑将军董承称，受献帝衣带密诏，当诛曹操。遂与硕及长水校尉种辑、将军王子服、王子兰等结谋。五年（200），事泄，为曹操所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴硕[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "与车骑将军董承、昭信将军王子服、长水校尉种辑等人接汉献帝旨除操。可是，董承家奴秦庆童与侍妾云英在暗处私语，被打，后秦庆童怀恨在心而向曹操密告董承谋反一事事情败露，董承等人都被曹操杀害。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张悌> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张悌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张悌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "巨先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张悌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张悌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少有名理，孙休时为屯骑校尉。魏伐蜀，悌论以“蜀阉宦专朝，国劳不备。必为魏所灭。”果如是。后拜丞相。晋伐吴，悌督沈莹、诸葛靓等率众三万渡江逆之。所领奋勇死战，无去意。军败，为王浑军所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张悌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司马炎分兵伐吴，丞相张悌分兵派将拒敌。亲率众出牛渚渡江抵抗。晋军所到既克。张悌战死于乱军之中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王越> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王越"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王越> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "王越"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王越> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王越> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "为虎贲，善剑术，称于京师。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵莋> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵莋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵莋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "趙莋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵莋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵莋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "任益州别驾从事。建安二十五年（220年）曹丕废献帝自立，他和其他蜀国官员力劝刘备称帝。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵莋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义中为赵祚，是刘备的别驾。建安二十二年，魏篡汉。举与军师诸葛亮等请先主嗣大统。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹不兴> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹不兴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹不兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹不興"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹不兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹不兴> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "画家。孙权使画屏风，误落笔点素，因就以作蝇。奉献之时，权以为生蝇，举手弹之。其最擅长者为人物、龙、虎及马。南齐谢赫《古书品录》列为第一品第二人。唐张彦远《历代名画记》亦以不兴擅画，定为八绝之一。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李盛> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李盛"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李盛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李盛"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李盛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李盛> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建兴六年（228），因兵败街亭，与参军马谡、将军张休俱被诸葛亮处死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄盖[东汉]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄盖[东汉]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄盖[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "黃蓋"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄盖[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄盖[东汉]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "受任为日南太守，刚到任，以供设不丰，挝杀主簿，被郡人驱逐。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘先> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘先"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘先> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "始宗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘先> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘先> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "尚书令。博学强记，尤好黄老言，明习汉家典故。为刘表别驾，劝表归太祖，表不决。奉章诣许，见太祖，太祖讽表，先驳之，太祖嘿然，拜先武陵太守。荆州平，先始为汉尚书，后为魏国尚书令。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘先> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "刘表别驾。表卒，蔡瑁当权，命先、治中邓义守荆州。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙谦[魏]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "孙谦[魏]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙谦[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孫謙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙谦[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙谦[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "曹爽部将。司马懿乘爽外出时发动兵变，经过曹爽门阙时，曹爽守督在门楼上欲射懿，谦则在后牵止再三，懿遂得脱险。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#孙谦[魏]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "(潘举)乃引弓弩手数十人，登门楼望之，正见司马懿引兵过府前。举令人乱箭射下。懿不得过。偏将孙谦在后止之曰：“太傅为国家大事，休得放箭！”连止三次，举方不射。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀粲> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "荀粲"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀粲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "奉倩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀粲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#荀粲> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "玄学家，荀彧的幼子。幼年聪颖过人，与兄长论荀彧与荀攸优劣，几个兄长不能说服。成年后以善谈玄理名噪一时。娶曹洪之女为妻，生活美满。不料，不久妻子重病不治而亡。荀粲悲痛过度，旋即亦亡，年仅二十九岁。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沙摩柯> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "沙摩柯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沙摩柯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "沙摩柯"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沙摩柯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沙摩柯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "东汉末三国时胡人首领。蜀章武初，刘备亲自领兵攻孙权，以金锦爵赏诱沙摩柯助战。二年（222），吴大都督陆逊以火攻破刘备，率诸军齐击，沙摩柯败死。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#沙摩柯> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "武陵蛮王，面红眼绿，使铁蒺藜骨朵，出场就射死了重病在身的甘宁，并击败淳于丹部。后蜀军兵败，他与周泰交锋二十余回合，被周泰所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王凌> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王凌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王凌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "彦云"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王凌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王凌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "乃汉司徒王允之侄。王允为李傕、郭汜所戮，举家遭害；王凌逾城逃脱，回归故土；后举孝廉，为发干长，遇事遭髡刑，在当道扫除时曹操车驾经过，曹操得知他是王允之侄，用他为骁骑主簿，迁职中山太守，管理有方，曹操用为丞相掾属。魏文帝即位，拜凌为散骑..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成何> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "成何"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成何> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "成何"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成何> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成何> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安末任督将。建安二十四年（219），关羽攻庞德于樊城北，庞德曾向他示以必死之志。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#成何> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "成何身为督将，随于禁率七路军来解樊城之围。见大军屯于川口怕遭水淹，就向于禁进言，却被于禁骂回。来见庞德，说此事。庞德听从其谏议准备屯军于高处，可为时已晚。关公放水淹了七军，成何听从庞德之令向前死战，被关公一箭射落水中。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戏志才> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "戏志才"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戏志才> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "志才"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戏志才> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#戏志才> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "志才筹画士也，为荀彧荐，太祖甚器之，早卒。太祖与荀彧书曰：“自志才亡后，莫可与计事者。汝、颍固多奇士,谁可以继之?”彧遂荐郭嘉。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵咨[吴]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵咨[吴]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵咨[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "德度"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵咨[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵咨[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "博学多识，善于应对。孙权为吴王时，任中大夫。多次出使曹魏。后拜骑都尉。曾力劝孙权称帝，受到孙权赞识。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵咨[吴]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "瑾见孙权，言先主不肯通和之意。权大惊曰：“若如此，则江南危矣！”阶下一人进曰：“某有一计，可解此危。”视之，乃中大夫赵咨也。权曰：“德度有何良策？”咨曰：“主公可作一表，某愿为使，往见魏帝曹丕，陈说利害，使袭汉中，则蜀兵自危矣。”权曰..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵萌> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵萌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵萌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "趙萌"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵萌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵萌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵萌> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "汉少帝因十常侍之乱于崔烈家中避难，闵贡找到汉少帝，迎其归来，右军校尉赵萌，后军校尉鲍信等数百人马人接驾。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周尚> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周尚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "周尚"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "周瑜从父，任丹杨太守。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周尚> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "原来孙坚讨董卓之时，移家舒城。策长瑜两月，瑜以兄事策。瑜叔周尚为丹阳太守，今往省亲，到此与策相遇。策见瑜大喜，诉以衷情。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯存> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯存"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯存> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "夏侯存"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯存> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯存> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯存> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "曹仁骁将。演义中关羽攻樊城，曹仁欲坚守不出。参谋满宠谏曰：「吾素知关羽勇而有谋，未可轻敌。不如坚守，乃为上策。」骁将夏侯存曰：「此书生之言耳。岂不闻『水来土掩，将至兵迎』？我军以逸待劳，自可取胜。」曹仁从其言，令满宠守樊城，自领兵来迎..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡瑁> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "蔡瑁"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡瑁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "德珪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡瑁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡瑁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "性格骄豪自喜。《襄阳耆旧记》载其少为曹操所亲。蔡氏乃襄阳大族，刘表初至荆州，使即以蔡瑁为辅。蔡瑁姊为刘表后妻，是以蔡瑁以亲见任。刘表有二子，次子琮娶蔡氏侄为妻，故蔡瑁甚厚爱刘琮，并与刘表外甥张允同为党羽。后刘表病重，表长子刘琦欲归看父..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#蔡瑁> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "荆州牧刘表麾下大将，却是谄佞小人。蔡瑁久事刘表，其姊为刘表后妻，是以蔡瑁以亲见任。孙坚曾因暗匿玉玺，先与刘表结怨；蔡瑁被遣出阵，却被坚将黄盖以铁鞭击中护心镜而败走。后刘表复与孙坚接战，谋士蒯良劝表稳守，蔡瑁却执意迎战，结果又为坚将程普..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥玄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "桥玄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公祖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少为县功曹，乞豫州刺史周景任为陈国从事，因追究陈相羊昌罪恶而著名。举孝廉，历洛阳左尉、齐相、上谷太守、汉阳太守、司徒长史、将作大匠。桓帝末，为度辽将军，保境安民，击败鲜卑、南匈奴、高句丽侵扰。灵帝初，任河南尹、少府、大鸿胪。建宁三年（..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#桥玄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "时人有桥玄者谓操曰：“天下将乱，非命世之才不能济。能安之者，其在君乎？”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩世雄> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "韩世雄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩世雄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "韓世雄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩世雄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#韩世雄> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "方士。为甘始之师，善行气。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任峻> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "任峻"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯达"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "董卓作乱时，任峻劝说中牟令杨原治理河南，抵抗暴乱。适逢曹操起兵，任峻征集宗族家客数百人归附曹操。之后曹操每次出征，任峻通常在后方补给军队。后来发生饥荒，枣祗建议实施屯田，任峻被任命为典农中郎将，招募百姓在许下屯田，结果连年丰收，积谷足..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#任峻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "典农中郎将。建安元年，太祖迎天子驾到许都，以毛玠、任峻为典农中郎将，催督钱粮。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#罗宪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "罗宪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#罗宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "令则"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#罗宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#罗宪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "十三岁就能写文，早期知名于士大夫间。师从蜀国大儒谯周，门人都称他为“子贡”。罗宪性格温和，人际关系很好，而且忠勇有谋。初当太子舍人，宣信校尉，出使入吴，被吴人称赞。后来宦官黄皓干涉朝政，时人多依附之，罗宪却不以为然，黄皓心忌，利用权力..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马昭> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "司马昭"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子上"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "司马懿次子。昭随父抗蜀，多有军识。景初二年，封新城乡侯。正始初，迁洛阳典农中郎将。曹髦时，继兄司马师为大将军。专揽国政，阴谋代魏。甘露五年，杀魏帝曹髦，另立曹奂为帝。景元四年，分兵谴钟会、邓艾、诸葛绪三路伐蜀，灭之。自称晋公。后加晋王..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#司马昭> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司马昭随父司马懿抵御诸葛亮伐魏。多有军识。司马师死后，司马昭为大将军。手握兵权，专揽国政，并阴谋代魏。甘露五年，杀魏帝曹髦，另立曹奂为帝。景元四年，司马昭分兵伐蜀。蜀灭亡后，钟会阴谋造反，司马昭率领大军亲讨。未至，钟会业已败亡。回朝后..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵统> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵统"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵统> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "趙統"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵统> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵统> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虎贲中郎、督行领军。父云，镇军将军。云卒，统嗣，官至虎贲中郎，督行领军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵统> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "父云，镇军将军。云卒，统与弟广往成都报丧。后主思念云昔日之功，封统为虎贲中郎，广为牙门将，就令守坟。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许汜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "许汜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许汜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "許汜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许汜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许汜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "本为吕布部下。兴平元年(194)，曹操复征陶谦，张超与吕布部将陈宫、从事中郎许汜、王楷共谋背叛曹操。吕布被围于下邳时遣许汜、王楷向袁术求援。后曾与刘备共议天下名士，谈到陈登时许汜对其表示不满，遭到刘备反对。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#许汜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "吕布谋士。吕布被围于下邳时遣许汜、王楷向袁术求援。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨洪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨洪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "季休"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘璋时历部诸郡。先主定蜀，太守李严命为功曹。严欲徙郡治舍，洪固谏不听，遂辞功曹，请退。严欲荐洪於州，为蜀部从事。军师将军诸葛亮表洪领蜀郡太守，众事皆办，遂使即真。顷之，转为益州治中从事。先主既称尊号，征吴不克，还住永安。汉嘉太守黄元反..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨洪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "魏主丕篡汉，洪时为治中，随众官奏请先主称帝。后丞相亮伐魏，留洪为尚书。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨综> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "杨综"@zh .
