<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨综> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨综> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初，司马宣王专权，解曹爽印绶，综劝爽挟主握权，爽不从。有司奏综导爽反，宣王以为各为其主，宥之，任为尚书郎。后为安东参军。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#杨综> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "司马懿诛曹爽时，爽令将印送去。主簿杨综扯住印绶而哭曰：“主公今日舍兵权，自缚去降，不免东市受戮也！”"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵岐> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "赵岐"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵岐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "邠卿"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵岐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵岐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "初名嘉，生于御史台，因字台卿，后避难，故自改名字，示不忘本土也。少明经，有才艺。娶扶风马融兄女，因融为外戚豪家，不与融相见，仕州郡，以廉直疾恶，为人忌惮。桓帝永兴二年（154），辟司空掾，转皮氏长，大兴学校。因得罪宦官唐衡及其兄唐玹，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#赵岐> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁绍在磐河与公孙瓒僵持不下，董卓便使太傅马日磾、太仆赵岐赍诏前去和解。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴押狱> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "吴押狱"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴押狱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "吴押獄"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴押狱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴押狱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国志记载：华佗临死，出一卷书与狱吏，曰：“此可以活人。”吏畏法不受，佗亦不强，索火烧之。在三国演义中，将此狱吏作吴姓。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#吴押狱> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "华佗在狱，有一狱卒姓吴，人皆称为“吴押狱”。此人每日以酒食供奉华佗。佗感其恩，乃告曰：“我今将死，恨有《青囊书》未传于世。感公厚意，无可为报。我修一书，公可遣人送与我家，取《青囊书》来赠公，以继吾术。”吴押狱大喜曰：“我若得此书，弃了..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞柔> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "庞柔"@zh .
