<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#庞柔> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "马超部下，庞德之兄。受刘璋之请与马超一起攻打刘备，后与马超一起投降刘备。"@zh .
