<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马秋> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "马超之子。超入蜀时留其庶妻董氏及子秋于张鲁。后曹操破鲁，秋为鲁所杀。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯楙> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "夏侯楙"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯楙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子林"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯楙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯楙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "大将军夏侯惇次子。文帝少与楙亲，及即位，以为安西将军、持节，承夏侯渊处都督关中。楙性无武略，而好治生。至太和二年，明帝西征，人有白楙者，遂召还为尚书。楙在西时，多畜伎妾，公主由此与楙不和。其后群弟不遵礼度，楙数切责，弟惧见治，乃共构楙..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#夏侯楙> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "征西将军夏侯渊之子，自幼嗣与夏侯惇为子，渊为黄忠所斩，曹操怜之，以女清河公主招为驸马，因此朝中钦敬。蜀相诸葛亮伐魏，楙自请出征，明帝以为大都督，调关西诸路军马二十余万，来敌蜀军。然楙一触即溃，为王平所擒，后被放回，为亮设计所用，折数将..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雷铜> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "雷铜"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#雷铜> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "雷銅"@zh .
