<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#华佗妻> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "华佗妻子。华佗临死前，至书给妻子，将《青囊书》交付吴押狱。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鄂焕> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "鄂焕"@zh .
