<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鄂焕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鄂焕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#鄂焕> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "高定部將。身长九尺，惯使方天画戟，有万夫不挡之勇。担任高定军的先锋与魏延等交战，中计被俘随即被放回。诸葛亮使反间计，焕先杀死雍闿，后又刺死朱褒。与高定一起投降蜀汉，被封为牙门将。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王朗[司徒]> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "王朗[司徒]"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王朗[司徒]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "景兴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王朗[司徒]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王朗[司徒]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "以通经，拜郎中，除菑丘长。师太尉杨赐，赐薨，弃官行服。举孝廉，辟公府，不应。徐州刺史陶谦察朗茂才。汉帝在长安，关东兵起，朗为谦治中，说谦遣使奉承王命。天子嘉其意，拜谦安东将军，朗会稽太守。孙策渡江略地。孙策渡江略地。朗功曹虞翻以为力不..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#王朗[司徒]> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "大将军曹真军师。初为汉会稽太守，为孙策攻败。后投太祖，与华歆逼奏汉帝禅位。魏建，蜀相诸葛亮攻，朗进以大将军曹真御之。明帝从之，并以朗为军师。两军遇于渭河，朗欲以言辞说降亮，反为亮痛斥，郎气满胸膛，大叫一声，撞死于马下。曹真将王朗尸首，..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张陟> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张陟"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张陟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張陟"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张陟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张陟> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安十一年（206），为并州刺史。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马玉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马玉"@zh .
