<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马玉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "诸葛亮《后出师表》中提到此人。原文：自臣（诸葛亮）到汉中，中间期年耳，然丧赵云、阳群、马玉、阎芝、丁立、白寿、刘郃、邓铜等及曲长屯将七十馀人。由于后出师表是否为诸葛亮所写存在争议，故文中所提人名是否真实，也有待考证。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马玉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "诸葛亮《后出师表》中提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周毖> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "周毖"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周毖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "仲远"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周毖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周毖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "董卓时任尚书。因其所荐举韩馥、刘岱、孔伷等人，至官后将兵讨卓，毖为卓所斩。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#周毖> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "当袁绍出逃冀州时，周毖与伍琼劝董卓暂且赐袁绍郡守之职，以笼络袁绍，同时可以收服民心。董卓从之，以袁绍为渤海太守。后董卓计划迁都，周毖与伍琼前来阻止，董卓认为二人保举了与他为敌的袁绍，有通敌之嫌，于是将二人处死"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李崇> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "李崇"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#李崇> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "李崇"@zh .
