<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#项羽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#项羽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "西楚霸王。秦末时被楚义帝封为“鲁公”，在前207年的决定性战役钜鹿之战中统率楚军大破秦军，秦亡后自封“西楚霸王”，统治黄河及长江下游的梁楚九郡，后在楚汉战争中的垓下之战为刘邦所败，逃亡至东城被杀。《史记·项羽本纪》称项羽在乌江（今安徽..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#项羽> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "秦朝末年人物，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张任> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张任"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张任> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "張任"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张任> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张任> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "益州从事，家世寒门，以忠勇著称，有志节。建安十八年（213），刘备取蜀时，张任对抗刘备于涪，退却后与璋子循守雒城。次年，遭生擒。刘备派人劝降，张任宁死不降，遂被杀，刘备为之叹息。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张任> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "演义第60回登场。刘备入蜀时，张任出言劝谏刘璋提防刘备，刘璋不听；宴会之际，庞统设计让魏延舞剑，趁机除掉刘璋，张任见势，出面对舞，解救了刘璋。后来，刘备攻打刘璋，张任引兵对抗，多次击退刘备，并在落凤坡埋伏射死庞统；后诸葛亮从荆州前来支..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严密> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "严密"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严密> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "嚴密"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严密> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#严密> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "三国时吴官吏。永安三年（260）任都尉，建议开垦丹杨湖田，作浦里塘。诏百官会议，咸以为用功多而田不得成，唯濮阳兴以为可成。于是征发兵民就作，功佣之费不可胜计，士卒死亡，百姓大怨之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝融> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "祝融"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "祝融"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#祝融> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "南蛮王孟获之妻、祝融氏之后。夫人使丈八长标，背插五口飞刀，百发百中。三江城为蜀相诸葛亮所得，夫人替夫出阵，以飞刀伤张嶷之手，又擒马忠，生擒二将。后为赵云、魏延挑衅，深入敌，旋即为马岱以绊马索擒下。获以张、马二将换回夫人。后亮七擒七纵获..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管辂> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "管辂"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管辂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管辂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管辂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "术士，容貌粗丑，不讲礼仪，性好嗜酒，言谈无常，人皆爱之而不敬之。从小就喜欢仰视星辰，每与小儿做游戏，就在地上画天文，人们叹为奇才。成人后，精通周易、风角、占相，远近扬名。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#管辂> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "人称为神卜管辂。深明《周易》，仰观风角，数学通神，兼善相术。被曹操召去占卜，预言蜀国攻势、夏侯渊战死、魯肃病死、许昌火灾等事无不应验。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘和> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘和"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘和> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉和"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘和> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘和> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "刘虞之子。初，和为侍中，帝思东归，因此遣和伪逃董卓，潜从武关出，告虞将兵来迎。道由南阳，后将军袁术闻其状，遂质和，使报虞遣兵俱西。虞乃使数千骑就和奉迎帝，而术竟不遣之。公孙瓒知术诈，固止虞遣兵，虞不从，瓒乃阴劝术执和，使夺其兵，自是与..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马隆> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "马隆"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "孝兴"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#马隆> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "晋东羌校尉。少而智勇，好立名节。魏兖州刺史令狐愚坐事伏诛，举州无敢收者。隆以武吏托称愚客，以私财殡葬，服丧三年，列植松柏，礼毕乃还，一州以为美谈。署武猛从事。泰始中，将兴伐吴之役兗州举隆才堪良将。稍迁司马督。初，凉州刺史杨欣失羌戎之和..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄权> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "黄权"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄权> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "公衡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄权> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄权> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "车骑将军。少为郡吏，州牧刘璋召为主簿。时别驾张松建议，宜迎先主，使伐张鲁。权劝谏之，璋不从。出权为广汉长。及先主袭取益州，权闭城坚守，须刘璋稽服，乃诣降先主。先主假权偏将军。及曹公破张鲁，鲁走入巴中，权进先主迎鲁，先主以之为护军。鲁已..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#黄权> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "初从刘璋，因劝璋勿引先主入蜀，而为璋所疏。先主攻璋，权都献策抵之。及蜀定，权闭门不降，先主亲往请之，乃降。后先主及称尊号，将东伐吴，权谏之，不从。先主败，权因吴兵隔断在江北岸，欲归无路，不得已而降魏。魏主曹丕大喜，遂拜黄权为镇南将军。..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁绪> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "梁绪"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "梁緒"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "大鸿胪。弟虔，蜀大长秋。绪初为魏天水功曹，后随姜维降蜀。官至大鸿胪，先蜀亡。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁绪> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "天水太守。弟虔，蜀上邽令。绪初为魏天水功曹。配合姜维之计，引诱蜀将赵云。后维降蜀，马遵、夏侯楙疑绪、尹赏与维结连，欲为内应，欲杀二人。是夜，楙数使人请梁、尹二人说话。二人料知事急，遂披挂上马，各执兵器，引本部军大开城门，放蜀兵入。后又..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苟安> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "苟安"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苟安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "茍安"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苟安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "虚构人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苟安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "虚构人物，出自三国演义。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#苟安> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "李严遣都尉苟安解送粮米。但苟安好酒，于路怠慢，违限十日。诸葛亮怒欲斩之，杨仪求情，乃杖八十放之。苟安怀恨在心，投魏。司马懿命其去成都散布谣言：“孔明有怨上之意，早晚欲称为帝。”宦官闻知报与刘禅，刘禅竟信以为真，下诏召回了孔明。 "@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张臶> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "张臶"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张臶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "子明"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张臶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#张臶> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少游太学，学兼内外，后归乡里。袁绍前后辟命，不应，移居上党。并州牧高干表除乐平令，不就，徙遁常山，门徒数百人，迁居任县。曹操为丞相，辟，不诣。魏明帝太和中诏求隐学之士能消灾复异者，郡数次荐举，以老病不行。正始元年（240）卒，时年一百..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董衡> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "董衡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "董衡"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "建安二十四年，随庞德、于禁讨蜀将关羽。后羽水淹七军，衡及部曲将董超等欲降，德皆收斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#董衡> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "董衡、董超随庞德、于禁讨蜀将关羽。后关羽水淹七军，庞德并二董及成何，与步卒五百人，皆无衣甲，立在堤上。及关羽来，董衡、董超见势危欲降，庞德亲斩之。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁隗> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "袁隗"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁隗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "次阳"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁隗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁隗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉太傅。累世三公，隗少历显官，先兄逢为三公。袁氏贵宠于世，富奢甚，不与它公族同。献帝初，隗为太傅。后董卓忿隗侄绍、术背己，遂诛隗及术兄基等男女二十余人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#袁隗> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "袁绍叔父。袁氏累世三公，贵宠于世。及董卓专权，隗侄绍、术起兵反卓，卓恐其为内应，灭其全家。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘焉> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘焉"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘焉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "君郎"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘焉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘焉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "少以宗室拜中郎，未几因事去官。后举贤良方正，辟司徒府，历洛阳令、冀州刺史、南阳太守、宗正、太常。灵帝末年，目睹政治腐败，天下将乱，求为外任，因之出为监军使者，领益州牧，封阳城侯。到任后，一方面镇压、招抚益州黄巾军；另一方面抑制地方豪强..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘焉> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "刘璋之父。东汉的益州牧，汉室的宗亲。看到汉室逐渐沒落，以州牧之身赴有天子之气的巴蜀就任，建立了独立的势力。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜维> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "姜维"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜维> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯约"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜维> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜维> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "幼年丧父和母亲生活，喜爱郑玄的经学，曾为魏中郎将，参天水郡军事。诸葛亮第一次北伐后投蜀汉，因他忠勤时事、思虑精密、敏于军事、即有胆义，又兼心存汉室，故深得诸葛亮的器重。诸葛亮于五丈原病逝后，姜维令杨仪反旗鸣鼓，导致尾追的司马懿退兵。姜..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#姜维> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "大将军。文武双全、侍母至孝。初为魏中郎将，诸葛亮欲取天水后姜维识破设伏败赵云，其后更劫了诸葛亮的寨。诸葛亮思其为接班人，并用计令夏侯楙和马遵误以姜维降蜀，姜维走投无路降蜀。姜维深得亮器重，亮授之平生所学。其后历次北伐，姜维出力甚多，比..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁冀> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "梁冀"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁冀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "伯卓"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁冀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#梁冀> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "大将军梁商之子。永和元年（136），拜河南尹。六年，商卒，冀继为大将军。其妹为顺帝皇后，顺帝卒，其妹以太后身分临朝，冀复任大将军、参录尚书事，理朝政达二十年，先后立冲、质、桓三帝。在任骄奢横暴，侵夺农民利益。延熹二年（159），桓帝与..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹殷> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "曹殷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹殷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "曹殷"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹殷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#曹殷> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "明帝之子。未至一周岁而卒，追封谥安平哀王。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘保> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "刘保"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘保> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "劉保"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘保> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicity> "史实人物"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘保> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#historicalDescription> "汉安帝长子。刘保出生后，生母李氏就被皇后阎姬毒杀。永宁元年（120年），身为安帝独子的刘保被立为皇太子。延光三年（124年），汉安帝乳母王圣、大长秋江京、中常侍樊丰诬陷太子的乳母王男、厨监邴吉。两人被杀，太子数为叹息。王圣等人惧有后祸..."@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#刘保> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#novelDescription> "东汉时期人，演义中曾提到此人。"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#纺绩> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "纺绩"@zh .
<http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#纺绩> <http://pengcheng.com/phoenixgraph/kg/sanguo#courtesyName> "紡績"@zh .
